      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Correspondent Week concludes with Everton fan Sean Norton joining James to discuss an Everton side that now have no lack of depth in midfield but still have some concerns in other areas.</p>
<p>And midfield should be an area of interest for Everton assets, but Christian Norgaard and James Garner remain doubts for GW1, new signings Hayden Hackney, Brennan Johnson and Tyrique George may not be first choice, Jack Grealish may return and the popular Iliman Ndiaye also carries concerns over his future and output. </p>
<p>You're still not thinking about Kiernan Dewsbury-Hall. Maybe you should...</p>
<p>James Tarkowski could do very well again as a DEFCON monster, but is he worth the extra over his cheaper teammates?</p>
<p>Plus, Barry v Beto and lots more...</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>
</p>
<p>Next Week on Planet FPL:</p>
<p>Monday: s. 10 ep. 3 - The Shortlist</p>
<p>Tuesday: That Show With Nico ep. 16</p>
<p>Wednesday: s. 10 ep. 4 - The Line Ups</p>
<p>Thursday: Ask James</p>
<p>Friday: s. 10 ep. 5 - Final Drafts</p>
<p>
</p>
<p>And on Patreon today: The Debrief with Suj and James on today's four Podcasts (IT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (AT)


</p>
