<p>There's a new no.1, Lewis Hall and Malick Thiaw will want monitoring for different reasons, there are three 6.0 forwards to consider and the standout might not be who was expected, and there's some midfielders at cheap prices who may do well.</p>
<p>But additions are also definitely required!</p>
