<p>That may take time to answer. But before European football begins there are some great opening fixtures and lots of FPL interest for fantasy managers to consider. </p>
<p>Injury concerns have opened up the possibility of a 4.0 defender and a 4.5 OOP defender both starting and there's coverage of those who performed well last season too such as Dan Ballard and Nordi Mukiele.</p>
<p>And there are attackers too with 6.0 pair Enzo Le Fee and Brian Brobbey likely to have interest and there's someone cheaper who could catch the ere too.</p>
