<p>Lacroix has gone, as said Munoz may follow, could more leave? And what do Palace want to invest in?</p>
<p>There's coverage of several interesting FPL prospects including Dean Henderson, Chris Richards, Tyrick Mitchell, Isamaila Sarr and Jean-Philippe Mateta.</p>
<p>And an intro to new boss Pierre Sage who leads Palace into the Europa League and takes over from Oliver Glasner who has departed following the Conference League victory. </p>
<p> </p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Next on Correspondent Week: ep. 13 with Paul Gaught-Allen on Ipswich</p>
<p>
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Correspondent Week episodes 13-16 with Paul Gaught-Allen on Ipswich, Spencer Barrowman on Sunderland, Neil Grover on Bournemouth and Adam Pritchard on Arsenal</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>And on Patreon: The Debrief with Suj and James on today's four Podcasts (IT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (AT)</p>
