    <item>
      <title>Brentford with Tom Medd | Correspondent Week ep. 10 | Planet FPL 2026/27</title>
      <description>We've reached the halfway point of Correspondent Week as James is joined by Brentford fan Tom Medd and after narrowly missing out on European qualification there's hopes they can build upon Keith Andrews first season in charge.

Igor Thiago will appeal again, and Brentford forwards always seem to do well in FPL.

Dango Ouattara and Kevin Schade will have admirers and there's defensive assets to consider too.

And the Bees may have just signed this year's Midfield DEFCON monster.



Next on Correspondent Week: ep. 11 with Jonny Pringle on Manchester City


And later today on Planet FPL: Correspondent Week episode 12 with Ruaidhri McLaughlin-Dowd on Crystal Palace



And on Patreon: The Debrief with Suj and James on today's four Podcasts (IT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (AT)





The full schedule for Correspondent Week can be found here: ⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl/posts/correspondent-166192123⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠⁠







