<p>James is joined by fellow Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders to discuss excitement over an evolving football philosophy under Roberto De Zerbi and new signings in Jan Paul Van Hecke, Marcos Senesi, Andy Robertson, Sandro Tonali and Matheus Fernandes.</p>
<p>But there's concern, with no new forward additions and there may be only two fit forwards for three spots in Gameweek 1.</p>
<p>Plus FPL discussion on the Kinsky-Dubravka double up, best defensive assets, the cons to Richarlison or Solanke; but there may be one sneaky attacking asset worth an early punt.</p>
