    <item>
      <title>Aston Villa with Lee Jackson | Correspondent Week ep. 8 | Planet FPL 2026/27</title>
      <description>Day 2 of Correspondent Week concludes with the Europa League Winners as James is joined by Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson, to discuss all things Villa.

There's discussion on the departures of Morga Rogers, Youri Tielemans and Lucas Digne and new buys Joao Gomes, Alejandro Garnacho and Johan Manzambi.

Ollie Watkins many be underpriced, yet many FPL managers will overlook him, if Emi Buendia could step up in Rogers absence and the best of the cheap defensive assets.



Next on Correspondent Week: ep. 9 with Ricky Saunders on Tottenham


Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Correspondent Week episodes 9-12 with Ricky Saunders on Tottenham, Tom Medd on Brentford, Jonny Pringle on Manchester City and Ruaidhri McLaughlin-Dowd on Crystal Palace



And on Patreon: The Debrief with Suj and James on today's four Podcasts (IT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (AT)





The full schedule for Correspondent Week can be found here: ⁠⁠⁠⁠https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl/posts/correspondent-166192123⁠⁠⁠⁠







