      <title>Leeds United with Ed Salinger | Correspondent Week ep. 6 | Planet FPL 2026/27</title>
      <description>Next on Correspondent Week James is joined by Leeds United fan Ed Salinger to discuss if Leeds can improve on last season and their FPL assets.

Dominic Calvert-Lewin is beginning to look like the template 6.0 forward pick, but might there be a better 6.0 choice from Elland Road...?

Harry Wilson may appeal following a successful final season at Fulham at a more expensive price of 6.5, whilst the reliable Ethan Ampadu may be and under the radar pick at 5.5.

And there's coverage of the backline, with James Trafford signed, Jaka Bijol and  another new signing Tarik Muharemovic could also appeal at 5,0, but money can be saved with three 4.5 options too.



Next on Correspondent Week: ep. 5 with Lewis James on Fulham


Later today on Planet FPL: Correspondent Week ep. 8 with Lee Jackson on Aston Villa



And on Patreon: The Debrief with Suj and James on today's four Podcasts (IT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (AT)





The full schedule for Correspondent Week can be found here: ⁠⁠https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl/posts/correspondent-166192123⁠⁠







