<p>There's discussion on the importance of Bruno Fernandes for FPL managers and starting him with or instead of Erling Haaland, if there's a clear frontrunner in the Matheus Cunha or Bryan Mbeumo debate, managers may also want a defensive asset to start with too.</p>
<p>Plus, if we should expect more signings following the arrivals of Youri Tielemans and Andrey Santos, the future of Marcus Rashford and coverage of squad depth.


