      <title>Brighton with Sam Murray | Correspondent Week ep. 1 | Planet FPL 2026/27</title>
      <description>Welcome to Planet FPL's biggest week of the year, it's Correspondent Week! 20 Podcasts across the next five days on each Premier League club with the Planet FPL Correspondents.

First up,  Brighton Correspondent Sam Murray joins James to discuss The Seagulls, and they start their season officially the night before the GW1 deadline with a trip to the Arctic Circle in the Conference League!

Discussion features new signings like Pascal Struijk and Luka Vuskovic, the departures of Jan Paul Van Hecke and and Danny Welbeck and all the possible FPL options to consider.

Bart Verbruggen, defensive options, Pascal Gross, Diego Gomez and even a forward may all catch FPL managers eyes on the Correspondednt Week opener!



Next on Correspondent Week: ep.2 with Mark Sutherns on Nottingham Forest

And later today: ep.3 with Gary Mantle on Chelsea, and ep.4 with Alex Trembath on Manchester United

And on Patreon: The Debrief with Suj on today's four Podcasts (BT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (IT+)



The full schedule for Correspondent Week can be found here: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl/posts/correspondent-166192123







