<p>First up,  Brighton Correspondent Sam Murray joins James to discuss The Seagulls, and they start their season officially the night before the GW1 deadline with a trip to the Arctic Circle in the Conference League!</p>
<p>Discussion features new signings like Pascal Struijk and Luka Vuskovic, the departures of Jan Paul Van Hecke and and Danny Welbeck and all the possible FPL options to consider.</p>
<p>Bart Verbruggen, defensive options, Pascal Gross, Diego Gomez and even a forward may all catch FPL managers eyes on the Correspondednt Week opener!</p>
