      <title>The Weekender ep. 43 | Planet FPL 2026</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

*  Thomas Tuchel's England DNA comments

* World Cup Final and half time show

* Ins and Outs at Aston Villa

* Arsenal concern for William Saliba

* Latest Premier League done deals

* First thoughts for FPL 2026/27

* Planet FPL in August




