    <item>
      <title>The Fallout: France 0-2 Spain | Planet FPL 2026</title>
      <description>David and James cover all the key talking points from last night's semi final as Spain outclassed favourites France in Dallas.

What went wrong for The French?

Have we underestimated Spain?

The key moments, tactics, individual performances all covered, and a question that tonight's winner will solve, just how do you beat Spain!?



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fallout on England v Argentina



Today on Patreon: The Story of England v Argentina (IT+) &amp; On This Day (AT)



