        <![CDATA[<p>David and James cover all the key talking points from last night's semi final as Spain outclassed favourites France in Dallas.</p>
<p>What went wrong for The French?</p>
<p>Have we underestimated Spain?</p>
<p>The key moments, tactics, individual performances all covered, and a question that tonight's winner will solve, just how do you beat Spain!?</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fallout on England v Argentina</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: The Story of England v Argentina (IT+) &amp; On This Day (AT)</p>
