<p>World Cup Conversation includes, Harry Kane's round of Golf with Donald Trump, football 'coming home',  Vozinha and other previously unkown players on the move, lack of shocks in the knockouts, Roberto Martinez links to Scotland, Mexico players had to decline 'gifts', players receiving death threats and Erling Haaland being humble.</p>
<p>Plus, Will Salt gets a permanent role at Southampton, Bournemouth's new kit, Alex Jimenez and Mason Greenwood are on the move and more.</p>
