      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

*  France 2-0 Morocco

* Norway v England preview

* Bruno Guimaraes links to Arsenal

* New signings at Newcastle &amp; Chelsea

* Andrey Santos to Man Utd

* Round-up of latest Premier League moves





