    <item>
      <title> That Show With Nico ep. 13 | Planet FPL 2026</title>
      <description>A relaxed chat with Nico and James about some hot topics at the World Cup disappointment for Nico with Portugal's performance and defeat to Spain last night.

There's discussion on Cristiano Ronaldo and Roberto Martinez following Portugal's elimination; Rodri got caught on camera, and he and Bernardo Silva appeared to fall out during the game; Cape Verde's brilliant effort against Argentina on Friday and Vozinha's 'gifts'; refereeing in the knockout stages; England winning in Mexico and The Mexicans previous victory against Ecuador; 'covering your mouth' red cards; the spooky coincidence involving Justin Kluivert and his father; plus Donald Trump's involvement in the Florian Balogun red card appeal and the USA's elimination last night







Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Last 16 Review



Today on Patreon: The Patreon QNA (IT+) &amp; Highlights from last night's Portugal-Spain Watchalong (AT)



The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl/posts/content-schedule-163031086




