      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>A relaxed chat with Nico and James about some hot topics at the World Cup disappointment for Nico with Portugal's performance and defeat to Spain last night.</p>
<p>There's discussion on Cristiano Ronaldo and Roberto Martinez following Portugal's elimination; Rodri got caught on camera, and he and Bernardo Silva appeared to fall out during the game; Cape Verde's brilliant effort against Argentina on Friday and Vozinha's 'gifts'; refereeing in the knockout stages; England winning in Mexico and The Mexicans previous victory against Ecuador; 'covering your mouth' red cards; the spooky coincidence involving Justin Kluivert and his father; plus Donald Trump's involvement in the Florian Balogun red card appeal and the USA's elimination last night</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Last 16 Review</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: The Patreon QNA (IT+) &amp; Highlights from last night's Portugal-Spain Watchalong (AT)</p>
<p>

