<p>David and James are still up having not slept since full time and discuss all the key talking points from a tie that began with kick off shenanigans, and ended with a freak injury.</p>
<p>In between Jude Bellingham delivered, Anthony Gordon impressed, there were three big refereeing decisions and The Three Lions fought like heroes to get over the line.</p>
<p>This was a night (and morning!) to celebrate for England fans, but there is still much to improve on. There's discussion on a shift in some of Thomas Tuchel's tactics and a look ahead to Saturday's Quarter Final against Erling Haaland's Norway.</p>
