      <title>Ask James | Wednesday July 1st | Planet FPL 2026</title>
      <description>On James' live stream today coverage of the latest from the World Cup as Mexico booked a place in the last 16 and await England if they win today, and France cruised to victory in Sweden and look a cut above the rest at the tournament.

Plus, have transfer talk is on the agenda with Tottenham agreeing a deal with West Ham for Matheus Fernandes and are also pushing for Sandro Tonali too. What is going on?





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fallout - England vs DR Congo



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; On This Day (AT)



The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl/posts/content-schedule-162372704





