      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On James' live stream today coverage of the latest from the World Cup as Mexico booked a place in the last 16 and await England if they win today, and France cruised to victory in Sweden and look a cut above the rest at the tournament.</p>
<p>Plus, have transfer talk is on the agenda with Tottenham agreeing a deal with West Ham for Matheus Fernandes and are also pushing for Sandro Tonali too. What is going on?</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fallout - England vs DR Congo</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; On This Day (AT)</p>
<p>

The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
