      <title>The Weekender ep. 40 | Planet FPL 2026</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Switzerland clinching Group B

* What Scotland need to make it through

* Brazil getting the best out of Vini Jr

* South Africa qualifying

* Ecuador's win against Germany

* Draws suited Japan-Sweden &amp; Australia-Paraguay

* Permutations for qualification and Last 32

* Elliot Anderson set to join Man City

* FIFA Fantasy knockout Chip usage discussion





Today on Patreon:  Quiz on World Cup Final Group Stage Games (IT+) &amp; Nico's Corner (AT)



