<p>* What Scotland need to make it through</p>
<p>* Brazil getting the best out of Vini Jr</p>
<p>* South Africa qualifying</p>
<p>* Ecuador's win against Germany</p>
<p>* Draws suited Japan-Sweden &amp; Australia-Paraguay</p>
<p>* Permutations for qualification and Last 32</p>
<p>* Elliot Anderson set to join Man City</p>
<p>* FIFA Fantasy knockout Chip usage discussion</p>
