      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On James' live stream, reaction to yesterday's World Cup games that saw Kylian Mbappe and Erling Haaland both score twice, while Lionel Messi went one better by recording a hat-trick.</p>
<p>There's tips for MD2 in FIFA Fantasy that features a focus on assets from Brazil and Ecuador and why using Mbappe as a 12th man doesn't feel quite right.</p>
<p>Plus, thoughts on England ahead of tonight's opener against Croatia, new rules implementation at the World Cup, and there's discussion on transfers including Tottenham having a deal agreed for Jan Paul Van Hecke and surprise links to Newcastle's Sandro Tonali.</p>
<p><br></p>
