    <item>
      <title>World Cup Preview: The Last Word | Planet FPL 2026</title>
      <description>With the World Cup starting tonight James gives his final thoughts on the tournament and for FIFA Fantasy in a short solo Podcast.

James covers England's win over Costa Rica, some updated team news that impacts FIFA Fantasy, David has sent a draft in and James covers his own current 15 choices and his final dilemmas.

Plus, thoughts on some of the controversies and concerns around the tournament, the favourites to win the competition and a reminder of Planet FPL's coverage during the tournament



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.38



