        <![CDATA[<p>With the World Cup starting tonight James gives his final thoughts on the tournament and for FIFA Fantasy in a short solo Podcast.</p>
<p>James covers England's win over Costa Rica, some updated team news that impacts FIFA Fantasy, David has sent a draft in and James covers his own current 15 choices and his final dilemmas.</p>
<p>Plus, thoughts on some of the controversies and concerns around the tournament, the favourites to win the competition and a reminder of Planet FPL's coverage during the tournament</p>
