      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On part 2 of 3 of our World Cup previews of the tournament and for FIFA Fantasy, David and James assess Groups E, F, G and H.</p>
<p>There's views on the four group favourites, Germany, The Netherlands, Belgium and Spain; the nations who could threaten them and discussion on some of the less familiar countries.</p>
<p>Will Yamal be risked in the opener? Why picking Spain players for Fantasy may be more complicated than it looks. Intrigue around Japan, Uruguay and more...</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: World Cup Final Thoughts with James</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: FPL At World Cups Quiz with Gary Robinson (IT+)</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>

