      <title>The Weekender ep. 35 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Freiburg 0-3 Aston Villa

*English dominance in Europa competitions

* The Southampton 'Spygate' scandal conclusion

*Celtic 3-1 Hearts

* Serie A &amp; La Liga Final Day Preview

* England World Cup Squad

* GW38 Free Hit Drafts





