    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Thursday May 21st | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>The concern for FPL managers that their assets may miss out on final day is real. Punts are discussed, but so much about Sunday depends on what we hear from respective managers in their press conferences.

So maybe investing in what's safe for minutes is best...?

Plus, congratulations to Villa, latest on the battle to stay up, Alonso at Chelsea, if Arsenal will be favourites next season, England's World Cup squad and more...





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender



Today on Patreon:  Tot&amp;Ham (IT+) &amp; What The Numbers Say (IT+)



The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-158539987




Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
