      <itunes:subtitle></itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>Arsenal are Champions. Through gritted teeth James concedes that they deserve it. Suj agrees. But what it's difficult to agree on is about what happens next for FPL managers for final day.

Do Arsenal and Man City now rotate on final day?

There's coverage of Arsenal's victory against Burnley, City's draw at a once again impressive Bournemouth who have secured Europa League qualification at minimum. 

And Tottenham lost at Chelsea meaning they may still need a point on final day to stay up.

There's a look at all the final day fixtures and the players under consideration for purchase.





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, scheduled for 1130am BST



Today on Patreon: When The England Squad Shocks with Ony Dozie (BT+) &amp; Away Days; Chelsea (AT)





The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-158539987





