<p>Do Arsenal and Man City now rotate on final day?</p>
<p>There's coverage of Arsenal's victory against Burnley, City's draw at a once again impressive Bournemouth who have secured Europa League qualification at minimum. </p>
<p>And Tottenham lost at Chelsea meaning they may still need a point on final day to stay up.</p>
<p>There's a look at all the final day fixtures and the players under consideration for purchase.</p>
