      <title>Fulham v Newcastle | CotC with Lewis James &amp; Simon Bibby | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>James has long had a feeling that this fixture could be the one in Gameweek 38 that 'goes off'. But is that correct?

On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Fulham fan Lewis James and Newcastle fan Simon Bibby to gauge their views on whether Fantasy managers should be looking at their clubs for final day investment.

Antonee Robinson is on pens (maybe), Will Osula is on fire with 6 in his last 6, but a deeper look tells us Fulham are not scoring freely, that said Newcastle are 15 without a clean sheet.

Plus, are Marcos Silva and Eddie Howe staying or going? What's the future for Harry Wilson and Anthony Gordon? The importance of Bruno Guimaraes and more.





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 55 | GW37 Review Part 2



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; Euro Focus: Freiburg (AT)



The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-158539987







