<p>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Fulham fan Lewis James and Newcastle fan Simon Bibby to gauge their views on whether Fantasy managers should be looking at their clubs for final day investment.</p>
<p>Antonee Robinson is on pens (maybe), Will Osula is on fire with 6 in his last 6, but a deeper look tells us Fulham are not scoring freely, that said Newcastle are 15 without a clean sheet.</p>
<p>Plus, are Marcos Silva and Eddie Howe staying or going? What's the future for Harry Wilson and Anthony Gordon? The importance of Bruno Guimaraes and more.</p>
