      <title>Ask James | Thursday May 14th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream today lots of FPL Dilemmas covered, including best three Arsenal assets, what to do now with City and Palace assets following the game last night, differentials for discussion and the importance of holding some transfers back for final day.

Plus, thoughts on many of the weekend fixture, the title race, who will stay up, the quality of current Premier League managers, team of the season, nostalgia and more...





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.34 and later on YouTube James presents the GW37 Deadline Stream live, in partnership with FPL Team, at 530pm BST



Today on Patreon: The Fallout: Man City 3-0 Crystal Palace (BT+) &amp; The Midweek FPL Dilemma (AT)



The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/posts/157921345









