      <itunes:subtitle></itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>A relaxed chat with Nico and James on an assortment of football related topics.

On the Podcast discussion includes reaction to Tottenham's draw with Leeds, bust ups at Real Madrid, the problem with incorporating individual superstars like Kylian Mbappe into off the ball pressing structures, players trying to make peace with fans after a bad result and booking accommodation in advance for European finals.

Plus, former Tottenham forward Carlos Vinicius had an eventful game in Brazil, also in Brazil a player was sent off for an 'interesting' gesture, thoughts on illegal streaming, Michael Olise doesn't speak much (or French ) and more...





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Manchester United v Nottingham Forest with Alex Trembath &amp; Mark Sutherns



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; Slack Stories (AT)



The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/posts/157921345







