      <title>The Weekender ep. 32 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Man Utd 2-1 Brentford

* PSG 5-4 Bayern

* Atleti 1-1 Arsenal

* Forest 1-0 Villa

* Shakhtar 1-3 Palace

* Scott Parker leaves Burnley by Mutual consent

* EFL Final Day permutations

* National League Final Day &amp; Play Offs

* GW35 Free Hit and Wildcard Drafts



Later on Planet FPL; James presents the GW35 Deadline Stream, in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 530pm BST





Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW35 Preview (BT+) &amp; The GW35 Team News Stream at 330pm BST (IT+)





