    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Wednesday April 29th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James live stream, lots of FPL dilemmas answered, featuring playing the Bench Boost, differentiating from the template, GW35 captaincy, Chelsea assets, Tottenham assets (yes really!), waiting for the right moment for Arsenal assets, Palace assets for the double, benching dilemmas and more.

Plus, reaction to last night's thriller in Paris.



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Wolves v Sunderland with Bradley Parker &amp; Spencer Barrowman



Today on Patreon: Quiz with Gary Robinson (IT+) * The Midweek FPL Dilemma (AT) 





The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/posts/156649918









