    <item>
      <title>Aston Villa v Tottenham | CotC with Lee Jackson &amp; Ricky Saunders | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson and Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders to discuss the latest at their clubs ahead of Sunday night's meeting at Villa Park.

Villa should have a top 5 place all but sealed despite Saturday's defeat at Fulham, but is the priority now the Europa League with their all English semi final with Nottingham Forest on the horizon?

Does that give Tottenham, stuck in the relegation zone and depleted by further injuries, a chance at Villa? And can they get out of this and stay up?

Plus, all the key FPL assets covered including expected minutes moving forward for Morgan Rogers and Ollie Watkins, if Antonin Kinsky will keep his place in goal and if 'Relegation Richy' should be sought for the run-in.



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for 1pm BST with an audio Podacst posted shortly after conclusion



Today on Patreon: UCL Fantasy Preview (IT+) &amp; Away Days; Wolves (AT)





The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/posts/156649918








