<p>West Ham have shown great spirit and form to get themselves out if the relegation zone, can they finish the job?</p>
<p>Whilst Everton remain in strong contention for European qualification despite Sunday's disappointing Merseyside Derby defeat.</p>
<p>All the key FPL assets covered, from two teams were the line-ups feel predictable. Including the keepers, Konstantinos Mavropanos, Crysencio Summerville, Jarrod Bowen, Michael Keane, Beto and Everton's midfield options.</p>
<p>

