      <title>Ask James | Wednesday April 22nd | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, plenty of coverage for those on a Free Hit this week and, yes some people really do want to get players from a team who haven't won this calendar year!

James reveals the players of interest to him this week, advice for managers running through the week and there's also coverage of having convictions in decision making in Fantasy when wanting to take on the template. 

Plus latest thoughts on the futures of Arne Slot and Liam Rosenior following that disaster from Chelsea last night.  



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: s9 Ep50 GW33 Review Part 2



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; Talking Tactics on Man City 2-1 Arsenal (AT)




The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post:
