      <title>The Weekender ep. 31 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Man Utd 1-2 Leeds

* Iraola's decision to leave Bournemouth at the end of the season

* Liverpool 0-2 PSG

* Atletico Madrid 1-2 Barcelona

* Bayern Munich 4-3 Real Madrid

* Arsenal 0-0 Sporting

* Remembering Alex Manninger

* Europa League round-up

* Europa Conference League round-up

* GW33 Free Hit Drafts

* GW33 Wildcard Drafts





