        <![CDATA[<p>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:</p>
<p>* Man Utd 1-2 Leeds</p>
<p>* Iraola's decision to leave Bournemouth at the end of the season</p>
<p>* Liverpool 0-2 PSG</p>
<p>* Atletico Madrid 1-2 Barcelona</p>
<p>* Bayern Munich 4-3 Real Madrid</p>
<p>* Arsenal 0-0 Sporting</p>
<p>* Remembering Alex Manninger</p>
<p>* Europa League round-up</p>
<p>* Europa Conference League round-up</p>
<p>* GW33 Free Hit Drafts</p>
<p>* GW33 Wildcard Drafts</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL; James presents the GW33 Deadline Stream, in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am BST</p>
<p><br></p>
