      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>A relaxed chat with Nico and James on assortment of football related topics.</p>
<p>On the Podcast discussion features FPL, Cost of football tickets, YouTube 'fans', Italy's failure to qualify for the World Cup and fans at the tournament, England losing to Japan, fans being in the 'wrong end' and family members being in away ends, Nico tests James on his knowledge of a Tottenham game from 20 years ago, Rayan Cherki and showboating, being the main man in a team versus a squad member with a title challenger, if players can be born with talent, retraining positions, everyone starting out as a forward and lots more...  </p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Burnley v Brighton with Jack Toner &amp; Sam Murray</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham with Shamil Gillani (IT+) &amp; The Midweek FPL Dilemma (IT+)</p>
<p><br></p>
