<p>So what now for Chip Strategy? David joins James for a detailed discussion and a look at the different paths managers can take for the FPL run-in, including the big predicament facing many Wildcarders. Should they really make their GW32 team look worse to get a better GW33 Bench Boost!?</p>
<p>Alternatives for those with all chips intact are covered, and we've not forgotten those who are short of chips either.</p>
<p>There's focus on Wildcard 32v35 and why the right answer for some might be neither, free hit 33v34, what's likely to happen with the still unarranged Manchester City versus Crystal Palace fixture, Bench Boost opportunities and concerns plus lots more...</p>
