      <title>The Weekender ep. 29 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Carabao Cup Final Review

* Mo Salah is leaving Liverpool

* Battle for Champions League qualification

* England Squad and who might make the World Cup squad

* World Cup Play Offs preview





Planet FPL will return on Tuesday April 7th with out final Chips &amp; Strategy Podcast of the season!



