      <title>The Weekender ep. 27 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Could Man City v Crystal Palace now go into GW31 or GW32?

* GW30 FPL Captaincy

* Galatasaray 1-0 Liverpool

* Atletico Madrid 5-2 Tottenham

* Newcastle 1-1 Barcelona

* Leverkusen 1-1 Arsenal

* Bodo/Glimt &amp; Bayern Munich victories

* Real Madrid 3-0 Man City

* PSG 5-2 Chelsea

* Lille 0-1 Aston Villa

* Nottingham Forest 0-1 Midtjylland

* Europa League &amp; Conference League round-up

* GW30 Free Hit Drafts

* GW30 Wildcard Drafts





Tomorrow  on Planet FPL: James presents the GW30 Deadline Stream, in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel, at 1230pm GMT



