<p>The Podcast features a look at when may be best for chip usage and alternatives for those who may have used chips, why GWs 35-38 could have an impact on whether FPL managers Free Hit in 33 or 34, what may happen to Manchester City v Crystal Palace if it doesn't go into DGW33, an upcoming timeline of events to take note of that can move projections again, the important role of TV revisited and lots more including a strong warning to be careful for those planning to Wildcard in GW32 and Bench Boost in DGW33.</p>
