      <title>Ask James | Wednesday March 4th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon, early thoughts for GW30, discussion on chip strategy ideas under worse case scenarios, the importance of what can be learned over the next week.

Plus, Wolves and if they could yet pull of a miracle escape, Arne Slot's future, race foe European qualification and lots more...



