      <title>Newcastle v Man Utd | CotC with Simon Bibby &amp; Alex Trembath | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents it's a meeting of the United's as James is joined by Newcastle fan Simon Bibby and Manchester United fan Alex Trembath ahead of Wednesday's games at St James's Park... but both are in contrasting form.

Manchester United have 6 wins and a draw from Michael Carrick's first 7 games and are now up to third - is the interim manager making himself the choice for the full time gig?

Over the same 7 Gameweeks Newcastle have only picked up four points and the pressure is mounting on Eddie Howe.

Plus FPL chat on the likes of Malick Thiaw, Anthony Gordon, Bryan Mbeumo and the in-form Benjamin Sesko.

And of course, Bruno Fernandes. Whom may be in line for another big proportion of the captaincy split with doubt over Erling Haaland. But should he be...?



Later on Planet FPL: James presents the GW29 Deadline Stream in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 5pm GMT 



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, scheduled for 1pm GMT on YouTube with an audio posted shortly after conclusion



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; Talking Tactics (AT &amp; IT+)






The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/posts/152025808








