      <title>The Weekender ep. 25 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Everton 0-1 Man Utd

* Champions League 2nd leg discussion

* Europa League &amp; Conference League round-up

* Ouattara v Rayan v Wilson for FPL

* GW28 Free Hit Drafts

* GW28 Wildcard Drafts

* James details why he is now likely to activate his Bench Boost chip this week!

* Breaking news on the Champions League Draw



Later on Planet FPL: James presents The GW28 Deadline stream in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 530pm GMT



Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW28 Preview (IT+) &amp; The Team News Stream (AT)





