        <![CDATA[<p>Why Wildcard now? For Suj and James, their strategy will likely be to wait for Gameweek 32 ahead of doubles and blanks, but there are plenty who are going now.</p>
<p>Suj and James explore why many are making the decision to Wildcard now, including teams that could have assets that are desirable, and assets that may be binned.</p>
<p>And very importantly there's a look at strategy ideas for those on Wildcard, including understanding future fixture swings, the impact on Chip usage, including if it means a bench boost should be used soon, how to mask potential deficiencies for DGW33, squad depth, managing BGW31, the importance of rolling transfers and a look at a possible draft.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Chelsea v West Ham United with Gary Mantle &amp; Chris Stone</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; Away Days: Burnley 24/1/26 (AT)</p>
