      <title>Ask James | Wednesday January 21st | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James live stream this afternoon lots of FPL discussion, including what to do with Manchester City assets, including the prospect of taking an under par Erling Haaland on; Bruno Fernandes and the appeal of other Manchester United assets, defensive enablers, midfielders desired, benching dilemmas, and Tottenham won, and played well last night. But was it a one off?



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Transfer Window Show



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham QNA (BT+) &amp; What The Numbers Say (AT)





