      <title>The Weekender ep. 19 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Was Macclesfield beating Crystal Palace the greatest ever FA Cup shock?

* Newcastle 0-2 Man City

* The Semenyo disallowed goal

* Wenger's offside proposal blocked

* Chelsea 2-3 Arsenal

* Manchester Derby tactical and selection preview

* GW22 Free Hit Drafts

* GW22 Wildcard Drafts



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW22 Deadline stream in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT 



Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (IT+) &amp; The Team News Stream (AT)






