    <item>
      <title>Chips &amp; Strategy | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 34 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>It's that time of year, where January arrives, the FA Cup 3rd round has gone &amp; the Carabao Cup Final can be projected. That means for FPL managers it's time to think seriously about what to do with chips.

Suj and James discuss the calendar for the rest of the season, understanding permutations and fixture projections to give an overview of when might be best to save chips for.

Wildcard now or save it?

Could there be a Double Gameweek soon?

There will also be a popular template strategy... but there needs to be an awareness that it could all change!



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.18



Today on Patreon: Money in Football (IT+) &amp; Talking Tactics (AT)





The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/148018953






