        <![CDATA[<p>It's that time of year, where January arrives, the FA Cup 3rd round has gone &amp; the Carabao Cup Final can be projected. That means for FPL managers it's time to think seriously about what to do with chips.</p>
<p>Suj and James discuss the calendar for the rest of the season, understanding permutations and fixture projections to give an overview of when might be best to save chips for.</p>
<p>Wildcard now or save it?</p>
<p>Could there be a Double Gameweek soon?</p>
<p>There will also be a popular template strategy... but there needs to be an awareness that it could all change!</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.18</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: Money in Football (IT+) &amp; Talking Tactics (AT)</p>
