      <title>Ask James | Wednesday January 14th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon Chelsea assets are wanted by FPL managers but do we need more information before we invest? And should Cole Palmer be avoided?

There's also discussion on keeping unwanted players because there's nowhere to go, benching dilemmas, holding four Man City assets, midfielders and lots more...




Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s9 ep34 'Chip Strategy'



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; The Midweek FPL Dilemma (IT+)




