    <item>
      <title>Amorim And United | The Fan View with Alex Trembath | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>Manchester United Correspondent Alex Trembath joins James to discuss the state of United following the recent departure of Ruben Amorim.

There's reflection on Amorim's tenure and how off field influences led to a clash behind the scenes and ultimately his departure.

Who is in charge at the club? How much influence do the likes of Jason Wilcox and Omar Berrada have?

And what's next? Michael Carrick looks set to take interim charge; what can we expect in the short-term from him with a squad that may well be imbalanced? 

 

Follow Alex on Twitter/x: https://x.com/FPL_Odyssey



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Wolves v Newcastle with Bradley Parker &amp; Simon Bibby



Today on Patreon: The Patreon QNA (BT+) &amp; Nico's Corner (AT)






