      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Manchester United Correspondent Alex Trembath joins James to discuss the state of United following the recent departure of Ruben Amorim.</p>
<p>There's reflection on Amorim's tenure and how off field influences led to a clash behind the scenes and ultimately his departure.</p>
<p>Who is in charge at the club? How much influence do the likes of Jason Wilcox and Omar Berrada have?</p>
<p>And what's next? Michael Carrick looks set to take interim charge; what can we expect in the short-term from him with a squad that may well be imbalanced? </p>
<p> </p>
<p>Follow Alex on Twitter/x: https://x.com/FPL_Odyssey</p>
