    <item>
      <title>That Show With Nico ep. 4 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>Nico 'the icon' Semedo is back on the Podcast with James, for a laid back chat about various topics from the World of football over the last month.

Topics covered include, James' GW20, Thomas Frank and the 'Arsenal cup' incident; chat on African Cup of Nations including great names, fans, refs and controversy around selection in the Cameroon squad; the true meaning of 'there's no easy games', record goalscorers and records that might not be broken;  the top 10 players going to the World Cup; managers who select their children to play; Wayne Rooney's charity victory and more, including where's Zinedine Zidane?



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: s9 ep33 GW21 Review



Today on Patreon: Tot &amp; Ham (IT+) &amp; Away Days: Bournemouth (IT+)





The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/147427430






