      <title>The Weekender ep. 17 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

*Wolves 1-4 Manchester United

*Inter Milan 0-1 Liverpool

*Liverpool v Brighton preview

*Round-up of English teams in Europe

*World Cup Draw

*GW16 Free Hit Drafts

*GW16 Wildcard Drafts

*Daniel Munoz replacements



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW16 Deadline stream in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 1230pm GMT 



Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (BT) &amp; The Team News Stream (IT)







