      <title>Ask James | Thursday December 11th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon, lots of moves are being made with FPL managers holding 5 free transfers. Discussion includes replacing Daniel Munoz, the want for Arsenal assets this week, captaincy, mid priced midfielders, keeping faith with forwards, considering rotation and lots more...



