        <![CDATA[<p>On James' live stream this afternoon, lots of moves are being made with FPL managers holding 5 free transfers. Discussion includes replacing Daniel Munoz, the want for Arsenal assets this week, captaincy, mid priced midfielders, keeping faith with forwards, considering rotation and lots more...</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.17</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: AFCON Preview with Ony Dozie (BT) &amp; Talking Tactics on Adam Wharton (IT)






