      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On Clash of the Correspondents, James welcomes Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson and Wolves fan Bradley Parker to discuss the latest at their club ahead of Sunday's meeting at Villa Park.</p>
<p>It's 6 wins in 7 for Villa and they are now bang in form and will expect another victory at the weekend. Morgan Rogers will be popular for Free Hitters this week but who else should be considered?</p>
<p>And what's the mood at Wolves since Vitor Pereira's sacking and the appointment of Middlesbrough manager Rob Edwards? They've only picked up two points in twelve games; is there any way they could yet pull off a miraculous escape?</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Follow Lee on Twitter/x: https://x.com/Lee_Jackson_92</p>
<p>Follow Bradley on Twitter/x: https://x.com/parker_bradley</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for 3pm GMT with an audio to follow shortly after conclusion</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: Ham&amp;Ars (BT+) &amp; Slack Stories (AT)










</p>
<p>The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/144249766</p>
