      <title>Ask James | Wednesday November 19th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>It's yellow and amber central on the FPL website currently with several key and template players flagged. James offers solutions and some calm on his live stream today.

There's also coverage of captaincy for the weekend, benching dilemmas, players on radar and considering the short-term when it comes to considering attacking options.

Plus, discussion on England, Scotland and the World Cup too.



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.14



Today on Patreon: Quiz with Nico Semedo on Portugal at major tournaments (IT+) &amp; The Midweek FPL Dilemma (AT)










