    <item>
      <title>The Clayton And James Show ep. 44 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Clayton and James Show...

*Clayton's trip to See Atletico Ottawa and the 'icycle kick'

*Antoine Semenyo's release clause

*Albania 0-2 England

*Greece 3-2 Scotland

*Hungary 2-3 Republic of Ireland

*OTD: France 1-1 Republic of Ireland (2009) - The Thierry Henry handball incident https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4RMSY5S9BA





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for 12pm GMT with an audio of the stream posted shortly after conclusion



Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars (IT+) &amp; What The Numbers Say (IT+)









The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/143760468









