      <title>The Weekender ep. 13 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Ireland 2-0 Portugal

* England 2-0 Serbia

* World Cup Qualifying round-up

* Fulham and speculation around Marco Silva's future

* Harvey Elliott's lack of minutes at Aston Villa

* Wolves v Crystal Palace tactics preview

* And 10 FPL dilemmas. Player A vs Player B



