      <title>The Weekender ep. 11 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Brendan Rogers departure from Celtic

* Carabao Cup round-up including defeats for Liverpool and Tottenham

* Could Crystal Palace's victory now cause blanks and double pre Christmas?

* Enzo Maresca admitting to not expecting Sunderland to play a back five at Chelsea

* Sunderland v Everton preview

* GW10 Free Hit &amp; Wildcard Drafts



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW10 Deadline Stream, in partnership with FPL Team, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 1230pm BST



Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (IT+) &amp; The GW10 Team News Stream (AT)





