      <title>Ask James | Thursday October 30th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, lots of FPL dilemmas covered ahead of Saturday's Gameweek 10 deadline, including Crystal Palace players are on agenda with Daniel Munoz, Ismaila Sarr and Jean-Philippe Mateta all appearing popular.

Plus, the potential monster who some want to sell but may want to get back, advice for Viktor Gyokeres and Joao Pedro owners, Triple captaincy, Bench Boost and Wildcard coverage and more...



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.11 with David &amp; James



Today on Patreon: Football in Easter Europe Quiz with Milan Rysavy (IT+) &amp; Away Days: Newcastle 29/10/25 (AT)











