      <title>The Clayton And James Show ep. 43 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Clayton and James Show...

*Discussion on Clayton's FPL team

*Increase in direct football and long throws in the Premier League

*Inconvenience to fans of fixture movements

*Euro Focus: Swedish title winners Mjallby

