      <title>Ask James | Thursday October 23rd | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream following his trip to Monaco to see another lacklustre Tottenham display the majority of questions focus on FPL dilemmas for GW9. There's coverage on flipping Gyokeres to Saka, other Arsenal assets, Enzo Fernandez, the big upcoming appeal of Crystal Palace's assets, benching dilemmas, cheap defenders, captaincy and lots more...



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.10 with David and James



Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham (BT+) &amp; Away Days: Monaco (IT+)









