<p>For West Ham, Monday's horror show against Brentford has caused real concern that they themselves face a genuine fight to stay up. There's a deep dive into Nuno Espirito Santo's start and the failings in the Brentford loss.</p>
<p>Plus all the important FPL discussion features Joe Rodon, Dominic Calvert-Lewin, Lucas Paqueta and Jarrod Bowen.</p>
