      <title>The Weekender ep. 9 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the Weekender this week with David and James discussion features:

* Wales' defeat to Belgium

* England's victory in Latvia

* World Cup Qualifiers round-up

* Jordan Pickford's new contract &amp; Everton 'beef' with Lee Dixon

* Burnley v Leeds preview

* GW8 Free Hit Drafts

* GW8 Wildcard Drafts



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents The GW8 Deadline stream, in partnership with FPL Team, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am BST



Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (BT+) &amp; The GW8 Team News Stream (AT)





