<p>There's reflection of Leicester's title success and memories from it and reasons behind their successes, including their style and some of the statistics behind the triumph.</p>
<p>Could it ever happen again? </p>
<p>If a Bournemouth or Crystal Palace won the title now could it be compared? </p>
<p>Was Nottingham Forest's run last season as close as we may see to a stylistic comparison?</p>
<p>How might winning the title be achieved by an 'outsider?' </p>
<p>And even if it is, can it ever compare to what Leicester did?  </p>
