      <title>Ask James | Thursday October 9th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James live stream this afternoon, lots of FPL discussion, include the need to wait on after the internationals for Enzo Fernandez, several Arsenal assets, mid priced midfielders, frustrations on Bruno Fernandes, when we might see the best of Alexander Isak and lots more including too much football continued...



