    <item>
      <title>That Show With Nico  ep. 1  | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>A brand new monthly format as Planet FPL's very own editor and social media manager Nico (the icon) Semedo joins James for a discussion on various football topics that Nico thinks should have been covered recently on the Podcasts, that were missed.

Conversation includes Nico's FPL team, players taking their shirt off, Axel Disasi and Raheem Sterling being left in the cold at Chelsea, Tosin Adarabioyo's family matter, Joey Barton making an unusual claim, Mikel Arteta has had a new idea, Jean-Philippe Mateta kicking the corner flag, trying to understand the mind of a referee, Victor Boniface's intriguing social media content, Neymar's inheritance and the form of Florian Wirtz.



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.7 with Suj &amp; James and on the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents the GW7 Deadline Streamm in partnership with FPL Team at 530pm BST



Today on Patreon: Money in Football (IT+) &amp; What The Numbers Say (IT+)



The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/139987527





