      <itunes:summary>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson and Fulham fan Lewis James to discuss the latest at their clubs ahead of Sunday's GW6 meeting at Villa Park.

And there's only one place to start, what is going on at Villa!?

With only one goal scored, no wins, and Sunday's limp draw at ten man Sunderland the most recent result, an inquest is beginning in to what is going wrong for Villa.

Meanwhile, Fulham have started well, they've won the last two at their only defeat, at Chelsea, was certainly controversial.

Can Fulham add to Villa's woes on Sunday?

Plus, do Villa assets need binning on mass, or should faith be kept in the likes of Morgan Rogers and Ollie Watkins for the upcoming home games against Fulham and Burnley? 

And there's coverage too for FPL on Fulham assets including Joachim Andersen, Josh King and Rodrigo Muniz.



