      <title>Ask James | Wednesday September 24th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On Ask James today, lots of FPL dilemmas covered, including if managers should hesitate on activating the Triple Captaincy on Erling Haaland with the Manchester City forward flagged, benching dilemmas, DEFCON defenders versus attacking full-backs, Tottenham assets, Bruno Fernandes, plans for Arsenal, choices for Wildcarders and lots more...



