    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Thursday September 18th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon, lots of dilemmas covered ahead of Saturday's Gameweek 5 deadline with many viewers faced with some tough benching dilemmas, and non Haaland owners are making plans to get to him.

But the Manchester City forward won't be the favoured choice for the majority this week, and that leaves non Salah owners, like James, with a difficult choice.

Plus, thoughts on Amorim, Semenyo, Tottenham, Wildcards, Bench Boosts and lots more...




Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Weekender ep.5 with David and James

 

Today on Patreon: Money in Football (IT+) anf Talking Tactics on Brentford 2-2 Chelsea (AT)




The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/138901501







