<p>But the Manchester City forward won't be the favoured choice for the majority this week, and that leaves non Salah owners, like James, with a difficult choice.</p>
<p>Plus, thoughts on Amorim, Semenyo, Tottenham, Wildcards, Bench Boosts and lots more...
</p>
