      <title>Each Team's Best Eleven | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 13  | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>With the transfer window closed and the International break in full swing, Suj and James take stock and assess all 20 Premier League teams with discussion on who would sit in each team's best eleven.

Who's a certain starter?

Which new signings become automatic choices?

Who's at threat from rotation?

Who loses their place?

Over 250 players covered in 75 minutes. 



