    <item>
      <title>The Weekender ep. 2 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>David and James discuss some of the key talking points in football from this week and have a look ahead to the weekend including a focus on FPL decisions

This week:

* Manchester United losing to Grimsby and implications for Ruben Amorim

* Carabao Cup round-up

* Transfer talk on Ladislav Krejci, Matheus Fernandes, Tyler Dibling, Yeremy Pino, Nick Woltemade and Xavi Simons.

