<p>All the games reviewed, which featured another humbling for West Ham where Joao Pedro went big, Tottenham putting in a professional display at Manchester City and earning a deserved victory, Arsenal got five against Leeds, there were important wins for Brentford and Burnley and Liverpool won at Newcastle last night in dramatic fashion.</p>
<p>Transfer targets are a theme of the Podcast, particularly in the midfield area and there's a warning to consider the unknowns when thinking about many players of interest.</p>
<p><br></p>
