      <title>Final Drafts | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 9 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>With the new FPL season now only hours away Suj, James and Clayton join forces to discuss their intended GW1 selections (subject to today's Team News) and strategy ideas.

Will Salah and/or Haaland make it in?

Will Bench Boosts be activated?

Who just misses out?

And more...



Later today on Planet FPL: James presents the GW1 Deadline Stream Live, and in partnership with FPL, at 530pm BST exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel 



