      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>With the new FPL season now only hours away Suj, James and Clayton join forces to discuss their intended GW1 selections (subject to today's Team News) and strategy ideas.</p>
<p>Will Salah and/or Haaland make it in?</p>
<p>Will Bench Boosts be activated?</p>
<p>Who just misses out?</p>
<p>And more...</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Later today on Planet FPL: James presents the GW1 Deadline Stream Live, and in partnership with FPL, at 530pm BST exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel </p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (IT+) and The Team News Stream in partnership with FPL Team at 330pm BST (AT)

</p>
<p>The full Planet FPL schedule for this week can be found via this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/136179749</p>
