      <title>Ask James | Thursday August 14th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>James is back from Italy and feeling the heartbreak of Tottenham narrowly missing out on beating Paris St Germain, but very proud of the effort given in alternative system last night.

The stream begins with thoughts on the game and the impact now on thinking for Tottenham FPL assets before taking on the questions as usual with a variety of topics covered, including the possibility of more penalties this season, players of preference at specific price points and lots more...



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Final Drafts with Suj, James and Clayton and then at 530pm BST exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel James presents The GW1 Deadline Stream Live



Today on Patreon: Ham&amp;Ars (IT+) and Away Days: The Super Cup Final (AT)



