        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James discuss Chip Strategy with a detailed look at opportunities during the first half of the season to use the Wildcard, Free Hit, Bench Boost and Triple Captain Chips.</p>
<p>There's a search for opportunities, caution offered for overplanning for the Bench Boost, circumstances that can make Free Hits appeal to some but not offers.</p>
<p>How much weightage should be put into planning for a Bench Boost or should we just hope it falls into place?</p>
<p>Two key Wildcard periods covered and there's coverage of an awareness of 'safe weeks' and danger weeks for Chip coverage. </p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James Live Stream (time TBC once James gets back from Italy!) with an audio to follow shortly after conclusion.</p>
<p><br></p>
