      <title>Sunderland with Spencer Barrowman | Correspondent Week ep.20 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On the conclusion of Correspondent Week James is joined by Spencer Barrowman to discuss all things Sunderland ahead of their return to the Premier League and they have enablers available and attractive first three fixtures.

Marc Guiu has joined from Chelsea and offers a legitimate 4.5 forward option for FPL managers, but is he the Sunderland attacker to start with? There's also 4.0 defensive options and a number of attractive midfield options.

They're all covered in a get-to-know the squad theme  that also includes discussion on manager Regis Le Bris, the ownership of the club and whether we can expect further signings.



Follow Spencer on on Twitter/x: https://x.com/FPL_Beery

