      <title>Wolves with Bradley Parker | Correspondent Week ep.15 | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>James has got the bleach ready after another difficult summer for Wolves with three key players leaving, yet despite some big concerns, even correspondent Bradley Parker has some interest in some Wolves assets.

There are standouts, forward Jorgen Strand Larsen, new signing Jhon Arias and defender Emmnauel Agbadou standout but there are others worthy of consideration too.

But FPL optimism is tempered by concern about general personnel with reinforcements needed to improve depth in some areas and a right wing-back is very much required. But will the owners spend?



Follow Bradley on on Twitter/x: https://x.com/parker_bradley

Next on Correspondent Week: ep.16 with Lee Jackson on Aston Villa

Tomorrow on Correspondent Week: Adam Pritchard on Arsenal, Sam Murray on Brighton, Ricky Saunders on Tottenham Hotspur and Spencer Barrowman on Sunderland

Tonight on Patreon: The Debrief with Suj on today's four Podcasts (IT+) and After The Podcast with today's Correspondents (AT)



