    <item>
      <title>Normal Service Resumed | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 6 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Suj and James are back from holidays to discuss all the latest key news for FPL with discussion on the latest and confirmed and likely deals with coverage on the likes of Victor Gyokeres, Alexander Isak, Morgan Gibbs-White, Goalkeeper moves and several interesting FPL enablers.

There's a reveal of, and conversation on, current FPL Drafts, including planned strategy for early Chip usage with debate on structure, Salah and Haaland, premium defenders, enablers and the impact of DEFCONs.

And there's an extended Q'N'A section featuring some of the hot topics on FPL managers minds.



Correspondent Week begins on Monday!



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Champions Again! with Lauren Harris on The Lionesses Euro's success



Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A (BT+) and Nico's Corner (IT+)





