    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Thursday July 17th | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On Ask James this week, conversation includes, Where's FPL!? Not even a price reveal yet, so what's happening? Conversation also includes discussion on strategy, players of interest and rumours around what may happen with the chips next season.

Plus, latest transfer rumours including discussion on Isak, Ekitike and Wissa; inevitably there's Tottenham chat and lots more including a plug for upcoming content, both for the general public and on Patreon.





Today on Patreon: Jack Blackbird hosts a Quiz on Opening weekends of the season and James presents One More Thing on Planet FPL plans going forward.








ALL CONTENT ON PLANET FPL PATREON IS FREE BETWEEN JULY 7TH AND JULY 17TH! SIMPLY SIGN UP AS A FREE MEMBER @ WWW.PATREON.COM/PLANETFPL







For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-134055945



