      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On Ask James this week, conversation includes, Where's FPL!? Not even a price reveal yet, so what's happening? Conversation also includes discussion on strategy, players of interest and rumours around what may happen with the chips next season.</p>
<p>Plus, latest transfer rumours including discussion on Isak, Ekitike and Wissa; inevitably there's Tottenham chat and lots more including a plug for upcoming content, both for the general public and on Patreon.</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: Jack Blackbird hosts a Quiz on Opening weekends of the season and James presents One More Thing on Planet FPL plans going forward.




