    <item>
      <title>Onside Vincenzo | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 4 with Craig Kemp &amp; Darren Addy | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>James is joined by Craig Kemp and Darren Addy, formerly of the Man On FPL podcast, and now going solo with their own YouTube channels for an FPL QNA.

There's discussion on Alexander Isak to Liverpool links and whether a deal being agreed can be foreseen and whether he would appeal for FPL irrespective of where he ends up.

There's questions covered on fixtures, captaincy and structure, the players on mind ahead of FPL's launch, potential early season surprise packages, defensive assets, player price predictions and lots more including some reminiscing about some FPL legends of the past.

And James's guests discuss their experience in content creation and their respective plans for their new channels.



Subscribe to Craig's YouTube Channel: https://www.youtube.com/@FPLVincenzo



Subscribe to Darren's YouTube Channel: https://www.youtube.com/@FPL_ONSIDE





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for 12pm BST with an audio to follow shortly after conclusion



Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham with Shamil Gilani and Talking Tactics on Chelsea's ability to change setup







