    <item>
      <title>Introducing Our Mini League Winner | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 3 with Jacob Hinchcliffe | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>James welcomes Planet FPL Mini League Winner Jacob Hinchcliffe to discuss the successes from his season which led to him finishing 56th in the World!

There's debate on Jacob's play style, how he did, comparisons with James' season and some of the mental challenges across a season that did even include one Gameweek rank outside the top ten million, and then the goal of getting into the top 100.

There's also discussion on Jacob's club Arsenal and a speculative chat on some of the potential FPL prices for the forthcoming season. 



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fan View with Brentford Correspondent Tom Medd



Today on Patreon: The Policing Of Football with JC and What The Numbers Say About James's 2024/25 Gameweek predictions



