      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>James welcomes Planet FPL Mini League Winner Jacob Hinchcliffe to discuss the successes from his season which led to him finishing 56th in the World!</p>
<p>There's debate on Jacob's play style, how he did, comparisons with James' season and some of the mental challenges across a season that did even include one Gameweek rank outside the top ten million, and then the goal of getting into the top 100.</p>
<p>There's also discussion on Jacob's club Arsenal and a speculative chat on some of the potential FPL prices for the forthcoming season. </p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fan View with Brentford Correspondent Tom Medd</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>Today on Patreon: The Policing Of Football with JC and What The Numbers Say About James's 2024/25 Gameweek predictions</p>
<p>

