      <title>Chelsea, Done Deals &amp; Speculation | The Transfer Window Show | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>Suj and James discuss all the key news featuring Premier League clubs in the transfer market over the last week which has included Chelsea agreeing deals for Jamie Bynoe-Gittens and Joao Pedro.

The imminent new arrivals are discussed and why there can be more moves expected involving The Blues.

There's also discussion on the latest stories featuring Arsenal, Aston Villa, Crystal Palace and Liverpool.

Kenny Tete and Antoine Semenyo have signed new deals and there's coverage of the done deals over the last week, which has featured moves by all three promoted clubs. 



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Club World Cup Last 16 Review



Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham (IT+) &amp; The Records (AT)



