    <item>
      <title>Rotation &amp; Pricing Of Defenders | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 2  | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>For years Trent Alexander-Arnold has been the highest priced defender in FPL, but with the right-back off to Madrid what should that mean for the pricing of defenders in FPL?

Suj and James deliberate who might come in as the most expensive and who that should be, discussing options from the expected top 3 of Arsenal, Liverpool and Manchester City.

There's also discussion about other assets such as Marc Cucurella, Lewis Hall, Daniel Munoz and Pedro Porro and where they should sit in the pricing.

Plus, should money be invested in premium defenders at all following last season and there's a look at some rotatable pairings that may well interest FPL managers for the start of the season.



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Women's Euros 2025 Preview with Lauren Harris



