    <item>
      <title>Club World Cup MW3 Review | Planet FPL 2025</title>
      <description>James discusses key moments from the final Group games at The Club World Cup and looks ahead to the upcoming last 16 ties.

There's a focus on Manchester City and their fluidity in last night's victory over Juventus, why Chelsea will fancy their chances in the competition now, the disappointment for the Argentinian sides and why on reflection we probably should have expected their neighbours from Brazil to out perform them.



