    <item>
      <title>PSR, The Confirmed &amp; The Rumoured | The Transfer Window Show | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>James discusses done deals at Bournemouth, Brighton, Crystal Palace, Leeds and Wolves over the last couple of weeks and discusses some of the big moves being rumoured.

That includes discussion on the likes of Anthony Elanga and Eberechi Eze, Arsenal's likely two ew central midfield players, their (and others) desire for a new number 9.

And why the June 30th deadline holds importance for clubs looking to comply with PSR and that features Crystal Palace.





Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Club World Cup Matchweek 3 Review



