    <item>
      <title>When To Wildcard | Chip Talk | Planet FPL 2025/26</title>
      <description>On Chip Talk James assesses opportunities to use the first Wildcard, using references from his 5 week rolling difficulty ticker to take a closer inspection at fixture swings and Gameweeks to attack.

There's analysis of activating early, looking at which teams may appeal during the first two International breaks and if there would be an escape for those considering a Gameweek 1 Bench Boost.

There's two London clubs who really appeal around GW8, but it may be that the Wildcard could be served best after the International break in November, or for some it may even appeal to wait for the Christmas period when the likes of Mohamed Salah will go to AFCON.



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for 12pm BST with an audio to follow shortly after conclusion.



Today on Patreon: What The Number Say (AT) and throughout the Week, The Forgotten Cups (IT+) 




For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-132057610




