    <item>
      <title>Captains &amp; Fixtures | Planet FPL S. 9 Ep. 1  | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Suj and James kick off their coverage for Season 9 of Planet FPL by assessing the schedules for all 20 clubs following the release of the 2025/26 fixtures with thoughts on who has it good and bad at various points throughout the season; including that all important start.

There's also discussion on the schedule with what's different from last season, what is likely to happen to fixtures postponed due to Cup commitments and there's discussion on captaincy with a look at who's best over the first 10 Gameweeks and whether Erling Haaland and Mohamed Salah can be taken on!



Today on Patreon: The 2024/25 Improbable Predictions (IT+) &amp; Projecting The Doubles (AT)



