      <description>On today's Ask James live stream lots of reaction to this morning's fixture announcement including who's got it good and bad and what it may mean  for Chip usage in FPL in the opening gameweeks.

Plus, more on Tottenham, when fans feel attacked in the media, FPL price predictions, potential schedule schanges and lots more...


