      <itunes:summary>Suj and James discuss the upcoming Club World Cup, the first to feature 32 teams, and as is covered, probably the last, because expansion can be expected for the next edition of the tournament.

There's discussion on the current mixed feelings from fans on their interest towards the tournament and some of the controversy around its staging.

And there's coverage of how to watch the tournament and an overview of all 32 teams competing.



