      <description>Following on from yesterday's Clash of the Correspondents James is again joined by Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders and Manchester United fan Gary Robinson for a more relaxed vibe, as this time James puts his guests to test with a Quiz ahead of tonight's Europa League Final,

There are 25 Questions, split into 5 sections, on Tottenham, Manchester United, both clubs, previous meetings and Europa League Finals.

Best of luck!


