    <item>
      <title>Villa In Focus | The Fan View with Lee Jackson | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Everyone wants to buy Ollie Watkins this week, so James thought he'd catch up with Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson to get the Villa few and get straight to the point... is he the best captain in Gameweek 37?

There's discussion on other Villa assets including Matty Cash, Marcos Asensio and Morgan Rogers; the impact of what the absence of Jacob Ramsey and Youri Tielemans may have.

Plus, reflection on Villa's season and their Cup defeats to Crystal Palace and PSG, Lee discusses his FPL seasons as he hopes to hang on for a top 5k finish and James gives his view from the other side, on what Tottenham may do at Villa Park tonight. 



Follow Lee on Twitter/x: https://x.com/Lee_Jackson_92


Later on Planet FPL: James presents the GW37 Deadline Stream, in partnership with FPL Team, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 5pm BST



