      <title>Ask James | Friday May 9th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On Ask James... it seems like many FPL managers are in the mood for a bit of risk taking, but might it be best in many cases to stand still? There's recommendations for GW36, captaincy discussion, reaction to Tottenham making the Europa League Final and lots more.



Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents The GW36 Deadline Stream Live, in partnership with FPL Team at 1230pm BST, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel



Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (IT+) &amp; The Team News Stream (AT)


