    <item>
      <title>Fulham v Everton | CotC with Lewis James &amp; Sean Norton | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Fulham fan Lewis James and Everton fan Sean Norton to discuss the latest at their clubs ahead of Saturday's meeting at Craven Cottage.



There's coverage of FPL assets from both clubs with Fulham still in the hunt for a European place, while Everton assets may well be popular next week with The Toffees hosting Southampton in the final ever game at Goodison Park.



And Sean is desperate for a ticket if anyone can get it him one!



