<p><br></p>
<p>Then Tom Medd joins James to chat Brentford's own possible late push for a European place, their excellent final fixtures, the prospects for the likes of Nathan Collins, Bryan Mbeumo and Yoane Wissa, plus the future of Thomas Frank.</p>
