      <description>On James' live stream questions are fielded on best selections for those on Free Hit, on Wildcard and for those looking to buy. Plus, there's more on the type of hits that are and are not worth it, when may be best for those still holding on to Chips, team news thoughts, probable line-ups, if James will make it to The Arctic Circle and more...

