    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Tuesday April 15th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream today plenty of thoughts on the upcoming Double in Gameweek 33 and which doublers to target, but with a strong message for those who have used their Wildcard to be careful if overlooking promising single gamweek players.

Plus, there are repeated warnings about what may happen in Double Gameweek 36, there's discussion on Gameweek 34 targets, summer transfer chat, why it's not worked for Tottenham and Ange, plus plenty more.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Ipswich Town v Arsenal with Paul Gaught-Allen and Adam Pritchard

Today on Patreon: The Patreon QNA with guest host Rob Pick (BT+) and Nico's Corner (AT)

