    <item>
      <title>GW31 Wildcards | Chip Talk | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Clayton joins James for a Podcast stacked full of important information that focus around advice for those on Wildcards now. There's a look at Wildcard Drafts setting to Bench Boost in both 32 and 33, Free Hitting in 33 and how those without a Free Hit Chip may want to consider navigating through the period of Gameweeks 33 and 34.

A period that we now know is confirmed following yesterday's announcement on Gameweeks 33 and 34, but there's a warning from James of why he believes there's every chance no team doubles in GW36.

And that has a lot to do with Tottenham; yes them; who lost again at Chelsea last night and the Podcast concludes with discussion on the game and why Ange Postecoglu has now completely lost the fans.

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: James presents The GW31 Deadline Stream, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am BST

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (IT+) and The GW31 Team News Stream (AT)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-125569712

