      <title>Ask James | Friday March 14th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream today the majority of questions focus towards Blank Gameweek 29 with discussion including captaincy and the importance of Erling Haaland, reservations about buying Bruno Fernandes, best forward options, when a hit is and isn't worth it, one and two week punts, chip strategy thoughts and more. 

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW28 deadline Stream, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel, in partnership with FPL Team, at 1230pm GMT

