    <item>
      <title>Free Hits &amp; Wildcards For GW29 | Chip Talk | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Suj and James present a new concept focusing on Chip usage in particular gameweek and this week with the Blank upon us there will be Free Hits and Wildcards active.

Suj is likely to be on Free Hit and shares a draft that will surprise, whilst James offers his alternative suggestion of what he would do if playing the Chip this week.

And there's also a breakdown of various ways of playing the Wildcard with a draft discussed of how to manage future doubles and blanks with no chips left and there's a look at setting up to Bench Boost in Gameweeks 30, 32 and 33.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for 2pm GMT with an audio posted shortly after conclusion

Today on Patreon: Money in Football on the 'Missions Millions' at Northampton Town (BT+) and Talking Tactics on Mathys Tel (AT)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/122979730

