      <description>James is back from The Netherlands and still sick, and it's fair to say Tottenham's performance in Alkmaar hasn't helped!

There's coverage of transfers on mind, whether Mo Salah can be taken on with captaincy this weekend, prioritising problems, forwards of interest, one, two and three week picks, Chip strategy and lots more...

