      <title>Ask James | Thursday February 27th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon lots of talk on Chip Strategy including around the Blank of Gameweek 29, what an attacking template may look like and, what those rinning through mat consider. There's also discussion on future use for the Assistant Manager, Wildcard and Bench Boost chips too.

Plus, thoughts on moves for Gameweek 28, Dango Ouattara owners' concerns, Manchester City assets and their performance at Tottenham, the brilliance of Mo Salah, when Cole Palmer needs binning by Fantasy managers and lots more...

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: s8 ep38, GW27 Review

