    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Wednesday February 19th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On today's Ask James' stream those on the Assistant Manager Chip are looking to move from Arne Slot or Unai Emery, but should they bother?

There's interest in Matheus Cunha and Bournemouth midfielders as expected and there's lot more chat on strategy including understanding 'when we will know' key dates for what's ahead and how those withthe majority of chips left may want to play what remains.

And that includes considering an unusual strategy for when to Wuildcard, and it's one under genuine consideration for James, who is very short on chips.

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: The Clayton &amp; James Show ep.27

Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham (IT+) &amp; The Midweek FPL Dilemma (AT)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-feb-122458937

