    <item>
      <title>Free Hit GW29 or GW34 Revisited | The People's Poll ep. 158 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Suj and James revisit a Podcast from 4 weeks ago deliberating which week would be best to Free Hit from the potential Blank Gameweeks of 29 and 34.

There's discussion on considering the template, including the importance of Erling Haaland, and the fixtures before after GW29 when making a decision on whether to activate the Free Hit or run through the Gameweek, and that decision will need to be made without the picture for the Doubles of 33 and the Blanks of 34.

There's a look at potential Free Hit Drafts for 29, 33 and 34 and James reiterates the script for the current projections and has warnings about how the weeks around the FA Cup Semi Finals may not be exactly what we think and how that can have big implications for Wildcarders looking to Bench Boost. And the consequence of the Newcastle v Crystal Palace arrangement for GW32 might not be as obvious for GW33 as it appears now.

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 11am GMT with an audio to follow shortly afterwards

Today on Patreon: UCL Fantasy Play Off 2nd Leg Preview Preview (IT+) and Slack Stories on Liverpool 2-1 Wolves (AT)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-feb-122458937

