    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday February 7th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On a later than usual Ask James, conversation focuses on Chip usage now that we know Aston Villa and Liverpool will double in Gameweek 25 and how is James feeling after Tottenham were dismantled so easily by Arne Slot's Liverpool?

Plus, there's discussion on Villa's offensive assets, selling Newcastle players, it looks like there will be some wild benching headaches for people next weekend and lots more...

Monday on on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s8 ep35, Chips &amp; The Assmen Vol. 2

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show (IT+), Away Days (AT) and The Best Bits (All Patrons)

