    <item>
      <title>The January 2025 Signings | The Transfer Window Show | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Clayton and James have an overview discussion of the January Transfer Window with an analysis of and details on the newest additions to the Premier League.

Manchester City and Aston Villa have been particularly busy but have they done enough to remedy concerns within the squad?

There's an intro to some of the players listeners may be less familiar with such as new Manchester United Patrick Dorgu, debate on whether movers like Ben Chilwell will get into the Crystal Palace line-up and discussion on some of the clubs who were quieter who may not have expected to be, such as Arsenal. And James gives his thoughts on Tottenham's new additions including the exciting Mathys Tel

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for the later than usual time of 6pm GMT with an audio posted shortly after conclusion

Today on Patreon: Injuries: The Psychology &amp; Management Of Them (BT+) and The New Signings - Will they be first choice? (IT+)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-121394026

