    <item>
      <title>Everton v Liverpool | CotC with Sean Norton &amp; Dan Lord | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>It's a Merseyside Derby Clash of the Correspondents as James is joined by Everton fan Sean Norton and Liverpool fan Dan Lord to discuss the two clubs ahead of their meeting at Goodison Park in Double Gameweek 24.

There's discussion on the best assets for FPL from both clubs with discussion featuring the likes of Jordan Pickford, Vitaliy Mykolenko and Iliman Ndiaye. Are they best Everton players to invest in?

And is the best Liverpool three now clear as TRent Alexander0-Arnolld, Mo Salah and Cody Gakpo? And if so should other Liverpool players be moved to accommodate them?

Plus, there's discussion on using the Triple Captaincy or Assistant Manager Chip, Liverpool's title challenge and Everton's change from Sean Dyche to David Moyes.

Follow Sean on Twitter/x: https://x.com/spirit_blues

Follow Dan on Twitter/x: https://x.com/FPL_LocoLord

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: The Clayton &amp; James Show

Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars (IT+) and The Rewatch: Man City 3-1 Chelsea (AT)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-120868390

