    <item>
      <title>Free Hit GW29 or GW34? | The People's Poll ep. 157 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Suj and James assess the possibilities for using the Free Hit Chip in one of the likely Blank Gameweeks of 29 or 34.

Gameweek 29 is likely to have two postponements due to the Carabao Cup Final; there is discussion on how best to manage the first Blank subject to which games are actually postponed with a look at how a template Free Hit might change subject to which games stay on.

But is GW34 a better week to cover the problems? There's discussion about the best fixtures in that week and how what could happen in a possible Double Gameweek 33 will impact the Blank  after, with some teams potentially Doubling and then Blanking in consecutuve weeks.

And a consequence could GW33 be better to use the Free Hit Chip?

The answer ultimately may be decided by the who, and when. 

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: Clayton &amp; James ep.23

Today on Patreon: UCL Fantasy MD7 Preview (IT+) * Away Days at Everton: One Last Time (IT+)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-120377210

