    <item>
      <title>He's Had Amad One Again | Planet FPL S. 8 Ep. 31 | GW21 Review | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Suj and James discuss all the Gameweek 21 games and it featured a week where James sold two players who scored 19 points and yet still ended up with a big gain following the returns of Anthony Gordon and last night's remarkable hat-trick from Amad Diallo.

But the North London Derby was lost.

On the Pod, Cole Palmer and (particularly) Aklexaner Isak captainers were rewarded for taking Mo Salah on, but who's best for the weekend?

Plus, all the games discussed, transfers on mind, planning ahead, key notes for the lead up to and after Blank Gameweek 29, Erling Haaland's new contract, being lucky and lots more...

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: James presents the GW22 Deadline Stream, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW22 Preview (IT+) and The GW22 Team News Stream (AT)

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/119895820

