Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl

#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #GW21Review
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James discuss all the Gameweek 21 games and it featured a week where James sold two players who scored 19 points and yet still ended up with a big gain following the returns of Anthony Gordon and last night's remarkable hat-trick from Amad Diallo.</p><p><br></p><p>But the North London Derby was lost.</p><p><br></p><p>On the Pod, Cole Palmer and (particularly) Aklexaner Isak captainers were rewarded for taking Mo Salah on, but who's best for the weekend?</p><p><br></p><p>Plus, all the games discussed, transfers on mind, planning ahead, key notes for the lead up to and after Blank Gameweek 29, Erling Haaland's new contract, being lucky and lots more...</p><p><br></p><p>Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: James presents the GW22 Deadline Stream, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT</p><p><br></p><p>Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW22 Preview (IT+) and The GW22 Team News Stream (AT)</p><p><br></p><p>For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/119895820</p><p><br></p><p>Want to become a member of our FPL community and support the Podcast? </p><p><br></p><p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow James on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow Suj on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow Clayton on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p><p><br></p><p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p><p><br></p><p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p><p><br></p><p>#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #GW21Review</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
