      <title>Ask James | Thursday January 16th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' stream this afternoon, discussion on some of the football played this week includes reaction to last night's North London Derby and there is lots of discussion on what's next for FPL managers, including, solutions for adding a third Liverpool player, interest in Everton assets, captaincy for GW22, investing in Chris Wood, benching headaches for the weekend, there's additional thoughts on Chip Strategies and lots more...

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s8 ep31, the GW21 Review

Today on Patreon: Sam Brennan's Manager Puzzle Quiz and Away Days

