    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday January 3rd | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James live stream, why holding transfers back may now be the play for many, but for other with several popular assets injured or suspended there will be a desire to make moves. There's coverage of the best players at varying price points across the positions; latest thoughts on the troubles at Manchester United and Tottenham, there's a detailed answer on Chip Coverage towards the end of the stream and James also reveals some of his FPL highlights from 2024 favourite ever Planet FPL Podcasts.

Tomorrow on on Planet FPL: James presents The GW20 Deadline Stream, Live and in partnership with FPL Team, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show, The Team News Stream and The Patreon Best Bits

