    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday December 20th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, discussion for GW17 includes captaining Mo Salah, latest on Matheus Cunha, interest in Fulham assets, desires for Nicolas Jackson and Alexander Isak, benching dilemmas feature enabling midfielders and some awkward defensive decisions.

Plus, plenty more including Christmas dinner, thoughts on when might be best to use the Free Hit Chip and updated thoughts on Tottenham following last night's victory against Manchester United.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents The GW17 Deadline Stream live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW17 Preview &amp; The Team News

