      <title>Ask James | Tuesday December 10th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>An earlier in the week Ask James stream this week due to James' trip to Glasgow for Tottenham's Europa League game and Rangers and naturally there is further Tottenham conversation on the under pressure Ange Postecoglu, but much of the fans ire is likely to be directed at Chairman Daniel Levy.

Plus, FPL discussion features discussion on GW16 captaincy, thoughts on the in-demand Enzo Fernandez, forward and defender options under consideration and lots more...
 
