      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>An earlier in the week Ask James stream this week due to James' trip to Glasgow for Tottenham's Europa League game and Rangers and naturally there is further Tottenham conversation on the under pressure Ange Postecoglu, but much of the fans ire is likely to be directed at Chairman Daniel Levy.</p><p><br></p><p>Plus, FPL discussion features discussion on GW16 captaincy, thoughts on the in-demand Enzo Fernandez, forward and defender options under consideration and lots more...</p><p> </p><p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Clayton and James Show ep.18</p><p><br></p><p>Today on Patreon: UCL Fantasy MD6 Preview and Slack Stories</p><p><br></p><p>For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/117605615</p><p><br></p><p>Want to become a member of our FPL community and support the Podcast? </p><p><br></p><p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow James on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow Suj on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow Clayton on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p><p><br></p><p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p><p><br></p><p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
