    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday November 29th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon lots of FPL related questions covered ahead of today's GW13 deadline including continued discussion on Erling Haaland to Mohamed Salah, captaincy for this week and forthcoming weeks, investing in the right Arsenal players including Bukayo Saka, best enabling defender choice, desires for Joao Pedro and Matheus Cunha, benching headaches and key updates on Tottenham after last night's draw exciting draw in The Europa League with Roma, which includes an interesting debate on the quality of Dejan Kulusevski.

Later on Planet FPL: James presents the GW13 Deadline Stream, Live and in partnership with FPL Team on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 530pm GMT

Today on Patreon: The GW13 Differential Show and The Team News Stream

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-nov-25-116672625

