    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday November 22nd | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On Ask James today, with the news of Tottenham missing both first choice centre backs there's a big warning for Fantasy managers who were looking to sell Erling Haaland, but with Mateo Kovacic also out for City, Tottenham are not without their own chances to hurt tomorrow and that may make selling or benching the likes of Brennan Johnson or Dominic Solanke awkward too.

Plus, Trent Alexander-Arnold is out and James will be moving him on as part of a plan to get Alexander Isak, and going treble Arsenal defence is not something James is ruling out at this stage, particularly with one player's xMins on the rise following today's Team News.

As usual, all the transfer and benching dilemmas covered and there's more chat on Ange Postecoglu and the long-term.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW12 Deadline Stream, Live and in partnership with FPL Team on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT

Today on Patreon: The GW12 Differential Show and The Team News Stream

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-nov-116203685

