      <title>Ask James | Friday November 15th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On Ask James today, Alexander Isak looks a popular buy for many this week, there's debate on several big name players including Erling Haaland, Mo Salah, Bukayo Saka and Bruno Fernandes. Plus, discussion on Ange Postecoglu, Tottenham assets, enabling defenders and forwards and lots more...

