    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Wednesday November 6th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream today there's further discussion on the 7.5-9.0 forwards and those below, the danger of having 'the ideal' midfield four, best enabling defenders for consideration, James' desire to own Salah but why thoughts of Isak may hold him back, upcoming captaincies including whether Solanke is the only for this weekend, how away fans get treated in Europe causes annoyance, the pressure is on Lopetegui and O'Neil and James also outlines why he would give no consideration to using the Free Hit Chip any time soon.  

Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham and The Midweek FPL Dilemma

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Brentford v Bournemouth with Tom Medd and Neil Grover

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/115329476

