    <item>
      <title>The 7.5-9.0 Forwards | The People's Poll ep. 153 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Suj and James have a look at five FPL forwards that James has been repeatedly warning recently that FPL managers shouldn't cut themselves off of, because although there are several good options below 7.5 (and one very good one above 9.0!) these five players may well show greater consistency and have more explosiveness.

The 5 players in question (WishJ) are Ollie Watkins, Alexander Isak, Dominic Solanke, Kai Havertz and Nicolas Jackson. There's analysis of their statistics so far this season and a look at the fixtures ahead, with consideration to who their threats from within, their capability to be Fantasy talisman and much more.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled for 12pm GMT with an audio posted shortly after conclusion

Today on Patreon: UCL Fantasy MD4 Preview

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/115329476

