      <title>Ask James | Friday November 1st | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, Erling Haaland is being sold by many to fund a move to Mo Salah, but it isn't that straightforward! James confirms why he's invested in Rayan Ait-Nouri, plus, concerns over structures with three cheap forwards continued, team news updates, Calvert-Lewin and Solanke frustrations, Gabriel concerns, captaincy, festive rotation concerns and lots more...

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW10 Preview, The Team News Stream and the Best Bits

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW10 Deadline Stream, in partnership with FPL Team, live and exclusive on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT

