    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday October 25th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, the big FPL dilemmas covered, including, Bukayo Saka keep or sell, if Son is the best Tottenham option, if Cole Palmer non-owners can wait until GW12, if Arsenal and Liverpool defenders should be benched, Erling Haaland, the Triple Captaincy Chip, differentials, enablers, flipping premium players and lots more...

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW9 Preview, The Team News Stream and the Best Bits

