      <itunes:author>Suj &amp; James</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle></itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Chelsea fan Gary Mantle and Newcastle fan Simon Bibby ahead of Sunday's meeting between the clubs at Stamford Bridge and right from the get-go on this Podcast there's a strong feeling about a positive Fantasy weekend for Cole Palmer!

That's in part because of Chelsea's bright start to the season which included a spirited performance despite defeat at Liverpool, but is also due to on-going concerns that not all is well with Newcastle... but why?

All the key FPL assets covered and with both set for positive fixture swings in Gameweek 12 there's plenty to cover with thoughts on Chelsea's defensive assets, the prospects for Anthony Gordon and Alexander Isak going forward, there's advice for Noni Madueke owners and James is very keen on investing in Nicolas Jackson.

Follow Gary on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Phantomantle

Follow Si on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fplBibs

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream scheduled from 930am BST

Today on Patreon: Money in Football and Talking Tactics

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-oct-21-114386113

