      <title>Ask James | Friday October 4th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, further thoughts on Ten Hag after Manchester United's draw in Porto and as expected lots of FPL topics covered including GW7 captaincy, benching conundrums, Luis Diaz owners seem to be getting itchy about his prospects and everyone wants a bit of Cole Palmer; but there's a Tottenham player many seem to want too!

