    <item>
      <title>Brighton v Tottenham | CotC with Sam Murray &amp; Ricky Saunders | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>James is joined by Brighton fan Sam Murray and Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders to discuss the latest at their teams and the Fantasy assets at their clubs ahead of Sunday's Gameweek 7 meeting at The Amex.

How have Bright fared so far under Fabian Hurzeler, and are they viewed as a team that has only lost once or winless in four?

And how high is confidence in the Tottenham camp following Sunday's excellent victory at Old Trafford?

All the key FPL assets covered including Joao Pedro's status, whether other Brighton assets should be sold, current confidence in Pedro Porro's output, the best pick up from Tottenham's midfield and the prospects for Dominic Solanke; particularly in light of some bad injury news for The Seagulls.

Follow Sam on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLSeagull

Follow Ricky on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Rickysaunders77

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 2pm BST with an audio posted shortly after conclusion

Today on Patreon: Money in Football and Talking Tactics

