    <item>
      <title>A Statistical Look At The First 6 Gameweeks | The People's Poll ep. 150 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Suj and James take a deep dive into some of the stats of players from the opening 6 gameweeks of the season to see what has caught the eye.

There's a look at Goalkeeper over and underperformance, who's exceeding their xG and who's due a goal, plus crossing monsters, those showing the most creativity, who's constantly getting shots away and one stat particularly catches James' attention.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Clayton and James Show

Today on Patreon: UCL Fantasy MD2 Preview and Nico's Corner

