    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday September 20th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>It seems everyone has forward concerns... on James' stream this week there's concern for those who own Alexander Isak, Joao Pedro or Rodrigo Muniz; so what should owners do?

Plus, there's discussion on captaincy with some who own Erling Haaland put off by Arsenal's defence strength; there's further defence of Ange Postecoglu despite Tottenham's dismal showing at Coventry in the Cup and lots more...

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show and The Team News Stream

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW5 Deadline Stream live, in partnership with FPL team, at 10am BST, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel

