      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>It seems everyone has forward concerns... on James' stream this week there's concern for those who own Alexander Isak, Joao Pedro or Rodrigo Muniz; so what should owners do?</p><p><br></p><p>Plus, there's discussion on captaincy with some who own Erling Haaland put off by Arsenal's defence strength; there's further defence of Ange Postecoglu despite Tottenham's dismal showing at Coventry in the Cup and lots more...</p><p><br></p><p>Today on Patreon: The Differential Show and The Team News Stream</p><p><br></p><p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW5 Deadline Stream live, in partnership with FPL team, at 10am BST, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel</p><p><br></p><p>For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-sep-112149674</p><p><br></p><p>Want to become a member of our FPL community and support the Podcast? </p><p><br></p><p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow James on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow Suj on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow Clayton on Twitter/x: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p><p><br></p><p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p><p><br></p><p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p><p><br></p><p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
