    <item>
      <title>What Is An Expert? | The People's Poll ep. 148 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Clayton and James have an open discussion about the word expert, its factual definition and its use within the FPL community.

Because it's a word James really dislikes. But why does he dislike it? Or is it that he doesn't dislike it at all, and only dislikes how it is used?

And there's brief coverage to kick off on the words that lost out in the poll, 'nailed' and 'essential'.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Clayton and James Show and Tot&amp;Ars

Today on Patreon: UCL fantasy Final Drafts and Slack Stories

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-sep-112149674

