    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday September 13th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream many of the hot topics covered ahead of tomorrow's FPL deadline as interest in Brighton and Liverpool assets appears high, but perhaps not as much as expected on Aston Villa...

Plus, more on going without Haaland, managers seem reluctant to pick their Fulham players this week, transfer and bench dilemmas covered and lots more...

Today on Patreon: The Differential Show and The Team News Stream

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW4 Deadline Stream live, in partnerhsip with FPL team, at 10am BST, exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel

