    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday September 6th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon questions answered from the FPL community and it seems Brighton and Liverpool assets are going to be popular and with consecutive home games on the horizon it makes complete sense for those Wildcarding ahead of Gameweek 6; but is it worth it buying to sell in two weeks...?

Plus, there's Tottenham coverage as usual, Brentford assets are on radar, looking ahead to possible alternative weeks to Wildcard and lots more...

Today on Patreon: Being Dad &amp; 3 Days With Harry

