      <title>The Clayton And James Show ep. 4 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Clayton and James present a new show idea where they discuss some of the current talking points in football, covering several topics. On today's Podcast:

Leicester's technicality escape from a Premier League points deduction

Lee Carsley's first England squad

Crisis club: Manchester United

Deadline Day deals with an impact on FPL

On this day nostalgia from 2016 as England won Sam Allardyce's only game in charge.

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SRuHCIFxQtw

