        <![CDATA[<p>Clayton and James present a new show idea where they discuss some of the current talking points in football, covering several topics. On today's Podcast:</p><ul>
<li>A tribute to Sven Goran Eriksson</li>
<li>FPL GW3 captaincy</li>
<li>Latest transfers discussion</li>
<li>Crisis club: Everton</li>
<li>On this day nostalgia from 2011 and a bad day for the North London clubs  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Md65jA-qlcU &amp; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gKgCSFZALkE</li>
