      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Clayton and James present a new show idea where they discuss some of the current talking points in football, covering several topics. On today's Podcast:</p><ul>
<li>The Monday night Football between Leicester and Tottenham</li>
<li>New Premier League Rules</li>
<li>New FPL players of interest</li>
<li>Joachim Andersen and Ilkay Gundogan proposed transfers</li>
<li>Antonio Conte's crazy start at Napoli</li>
<li>On This Day Nostalgia from 1994 - Leicester 1-3 Newcastle https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dxCJTuCojjY</li>
