      <title>Where Should Each Club Buy? | The People's Poll ep. 147 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Clayton and James discuss the winner of this weeks People's Poll vote and assess where all 20 Premier League clubs should be looking to invest in their squads ahead of the closure of The Transfer Window next Friday?

Who needs a new forward? 
Who needs defensive reinforcement? 
Who requires better cover in a specific position?

Speculation on who may move and more.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Clayton and James Show

Today on Patreon: GW1 Debutants Quiz and Away Days

