      <title>Final Drafts | Planet FPL S. 8 Ep. 7 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Suj, James and Clayton reveal their final drafts ahead of today's Gameweek 1 deadline. But are they actually likely to be the confirmed line ups by the time the deadline arrives? Perhaps not with team news today still so important and some on this Podcast might be more sure of what they're doing than others...

Still to come on Planet FPL today: James presents The GW1 Deadline Steam Live, in partnership with FPL team, exclusively on The Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 530pm BST

