      <description>In a Planet FPL public first, Suj and Clayton join James for a 3-way - get your minds out of the gutter - to answer questions from the FPL Community on a range of topics that haven't been covered already on this week's Planet FPL Podcast.

Includes discussion on FPL goal setting, Saka v Son, Goalkeepers, planned transfers, covering price points, Oscar Bobb's injury, Ebe Eze, one week punts, longer-term picks, enablers and lots more.

