    <item>
      <title>Chip Strategy | Planet FPL S. 8 Ep. 4 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>James details to Suj and the audience what we can expect throughout the season with Blank and Double Gameweeks and it's going to make Chip Strategy very different in this season to what we have been use to in previous campaigns.

So is it safe to use the Chips early in the season? Is James' intention to Bench Boost in Gameweek 1 a consequence of this?

There's discussion on options for using the Chips both in the first and second half of the campaigns, why Manchester United and Tottenham could cause a particular headache to the schedule and why we shouldn't forget The Mystery Chip will also be available in the second half of the season.

And there's further analysis of options for when to use the first Wildcard.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s8 ep5 - Captaincy And Rotations

Today on Patreon: Telegraph and CloudFF

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-aug-109908150

