    <item>
      <title>The Shortlist | Planet FPL S. 8 Ep. 3 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Suj and James give an A-W overview of all 20 teams and the players they are considering for their FPL drafts ahead of Gameweek 1, commenting further on what was learned from the 20 Correspondent Week Podcasts and what new information was learned from each club's final pre-season friendlies.

There's discussion on squad structure, enablers, premiums and specific players who may deliver returns in Gameweek 1, particularly as James continues to look towards an opening weekend Bench Boost. But with Dominic Solanke signed has he locked four Tottenham players into his squad?

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s8 ep4 - Chip Strategy

Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A and The Correspondent Week Draft

