    <item>
      <title>Bournemouth with Neil Grover | Correspondent Week ep.18 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>*Recorded last night prior to this morning's reported news that it now looks likely Dominic Solanke will be on his way to Tottenham...

...James is joined by Bournemouth fan Neil Grover and conversation immediately gets into the big transfer story featuring The Cherries, with talisman Dominic Solanke heavily linked with a move to Tottenham. Will he or won't he? And in which circumstances should FPL managers be investing in the forward?

There's discussion on which Cherries attacking assets may step up in the scenario of their star forward leaving, one solution may be that a player listed as a midfielder could end up out of position.

Plus, best defensive assets assessed, where the club can be expected to invest in the transfer market and the club's continuing ambition to improve.

Follow Neil on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/AFCBNG

Next on Correspondent Week: ep.19 Leicester with Aaron Lagor

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/109354364

