    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday July 26th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>A later than usual Ask James for the final public content before Correspondent Week kicks off on August 5th, and the stream is dominated by FPL discussion.

There's coverage of Haaland v Salah, best midfield options between 4.5 and 6.5, set and forget enablers, there's chat on ownership with those that have high ownership and those who are perhaps being overlooked and the inevitable Tottenham chat includes best options from the team, what's needed for the club to spend with the best.

Planet FPL Returns... on August 5th with Correspondent Week. 20 Podcasts in 5 days that kicks off with Adam Pritchard on Arsenal

Today on Patreon: Coming up...

