      <title>The New Buys We Don't Know | The Transfer Window Show 2024/25</title>
      <description>Clayton and James have a look at some of the Premier League's newest additions from overseas who listeners and viewers may not be familiar with.

There's coverage of Manchester United's big money buys, some of Brighton's newest additions, the new forward at Brentford, Manchester City's new man and there's also coverage of signings at Aston Villa, Chelsea, Crystal Palace and Nottingham Forest.

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James live stream at 6pm BST with an audio Podcast posted shortly after

