      <title>The Pilot Episode | The Clayton And James Show ep. 1 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>Clayton and James present a new show idea where they discuss some of the current talking points in football, covering several topics. On today's Podcast:

Premier League players with only one year left on their contract, includes coverage of Chelsea, Liverpool, Newcastle, Kevin De Bruyne, Heung-Min Son and Kevin De Bruyne

6.5 FPL midfielders

Notes from Tottenham's performance at QPR on Saturday

European Leagues taking legal action against FIFA over 'abuse of dominance'

2025 Club World Cup

Her Game Too


Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Transfer Window Show, looking in more detail at the Premier League's new signings who we may be unfamiliar with

