    <item>
      <title>Fixture Swings | Planet FPL S. 8 Ep. 2 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Suj and James take a deep dive into the fixture schedule in the first half of the season looking at opportunities to buy and sell FPL assets where fixture swings occur... and spoiler in many cases it's difficult to find these so-called swings.

There's discussion on when rolling could be beneficial and James details rolling 5 week periods that show periods when managers may want to use their first Wildcard and there is one particularly naughty period that will be difficult to navigate.

And there's listener questions covered too.

For further information on The Ghost Of White Hart Lane, the play on the life of Tottenham and Scotland legend John White please view this link: https://tickets.edfringe.com/whats-on/ghost-of-white-hart-lane

