    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday July 19th | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>On James' live stream on YouTube lots of FPL dilemmas covered following Wednesday's launch including keeping an open mind, fixture swings and the prospect of a GW2 Wildcard following a GW1 Bench Boost is mentioned quite a bit.

Plus, having an awareness of which clubs are actively pursuing players for certain positions, underpriced players, structures, Tottenham chat, upcoming content plans and lots more... 

Monday on Planet FPL: s8 ep2, with a focus on fixture swings 

Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars with Clayton and James and the best bits of the Copa America with Nico and James

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-july-108161865

