    <item>
      <title>First Impressions | Planet FPL S. 8 Ep. 1 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>With Fantasy Premier League open and all the prices available for the 2024/25 season Suj and James kick off their coverage of Season 8 of Planet FPL by assessing the players of interest from all 20 clubs running through from Arsenal to Wolves.

There's discussion on unavoidable premiums, the mid price players who really interest and budget enablers are identified from both well and unfancied teams.

Plus, why tough fixtures will push many away from certain clubs, why some pricing points towards solution players, James gets excited about one particular young prospect and lots more...

Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James live stream on YouTube at 12pm BST with an audio version to follow shortly after conclusion

Today on Patreon: The (Bad) Improbable 23/24 Predictions and Talking Tactics on Fabian Hurzeler

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-july-108161865

