    <item>
      <title>Five Free Transfers | The People's Poll ep. 145 | Planet FPL 2024/25</title>
      <description>With the launch of Fantasy Premier League 2024/25 anticipated today, Suj and James react to yesterday's news of changes to gameplay for the season ahead including the ability to store up to 5 transfers.

But who does it benefit most? Will fixture planners like James benefit from the change? Or will Suj be able to forget deadlines for a month with little consequence?

Plus, ultimately is the change good for the game and what are the impacts on fellow Chip usage for things like the Free Hit and Wildcards?

Today on Patreon: The Good 23/24 Predictions and Nico's Corner

For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-july-108161865

