    <item>
      <title>Take A Sad Song And Make It Better | Planet FPL On Euro 2024</title>
      <description>Clayton and James discuss the 4 games played at the weekend in The Euros which included England's dramatic victory against Slovakia where The Three Lions were only seconds away from elimination before Jude Bellingham's incredible equaliser.
Did England deserve their victory? What went well, what didn't and will England likely change anything for Saturday's quarter final with Switzerland?
There's discussion on the strengths of The Swiss following their excellent victory against a bad Italy and there's also a review of Germany and Spain's victories.
Plus, how the Euro Fantasy weekend went and James might be holding off from Wildcarding this week.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL on Euro 2024 discussing the two games on Monday
Today on Patreon: Extra Time on England and Slack Stories
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-july-107229643
