    <item>
      <title>It's Gone Southgate | Planet FPL On Euro 2024</title>
      <description>Many England fans would have been ready for this, a sub-par performance and points dropped in the Group. So why does it still feel so bad!?
Suj and James discuss being here before but why yesterday's draw with Denmark feels worse for England than previous draws at major tournaments, and there's search for how to fix the clear problems The Three Lions are having.
It didn't help that England's showing was followed by Spain putting in a super performance against reigning Champions Italy either.
Yesterday's games covered and Suj may be getting his revenge on James in Euro Fantasy.
If you want to join our Euro Fantasy mini league the code is - 1LoPXq  
Monday on Planet FPL: Calin Mates joins James to discuss the games played over the weekend at The Euros
Today on Patreon: Ask James at 4pm BST and Premier League Fixtures Initial Reaction
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-june-106348382
