    <item>
      <title>Parting Kompany | with Jack Toner | The Fan View | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>Burnley Correspondent Jack Toner joins James to discuss the shocking turn of events that saw manager Vincent Kompany become Bayern Munich's new manager despite suffering relegation with The Clarets.
Why have Bayern ultimately decided to go with the former Manchester City defender and could he make a success of a job where he'll have nowhere near the power or influence he had at Turf Moor?
How will he remembered by Burnley fans after last season ultimately ended in a dismal return following the previous season's outstanding Champioship triumph?
And there's discussion on potential Kompany replacements and what may be next for the club moving forward.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Euro Fantasy Final Drafts
Today on Patreon: Nostalgia on Euro 88 and Predicting The Euros
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-june-105922183
