    <item>
      <title>What Do Chelsea Want To Be? | with Gary Mantle | The Fan View | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>Chelsea correspondent Gary Mantle joins James to discuss a dramatic couple of weeks at Stamford Bridge with an excellent finish to the Premier League season was followed by the shocking departure of Mauricio Pochettino and the appointment of Leicester City manager Enzo Maresca.
There's discussion on whether the Pochettino departure really was by 'mutual consent' and fan sentiment towards the decision and the former Tottenham manager. 
The feeling towards the appointment of Enzo Maresca and what we can expect from The Championship winning manager.
Plus the Podcast as a repetitive theme of asking what is it that Chelsea really want? Is it immediate success or a longer term vision? And who really is making the football decisions... and do they know what they're doing!?
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Euro Fantasy Watchlist
Today on Patreon: Telegraph Fantasy with 2023/24 Champion James Ingram
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-june-105922183
