    <item>
      <title>Return Of The Saints | with Matt Samuel | The Fan View | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>Following Southampton's Play-Off Final victory that sealed an immediate return to the Premier League James welcomes Saints Correspondent Matt Samuel on to the Podcast discuss the highs and lows of The Saints promotion campaign.
There's also discussion on the importance of manager Russell Martin and the style implemented to the team, whether they have shown the ability to adapt and which players have the quality to do well in the Premier League, such as top scorer Adam Armstrong.
And where do Southampton most need to invest to improve the team and the squad?
Follow Matt on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/CS_Wipeout
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 12pm BST with an audio to follow
Today on Patreon: Money in Football on Manchester City and the 115, plus Talking Tactics on The Champions League Final
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-june-105476558
