    <item>
      <title>In Conclusion | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 55 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>After a week away from Podcasting Suj and James (are not back!) discuss some of the recent events in football, with discussion on the European and FA Cup Finals, managerial changes and reflection on the FPL season that was, which includes James believing he's found where it all went wrong for Suj!
The Podcast also features discussion on Lucas Paqueta's potential ban and the future of FPL and whether following analytic models is required to stay good at the game.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: A discussion on England following tonight's game against Bosnia
Today on Patreon: The Q'N'A and Twitter Stories
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-june-105476558
