    <item>
      <title>Man City v Man Utd | CotC with Jonny Pringle &amp; Gary Robinson | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>You wait over 150 years for an all-Manchester FA Cup Final and then two come along in succession. James is joined by Manchester City fan Jonny Pringle and Manchester United fan Gary Robinson to preview tomorrow's FA Cup Final.
There's discussion on the achievement of City's fourth consecutive Premier League title. Does that make them the greatest ever English side?
But what about those hanging 115 charges. Will it stop City getting the credit their fans feel they deserve?
Will Erik Ten Hag make it through the weekend? Noises are being made that United are now actively seeking a potential replacement for The Dutchman?
Plus, Cup Final tactics, Marcus Rashford's England omission, Phil Foden's brilliance and more.
Donate to GW39FPL: https://www.gw39northvsouth.co.uk/
__________________________________________________________
Today on Patreon: Ask James
*Content will resume on Monday June 3rd
