    <item>
      <title>Sheffield United v Tottenham | CotC with Ben Thompson &amp; Ricky Saunders | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>For the final Premier League Clash of the Correspondents James welcomes Sheffield United fan Ben 'Tommo' Thompson and Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders to discuss the latest at their clubs ahead of Sunday's final day meeting at Bramall Lane.
For The Blades it's been a season of struggles with 101 goals conceded. Is there hope for next season or fear that another season of struggle awaits in The Championship with several players out of contract and loanees unlikely to be bought?
And how is the season viewed for Tottenham now? A spectacular start has now become a flat finish but did the season still go beyond expectations? And what's the view now on Ange Postecoglu?
Plus, there's FPL discussion on the best Tottenham assets for the weekend in a game where goals can certainly be expected.
Follow Tommo on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/FPL_Blade
Follow Ricky on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/Rickysaunders77
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show, Chip Talk and The Team News Stream
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-may-104150045
