    <item>
      <title>You're Only As Good As Next Week | Planet SkyFF S.5 Ep.45 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj and James discuss the key talking points ahead of the final two gamedays, but is there anywhere to go tonight for those lucky enough to still have transfers in hand? Or should there be patience for final day assets?
There's coverage of the four teams playing tonight and the differentials who could go big on Sunday, why picking your battles on captaincy is important and James reasons why in his situation there's no reason to go against in his situation, but for Suj - who has actually used his transfers - there's reason to seek punts with his captaincy picks.
Plus, there's a philosophical take on the mental side of Sky versus FPL, data scrape from the games played this week, listener questions covered and thoughts begin to turn to next season.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s7 ep53 reviewing the four games played Monday-Wednesday
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham and Nico's Corner
