    <item>
      <title>Leicester's Promotion | with Aaron Lagor | The Planet FPL Fan View 2023/24</title>
      <description>James is joined by Leicester City correspondent Aaron Lagor following the Foxes crowning as Championship Champions that means they will be making an immediate return to the Premier League under the stewardship of Enzo Maresca.
There's discussion on how The Foxes did it, Maresca's philosophy and tactics which naturally has parallels with that of Pep Guardiola, whom Maresca was previously assistant to at Manchester City.
There's an overview of the squad which includes some early thoughts on who may appeal to FPL managers next season and that could include the Championship goalkeeper of the season, Kiernan Dewsbury-Hall and a 37 year-old Jamie Vardy who is still going strong.
But there are concerns, with the season rumoured to be set to begin with a points deduction due to failures to meet PSR requirements and therefore spending may be limited and sales shouldn't necessarily be ruled out either.
Follow Aaron on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/AaronLagor
Today on Planet FPL: James presents the GW36 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team exclusively on YouTube at 530pm BST
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW36 Preview and The Team News Stream
