    <item>
      <title>No Time For A White Flag | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 49 | GW34 Midweek Review | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Suj and James review the 6 games played in midweek as Arsenal and Manchester City went big in their pursuit of the title but Liverpool's attempt to keep pace hits the skids in the Merseyside Derby at Everton. Now focus turns from Free Hit 34 to Wildcard 35 with Suj (probably) and James both on Wildcard.
On the Podcast there's a big lean in the discussion to covering FPL assets from the teams who played in midweek which features 5 of the 6 teams who have a Double in GW37 and whether assets from the likes of Arsenal, Crystal Palace, Everton and Liverpool should go alongside them for the run-in.
James also gives a detailed view on Tottenham assets who have two upcoming doubles before revealing his intended Wildcard (subject to team news) and there's one player he's desperate to have but isn't likely to fit in.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents The GW35 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team at 10am BST exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube channel
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW35 Preview and The GW35 Team News Stream
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-apr-102812089
