    <item>
      <title>Schar The Plan | Planet SkyFF S.5 Ep.42 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>Suj rejoins James for the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast ahead of another big night of moves where differentials will be purchased - but will they actually be differentials?
Manchester United and Newcastle assets could become popular quickly and James reveals the 3 he intends to buy, it's only 3 as there was a stroke of luck when forced into a move on Sunday and one more needs to be saved for Manchester City tomorrow.
But will Suj actually make the transfers he wants with a whopping 16 left and sights set on the top 1000, whilst for James entry into the top 100 has been achieved. How high could he finish?
Plus, discussion for what should be an open few days for captaincy, Tottenham assets for Sunday, data from the weekend and thoughts on trying to chase down individual opponents in mini leagues
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Chelsea v Tottenham with Gary Mantle and Ricky Saunders
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham and Twitter Stories
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-apr-102812089
