    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Thursday April 18th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon lots of questions focusing on Double Gameweek assets for GW34 from Arsenal, Crystal Palace and Liverpool and should Free Hitters overlook those with just one fixture?
Plus, reaction to last night's Champions League exits for Arsenal and Manchester City and why James had no second thoughts about wanting rivals Arsenal to go out despite 5th now being unlikely to get Tottenham a Champions League place for next season.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Everton v Liverpool with Sean Norton and Dan Lord
Today on Patreon: A Scandinavian Quiz hosted Victor Sundal
