    <item>
      <title>Arsenal v Aston Villa | CotC with Adam Pritchard &amp; Lee Jackson | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>It's the Clash of the Correspondents where James doesn't really want either team to win as table topping Arsenal fan Adam Pritchard and top 4 chasing Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson guest to discuss the latest at their clubs and preview Sunday's meeting at The Emirates.
There's discussion on each club's respective challenges in both the league and in Europe this season and there's plenty of FPL chat including best Arsenal options for this week, Double Gameweek 34 and whether GW35 Wildcarders would be right to overlook The Gunners. And should this be the end point for interest in FPL assets from Villa despite Ollie Watkins' incredible season?
Plus, fixtures and form assesses, there's discussion on Arsenal's core players that should in the main be free from rotation fears and why injuries and suspensions have dented, but by no means finished, Villa's hopes of a top 4 finish.
Follow Adam on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho
Follow Lee on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/Lee_Jackson_92
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: NOT The GW33 Deadline Stream in partnership with FPL Team - Live Stream at 6pm BST with an audio to follow shortly after conclusion
Today on Patreon: Money in Football on the idea of a Premier League Luxury Tax and Talking Tactics on Brentford's comeback at Aston Villa on Saturday
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-april-101927782
Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? 
