    <item>
      <title>Brentford v Sheffield United | CotC with Tom Medd &amp; Ben Thompson | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Brentford fan Tom Medd and Sheffield United Ben 'Tommo' Thompson to discuss the latest at their clubs and preview Saturdays Gameweek 33 meeting.
Are The Blades as good as down or can they pull off a miraCulous escape following a confidence building draw with Chelsea at the weekend?
How nervous should The Bees be about their own plight? The fixtures remaining are good but the long-term form is a concern.
Plus, FPL discussion on both, with Bees assets appealing for those looking at a one week punt on the likes of Bryan Mbeumo and Ivan Toney or a defensive asset, and there is one Blades asset that we should pay particular attention to for their Double in Gameweek 34.
Follow Tom on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/FPLDummyTom
Follow Tommo on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/FPL_Blade
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s5 ep40
Today on Patreon: UCL Fantasy Preview and Chip Talk on a GW33 Wildcard
