      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Clayton joins James to discuss all the midweek action from GW31 that ended with big drama at Stamford Bridge as Cole Palmer's hat-trick saw him match Phil Foden's 20 point haul from the night before. James own both but still got a red arrow!</p><p>It was also a midweek full of captaincy fails with no shows for Erling Haaland and Bukayo Saka whilst Mo Salah returned a 1 pointer after being subbed in the 59th minute!</p><p>There's discussion on weekend captaincy for GW32 but with Heung-Min Son also likely to be an option along with those previously mentioned and James ponders a move for a Goalkeeper.</p><p>As usual all the games reviewed with all the relevant FPL chat on each team and there's a very different intro to normal as the lads went back to record again as upon conclusion of the Podcast the Premier League surprising announced that Chelsea and Tottenham will play their rearranged game in Gameweek 35 rather than 36.</p><p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents The GW32 Deadline Steam in Partnership wth FPL Team live at 10am BST exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel</p><p>Today on Patreon: The Differential Show 32 Preview and GW32 Team News Stream</p><p>For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-march-101416876</p><p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p><p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p><p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p><p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p><p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p><p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p><p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p><p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p><p>#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #GW31Review</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
