    <item>
      <title>Parr For The Course | Planet SkyFF S.5 Ep.39 with Ian Parrin | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast TV projection king Ian Parrin joins James to discuss all the latest talking points for Sky Fantasy and there's a key discussion on projecting what the TV picks may be in the penultimate two weekends of the season. Will there be a single gameday that Sky managers need to be aware of?
There's also discussion on upcoming captaincy and transfer plans including whether it should be an exodus of Tottenham assets to Arsenal tonight, data analysis from the games played since Saturday and the two key dates left on the calendar where big gains can be made.
Thursday on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Fulham v Newcastle with Dara Curran and Simon Bibby
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars and Away Days West Ham
