    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday March 22nd | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, Mo Salah and Cole Palmer are likley to be popular ahead of GW30, if Heung-Min Son is likely to head back out on the left-wing and lots of strategy questions about chip usage which includes an update from James on changes to the double gameweek fixture projections and why GW35 Wildcarders may now have a big advantage at the season's conclusion.
Today on Patreon: The Diffeent(ial) Show as James is joined by his Wife and Talking Tactics on Sunday's thriller between United and Liverpool at Old Trafford
