    <item>
      <title>Get Your Muniz Ready | Planet SkyFF S.5 Ep.37 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast there's plenty to discuss for Suj and James despite a largely irrelevant weekend for Sky Fantasy managers and that includes when to sell the underwhelming assets who have just played, but with cautious notes, particularly around the likes of Ollie Watkins who may have future single game days that we can't currently see.
There's chat around making gains before and after FA Cup Semi Final weekend with 3 games getting moved back, the 4 teams who managers will target over the next couple of weeks, there's an update on top 1000 ownership and the team of 2024 so far.
Plus, listener questions and more.
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham and Nico's Corner
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fan View with Gemma and Harrison Eno on West Brom and The Championship promotion race
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/100583314
