    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday March 15th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James live stream this afternoon plenty of focus on the Blank Gameweek, with solutions offered on questions for both those who are and aren't Free Hitting, with the best options from Brentford, Nottingham Forest and Tottenham all covered in detail.
There's also concern over Ollie Watkins status and James advises a clear strategy for owners and those on a Free Hit.
Plus, reminders to #PlayItYourWay when assessing when to play Chips now and in the weeks to come and reaction to the European draws which included blockbuster Champions League draws for Arsenal and Manchester City who could meet each other in the semi-final.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW29 Deadline Stream in partnership with FPL Team live at 1230pm GMT exclusively on the Planet FPL YouTube channel
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show and Team News Stream
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/100146453
