    <item>
      <title>West Ham v Aston Villa | CotC with Chris Stone &amp; Lee Jackson | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents it's a Claret and Blue Derby as James welcome West Ham fan Chris Stone and Aston Villa Lee Jackson to discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of their crucial Europa ties tonight and Sunday's Blank Gameweek 29 meeting at London Stadium.
With many FPL managers Free Hitting this week there's discussion on the best assets from both clubs and key discussions such as best defensive assets from each and head to head duels such as Jarrod Bowen or Mohammed Kudus and Douglas Luiz or Leon Bailey are also covered.
There's also discussion on if Ollie Watkins shouyld be given the armband by FPL managers this weekend and why this might be the last weekend to invest in either club for the remainder of this season!
Plus, form injuries and expectations discussed as West Ham still remain in the hunt for European qualification via the league and Aston Villa's duel with Tottenham has become a lot more difficult to call after Sunday's big result at Villa Park.
Follow Chris on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/Fpl_SkyAddict
Follow Lee on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/Lee_Jackson_92
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 12pm GMT with an audio posted shortly after
Today on Patreon: Money in Football on concession pricing at football and Chip Talk on a GW29 Free Hit
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/100146453
