    <item>
      <title>The Soblanke Weekend | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 41 | GW28 Review | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Clayton joins James to discuss all the key talking points from the Double Gameweek weekend which included some big hitting FPL assets flopping, including the heavily captained Dominic Solanke while other Bournemouth and Luton assets also let failed to return for the army of FPL managers who has backed them.
All the games reviewed, including Arsenal's late win against Brentford, Tottenham's demolition of Aston Villa and the Liverpool-Manchester City draw.
Plus, best assets for the upcoming Blank in Gameweek 29 with an analysis of the 8 teams playing next weekend, Son v Watkins v Toney for captaincy, why Free Hitters can target some alternative players for those not using the Chip and lots more...
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The People's Poll Podcast, vote for your topic of choice before 5pm GMT here: https://www.patreon.com/posts/100146453
