    <item>
      <title>*NOT* The Planet FPL GW27 Deadline Stream In Partnership With FPL Team  | Fantasy Premier League 2023/24</title>
      <description>With James off to Tottenham tomorrow and no deadline stream he decided to bring his usual run up to deadline stream forward to Friday night. And Tottenham and specifically Heung-Min Son are high on agenda for FPL managers, particularly with Richarlison ruled out for the next couple of weeks.
Lots of other FPL dilemmas covered, including Bournemouth assets, hits for defenders, captaincy, Dominic Solanke's fitness and there's lots more strategy chat, particularly surrounding Gameweek 29.
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show, Team News Stream and Nico's Corner
