    <item>
      <title>Chipping In Some More | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 39 | Chip Strategy Special | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Following the conclusion of the FA Cup 5th round, the quarter final draw and the confirmation of the 4 fixtures for Blank Gameweek 29, Suj and James discuss all the latest for Chip Strategy on one of the most important Planet FPL podcasts of the season.
James runs through his projections for the remaining Gameweeks and the reasoning behind them, including where Chelsea v Tottenham is likely to go and which teams are likely to double in Gameweeks 34 and Double.
Plus, there's discussion on permutation awareness, the need for some to still have a Plan B, navigating GW28/29 and the best weeks to use the Bench Boost, Free Hit, Triple Captain and Wildcard chips.
Remember: Play It Your Way! and 'what's best?' can be very team dependent.
Today on Patreon: Money in Football on the future of The League Cup and Chip Talk on a GW27 Wildcard.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: NOT The GW27 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team at 7pm GMT on the Planet FPL YouTube channel with an audio posted shortly after.
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post:
  / 99224753  
