      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Following the conclusion of the FA Cup 5th round, the quarter final draw and the confirmation of the 4 fixtures for Blank Gameweek 29, Suj and James discuss all the latest for Chip Strategy on one of the most important Planet FPL podcasts of the season.</p><p>James runs through his projections for the remaining Gameweeks and the reasoning behind them, including where Chelsea v Tottenham is likely to go and which teams are likely to double in Gameweeks 34 and Double.</p><p>Plus, there's discussion on permutation awareness, the need for some to still have a Plan B, navigating GW28/29 and the best weeks to use the Bench Boost, Free Hit, Triple Captain and Wildcard chips.</p><p>Remember: Play It Your Way! and 'what's best?' can be very team dependent.</p><p>Today on Patreon: Money in Football on the future of The League Cup and Chip Talk on a GW27 Wildcard.</p><p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: <strong>NOT</strong> The GW27 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team at 7pm GMT on the Planet FPL YouTube channel with an audio posted shortly after.</p><p>For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post:</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbklVREpZT0FxS2dvUW41WVowU3lVRmlVazdoZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuMXE3MHdrQlZ2cWk5Nmt1Rk1NeUhvVEZMb3p5QThiTHBoTTJkUDl3V0JISFI4OVUxR3JZXzl3UVpfZUpjUGppMk9kMi1CQlVLYXJYSWFpMFd5Q3l3ck5SdGE3Umxmamt6NHlwa0E1RW1FSUpLcUtJWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fposts%2F99224753&amp;v=t3StX8cMYeY">  / 99224753  </a></p><p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast?</p><p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1ZSMHZ4QjYwUklHWEtPcTFERXc5Y2JoMkJsQXxBQ3Jtc0tuVXBQSkhDeFVrdGNCY0ozWXZRRy1BaVZzYlJpU21QLWc3ck9FX3RzUTlMTmZYSXdRQllJWDBMQkhqRUhvMnJ4a3p3VHMxZ09wRzRfcGVYQU1tNUZIdGZGVXN4d0NCOUZuTml2bzgydVJhd0NsWV9Qcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.co