    <item>
      <title>Ask Suj &amp; Clayts | Friday February 23rd | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>James usually does a live stream most Friday's, but in his absence, Suj and Clayton stepped up (with a fire album cover photo - check Twitter), and in the world where everything revolves around Fantasy Premier League - Suj specifically asked for NO FPL questions.
A variety of weird and wonderful topics, ranging from deep amateur philosophy, to what animals the two could fight, who at Planet FPL would win a Royal Rumble, Suj's jiu-jitsu &amp; Clayton's Salsa Dancing and, a Suj rant, about one of the questions... all of this and more!
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/98751963
