    <item>
      <title>Pack of Wolves | Planet SkyFF S.5 Ep.33 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj is joined by Gary Robinson to discuss the fallout from the weekend results, including modest returns for Halaand, the return of the Egyptian King Salah, and planning for the Wolves v Sheffield United and West Ham v Brentford single game day coming up.
We look at whether it's still time to invest in Liverpool with their injuries, and when it might be time to get stuck in to Bournemouth too.
Today on Patreon: Ham&amp;Ars - is Clayton nice to Suj just a few weeks after the 6-0 drubbing ARsenal gave to West Ham?
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL S.7 Ep. 37 - the 2nd half of DGW25 reviewed for you.
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-12th-98316960
