    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday February 16th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>Mo Salah is back in full training for Liverpool ahead of their Double Gameweek but should he be forced back in immediately for FPL managers?
On James' live stream there's a heavy focus on the upcoming double, but which Brentford, Liverpool, Luton or Manchester City assets are worth getting? And how does that impact on the upcoming blanks of Gameweeks 26 &amp; 29?
For James it's now likely two transfers for a -4 and that is likely to be for two players that DON'T have a double and could it include the player that was regrettably sold last week!?
Plus best replacements for Trent Alexander-Arnold, benching headaches, Triple Captaincy chat and more.
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show, The Team News Stream and Talking Tactics on Bayer Leverkusen
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the DGW25 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel at 10am GMT
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-12th-98316960
