    <item>
      <title>Planning For BGW29 | The People's Poll ep. 139 | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>James is joined by Clayton to explore the best ways of planning towards Gameweek 29 without the use of the Free Hit Chip over the 5 weeks ahead which includes an updated explainer of what we know for the Blank over FA Cup Quarter Final weekend and what is projected to be added.
There's a week by week and step by step guide of which teams to target and sell and when on the pathway to GW29, when we'll get confirmation of what GW29 will look like, how we can plan for that event before we know it, which includes pairing teams such as Luton and Manchester United.
There's coverage of all 20 teams, awareness of value during a planned course of making transfers, why buying Ivan Toney now looks great but may cause a headache, whether a Wildcard would be required straight after the Blank for those heading towards 29, if hits should be taken going into a Blank and lots more.
Today on Patreon: People's Poll Losing Topics, Free Hit 25 and Triple Captain v Bench boost for GW25 + Nico's Corner
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James live stream at 12pm GMT with an audio posted shortly after conclusion
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-12th-98316960
