    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Fri February 9th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon lots of attentions on players who double this week with Liverpool, Luton and Manchester City players heavily focused on and there's also a lot of talk on strategy following Chelsea's excellent win at Aston Villa that will have thrown some FPL managers off course. There's talk on whether a bench boost in GW25 can be right, the difficulty in projecting double gameweeks in 34 and 37 and why though many will frown upon the idea of Free Hitting in GW29 it'll be the right solution for others.
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show and Team News Stream
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Exclusive to the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents the GW24 Deadline Stream in partnership with FPL Team at 10am GMT
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/97881178
