    <item>
      <title>Luton v Sheffield United | CotC with Dan Ashby &amp; Ben Thompson | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Luton Town fan Dan Ashby and Sheffield United fan Ben 'Tommo' Thompson to discuss the latest at their clubs ahead of Saturday's GW24 meeting at Kenilworth Road
Luton assets are about to become very popular in FPL with two forthcoming double Gameweeks and the may cover the blank of 29. Plus they're playing really well! So who's best to invest in?
Are there also really cheap enablers that can be considered from The Blades?
Plus, there's discussion on the relegation battle and we hear from two fans who were promoted with an inability to spend big on what they think of FFP/PSR
Follow Dan on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/danlukeashby
Follow Tommo on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/FPL_Blade
Today on Patreon: Money in Football with Martyn Poole on the latest at Reading and Nico's Corner
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James live stream at 12pm GMT with an audio version posted shortly after
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/97881178
