    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Thursday February 1st | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream today conversation includes why Liverpool v Luton hasn't be arranged for GW25 and why if an announcement isn't forthcoming we might be looking at at a treble Gameweek for The Reds later in the season... but it's not as good as it sounds!
Plus, now Erling Haaland is back has he got to be bought back or is there a case to wait one more week? There's discussion on benching dilemmas and captaincy for GW23, notes on Tottenham last night, thoughts on 'Walkergate' and more...
