    <item>
      <title>Klopp's Shock Announcement | The Fan View with Dan Lord | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>Liverpool correspondent Dan Lord joins James to give his fan view on Friday's shock announcement that Jurgen Klopp with leave The Reds at the end of the current season.
There's discussion on the emotional reaction of the announcement and what's next for Liverpool, not just this season but beyond in to coming years. Is Xabi Alonso the obvious candidate to replace The German?
There's reflections on Klopp's achievements on Merseyside, the trophies, the near misses, the best memories and where he will be regarded by Liverpool fans in relation to other great managers in the club's history.
And the Podcast concludes with a summary of Liverpool's FPL assets ahead of a likely Double Gameweek in 25.
Follow Dan on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/FPL_LocoLord
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s5 ep30
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW22 Preview and The GW22 Team News Stream
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-jan-feb-97403480
