    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday January 26th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, reaction to this morning's shocking news that Jurgen Klopp will stand down as Liverpool manager at the end of the current season. Where does Klopp rank among the Premier League greats and what is the impact on Liverpool both for the remainder of this campaign and beyond?
Plus, this weekend is obviously important for FPL managers as we head into blank and double season and that may also impact decisions for GW22. Discussion includes captaincy and transfer ideas...
Monday on Planet FPL: Chipping in Again, Planet FPL s7 ep32, Chip Strategy Special
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show and Talking Tactics
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-jan-22nd-96961361
