      <title>Ask James | Friday January 19th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon, pros and cons of buying Kevin De Bruyne for GW22, thoughts on Ivan Toney and Brentford for the next couple of months, when end of season double gameweeks will be confirmed, James Maddison's return and Tottenham's interest in Antonio Nusa, plus much more
