    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday January 12th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this morning, deliberations over who to sell first from the flagged Trent Alexander-Arnold, Jarrod Bowen, Mo Salah and Heung-Min Son deliberated. James reveals his likely 2 Free Transfers but there could be a third move for a -4. There's more strategy talk around chips, conversation on benching headaches, some Tottenham nostalgia, anti-competition discussion and more...
Still to come today on the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents The GW21 Deadline Stream in partnership with FPL Team, live at 515pm GMT
Today on Patreon: The GW21 Differential Show and The G21 Team News Stream in partnership with FPL Team
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/96059135
