    <item>
      <title>Best GW21 Captain? | The People's Poll ep. 136 | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>Clayton joins James for discussion for captaincy this week and with Mohamed Salah, Heung-Min Son and Jarrod Bowen absent, plus Erling Haaland remaining doubtful, it's not easy to choose who may be best!
The podcast doubles up as a preview of the games in GW21 including tactical insight into Manchester United against Tottenham with an analysis of captaincy possiblities from each game leading towards an overall conclusion.
But will James and Clayton agree...?
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 10am GMT with an audio posted shortly after conclusion
Today on Patreon: Money in Football on Nottingham Forest's possible FFP Charge and Talking Tactics on Tottenham's defensive issues on their right
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/96059135
