    <item>
      <title>Repair And Overhaul | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 27 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>With just over 48 hours to go until the closure of the Sky Fantasy Football Overhaul Suj and James deliberate the players under consideration for selection ahead of the Friday night Burnley-Luton encounter, but should Sky managers really consider skipping the very first game after Overhaul?
Every team covered, with a number ruled out of interest; there's a core 5-6 players likely to be in the majority of teams, considering how to get injured and unavailable players back in needs to be remembered, covering captaincy is discussed and James reveals his current draft.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: People's Poll Podcast, vote for your topic of choice via this tweet before 5pm GMT https://x.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1745040537252495648?s=20
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham and Nico's Corner
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/96059135
