      <itunes:summary>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Chelsea fan Gary Mantle and Fulham fan Dara Curran to discuss all the latest at their clubs as both prepare for Carabao Cup Semi Final 1st legs this week and Saturday's West London Derby.
If Chelsea are to get themselves into contention for a Champions League place they need to find consistency and soon; can they do it?
But does Saturday's game mean more for Fulham? And how confident are they following their victory over Arsenal?
Plus, all the important FPL assets covered including Malo Gusto, Cole Palmer and Raul Jimenez. Likely line-ups moving forward and lots more...
Follow Gary on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/Phantomantle
Follow Dara on Twitter/x: https://twitter.com/TheTinkerMen
