    <item>
      <title>Your Overhaul Fix | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 26 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>With the Overhaul now open Suj and James discuss the fixture schedule for the forthcoming months to decipher the teams Sky Fantasy managers will want to invest in for the short and long term and to cover captaincy.
There's discussion on how the want for coverage of some teams eliminates the need for others and the importance of working back from the ideal Sky Fantasy team, particular if the intention is to buy back those on International duty such as Mohamed Salah and Heung-Min Son.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents Bournemouth v Liverpool with Neil Grover and Dan Lord
