    <item>
      <title>Reset Button | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 25 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>With only a week to go before The Overhaul Suj and James discuss all the latest talking points for Sky Fantasy Football and for many tonight feels like the last night to invest. And that means a final look at Chelsea and Manchester City players, but which offer the best investment?
Is it too early to punt on Christopher Nkunku? What should managers do if Erling Haaland suddenly returns tonight or on Saturday?
Plus, remaining captaincies discussed, Gameweek data learnings, listener questions and notes for after Overhaul, including which Salah and Sonny might need to wait until March and there will be some ugly single gamedays
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, West Ham v Brighton with Chris Stone and Sam Murray
Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A and there's a Watchalong with James tonight from 7pm BST for all the Wednesday night football
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-dec-24th-95233013
