    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday December 22nd | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon there's discussion on Wildcard options for those blessed to still have the chip, notes on possible rotation over the festive period and among a varied assortment of questions there's a warning that buying back Mo Salah and Heung-Min Son when they return from international duty may not be as easy as many would think... and that's down to Blank and Double Gameweeks...
Sunday evening on Planet FPL: s7 ep26 GW18 Review
Today on Patreon: Money in Football on the 'Chelsea Loophole' and yesterday's Super League announcement. Plus Chip Talk on Wldcarding in GW19 vs GW20
