      <title>The Big 2023 Football Quiz | Planet FPL</title>
      <description>James presents the annual calendar year football quiz with 50 questions on events that happened in football, primarily featuring Premier League clubs in 2023. And Suj brings his worryingly sketchy memory for the answers to make you all feel like there is an achievable target to beat.
Very best of luck and enjoy the quiz which also acts as a nice remider of many of the key football events throughout the year.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents his Ask James stream Live at 12pm GMT with an audio to follow shortly after
