    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday December 15th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>As we approach the 630pm GMT GW17 FPL Deadline this evening James fields questions on his Ask James live stream and much surrounds the fitness of Erling Haaland. Will he make it? And if not who should replace City's superstar striker?
Plus, Pedro Porro is a popular choice, but when is and isn't he worth a -4? There is advice for Anthony Gordon owners with doubts surrounding his fitness and lots more...
Still to come today on Planet FPL: James presents The GW17 Deadline Stream in partnership with FPL Team Live at 530pm GMT, exclusive to the Planet FPL YouTube Channel
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW17 Preview and The GW17 Team News Stream Live at 4pm GMT
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-dec-11th-94462307
