    <item>
      <title> Kings Of Leon | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 23 | GW15 Review | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>It's more fun with flags with Alphonse Areola, Jamal Laascelles and Heung-Min Son all doubts for the weekend after last night's games that featured Suj's West Ham beating James' Tottenham in the Planet FPL derby.
There's also concerns over several players who could be rotated or suspended over forthcoming Gameweeks and many in the FPL Community will be looking for a Bryan Mbeumo replacement. Cole Palmer and Anthony Gordon appear the obvious choices to replace Brentford's talisman but James may have a different solution...
All the GW15 games discussed which included another late Arsenal away game, a 5 star showing from Fulham and brilliant victories for Aston Villa, Manchester United and Everton.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW16 Deadline stream in partnership with FPL team at 10am GMT on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW16 Preview
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-dec-4th-94050445
