    <item>
      <title>Dirty Sanchez | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 22 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>A week of largely underwhelming captaincy returns for many in Sky Fantasy as Suj and James look ahead to a period where there will be big interest in Newcastle and Tottenham assets tonight and Chelsea's good run begins on Sunday and for some, including Suj and James, the investment has already been made.
There's an update on the prospect of the Man City-Brentford game happening prior to Overhaul, learnings from the weekend, the default upcoming captaincies, awareness of having reserve cover for gamedays, there's attempts to make sense of Chelsea's defenders, Porro v Romero, players on 4 yellows are annoying, listener questions and more...
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s7 ep23 GW15 Review
Today on Patreon: Ask James live stream at 3pm GMT with an audio version to follow
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-dec-4th-94050445
