    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday November 24th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On James' live stream, questions from FPL managers who in the main are concerned ahead of a GW13 that sees many with conflicting issues with assets playing against each other. So what's the solution?
Plus, Jarrod Bowen injury news is important for many, Bryan Mbeumo appeals despite playing Arsenal, holding assets who have good GW18 fixtures deliberated and many returning stars need monitoring.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents The GW13 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team at 10am GMT, exclusive to The Planet FPL YouTube Channel
