    <item>
      <title>Fulham v Wolves | CotC with Dara Curran &amp; Bradley Parker | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Fulham fan Dara Curran and Wolves fan Bradley Parker to discuss all the latest at their clubs and why Fantasy Managers should give both clubs a second look ahead of the Monday Night Football at Craven Cottage.
It's only 1 win in 7 for Fulham and scoring goals continues to prove a problem. What are the solutions and best options?
Meanwhile it's only 1 defeat in 7 for Wolves and the mood has changed for the positive under Gary O'Neil. What can be achieved this season?
Plus, discussion on FPL assets and why the need for cover in this week and gameweeks 15, 16 &amp; 18 means both clubs should be worth a second look, particularly defensively. And the Podcast should very much appeal too to Sky Fantasy managers ahead of Monday's single gameday.
Follow Dara on Twitter: https://twitter.com/TheTinkerMen
Follow Bradley on Twitter: https://twitter.com/parker_bradley
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 12pm GMT with an audio version to follow
Today on Patreon: Quiz on hat-tricks hosted by Alex Trembath
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/93210524
