    <item>
      <title>Luke Who's Back | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 20 with Luke Williams | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>James is joined by Luke Williams, christened 'The Godfather' of Sky Fantasy Football and he is currently flying high at 27th Overall and very much in the running to win the top prize!
How has Luke managed to start so well? Does he think he can sustain his run? Or is it still too early to dream of winning the overall prize?
There's further discussion on Monday's Fulham-Wolves single gameday, differentials and tales of how Luke has learned from past mistakes/successes and lots of listener questions covered.
Follow Luke on Twitter/x: Luke (@dis_fpl) / X (twitter.com)
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Fulham v Wolves with Dara Curran and Bradley Parker
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars, with the latest discussion on the North London rivals
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/93210524
