      <title>Before Unlucky 13 | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 20 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Clayton is back in the hotseat bringing stats on key individuals for James on what we've seen in the Premier League season leading to discussion points ahead of the Premier League and FPL resumption this weekend.
All the big names covered, there's interesting debate on GW13 captaincy, the theory behind picking 'those we know will play' during the busy festive period, GW18 awareness, the possible GW20 Double, injuries and lots more...
