    <item>
      <title>The Lone Wolf | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 19 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj and James discuss upcoming plans and what they decided to do at the weekend with their injured players. Spoiler: Not all were sold.
There's chat on captaincy after the break, why differentials could be the play the closer we get to Overhaul, the continued awareness of Chelsea's fixture swing, December single gamedays and Manchester City's final run before Overhaul.
Plus, there's full coverage of Fulham and Wolves assets ahead of their meeting on November 27th, learnings from the weekend and listener questions covered.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Brentford v Arsenal with Tom Medd and Adam Pritchard
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham with discussion on Tottenham and West Ham
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-92381736
