    <item>
      <title>Newcastle v Chelsea | CotC with Simon Bibby &amp; Gary Mantle | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>A week can be a long time in football and that certainly feels the case ahead of this Clash of the Correspondents as James is joined By Newcastle United fan Simon Bibby and Chelsea fan Gary Mantle to preview the GW13 meeting at St James's Park.
10 days ago Newcastle were beating Arsenal but defeats since to Dortmund in the Champions League and Bournemouth in the Premier League amidst a mounting injury list has caused some concern.
At the same time Chelsea were looking ahead to a daunting run of fixtures while struggling for form, but have since taken 4 points and scored 8 goals across 2 games against Tottenham and Manchester City.
The fortunes have changed for both, quickly, so can Chelsea can now take advantage at one of te toughest way grounds to win at? Or Newcastle maintain their strong home form?
Plus, key FPL assets discussed including Kieran Trippier, Tino Livramento, Anthony Gordon, Reece James and Cole Palmer. And there's a big differential about to make their debut...
Follow Si on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fplBibs
Follow Gary on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Phantomantle
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s5 ep19
Today on Patreon: Horsham's Big Day, The Fan view with Rob Chetty
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: 
https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-nov-13th-92791278
