    <item>
      <title>2 Multiplied By 10 Plus 1 | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 18 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <description>Just when you thought it was safe to log out, the game changes the outlook. It was a disastrous week for the majority of Sky Fantasy Managers and for around half Cristian Romero's red card on Monday night means action needs to be taken for owners.
On the Podcast Suj and James plot solutions to the Romero problem including whether managers should go back when his suspension ends. There's other injuries that may concern too, but within the chaos there are plenty of opportunities within a number of teams.
Plus, weekend learnings, upcoming captaincy preferences, current thinking on the Fulham-Wolves single gameday, listener questions and more...
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Brighton v Sheffield United with Sam Murray and Ben Thompson
Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham with discussion on the absolutely bonkers Monday Night Football
For the full Planet FPL schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-92381736
