    <item>
      <title>Planet FPL Live 4! Audience Q'N'A | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Following Sunday night's live show much of the audience stayed behind for a Q'N'A with Suj and James to ask a variety of FPL and football questions. And absolutely nothing said came back to bite James on the arse at Tottenham last night!
There's talk on FPL players who could break the template, how to deal with the bad Gameweek, football fandom, VAR, Tottenham's title chances (James edit: yes this would now be no chance!), Jarrod Bowen's quality, concerns for Fulham, England's Euro 2024 chances
Thank you to everyone who supported and helped with Monday's event and thank you to everyone in the audience who contributed a question.
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s5 ep18
Today on Patreon: MD4 UCL Fantasy Preview
