    <item>
      <title>Preparing For BGW18 | The People's Poll ep. 134 | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <description>How much of a consciousness should Blank Gameweek 18 have on the thinking and strategy of FPL managers?
On this Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss the two paths managers are on. Those who have used the Wildcard and those who will use it straight after GW19. What difference does this make? Should managers already have a consciousness of the transfers they make now and how that could impact on the Blank?
There's advice, particularly around rotating defensive players, the 3 teams who have outstanding GW18 fixtures, consciousness of who has it good before and in the Gameweek.
And awareness of those who don't play, Manchester City and Brentford, their great fixtures before and after the Blank and the likelihood of the postponed fixture being rearranged for GW20, but at what point should we think that might not happen...?  
TICKETS FOR THE PLANET FPL LIVE SHOW OUR NOW ON SALE! Buy your tickets for the event on November 5th here https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/planet-fpl-live-4-tickets-737062452637?aff=ebdsshslack
Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the GW11 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team at 10am GMT on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel
Today on Patreon: The Differential Show, GW11 Preview
