      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon lots of FPL dilemmas covered and there does seem in some cases a reactionary nature to some suggested transfers. There's answers for benching dilemmas, one week punts, future transfers and more... which includes why time may be up on Erik Ten Hag's reign as Manchester United manager..
