      <title>Log Out | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 17 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/log-out-planet-skyff-s-5-ep-17-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss all the latest for Sky Fantasy and for many managers this could be a period to relax and let the points take care of themselves and for those trying to chase patience may be needed.
That's because the upcoming captaincy options focuses very much around the current top 4 of Arsenal, Liverpool, Manchester City and Tottenham looking best and the announcement of the December TV fixtures has only added to the narrative.
There's a full briefing of the TV picks including those straight after Overhaul, why returning to Chelsea ownership will look crucial, learnings from the weekend, listener questions and more...
