    <item>
      <title>Luton v Liverpool | CotC with Dan Ashby &amp; Dan Lord | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/luton-v-liverpool-cotc-with-dan-ashby-dan-lord-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>James is joined by Dan and Dan on Clash of the Correspondents this week as Luton Town fan Dan Ashby and Liverpool fan Dan Lord discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of the Super Sunday meeting at Kenilworth Road.
Luton have shown variation of late but points are still proving difficult to accumulate. Can they beat the drop and does it already look like 3 from 4 will go down?
Can The Reds mount a serious challenge for the title after a promising start despite some difficult fixtures?
Plus, Salah v Haaland for the GW11 FPL armband, Kostantinos Tsimikas potential, the 'want' to have Mr Chaos Darwin Nunez and are there any enabling Luton assets for consideration?
Follow Dan Ashby on Twitter/X: @danlukeashby
