      <description>On the Gameweek 10 Review, a big weekend of swings with Erling Haaland returning big and Ollie Watkins blanking, whilst Mo Salah and Bukayo Saka returned but perhaps not as big as captainers may have hoped.
City tore United apart in the Manchester Derby, Tottenham stayed top with victory at Palace and Chelsea lost at home to Brentford again.
All the games reviewed and all the important FPL assets discussed. 
