      <description>With James off to Selhurst Park tonight for the game, the Deadline stream was brought forward to a lunchtime start and released for you as an audio too.
 There's big desire for many to get Ollie Watkins and Bukayo Saka and for many it looks like Tottenham assets may have to be the sacrifice to get there. But at what cost...?
 Plus there's discussion on captaincy, advice for those on Wildcard, best enablers, hit evaluations and lots more...
