    <item>
      <title>Bournemouth v Burnley | CotC with Neil Grover &amp; Jack Toner | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/bournemouth-v-burnley-cotc-with-neil-grover-jack-toner-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>In pre season they were the two teams who the cool kids (and some not cool kids) were predicting to surprise and finish towards the upper ends of the bottom half or perhaps even better. But now both currently find themselves in the relegation zone and in deep trouble.
 So why has it gone so wrong for Bournemouth and Burnley?
 James is joined by Bournemouth fan Neil Grover and Burnley fan Jack Toner to discuss what's gone wrong and if there is reason for optimism ahead of what already feels like a vital 6 pointer at The Vitality Stadium on Saturday.
 Follow Neil on Twitter @AFCBNG
 Follow Jack on Twitter @TurfyTopper
 TICKETS FOR THE PLANET FPL LIVE SHOW OUR NOW ON SALE! Buy your tickets for the event on November 5th here https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/planet-fpl-live-4-tickets-737062452637?aff=ebdsshslack
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents *NOT The GW10 Deadline Stream Live at 12pm BST with an audio version to follow
 Today on Patreon: Nico hosts a Quiz on the Balon D'Or
