    <item>
      <title>What's Wrong At Manchester United? | The Fan View with Gary Robinson | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/whats-wrong-at-manchester-united-the-fan-view-with-gary-robinson-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Gary Robinson joins James for a detailed discussion on all things Manchester United and to reflect on what has been a difficult opening start to the season for the club both on and off the pitch.
 Sheikh Jassim has reportedly withdrawn his bid to buy the club and a minority investment from Sir Jim Ratcliffe and INEOS now appears to be close to competition, leaving many United fans unhappy as there was hope the Glazers would leave.
 There's been off field issues with Mason Greenwood, Antony and Jadon Sancho and pressure has been mounting on manager Erik Ten Hag with results not meeting expectations.
 So how do the issues get resolved?
 And the Podcast begins with discussion on the sad passing of the great Sir Bobby charlton.
 TICKETS FOR THE PLANET FPL LIVE SHOW OUR NOW ON SALE! Buy your tickets for the event on November 5th here https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/planet-fpl-live-4-tickets-737062452637?aff=ebdsshslack
