      <description>On the Ask James live stream this morning lots of FPL dilemmas covered including over those who are at risk of not being available including Bukayo Saka, there's lots of interest in Liverpool's Konstantinos Tsimikas, there's talk of holding Tottenham assets longer-term and differential midfielders are attracting interest...
