    <item>
      <title>Tottenham v Fulham | CotC with Ricky Saunders &amp; Dara Curran | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/tottenham-v-fulham-cotc-with-ricky-saunders-dara-curran-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>James is joined by Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders and Fulham fan Dara Curran to discuss the latest at their clubs ahead of the Monday Night Football at White Hart Lane.
 Tottenham, against all expectations, are top. Could they...? They couldn't, could they?
 Fulham, are struggling to replace the loss of Aleksandar Mitrovic's goal, is there cause for concern?
 Plus There's discussion on the all important FPL assets across both squads, including whether Heung-Min Son should be given the armband by FPL managers in GW9, if Pedro Porro is worth paying the extra for over Destiny Udogie, why FPL managers may want to consider their options if they own Fulham's Bernd Leno and there's enabling options from both squads to keep an eye on.
 Follow Ricky on Twitter @Ricksaunders77
 Follow Dara on Twitter @TheTinkerMen
 TICKETS FOR THE PLANET FPL LIVE SHOW ARE NOW ON SALE! Buy your tickets for the event on November 5th for just £5 here  https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/planet-fpl-live-4-tickets-737062452637?aff=ebdsshslack
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Simon Thorpe joins James for Planet SkyFF s5 ep15
 Today on Patreon: FPL, Variance and Poker with Tom Hiom
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-oct-16th-91067804
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? 
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Follow Clayton on Twitter: https://twitter.com/claytsAFC
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 #THFC #FFC #FPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
