      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>James is joined by Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders and Fulham fan Dara Curran to discuss the latest at their clubs ahead of the Monday Night Football at White Hart Lane.</p> <p>Tottenham, against all expectations, are top. Could they...? They couldn't, could they?</p> <p>Fulham, are struggling to replace the loss of Aleksandar Mitrovic's goal, is there cause for concern?</p> <p>Plus There's discussion on the all important FPL assets across both squads, including whether Heung-Min Son should be given the armband by FPL managers in GW9, if Pedro Porro is worth paying the extra for over Destiny Udogie, why FPL managers may want to consider their options if they own Fulham's Bernd Leno and there's enabling options from both squads to keep an eye on.</p> <p>Follow Ricky on Twitter @Ricksaunders77</p> <p>Follow Dara on Twitter @TheTinkerMen</p> <p>TICKETS FOR THE PLANET FPL LIVE SHOW ARE NOW ON SALE! Buy your tickets for the event on November 5th for just £5 here <a href="https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/planet-fpl-live-4-tickets-737062452637?aff=ebdsshslack"> https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/planet-fpl-live-4-tickets-737062452637?aff=ebdsshslack</a></p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Simon Thorpe joins James for Planet SkyFF s5 ep15</p> <p>Today on Patreon: FPL, Variance and Poker with Tom Hiom</p> <p>For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-oct-16th-91067804">https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-oct-16th-91067804</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#THFC #FFC #FPL</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
