    <item>
      <title>Taking The Biss | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 14 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/taking-the-biss-planet-skyff-s-5-ep-14-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss their latest thoughts for Sky Fantasy Football after a weekend that caused moves that weren't intended, with Jordan Beyer unavailable, Taiwo Awoniyi out for a month and Yves Bissouma sent off. What moves were made and what's on the agenda next?
 Plus, learnings from the weekend, new enablers putting their hands up for consideration, why 1 Tottenham might not be enough, considering hop on, hop offs with Liverpool and listener questions covered... 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Newcastle United v Crystal Palace with Simon Bibby and Ruaidhri McLaughlin-Dowd
