Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James discuss their latest thoughts for Sky Fantasy Football after a weekend that caused moves that weren't intended, with Jordan Beyer unavailable, Taiwo Awoniyi out for a month and Yves Bissouma sent off. What moves were made and what's on the agenda next?</p> <p>Plus, learnings from the weekend, new enablers putting their hands up for consideration, why 1 Tottenham might not be enough, considering hop on, hop offs with Liverpool and listener questions covered... </p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Newcastle United v Crystal Palace with Simon Bibby and Ruaidhri McLaughlin-Dowd</p> <p>Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham</p> <p>For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: </p> <p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/89442472">https://www.patreon.com/posts/89442472</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#SkyFF #SkyFantasy #SkyFantasyFootball</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
