    <item>
      <title>You Don't Own Him | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 13 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/you-dont-own-him-planet-skyff-s-5-ep-13-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss all the latest for Sky Fantasy Football ahead of a weekend where for many assets there's a case to buy, but also a case to wait.
 There's discussion on captaincy for Saturday, with Heung-Min Son on mind, and if Sunday is the sort of day where you can gamble and take on Erling Haaland as he visits The Emirates.
 There's discussion on Marvellous Nakamaba and Jordan Beyer following varying fortunes in last night's Luton and Burnley game and to get to Beyer James made a perhaps surprising sacrifice.
 Plus, listener questions, Tottenham assets, concerns over Saka's fitness, the last chance to join the Newcaste train and consciousness of re-entry points for the likes of Saliba, Watkins, Dunk and Rodri... 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Wolves v Aston Villa with Bradley Parker and Lee Jackson
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: 
