      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/when-to-wildcard-planet-fpl-202324-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>In an extension of yesterday's main Podcast Suj and James discuss when is best to Wildcard and why for many the time will be now.
 There's chat on the possibility of Wildcarding over the next 3 weeks, awareness of fixture swings, drafts with and without Erling Haaland and Mo Salah.
 And there's a look at Wildcarding in late December around Manchester City's GW18 Blank and the possible GW20 Double.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s5 ep13, all the latest of Sky Fantasy Football
