        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James review all the football so far in Gameweek 7 which featured huge controversy, particularly at White Hart Lane with Luis Diaz having a goal disallowed which was clearly onside. </p> <p>James sets a 10 minute timer to explain anger at what was arguably the worst piece of refereeing in Premier League history, despite the fact victory took Tottenham up to second.</p> <p>The rant is followed by discussion on all the games including Villa's mauling of Brighton as Ollie Watkins scored a monster 23 points to take him top of the FPL points scoring chart ahead of Erling Haaland who blanked as Manchester City were beaten at Wolves.</p> <p>Plus, all the FPL assets of interest discussed as West Ham and Jarrod Bowen come into our thinking, there's injury updates, tactical thoughts and whether Heung-Min Son is deserving of the Gameweek 8 armband...  </p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: When To Wildcard, a look at now versus December</p> <p>Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A</p> <p>For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: </p> <p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/90159270">https://www.patreon.com/posts/90159270</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a hre