Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>James is joined by Bournemouth fan Neil Grover and Arsenal fan Adam Pritchard to discuss the latest at their clubs and the FPL assets within them in the first of two Clash of the Correspondents this week.</p> <p>The Cherries remain winless under Andoni Iraola but they've had a tough run of fixtures and have only lost to teams within the current top 4. Is there case for optimism still on the South Coast ahead of a kinder run of fixtures after Arsenal?</p> <p>Arsenal remain unbeaten but there appears some cause for concern amongst some recent injury concerns and an absence for Declan Rice would lead to potentially significant alarm. And do they need a no 9?</p> <p>Plus, all the key FPL assets discussed including best Bournemouth options that may enable investment in Liverpool, Bukayo Saka and if he'll ever get a rest, if Gabriel should be back on radar and more...</p> <p>Including if Adam and James can maintain peace after yesterday's North London Derby... </p> <p>Follow Neil on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/AFCBNG">https://twitter.com/AFCBNG</a></p> <p>Follow Adam on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho">https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho</a></p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s7 ep12 - Gameweek 6 Review</p> <p>Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A</p> <p>For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week, including our offering on Patreon view this post: </p> <p><a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/89794423">https://www.patreon.com/posts/89794423</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#AFCB #AFC #FPL</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
