      <description>On James's live stream this morning on YouTube much of the talk focuses on this week's big transfer target Julian Alvarez. Has James bought? And should others?
 Plus, discussion on weekend benching headaches, thinking longer term is advised for those on Wildcard, if Tottenham assets should be held ahead of the North London Derby and lots more... including what a non owner should do if they DON'T have Erling Haaland...
