      <title>Ask James | Friday September 15th | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-friday-september-15th-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>On James' live stream this afternoon, inevitable questions on Tottenham assets covered, including how important is it to buy Son and if he should be captained, Porro vs Udogie and the importance of knowing what we get from Maddison.
 Plus, who's expendable if investing in Tottenham? The importance of considering outcomes before purchasing, when might the Wildcard be of best use and lots more...
