      <title>How Howe Morris Minor? | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 10 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/morris-minor-planet-fpl-s-7-ep-10-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Clayton joins James for a discussion on what we've learned so far, what we still need to understand and what impact the announcement of the Luton-Burnley fixture should have on Fantasy managers in the build up to Double Gameweek 7.
 Best Luton and Burnley assets covered, awareness of upcoming positive fixture swings that are coming up, particularly for Liverpool and Aston Villa, weariness of rotation for the four Champions League clubs, if Fulham are worth a second look and just how much investment and confidence should there in Tottenham assets with 5 currently making up the team of the season...?
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Southampton v Leicester City with Matt Samuel and Aaron Lagor
