      <title>Better Clayt Than Never | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 9 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/better-clayt-than-never-planet-skyff-s-5-ep-9-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>James is joined by Clayton for his Sky Fantasy Podcast debut and he's in his first season of playing but finding it difficult to adjust to the style of Sky Fantasy management. Can James help open Clayton's mind to exploiting key fixtures gains and principles of what works in Sky Management?
 Plus, fixture adjustments in September and October and what the fallout of that means including the consequences particularly for interest in Arsenal and Newcastle players, learnings from the weekend, the Nottingham Forest single gamedays, listener questions and lots more...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Manchester United v Brighton with Gary Robinson and Sam Murray
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars, with all the latest on the North London clubs
