    <item>
      <title>Sheffield United v Everton | CotC with Ben Thompson &amp; Sean Norton | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/sheffield-united-v-everton-cotc-with-ben-thompson-sean-norton-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>James is joined by Sheffield United fan Ben 'Tommo' Thompson and Everton fan Sean Norton on Clash of the Correspondents on what already feels like a critical 6 pointer at the foot of the table with both sides pointless so far this season.
 How dire is the situation for both clubs? Does this already feel like a must win or must not lose situation?
 Plus, thoughts on the squads going forward with the transfer deadline looming tonight and whether more incomings can be expected and there's discussion on the FPL assets that will interest such as George Baldock, Cameron Archer and Jordan Pickford...
 Still to come on Planet FPL today: James presents The GW4 Deadline Stream Live in partnership with FPL Team at 530pm BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel
 Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW4 Preview
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
