      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On James' live stream this morning, solution to the Luke Shaw problem detailed, there's coverage of both FPL and SkyFF questions and it won't surprise with the fixtures ahead that Chelsea and Manchester City assets are popular.</p> <p>Plus lots more... including James Maddison's fitness, looking ahead, GW3 Bench Boosts discussed and considering enablers as a solution to the immediate...</p> <p>Still to come today on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel James presents the GW3 Deadline stream Live in partnership with FPL Team at 530pm BST</p> <p>Today on Patreon: GW3 Preview | The Differential Show</p> <p>For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
