      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/city-slickers-planet-skyff-s-5-ep-7-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss how their gameweek went and moves on mind ahead of a very important entry point on Sunday.
 And that entry point is for Manchester City, how big should Sky Fantasy managers go ahead of the trip to Bramall Lane?
 There's discussion on the October TV fixture announcement and that will bring Tottenham assets into managers thinking when the time is right.
 Plus, captaincy for the weekend including the tough Saturday choice, the premium who may become expendable, learnings from last weekend and more...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: People's Poll - Manchester United's Mason Greenwood U-Turn
