      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/a-chily-start-planet-skyff-s-5-ep-6-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James reflect on their opening decisions in Sky Fantasy and discuss their likely first moves this weekend and Chelsea assets are top of the agenda, but who's best to buy?
 Plus, thoughts on the Forest-Sheffield United Friday night clash, if those who don't own should skip and if those who do you should look to sell straight after.
 Plus, who caught the eye at the weekend including a player to keep on radar at 6.6, captaincy thoughts for the rest of the weekend including a wide open Sunday and Haaland v Salah on Saturday...
