        <![CDATA[<p>On the first Gameweek Review of the season Suj &amp; James discuss the 9 games played at the weekend and all the relevant fallout for FPL managers.</p> <p>But first there's discussion on the drama before deadline surrounding the Manchester City team news and the rumoured absence of Arsenal's Gabriel.</p> <p>There's discussion on the FPL assets that interest most now that we've seen them play, what John Stones and Gabriel owners should do, the season's first bandwagon might not be a bandwagon at all. Plus, there's tactical insight to the games watched, including discussion on Arsenal's 3-1-6, Villa's high line that got shredded at Newcastle, Chelsea's unexpected setup.</p> <p>And what about that Bench Boost? Was it successful for James...?</p> <p>And do Salah owners dare captain the Egyptian King over Erling Haaland in GW2?</p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James live stream at 12pm BST with an audio version to follow</p> <p>Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A</p> <p>For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-aug-14th-87649352">www.patreon.com/posts/content-aug-14th-87649352</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.c