      <description>On the final Sky Fantasy Football Podcast before Friday's big kick off Suj and James ponder their current drafts and the final decisions (well, James does anyway!)
 On the Podcast: Kane vs Salah, sacrificing one from the Arsenal, Liverpool and Man Utd attacks, that annoying Forest-Sheffield United single gameday, Man City assets, Levi Colwill's prospects, best enabler, first weekend captaincy, forward thinking and more...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 12pm BST with an audio version to follow
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-87295971
