      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p> Bournemouth fan Neil Grover joins James for discussion on The Cherries and a very important discussion on what to expect from new manager Andoni Iraola… and there’s plenty for Bournemouth fans to be enthused about.</p> <p> There is however a daunting opening 7 fixtures of the season and Bournemouth will do well to be outside the bottom 3 by the end of it… but on the flip side Iraola’s Rayo Vallecano were adept at causing upsets against the big boys, which leads to an interesting debate about the GW2 fixture at Liverpool.</p> <p> There’s a detailed tactical chat about how Iraola likes to set up, plus an overview of the squad, likely starting eleven, the prospects for Dominic Solanke and why new left-back Milos Kerkez should be one Fantasy managers keep a close eye on…</p> <p> Follow Neil on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/AFCBNG">https://twitter.com/AFCBNG</a></p> <p> Next on Correspondent Week: ep. 16 – Chelsea with Gary Mantle, Friday 2pm BST </p> <p> Today on Patreon: The Correspondent Week Debrief with Suj: on Sheffield United, Newcastle, Bournemouth and Chelsea</p> <p> For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/86901192"> https://www.patreon.com/posts/86901192</a></p> <p> Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p> Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl"> https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p> Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod"> https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p> Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah"> https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p> Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC"> https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p> Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL"> https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p> Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl"> https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p> Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl"> https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p> #FPL #CorrespondentWeek #AFCB</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
