    <item>
      <title>Tottenham with Ricky Saunders | Correspondent Week ep. 12 | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/tottenham-with-ricky-saunders-correspondent-week-ep-12-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>Ricky Saunders joins James to talk all things Tottenham and there’s only one place to start, and that’s to answer the big burning question, will Harry Kane stay, and what will Tottenham look like with and without their talisman?
  There’s an intro to Ange Postecoglu, spoiler, expect a much more attacking Tottenham, and details of tactical principles including the roles of the full-backs and who’s likely to start in those positions.
  Plus, the need for at least one centre-back is desperate, the roles of James Maddison and Heung-Min Son in this ‘new Tottenham’ are beginning to look defined and there’s eyes on a couple of interesting lower price Tottenham players, though like with much of the team there’s no certainty that they will start.
  Follow Ricky on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Rickysaunders77
  Next on Correspondent Week: ep. 13 – Sheffield United with Ben Thompson, Thursday 7pm BST 
  Today on Patreon: The Correspondent Week Debrief with Suj: on Manchester United, West Ham, Fulham and Tottenham
  For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/86901192
  Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? 
  Join us on Patreon:  https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
  Follow James on Twitter:  https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
