      <title>West Ham United with Chris Stone | Correspondent Week ep. 10 | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/west-ham-united-with-chris-stone-correspondent-week-ep-10-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>Chris Stone joins James to discuss the potential of The Hammers FPL assets and reflect on the Europa Conference League triumph.
  But is all well? Since European glory, star man Declan Rice has been sold and no signings have been made. Remarkably there are still question marks hanging over David Moyes’ future…
  Can Jarrod Bowen rediscover the form that made his so popular with Fantasy managers two seasons ago? Or could Said Benrahma offer an intriguing and cheaper alternative?
  Who’s likely to start upfront? Who’s the best of the 4.5 defenders and could 4.0 Alphonse Areola start in goal?
  Follow Chris on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_SkyAddict
  Next on Correspondent Week: ep. 11 – Fulham with Dara Curran, Thursday 10am BST 
  Today on Patreon: The Correspondent Week Debrief with Suj: on Crystal Palace, Brentford, Luton and Wolves
