    <item>
      <title>Gaffr Preview with the EFL Fantasy Podcast | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/gaffr-preview-with-the-efl-fantasy-podcast-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>Angus McPhail, Dan Ashby and Jamie Roberts from the EFL Fantasy Podcast joins James for a preview of Gaffr, the Fantasy game for The Championship, which kicks off in 7 days time.
 There's an outline of scoring differences to FPL for new players, the vital 'boosts' in play and why the type of player you want in Gaffr can vary somewhat to the best FPL assets.
 And there's debate about best Gaffr assets as James (definitely not an expert) reveals his current Gaffr draft and gets roasted for it... or does he...? 
 Follow The EFL Podcast on Twitter: https://twitter.com/EFL_Fantasy
 Follow Angus on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Angus81
 Follow Dan on Twitter: https://twitter.com/danlukeashby
 Follow Jamie on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Jamie_Gaffr
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham
 Next Week: Correspondent Week - 20 Podcasts in 6 days with the Correspondents on each Premier League club. Starts on Monday evening.
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Follow Clayton on Twitter: https://twitter.com/claytsAFC
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 #Gaffr #EFLFantasy #TheChampionship
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
