 Follow Dan on Twitter: https://twitter.com/danlukeashby
 Follow Jamie on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Jamie_Gaffr
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham
 Next Week: Correspondent Week - 20 Podcasts in 6 days with the Correspondents on each Premier League club. Starts on Monday evening.
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
