Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Angus McPhail, Dan Ashby and Jamie Roberts from the EFL Fantasy Podcast joins James for a preview of Gaffr, the Fantasy game for The Championship, which kicks off in 7 days time.</p> <p>There's an outline of scoring differences to FPL for new players, the vital 'boosts' in play and why the type of player you want in Gaffr can vary somewhat to the best FPL assets.</p> <p>And there's debate about best Gaffr assets as James (definitely not an expert) reveals his current Gaffr draft and gets roasted for it... or does he...? </p> <p>Follow The EFL Podcast on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/EFL_Fantasy">https://twitter.com/EFL_Fantasy</a></p> <p>Follow Angus on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/Angus81">https://twitter.com/Angus81</a></p> <p>Follow Dan on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/danlukeashby">https://twitter.com/danlukeashby</a></p> <p>Follow Jamie on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/Jamie_Gaffr">https://twitter.com/Jamie_Gaffr</a></p> <p>Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham</p> <p>Next Week: Correspondent Week - 20 Podcasts in 6 days with the Correspondents on each Premier League club. Starts on Monday evening.</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL">https://www.youtube.com/@PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#Gaffr #EFLFantasy #TheChampionship</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
