      <description>Suj and James discuss understanding the 'want' versus the 'need' on the latest Sky Fantasy Football Podcast and there's detailed analysis on the best midfield enablers which includes a new Marvelous addition...
 Is Nakamba now the go to midfield enabler? Maybe so, but it still might not be reason enough to start with him...
 And who are the players we want that we may have to go without...?
