Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #ChipStrategy
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James discuss their annual pre season Podcast looking at Chip Strategy and when might be best to use the Free Hit, Bench Boost, Triple Captain and Wildcard chips.</p><p>There's an overview of the season picture including the outlook for the end of season Blanks and Doubles and why a template may not be as strong during that period this season.</p><p>Plus, where the postponed Luton-Burnley and Man City-Brentford fixtures are likely to go, why use for the first Wildcard isn't obvious, awareness of best Triple Captaincy possibilities, why the Free Hit can be used more aggressively this season and why consideration should be given to going against the norm with the Bench Boost...</p><p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The People's Poll will have a look at players who may well improve in their 2nd Premier League season</p><p>Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A</p><p>For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-july-86551047">https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-july-86551047</a></p><p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p><p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p><p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p><p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p><p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p><p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p><p>#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #ChipStrategy</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
