    <item>
      <title>Inspect This | with Luke Williams (@ffscout_luke) | Planet SkyFF S. 5 Ep. 3 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/inspect-this-with-luke-williams-ffscout_luke-planet-skyff-s-5-ep-3-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Luke Williams joins James on this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast to discuss some key topics including learning from mistakes, the importance of 'starters', getting the right enabler and goalscoring midfielders versus reliable midfield tier points scorers.
 There's a focus on Arsenal assets and the challenge of picking the right one considering the 'want' of several midfield players across the game, plus the impact of the Luton-Burnley matchday 2 postponement and it means a greater emphasis should be placed on West Ham assets... 
 Follow Luke on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ffscout_luke
 Follow the Inspected Goals Podcast on Twitter: https://twitter.com/inspectedGoals
 And subscribe to the Inspected Goals YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/@inspectedgoals1086/featured
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clayton joins James for The Transfer Window Show
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars, with all the latest on the North London rivals
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/86217104
