    <item>
      <title>What's Changed? | with guest host Tom Campbell | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 3 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/whats-changed-with-guest-host-tom-campbell-planet-fpl-s-7-ep-3-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>The Mayor FPL Tom Campbell is back to guest host the Podcast and ask James what's likely to change about 5 clubs who are likely to be key in FPL managers thinking ahead of GW1; Manchester United, Newcastle, Liverpool, Brighton and inevitably, Tottenham.
 What impact will new signings Andre Onana and Mason Mount have on our interest in United assets?
 Can Newcastle maintain their strong defensive numbers from last season and how will Sandro Tonali fit in?
 Which of the mid priced Liverpool assets is most likely to stand out?
 Will brilliant Brighton provide brilliant FPL assets again?
 And how are Tottenham likely to set up tactically under Ange Postecoglu?
 Follow Tom on Twitter @UtterlyTC: https://twitter.com/UtterlyTC
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Lauren Harris is James' guest for a preview of the Women's World Cup
 Today on Patreon: Clayton joins James for the Patreon Q'N'A
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/86217104
