      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-friday-july-14th-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>On James's YouTube stream lots of conversation on FPL topics including strategies, forward thinking, preparing mentally, ownership consciousness and the individuals that are on people's mind including Trent, Mo Salah, Phil Foden, Raheem Sterling and lots more...
 Plus, as ever there's conversation on Tottenham, the positivity of 'most' clubs heading into the new season and also reflection on Dele's interview on The Overlap yesterday...
 If you would prefer to watch today's stream https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MoBpHxyp-I8
