      <title>The Transfer Window Show ep. 2 with fpl.team's Peter Featherstone | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-transfer-window-show-ep-2-with-fplteams-peter-featherstone-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>On The Transfer Window Show James is joined by Peter Featherstone from fpl.team to discuss all the latest stories effecting Premier League clubs in the transfer window.
 There's discussion on some of the latest completed moves including Pau Torres, Nathan Collins and Manor Soloman; the continued exodus of players from Stamford Bridge and all the latest rumours including Manchester United's attempts to sign Andre Onana and Saudi Arabia's continued attempt to sign stars that has included links with the likes of Aleksander Mitrovic and Jordan Henderson...
 Check out https://fpl.team/
 Support fpl.team https://ko-fi.com/fplteam
 Follow Peter on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fplteam_
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents his Ask James stream live on YouTube at 12pm BST with an audio version to follow
