    <item>
      <title>England's u21 Winners | The People's Poll ep. 128 | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/englands-u21-winners-the-peoples-poll-ep-128-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>Following England's European Championship success at Under 21 level Suj &amp; James discuss the players at the heart of the success and ask if they can become regulars for the full national men's team in the years to come.
 Plus, is it easier for young attackers to make their mark? There's acknowledgement of some of the youngsters already doing well for the full team and discussion on the players who may make an impact for next group of under 21s.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s5 ep2, with a look at what's 'needed' For Sky Fantasy Mangers
