      <title>The Transfer Window Show ep. 1 | Planet FPL 2023/24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-transfer-window-show-ep-1-planet-fpl-202324</link>
      <description>James is joined by Clayton Fernandes for a new show for Thursday's in July called The Transfer Window Show which focuses on the biggest stories from The Transfer Window.
 On today's Podcast there's discussion on some of the biggest deals done so far featuring discussion on Declan Rice, Kai Havertz, James Maddison, Mason Mount, Alexis Mac Allister, Dominik Szoboszlai, Mateo Kovacic and Youri Tielemans.
 There's also coverage on Brentford, Brighton, Chelsea and Wolves, the departure of Ilkay Gundogan and the future of Harry Kane amid links with Bayern Munich...  
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James live stream at 12pm BST on YouTube with an audio version also available
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham
