      <description>Suj and James begin their 5th season of coverage of Sky Fantasy Football with an introduction to the game aimed to assist new players. 
 There's discussion on the rules, the scoring and some top tips on strategies around captaincy, transfers and players who will be of interest almost irrespective of their opening price. 
