      <title>FPL Fixture Analysis | Planet FPL S. 7 Ep. 1 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fpl-fixture-analysis-planet-fpl-s-7-ep-1-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the opening Podcast of Planet FPL Season 7, Suj &amp; James take a deep dive into the fixtures with a particular focus on the teams that do and don't appeal for FPL managers at the start of the season. 
 The Podcast features discussion on captaincy and if it'll be safe to oppose Erling Haaland often enough to consider going without him, there's a summary of rotational pairing options and teams positive and negative fixture streaks and none of the big clubs should be out of the thinking of FPL managers at the start... 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Reaction to Monday's Price Reveals on the People's Poll Podcast
 Today on Patreon: An explainer of James' Planner
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-july-85485750
