      <description>On the final Podcast of Planet FPL Season 6 Suj &amp; James discuss their FPL Seasons, reflecting on the good and the bad including reflection on chip usage, the players who helped and hindered their seasons most, best and worst weeks and there's an analysis on the two biggest areas of point scoring which meant Suj beat James.
 Plus, lessons learned, the importance of the template and the Podcast begins with the positive reaction to West Ham's Conference League triumph.
 The Podcast returns on Monday July 3rd with the launch of Season 7!
 Today on Patreon: Our Patreon Survey feedback Podcast and Talking Tactics on Inter Milan and the Champions League Final
