    <item>
      <title>A Chat With AT Patreon Mini League Winner Chris Duckworth | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/a-chat-with-at-patreon-mini-league-winner-chris-duckworth-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>James is joined on the Podcast by Advanced Tier Patreon Min League Winner Chris Duckworth to discuss his successful FPL season that has now seen him achieve successive top 10,000 finishes.
 There's discussion on Chris' playstyle and key decisions made throughout the season, which includes deploying chips in exactly the same way James did! And there's thoughts on the importance of starting well, awareness of staying with the template and the players that helped and hindered Chris' season.
 Follow Chris on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPL_Coke_Zero
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Ask James, live stream at 12pm BST with an audio Podcast to follow
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ars: A discussion on Tottenham and Arsenal with @ClaytsAFC
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/84092975
