    <item>
      <title>Man City v Man Utd | F.A. Cup Final CotC with @FPLPringle &amp; @ismyCAPplaying | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/man-city-v-man-utd-fa-cup-final-cotc-with-fplpringle-ismycapplaying-planet-fpl-202223-0</link>
      <description>On the final Clash of the Correspondents of the season James is joined by Manchester City fan Jonny Pringle and Manchester United fan Gary Robinson to preview Saturday's first all Manchester FA Cup Final.
 There's tactical thoughts and discussion on likely line ups for the final, the evolution of the rivalry over City's dominant period and discussion on the club's seasons...
 Can anyone compete with City in the next campaign following another title victory?
 Should United be happy with 3rd, a League Cup win and another final to come?
 And City are on the verge of the treble, a feat only achieved by rivals United back in 1999, but do City dare look beyond United? And if they do win on Saturday would beating Inter appear a formality?
 Today on Patreon: The Differential Show Season Review
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-may-2nd-83712571
 ___________________________________________
