    <item>
      <title>Revenge Or Repeat? | GW39 Preview with @Benny_Blanco40 &amp; @DavidMunday815 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/revenge-or-repeat-gw39-preview-with-benny_blanco40-davidmunday815-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>This Saturday the hotly anticipated GW39 rematch between North and South members of the FPL Twitter Community takes place at Castle Vale Stadium in Birmingham to raise money for Street Child United.
 James is joined by North Player Manager Benny Blanco and South Player Manager David Munday to preview Saturday's meeting where the North will be looking to avenge last year's 2-1 defeat.
 There's discussion on the rivalry, the banter, what's different this year on the day of the event and how the community can pick their favourite players in the official GW39 Fantasy game on gaffr.io
 Plus, a reminder that the game is played for Street Child United, raising valuable funds for a very important charity.
 Buy Tickets or Donate to the GW39 fundraising fund: https://www.gw39northvsouth.co.uk/
 Follow GW39 on Twitter: https://twitter.com/GW39FPL
 Follow Benny on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Benny_Blanco40
 Follow David on Twitter: https://twitter.com/DavidMunday815
 Today on Patreon: Ask James live stream at 3pm BST
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: FA Cup Final, Clash of the Correspondents, Manchester City v Manchester United with @FPLPringle &amp; @ismyCAPplaying
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-may-2nd-83712571
 ___________________________________________
