      <title>No Kane Meant Pain | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 52 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/no-kane-meant-pain-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-52-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the final Gameweek Review of the season Suj &amp; James discuss all the games from Sunday's Premier League Final Day... and guess who missed the deadline...!!!
 On the Pod, the brilliance of Harry Kane, Villa clinched European qualification, Everton stayed up at the expense of Leeds and Leicester, there's thoughts on who needs to invest where over the summer and early thoughts on next season...
 Thank you to everyone who has supported the show this season.
 Today on Patreon: The Patreon Q'N'A
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James is joined by new Luton Correspondent @danlukeashby to discuss The Hatters promotion to The Premier League on The Fan View
