      <title>Everton v Bournemouth | CotC with @spirit_blues &amp; @AFCBNG | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/everton-v-bournemouth-cotc-with-spirit_blues-afcbng-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents (recorded prior to Leicester's draw at Newcastle) James is joined by Everton fan Sean Norton and Bournemouth fan Neil Grover to discuss the latest at their clubs and discuss Sunday's critical final day game at Goodison Park.
 There's discussion on one week punts for FPL. Who's the best offensive Everton asset to take a chance on? Is Dominic Solanke being overlooked?
 Plus, there's discussion on a potential Everton takeover, The Toffees battle to beat the drop and the incredible job Gary O'Neil has done to get The Cherries away from danger. 
 Tomorrow on the Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s4 ep41
 Today on Patreon: Money In Football - Ivan Toney's Betting Ban
