      <title>Ask James | Friday May 19th 2023 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-friday-may-19th-2023-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On James' live stream on YouTube this afternoon thoughts on the key talking points covered and it seems most of the community want to buy Bruno Fernandes with doubts over the fitness of Marcus Rashford... but James isn't likely to be one investing in the United playmaker.
 Plus, best Brighton and Man City assets to invest in now, benching headaches around the likes of Alexander-Arnold, Salah and last night's hero (or villian, subject to whether you own him) Callum Wilson...
 Tomorrow on the Planet FPL: James presents The GW37 Deadline Stream Live on the Planet FPL YouTube channel at 10am BST
