    <item>
      <title>Sunday's The Day | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 40 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/sundays-the-day-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-40-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>It's final decision time in Sky Fantasy with many managers likely to use their final transfers in the coming week, but where's best to invest?
 Are the 3 for 1s available for Brighton and Manchester City assets now less interesting with several Seagulls attacking assets to choose from and with City now likely to wrap up the title over the weekend?
 It's meant a second look elsewhere with Newcastle forwards tomorrow night worth a second look and the idea of West Ham assets on Sunday is discussed.
 Plus, captaincy for the week ahead, going with and against the template and more...
 Tomorrow on the Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Manchester United v Chelsea with @ismyCAPplaying &amp; @Phantomantle
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham
