      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/big-mac-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-48-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James wrap up their review of Gameweek 34 with discussion on the final 4 games played this week which saw Arsenal beat a woeful Chelsea, Man City struggle for a while but then cruise to victory against West Ham, Liverpool beat Fulham and there was late drama at The Amex as Alexis MacAllister's 99th minute penalty meant Brighton beat Manchester United and it also caused some massive late swings for FPL managers.
 Plus, there's discussion on being prepared to make late moves tomorrow ahead of the 130pm BST GW35 Deadline with their being every possibility of some late team link information on Manchester City.
 And there's round 2 of Fight Club
 Tomorrow on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel: James presents the GW35 Deadline Stream Lie at 1230pm BST 
 Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW35 Preview
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-may-1st-82305708
