      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest for Sky as managers consider their final moves with key entry points coming up for the Manchester clubs, Brighton and Newcastle.
 Is everyone else bar Liverpool expendable?
 Are there any differentials or enablers that can be considered from outside the 5 remaining clubs of interest?
 Plus, captaincy for the 5 gamedays ahead, picking battles, learnings from the last week, listening questions and more...
