    <item>
      <title>Let's Fight About This | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 47 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/lets-fight-about-this-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-47-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the first part of the Double Gameweek Review Suj &amp; James discuss the 9 games played so far which included Brighton hitting Wolves for six but many FPL managers missed those that hauled, while Julian Alvarez reminded everyone of his quality at Craven Cottage and both West Ham and Tottenham were beaten 4-3... but is seems Suj is more bothered about the Anfield result than James.
 Plus, the relegation battle remains very tight following a thrilling draw between Leicester and Everton, Sam Allardyce looks to be on his way to rescue Leeds after they conceded four at Bournemouth and much of the theme for the Podcast focuses on looking for differentials with many an FPL team looking very similiar currently....
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s4 ep38 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy
 Today on Patreon; The Patreon Q'N'A
