      <itunes:subtitle>Following Sheffield United's promotion back to the Premier League James is joined by Ben 'Tommo' Thompson to discuss The Blades promotion and their chances in the Premier League next season. There's an overview of the squad, the current best eleven,...</itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>Following Sheffield United's promotion back to the Premier League James is joined by Ben 'Tommo' Thompson to discuss The Blades promotion and their chances in the Premier League next season.
 There's an overview of the squad, the current best eleven, where the team needs strengthening most and discussion on key players Ilman N'Diaye and Sander Berge.
 But is there cause for concern...?
 The speculated club takeover of Dozy Mmobuosi appears to be off, much of the squad is out of contract and the club may well have to be prudent to improve a squad which still contains many familiar names from the side that finished bottom in the Premier League in 2021.
 Follow Tommo on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPL_Blade
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s6 ep47: A Review of the DGW34 Weekend
 For the full Planet FPL Schedule this week view this post: https://www.patreon.com/posts/schedule-may-1st-82305708
