    <item>
      <title>White Flag | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 46 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/white-flag-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-46-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the Gameweek 33 Review all eyes continue to be on 5 teams for many FPL managers but there are a number of teams in the upcoming Double Gameweek who have great single fixtures at home and that includes an Arsenal side who were put to the sword by an outstanding Manchester City on Wednesday.
 There's tactical insight into City's 4-1 win, Suj gives all the detail on Liverpool's victory at West Ham and James actually 'felt something' in Tottenham's 2-2 draw with Manchester United.
 All the games covered as usual and a number of FPL managers will be deploying their Wildcard and that includes Suj who has just entered the top 100k, has James given up hope of catching him...?
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents the DGW34 Deadline Stream Live at 10am BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel
 Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW34 Preview
