    <item>
      <title>Man City v West Ham | CotC with @FPLPringle &amp; @Fpl_SkyAddict | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/man-city-v-west-ham-cotc-with-fplpringle-fpl_skyaddict-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Manchester City fan and Jonny Pringle and West Ham fan Chris Stone to discuss the latest at their clubs and the Double Gameweek 34 meeting at The Etihad.
 Do City have the title in the bag following last night's 4-1 victory over Arsenal or is there reason to believe there could still be more twists in the title race? 
 And could West Ham yet be dragged back into trouble? It's assumed they should be fine but there are difficult fixtures to come.
 Plus, FPL discussion includes best City assets for the Double and beyond, rotation concerns, best defensive asset, if De Bruyne is worth investing in, brilliant Haaland and if we should be over looking Hammers assets?
 Follow Jonny on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLPringle
 Follow Chris on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_SkyAddict
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: s6 ep46 with a review of Gameweek 33
 Today on Patreon: It's a Quiz on AC and Inter Milan
 Full the full Planet FPL Schedule this week including the offering on Patreon see this post.. https://www.patreon.com/posts/81965546
