      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/cut-that-out-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-37-sky-fantasy-football-0</link>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss planned moves with many clubs having additional fixtures over the next 8 days and why landing with a lot of Manchester City could be the play for the end of the season.
 On the Pod, captaincy for the next week discussed, identifying players that managers want to keep until the end of the season and the impact of the announcement of the penultimate weekend fixtures which could mean that the likes of Harry Kane and even Arsenal assets can be expendable, and why managers now are generally only looking at investment in 5 teams...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Manchester City v West Ham United with @FPLPringle &amp; @Fpl_SkyAddict
