        <![CDATA[<p>James is joined by Arsenal fan Clayton Fernandes to discuss what a combined Manchester City and Arsenal best eleven might look like.</p> <p>The skillsets of many of the players discussed, Zinchenko Vs Stones inverted, Odegaard or De Bruyne and plenty more debated, plus thoughts on tomorrow night's big game.</p> <p>What would your XI be?</p> <p>Follow Clayton on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/claytsAFC">https://twitter.com/claytsAFC</a></p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s4 ep37 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy</p> <p>Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW33 Preview</p> <p>Full the full Planet FPL Schedule this week including the offering on Patreon see this post.. <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/81965546">https://www.patreon.com/posts/81965546</a></p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#MCFC #AFC #MCIARS</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
