      <title>Isak Another!? | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 45 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/isak-another-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-45-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the Blank Gameweek 32 Review Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss the fallout from a crazy weekend that featured Arsenal dropping more points against Southampton, Diogo Jota starring for Liverpool and Newcastle demolishing Tottenham 6-1.
 On the Pod, all the games reviewed, why now the Manchester clubs, Brighton, Liverpool and Newcastle are the focus for the majority of FPL managers, what Wildcarders are likely to do this week, differential forwards appeal, why waiting might be the better play for many ahead of GW33, update on future Double Gameweeks and more... 
 And the more of course includes James' annihilation of Tottenham's performance on Tyneside
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The People's Poll with @claytsAFC with a Man City v Arsenal theme. Pick your favourite before 530pm BST via this tweet https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1650387112460468226?
 Today on Patreon: The Q'N'A
