    <item>
      <title>Liverpool v Nottingham Forest | CotC with @FPL_LocoLord &amp; @FFScout_Mark | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/liverpool-v-nottingham-forest-cotc-with-fpl_locolord-ffscout_mark-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On the final Clash of the Correspondents of the week James is joined by Liverpool fan Dan Lord and Nottingham Forest fan Mark Sutherns ahead of Saturday's meeting at Anfield.
 On the Podcast...
 Can Liverpool still make the top 4?
 Can Forest fight their way out of trouble?
 There's discussion on the recent tactical tweaks from both tactically that has seen Trent Alexander-Arnold move into a midfield position in possession and Forest's switch to a back three.
 There's of course coverage of the best Liverpool assets for Free Hitters this weekend and for those investing longer-term including one under the radar budget option, and is Mo Salah the right captaincy choice this weekend?
 Plus Mark runs into tech problems and drops out halfway through and James's son Harry finds a question about Trent Alexander-Arnold particularly funny... 
 Follow Dan on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPL_LocoLord
 Follow Mark on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FFScout_Mark
 Today on Patreon: The Differential Show GW32 Preview
 Still to come today on the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents the GW32 Deadline Stream Live at 530pm BST
 Full the full Planet FPL Schedule this week including the offering on Patreon see this post... 🗓 Content Schedule: Apr 17th-21st | Patreon
