    <item>
      <title>Arsenal v Southampton | CotC with @ThreeFiveWho &amp; @CS_Wipeout | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/arsenal-v-southampton-cotc-with-threefivewho-cs_wipeout-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On the second of three Clash of the Correspondents this week James is joined by Arsenal fan Adam Pritchard and Southampton fan Matt Samuel to discuss the latest at their clubs, the title race, the relegation battle and the important Arsenal FPL assets ahead of Blank Gameweek 32.
 Have Arsenal blown their chance after losing 2-0 leads consecutively to Liverpool and West Ham? With the title still very much in their hands surely victory at The Etihad next Wednesday would seal the deal.
 But should Southampton be overlooked? Can they yet pull off a miraculous escape from the foot of the table? Or has rthe towel been thrown in already?
 Plus, best three Arsenal assets for Free Hitters this week and whether for those Bench Boosting in 34 if those players can be a part of that selection.
 It's top versus bottom... 
 Follow Adam on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho
 Follow Matt on Twitter: https://twitter.com/CS_Wipeout
 Today on Patreon: Ask James, live stream at 1pm BST for all Patrons with an audio version to follow for Advanced and Intermediate Tier Patrons https://www.patreon.com/posts/ask-james-1pm-81782730
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Liverpool v Nottingham Forest with @FPL_LocoLord &amp; @FFScout_Mark
 Full the full Planet FPL Schedule this week including the offering on Patreon see this post... 🗓 Content Schedule: Apr 17th-21st | Patreon
