      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On the Sky Fantasy Podcast Suj uses 5 transfers and closes in on trhe top 100 but it was another painful week for James without Erling Haaland. </p> <p>On the Pod, there's plenty of gains to be made and transfer entry points to exploit in the next week. Should Arsenal assets be sold following the Friday night fixture? Who should be held and sold? Which Liverpool assets are best for Saturday against Forest and beyond?</p> <p>Plus, upcoming Brighton and Man City entry points, if investing in Ollie Watkins is still worth it, why the game will change after Leicester's Monday night game with Everton in 12 days, upcoming captaincy choices, awareness of Marcus Rashford's fitness, learnings from the weekend and lots more... </p> <p>Today on Patreon: It's Tot&amp;Ham</p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Arsenal v Southampton with @ThreeFiveWho &amp; @CS_Wipeout</p> <p>Full the full Planet FPL Schedule this week including the offering on Patreon see this post... <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/81629611">https://www.patreon.com/posts/81629611</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#SkyFF #SkyFantasy #SkyFantasyFootball</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
