    <item>
      <title>Are We Blind? | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 35 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/are-we-blind-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-35-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj is up into the top 500, can he still claim a top 100 finish...? He thinks he can!
 On the Pod. a weekend where Arsenal and Liverpool assets can be attacked, but who's actually wanted? Plus, we're heading into a period where only 5 or 6 teams appeal, learnings from the previous week, what the Matchweek 36 TV selections means and why Arsenal v Chelsea has now moved to a single gameday on a Tuesday night...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents, Tottenham Vs Bournemouth with @Rickysaunders77 &amp; @AFCBNG
 Today on Patreon: Tot&amp;Ham
