    <item>
      <title>Jack The Lad | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 43 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/jack-the-lad-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-43-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj returns from holiday to join James for the Gameweek Review Podcast as the lads review on the weekend football from another dramatic weekend that once again had big implications for FPL managers.
 On the Pod, all the games discussed as West Ham actually won an away games, James tells us just how lucky Tottenham were on Saturday, Erling Haaland struck a brace to reward captainers and is another Manchester City asset the go-to purchase if Marcus Rashford is out injured?
 Plus, Leicester's managerial change, how Crystal Palace thumped Leeds at Elland Road and reaction to all the drama from the compelling 2-2 draw between Liverpool and Arsenal that featured some very interesting tactical tweaks...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s4 ep35 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy
 Today on Patreon: The Q'N'A
 Full the full Planet FPL Schedule this week including the offering on Patreon see this post... https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-apr-10th-81280644
