 Plus, why this week looks like being a quiet one for transfers, upcoming captaincy, further debate on buying Erling Haaland back, midfield differential suggestions, if any Crystal Palace assets appeal on Sunday with Wilfried Zaha now ruled out injured and learnings from the latest games
