    <item>
      <title>Content Creation, Team Leaks &amp; Copycats with @FPL_Harry | The People's Poll ep. 124 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/content-creation-team-leaks-copycats-with-fpl_harry-the-peoples-poll-ep-124-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Harry Daniels is one of the FPL Community's finest on YouTube, here he joins James to discuss a number of topics including what it's like for a successful FPL manager to have copycats managers repeating their every move and the influence of team leaks on late decision making, how those who have sources with info have to tread carefully but also have no intention of misleading their followers.
 Plus, is there a way to stop said leaks by adjusting the FPL deadline? How Harry grew his channel and is on the verge of 50,000 subscribers and how he feels as a Chelsea fan following the dismissal of Graham Potter...
 Subscribe to Harry's YouTube Channel: (1) FPL Harry - YouTube
 Follow Harry on Twitter: (1) Harry (@FPL_Harry) / Twitter
 On Patreon today it's an FPL Quiz hosted by @James_J1J
 On Planet FPL tomorrow: Planet SkyFF s4 ep34; @bridgamatuer joins James to discuss all the latest for Sky Fantasy Football
 For the full schedule of content for this week view this post 🗓 Content: April 3rd-8th | Patreon
