    <item>
      <title>Returners And Blanco's with @Benny_Blanco40 | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 41 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/returners-and-blancos-with-benny_blanco40-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-41-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Co-founder of the FPL GW39 charity match Benny Blanco joins James to review the 9 Gameweek 29 games played at the weekend which included the drama of Erling Haaland and Bukayo Saka not starting, while Bench Boosters on the whole have started quite well with Aston Villa, Brentford and Newcastle assets performing well but so far the Manchester United gamble hasn't paid off.
 All the games discussed as usual, with thoughts on both Man City and Liverpool assets prominent in thinking for the weeks ahead following City's 4-1 win at The Etihad, assets worth selling, why many a FPL manager will be waiting on Haaland fitness news and Benny gives us all the detail for the GW39 Charity match.
 Support the GW39 FPL North v South Charity match at HOME | GW39 North v South
 Follow Benny on Twitter: (1) Benny Blanco (@Benny_Blanco40) / Twitter
 On Patreon today it's the Q'N'A with @FPLHunter10
 On Planet FPL tomorrow: J@FPL_Harry joins James for the People's Poll and a discussion on content creation, copycats managers and team leaks
 For the full schedule of content for this week view this post 🗓 Content: April 3rd-8th | Patreon
 ___________________________________________
