        <![CDATA[<p>It was an early morning start for James with his live stream this morning (reasons explained) and the major theme of the stream was hit taking ahead of the biggest double gameweek for the season. Who's worth it? Who's not? When is it justified?</p> <p>Plus, plenty more...</p> <p>On Patreon today it's The Differential Show GW29 Preview</p> <p>On Planet FPL tomorrow: James presents the GW29 Deadline Stream Live at 10am BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel</p> <p>For the full schedule of content for this week view this post <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-schedule-80587061">🗓 Content Schedule Mar 26-Apr 1 | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon</a></p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
