    <item>
      <title>Aston Villa v Bournemouth | CotC with @Lee_Jackson_92 &amp; @AFCBNG | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/aston-villa-v-bournemouth-cotc-with-lee_jackson_92-afcbng-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On the second Clash of the Correspondents ahead of Blank Gameweek 28 James is joined by Aston Villa fan Neil Grover and Bournemouth fan Neil Grover to preview the weekend meeting at Villa Park, all the latest at their clubs and the FPL assets of interest with both clubs playing in the Blank and having a double Gameweek in 29.
 Villa will appeal particularly this week, should Ollie Watkins be a shoo-in for FPL managers? Whose the best of the Villa defenders to target? (we find out it's complicated!) and what about the prospects for Leon Bailey and Emi Buendia?
 While Bournemouth shouldn't be overlooked neccessarily either, Philip Billing is on a fine run of form and there's a strong case made for Neto, Dango Outtara and Dominic Solanke who could all offer solutions, particularly for those looking to Bench Boost in GW29.
 Plus, can Villa make a late run for a European spot and Bournemouth will believe with their remaining fixtures (they only play one of the top 8 between now and the end of the season) that they can prove the doubters wrong and beat the drop...
 Follow Lee on Twitter: Lee J 🦁 (@Lee_Jackson_92) / Twitter
 Follow Neil on Twitter: Neil Grover (@AFCBNG) / Twitter
 On Planet FPL tomorrow: Ask James live stream at 930am GMT on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel with and audio version posted shortly after conclusion.
 On Patreon today it's a Quiz with @ClaytsAFC on Premier League 'One Season Wonders'
 For the full schedule of content for this week view this post 🗓 Content: Mar 13th-17th | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon
 ___________________________________________
