      <description>Suj is back to his old tricks of missing deadlines, not doing it just once but twice this week! Can James help Suj refocus and identify 5 key transfers for the week ahead?
 On the Sky Fantasy Podcast, the 5 key teams to target for transfers this week, weekend captaincy, making sure covergae is there for next weekend when 6 teams don't play, entry points further down the line after the international break and why many should once again consider selling Erling Haaland...
 On Planet FPL tomorrow: Clash of the Correspondents - Brighton v Crystal Palace with @FPLSeagull &amp; @Migtavius
