    <item>
      <title>Raya Of Light | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 29 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/raya-of-light-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-29-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest talking points for Sky managers and Ederson owners can now count down the days before they can sell!
 There's discussion on Thiago Silva replacements for those who made the move on Sunday, captaincy for the weekend, talking points from the weekend, fallout from the FA Cup results including why Brentford now look a must to invest in on Monday, but they're not the only team with major gains coming up and there are several differentials who may attract interest...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: That Chip Strategy Podcast 3 - Covering the fallout of the FA Cup results and draw, Double Gameweek projections and why it's now decision time on strategy for FPL managers
 On Patreon today Money In Football: The Proposed Takeover Of Sheffield United
 For the full schedule of content for this week view this post 🗓 Content: Feb 27th-Mar 3rd | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon
