    <item>
      <title>Predicting Pep with @ffscout_luke | The People's Poll ep. 123 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/predicting-pep-with-ffscout_luke-the-peoples-poll-ep-123-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Luke Williams from the Inspected Goals FPL Podcast joins James to discuss his uncanny knack of predicting Pep Guardiola line-ups. Why did he start doing it? And how has he been successful in working out how Pep may set City up for individual games.
 There's discussion on City's tactics, why what the opponent may do is important to consider, when rotation is likely to hit hardest and become less predictable and what the impact is for Fantasy managers, not just for now, but for later in the season...
 Follow Luke on Twitter: dis (@ffscout_luke) / Twitter
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s4 ep29 with all the latest discussion for Sky Fantasy Football
 On Patreon today it's an FPL Chip Strategy Quiz
 For the full schedule of content for this week view this post 🗓 Content: Feb 27th-Mar 3rd | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon
