      <title>Ask James | Friday February 24th 2023 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-friday-february-24th-2023-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On James' live stream this morning FPL managers are clearly keen to invest in Liverpool, when's the points hit worth it and when's not. Plus, there's lots of coverage of planning ahead in planning with double gameweeks to come in 27 and 29 and a blank gameweek in 28. A recommendation is to consider alternative chip strategies and for James that may mean a Wildcard as early as Gameweek 26 should Fulham beat Leeds in the FA Cup on Tuesday...
 Still to come today on the Planet FPL YouTube channel: The GW25 Deadline Stream at 530pm GMT
 On Patreon today it's The Differential Show GW25 Preview
 For the full schedule of content for this week view this post 🗓 Content Schedule: Feb 20th-24th | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon
