 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 #Liverpool #Wolves #FPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Liverpool fan Dan Lord and Wolves fan Bradley Parker to discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of the clubs 4th meeting already in 2023 and preview the all important FPL Double Gameweek 25.</p> <p>Liverpool appeared to be recovering, but back to back 2-0 wins was followed by the mauling by Real Madrid on Tuesday night. This is now clearly more than just a blip. Can The Reds still finish in the Top 4 and why are there so many inconsistencies in their results and performances?</p> <p>Wolves have started very well under Julen Lopetegui, picking up 13 points from his first 7 games in charge, but there was a setback against Bournemouth on Saturday. Is it right to assume now that under their experienced new manager Wolves will be safe from the drop?</p> <p>And many FPL managers are looking to steam into Liverpool assets; who's the best 3 to get? And there's an explanation of why what looks like a short-term investment could be something that lasts 2 months. </p> <p>And is investment in Wolves assets worth it? Is it better to look at defensive or offensive assets or should they just be avoided? </p> <p>Follow Dan on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/FPL_LocoLord">(2) Dan (@FPL_LocoLord) / Twitter</a></p> <p>Follow Bradley on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/parker_bradley">(2) Bradley Parker (@parker_bradley) / Twitter</a></p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents an Ask James stream at 930am GMT with an audio Podcast posted shortly after conclusion and there's also The Deadline Stream exclusive to the Planet FPL YouTube channel at 530pm GMT</p> <p>On Patreon today it's a Quiz hosted by @DanFPL76</p> <p>For the full schedule of content for this week view this post <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/78941376">🗓 Content Schedule: Feb 20th-24th | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon</a></p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#Liverpool #Wolves #FPL</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
