    <item>
      <title>The Football Sustainability Index | The People's Poll ep. 122 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-football-sustainability-index-the-peoples-poll-ep-122-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>The Football Sustainability Index by Fair Game is a report that examines four key criteria as to how well a football club is doing off the pitch. It measures Financial Solvency, Good Governance, Fan Engagement and Equality Standards and to create an overall Sustainability Index score for clubs in the Premier League and The Championship.
 But what is the aim? Could this index be used as part of the government's 'White Paper' release that is expected this week? And does it actually matter to the clubs if they are performing well on the index? 
 Tomorrow on Planet Planet SkyFF s4 ep 28 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy Football
 On Patreon today Money In Football: The Crisis At Southend United. A club who could be only 8 days away from liquidation.
 For the full schedule of content for this week view this post 🗓 Content Schedule: Feb 20th-24th | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon
