      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On the Gameweek 23 review Suj &amp; James discuss all the key moments from the weekend which included a weekend of controversial refereeing decisions and lots of new information for FPL managers to consider...</p> <p>There's thoughts on Guardiola's tactical set up yesterday, Toney's dominant display at Arsenal, the almost inevitable Saints sacking of Nathan Jones after the defeat to 10 man Wolves and James' positive mood on Tottenham has evaporated quite weekly after the humbling at Leicester and a growing injury list.</p> <p>Plus, maneuvering GW25 and why it just became a lot more difficult to sell many blankers, especially those from Brentford and Brighton who now have GW27 doubles.</p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents: Brentford vs Crystal Palace with @FPLDummyTom &amp; @Migtavius</p> <p>On Patreon today it's the Patreon Q'N'A</p> <p>For the full schedule of content for this week view this post <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/content-feb-13th-78618825">🗓 Content: Feb 13th-18th | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon</a></p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? </p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
