      <description>With James off to support Tottenham for their trip to Leicester tomorrow the Deadline Stream was brought forward to Friday evening and therefore released as an audio Podcast as well.
 Lots of questions answered on Arsenal and Manchester City assets and how the announcement of additional gameweek 27 fixtures for Brentford, Brighton, Crystal Palace and Southampton should affect our thinking.... 
 On Patreon today it's The Differential Show DGW23 Preview
