    <item>
      <title>Arsenal v Man City | CotC with @ThreeFiveWho &amp; @FPLPringle | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/arsenal-v-man-city-cotc-with-threefivewho-fplpringle-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>It's the biggest Clash of the Correspondents of the season so far as James is joined by Arsenal fan Adam Pritchard and Manchester City fan Jonny Pringle to discuss all the key talking points ahead of their Double Gameweek 23 meeting that could have a huge bearing on who wins the title.
 We get both perspectives on the title race, do Arsenal believe from here they should win it? Can City sort themselves out and put a run of form together?
 Plus, all the key players from an FPL perspective discussed ahead of a Gameweek where many FPL managers will want 6 players across the 2 teams and the Podcast opens with thoughts on the Premier League's decision to charge City with over 100 breaches of financial rules...
 Follow Adam on Twitter: (2) Adam P (@ThreeFiveWho) / Twitter
 Follow Jonny on Twitter (4) Jonny (@FPLPringle) / Twitter
 On Friday: James presents Not The GW23 Deadline Stream Live at 530pm BST (Leicester away Saturday, priorities!) on the Planet FPL YouTube channel and there will be an audio version posted after the stream conclusion.
 And on Patreon today it's our weekly quiz
 ___________________________________________
