    <item>
      <title>Fulham v Nottingham Forest | CotC with @TheTinkerMen &amp; @FFScout_Mark | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fulham-v-nottingham-forest-cotc-with-thetinkermen-ffscout_mark-planet-fpl-202223-0</link>
      <description>On the first of two Clash of the Correspondents this weeks James is joined by Fulham correspondent Dara Curran and Nottingham Forest fan Mark Sutherns to discuss all the latest at their clubs and the potential for the FPL assets from their clubs.
 It's only four goals conceded in 7 since the World Cup for Fulham. Are they now a more defensive side? And is a challenge for a European spot now a realistic target?
 While Forest have more Premier League points in 2023 than any other club! Are they likely to pull further away from the relegation places or is a battle for survival still expected?
 Plus, is Aleksander Mitrovic 100% fit or do concerns persist? Can Brennan Johnson continue his hot streak? Best defensive FPL assets discussed for two clubs who could cover Blank Gameweeks well and there's a sense check on Fulham's best eleven and Forest's transfer business...
 Follow Dara on Twitter: https://twitter.com/TheTinkerMen
 Follow Mark on Twitter https://twitter.com/FFScout_Mark
 On Wednesday: Planet SkyFF s4 ep26 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy as James is joined by @FFH_Sky's @paulmcanulty1
 And on Patreon today it's a UCL Fantasy Preview with James joined by @FF_Thinker, @James_J1J &amp; @FPL_Rasmus
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? 
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 #FFC #NFFC #FPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
