    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday February 3rd 2023 |Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-friday-february-3rd-2023-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On James' live stream this morning there's a heavy focus on the four teams about to have a Double Gameweek, Manchester United and Leeds this week, and Arsenal and Manchester City next week.
 Plus, there's further strategy chat, concerns about GW25 and lots more...
