    <item>
      <title>That Chip Strategy Podcast 2 | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 31 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/that-chip-strategy-podcast-2-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-31-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>The much promised Chip Strategy follow up Podcast has landed! And as was the case 3 weeks ago James goes to town on what may have with potential postponed fixtures and likely future postponements that can aid in planning Chip Strategy.
 But there looks like there will be many different ways to deploys the Chips this year and several different scenarios are discussed for those that have all their Chips remaining and for those who have already used some.
 Plus, teams to target, teams that should remain conscious in our thinking and teams to avoid. There's coverage of what the outlook is likely to look like for Blanks and Doubles to come and what games we should be aware could suddenly be arranged at short notice and that may include a double for Liverpool in a blank.
 Plus, ideas for the forthcoming GW22 and is now the right to time - for those who still have it - to activate the Triple Captaincy Chip...?
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents his Ask James live stream at 9am (or 930am) GMT with an audio version to follow and then exclusive to YouTube he will also present The GW22 Deadline Stream Live at 530pm GMT.
 On Patreon today it's a Quiz on the January Transfer Window
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? On Planet FPL Patreon in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level.
