    <item>
      <title>Is The Premier League Too Powerful? | The People's Poll ep. 121 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/is-the-premier-league-too-powerful-the-peoples-poll-ep-121-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>An open discussion about the spending and revenues of the Premier League versus the other big five leagues and the trends are suggesting that England's top flight clubs are operating ona different level to clubs around Europe.
 There's a look at transfer spending, Television deals and matchday revenue and if the Premier League's growth can be stopped. Could something happen that means income declines? And should we care if it doesn't...?
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents - Manchester United vs Leeds United with @ismyCAPplaying &amp; @fpl_tactician
 On Patreon today it's the Patreon Q'N'A
 ___________________________________________
