      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj's rise through the ranks continues! He and James discuss thinking ahead including suggestive thinking for transfers which hinge quite a bit on the announcement of the March TV fixtures and the Cup results.
 There's analysis of learnings over the last week, why James has cut his losses on Man City defenders and there's a look at Sky's best bonus point scorers throughout the season.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents - Newcastle United v West Ham United with @fplBibs and @Fpl_SkyAddict
