    <item>
      <title>Juventus' 15 Point Deduction | The People's Poll ep. 120 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/juventus-15-point-deduction-the-peoples-poll-ep-120-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>A few days ago Juventus' season was thrown into disarray after they received a 15 point deduction in Serie A taking them from 4th to 10th in the table. On the Podcast there's detail of why they've been punished, their right to appeal and why there could be more punishment to come.
 Plus, why Serie A continues to cast envious eyes at the riches of the Premier League and why Tottenham could be impacted by what happens next.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet SkyFF s4 ep24 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy Football
 On Patreon today it's Tot&amp;Ham which includes a review of Tottenham's win at Fulham last night and the future of Antonio Conte, Daniel, Levy, Harry Kane and the use of The Y Word
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? On Planet FPL Patreon in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level.
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
