Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On the Gameweek 21 review Podcast Suj &amp; James cover the 9 Premier League games played at the weekend and the fallout from them ahead of what will probably be Double Gameweek 22 but might not be.</p> <p>Erling Haaland punished those who didn't captain him with another home hat-trick but Arsenal responded to City's win with a dramatic victory against Manchester United and with their own double gameweek in 23 to come there's detail on favoured Arsenal and City assets.</p> <p>United and Leeds assets receive coverage ahead of their potential 22 double and Marcus Rashford Triple Captain is very much under consideration for James.</p> <p>Plus, an analysis of all the other games including Liverpool's uninspiring draw with Chelsea and there's a reminder why there are so many reasons why this week, more than any other in the whole season, is not the week to make early transfers...</p> <p>Tomorrow on Planet FPL: The People's Poll Podcast. Vote for your favourite topic from these 3 options before 5pm GMT <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1617463243470954502?s=20&amp;t=djC9e4jfwzBLaljOEl4GzQ"> https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1617463243470954502?s=20&amp;t=djC9e4jfwzBLaljOEl4GzQ</a></p> <p>On Patreon today it's a the weekly Patreon Q'N'A</p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? On Planet FPL Patreon in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level.</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #GW21Review</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
