      <description>It's basically s6 ep29b as Suj &amp; James wrap up their final thoughts from Gameweek 20 with a review of Manchester United's draw at Crystal Palace and Manchester City's comeback victory against Tottenham.
 City and United FPL assets get particular focus and the City players continue to cause a headache for many FPL managers.
 Plus a reminder of why rolling will be right for the majority this week... but it won't be right for everyone.
