      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest topics including why for James the only way to make gains is probably to do little, while for Suj it's to keep making moves... and it's all to do with transfer counts.
 Upcoming captaincy discussed including the 3 single gamedays in the next week, why it's looking increasingly likely that an additional Manchester United fixture is likely to be added in early February, plus reflection on the best performing players since Overhaul and lots more including upcoming entry and exit points.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Clash of the Correspondents - Leicester v Brighton with @AaronLagor and @FPLSeagull
 On Patreon today it's Tot&amp;Ham
