    <item>
      <title>Ask James | Friday January 13th 2022 |Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-friday-january-13th-2022-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the audio from James's live stream this morning Double Gameweek players are on my mind. There's an overview and thoughts on assets from Crystal Palace, the Manchester clubs and Tottenham.
 Plus, there's more on strategy and warnings of thinking ahead when making transfers and why Graham Potter should get more time as Chelsea manager despite another bad result last night at Fulham.
 On Planet FPL Patreon, in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Still to come today on the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents The GW20 Deadline Stream Live at 530pm GMT and Suj will rejoin James on Monday for s6 ep29 reviewing all the weekend games.
 And on Patreon today it's The Differential Show GW20 Preview
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? On Planet FPL Patreon in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level.
