    <item>
      <title>Wrong Kind Of Blanket | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 22 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wrong-kind-of-blanket-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-22-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the latest Sky Fantasy Football Podcast it's more regret for James have landed on 8 Manchester City players and Suj tells James he will beat him this season!
 There's discussion on the upcoming single gamedays featuring Fulham, Chelsea, Aston Villa, Leeds, Crystal Palace, the Manchester clubs and Tottenham and upcoming captaincies including consciousness of what to do on Saturday week.
 When's best to get back into United? Is it better to buy Harry Kane on Sunday or wait for the Fulham game on Monday week? Plus, Chelsea's big immediate gain and why at least 1 Newcastle player has to be bought by James on Sunday.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL: Planet FPL s6 ep 28 with an overview of Chip Strategy following the domestic Cup results
 On Patreon today it's Tot&amp;Ham
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? On Planet FPL Patreon in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level.
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
