    <item>
      <title>Shaw Kane Can Do It | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 27 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/shaw-kane-can-do-it-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-27-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>It's the halfway stage of the FPL season as Suj &amp; James review the 10 games played so far in DGW19 and Harry Kane is on mind after a haul at Selhurst Park and with a potential Double to come in GW20.
 As usual all the games reviewed including Pep's tactical overthink against Chelsea and concerns remain around City assets ahead of their likely 20 Double, concerns that Liverpool 'weren't right' surfaced badly at Brentford and Newcastle held the leaders at The Emirates.
 Plus, the relegation scrap is heating up, Marcus Rashford delivered again, Brighton excelled and plenty more including the mid priced midfield asset that is very much on James' radar... 
 On Patreon today there's a quiz hosted by Manchester United correspondent Gary Robinson 
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? On Planet FPL Patreon in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level.
