      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/follow-through-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-21-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James investigate why despite some decent returns their ranks are on the side, but with opportunities to make transfers available to many over the next 2 gamedays there's plenty of reason to think gains can be made.
 Villa and Leeds assets are on agenda tonight with their single gameday looming next Friday night, there's coverage of the best choices from both and there's gains to be had too on Chelsea and Man City players tomorrow and for James the commitment to go all-in on City is on.
 On Planet FPL Patreon, in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
