      <description>Last Thursday football lost its first icon and one of sport's first global superstars Edson Arantes Do Nascimento, known fondly as Pele. On today's Planet FPL Podcast Suj &amp; James reflect on the career of the King and memories of his incredible on field successeses with Santos and Brazil
