      <description>Suj rejoins James on the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast this week and give thoughts for what Sky managers should do for tonight's Morocco and France World Cup Semi Final and the 3rd/4th place Play off for those who may have no coverage.
 And then thoughts turn to the Premier League's Overhaul and a discussion about what's required looking ahead at the fixtures towards the end of February and there's a theme that focuses a lot on why Manchester City players will prove popular.
 On Planet FPL Patreon, in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
