      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/englands-snow-joke-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-23-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj rejoins James after a hiatus in front of he camera with first thoughts on the return of FPL which is now only 2 weeks away and the World Cup's final 4 means an FPL template looms with not as many players likely to be absent in GW17 as was first thought.
 There's a review of the weekend Quarter Finals including England's defeat to France and James gives an overview on some of the Premier League fixtures runs for when FPL resumes.   
 On Planet FPL Patreon, in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 On Tuesday: Clash of the Correspondents: Crystal Palace v Fulham with @Migtavius &amp; @TheTinkerMen
 And on Patreon today Suj &amp; James present their weekly Q&amp;A
