      <description>James presents the Breakfast Steam for half hour with a round-up of all the latest World Cup talking points as England booked qualification to the knockout stage after a resounding 3-0 win against Wales. England will meet Senegal on Sunday, conquerors of Ecuador while there were also wins for The Netherlands and the United States.
 On Planet FPL Patreon, December is FREE! Sign up in November and it becomes a 2nd month for free and in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
