      <description>This week James presents the Breakfast Stream for half hour with a round-up of all the latest World Cup talking points which yesterday included another huge World Cup shock as Japan recovered from a goal deficit to stun 2014 Champions Germany. There was also a scare for Belgium who were dominated for large parts by Canada but still won and Spain hit seven against Costa Rica.
