      <description>This week James presents the Breakfast Stream for half hour with a round-up of all the latest World Cup news  featured a 6-2 win for England against Iran, a win for the Dutch Wales headlines and today there’s thoughts on yesterday’s games drew with USA and there was lots of added time.
