      <title>FIFA World Cup Fantasy Preview | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fifa-world-cup-fantasy-preview-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James preview FIFA's official World Cup Fantasy game and begin with a rundown on the rules which has caused a lot of confusion within the FPL community, and once clarified there's discussion on how best to use the chips which are different to what many are accustomed to.
 Plus, James details his Watchlist of players under consideration, why big upfront will be popular and why goalscoring defenders should be sought...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - How FIFA were awarded the World Cup
 ___________________________________________
