      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/skyff-world-cup-preview-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-16-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>For the next month Sky Fantasy Football doesn't revolve around £50,000, it revolves around £10,000, as Sky managers turn their attention to the Fantasy World Cup game.
 On the Pod, strategy ideas, the importance of captaincy, how this game will differ to the Premier League version, consideration of how to use transfers, ownership numbers and players to consider.
 Plus final thoughts and notes on the weekend that was in the Premier League from a Sky perspective
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Official FIFA Fantasy World Cup Preview
