    <item>
      <title>England's World Cup Squad | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/englands-world-cup-squad-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss yesterday's announcement of Gareth Southgate's England World Cup Squad and on the whole it's largely a positive reaction with in-form Ben White, James Maddison and Callum Wilson all getting call ups.
 There are however areas of concern in the wing-back positions with Luke Shaw the only natural left footed defensive player in the squad, concerns around the fitness of players like Kalvin Phillips and overall concerns with the lack of midfield options.
 Plus, why the team picked for the opener against Iran shouldn't be definitive of what England's best eleven is going to be and whether a back three or four should be favoured in the opening stages of the tournament.
 On Planet FPL Patreon, December is FREE! Sign up in November and it becomes a 2nd month for free and in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Coming up Monday on Planet FPL - s6 ep22 reviewing all the weekend GW16 games and still to come tomorrow on the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents the GW16 Deadline Stream Live at 10am GMT.
