    <item>
      <title>Mo Staches, Mo Probems | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 21 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/mo-staches-mo-probems-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-21-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the GW15 review Suj &amp; James discuss all the drama from an action packed Premier League weekend which for Fantasy managers began with FPL's website crashing for the final 15 minutes ahead of deadline. 
 All the games reviewed with extended thoughts on Leeds dramatic win over Bournemouth, why Leicester have found solidity again, why Arsenal and Newcastle continue to look the real deal and Liverpool's crucial win at Tottenham.
 Plus there's a theme of 1 week punts on the agenda with only Gameweek 16 remaining ahead of the World Cup and the Unlimited Transfer period.
 On Planet FPL Patreon, December is FREE! Sign up in November and it becomes a 2nd month for free and in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL: James presents his Ask James live stream at 3pm GMT on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after conclusion.
 ___________________________________________
