    <item>
      <title>Could FIFA Ban Iran? | The People's Poll ep. 118 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/could-fifa-ban-iran-the-peoples-poll-ep-118-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Due to gender discrimination laws and rumours of arms being given to Russia there are growing calls for football's governing body to ban Iran from the World Cup. Is it likely to happen? And who would replace them if they were expelled?
 There's discussion on sexism, equality, hypocrisy and what England should do considering they are scheduled to play Iran in 20 days time or should football and politics simply not mix? 
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s4 ep14 with all the latest discussion for Sky Fantasy Football  
 ___________________________________________
