    <item>
      <title>Pumpkin To Moan About | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 20 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/pumpkin-to-moan-about-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-20-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the Gameweek 14 talking points as Graham Potter's return to Chelsea turned into a horror show, Arsenal and Newcastle were scary good in big home wins, Tottenham came back from the dead, Leeds shocked Liverpool at Anfield and the FPL servers had last minute Gremlins.
 Key talking points and tactical pointers discussed from all the games including problem solving for the remaining two gameweeks before the unlimited period.
 Plus, why James deviated from buying Callum Wilson and took a regrettable (hindsight) -4, the late pre deadline drama of the Erling Haaland news and debate on if the FPL deadline should move again, thoughts on those walking the suspension tightrope/already suspended and Suj might buy Trossard back...
 On Planet FPL Patreon, December is FREE! Sign up in November and it becomes a 2nd month for free and in January all Patrons will be boosted to the next tier level. Support the show at www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL: The People's Poll Podcast, vote for your favourite before 5pm GMT today via this tweet  https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1587010264356077568?s=20&amp;t=o3meCBktRhJwcdofrg-0Fw
 ___________________________________________
