    <item>
      <title>Brentford v Wolves | CotC with @FPLDummyTom &amp; @parker_bradley | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/brentford-v-wolves-cotc-with-fpldummytom-parker_bradley-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On Clash of the Correspondents this week James is joined by Brentford fan Tom Medd and Wolves fan Bradley Parker to discuss all the latest at their clubs and preview Saturday's GW14 meeting in West London.
 It's a 'miserable' mood for both Correspondents following 4-0 defeats for both at the weekend and there are plenty of laughs to be had on this Podcast.
 For The Bees, 9 goals conceded in their last 2 away games is countered by consecutive clean sheets at home. Do The Bees have an 'away' problem? There's also discussion on speculation linking Thomas Frank to vacant jobs and whether we can expect a switch back to a 4-3-3.
 While at Wolves concern is greater, with a new permanent manager not set to be appointed until 2023 and only 5 goals scored all season concern is growing about prospects of survival. There is even speculation that interim manager Steve Davis may not be picking the team or having the final say on tactics.
 Plus, the stats that prove Ivan Toney does better in a back four and whether FPL managers should buy, hold or sell and enablers that may appeal are talked up/down... 
 Follow Tom on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLDummyTom
 Follow Bradley on Twitter: https://twitter.com/parker_bradley
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Ask James live stream scheduled for 3pm BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel with a Podcast version to follow shortly after conclusion.
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in October features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's content features a quiz where every answer is a European capital City
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 #Brentford #Wolves #FPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
