    <item>
      <title>Feels Like Almirgeddon | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 19 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/feels-like-almirgeddon-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-19-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the Gameweek 13 review Suj &amp; James discuss all the weekend games as enabling midfielders put their hand up for consideration as Miguel Almiron, Alex Iwobi, Andreas Pereira and Granit Xhaka were among those who returned with double point hauls.
 What to do with Mo Salah? Could he yet prove to be the best captaincy option this week despite a blank and a below par performance in Liverpool's defeat at Forest?
 Plus, Arsenal slipped up, Leandro Trossard scored... of course Trossard scored.... why Tottenham are begging for the break, impressive Newcastle, short term thinking for FPL managers and putting yourself in the position to be lucky
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL: The Fan view - Aston Villa with @Lee_Jackson_92
 ___________________________________________
