    <item>
      <title>Blanking Praet's And Koch's | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 18 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/blanking-praets-and-kochs-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-18-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the midweek football in Blank Gameweek 12 which featured James's painful trip to Old Trafford where Manchester United dismantled Tottenham and there's a detailed discussion of what United did so well and why Tottenham looked so poor.
 All the games discussed, with several pointers towards assets that should be of interest for those on Wildcard which includes an emerging enabler to target, Darwin Nunez's impact on Mo Salah and there's discussion on the best Arsenal and Man City assets including thoughts on a difficult Bukayo Saka v Phil Foden decision.
 Plus, Cristiano Ronaldo's sulk, Steven Gerrard's sacking, Wolves pause their search, brilliant Bruno's, trying to figure out Graham Potter's Chelsea and lots more including FPL's missing yellow card scandal and a very bad joke!  
 ___________________________________________
