      <description>On the Sky Fantasy Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest talking points including captaincy for the 5 upcoming gamedays, key pointers from the weekend games and transfers on mind, which include coverage needed for Thursday and why everyone will want a West Ham asset on Monday night.
 Plus, why Forest assets should go, why a movement of Brighton assets may require a second thought, players of interest on 4 yellows, how and who to get in from Arsenal and Manchester City, Twitter questions covered and more....
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: Manchester City v Brighton with @FPLPringle &amp; @FPLSeagull
