    <item>
      <title>Newcastle v Everton | CotC with @fplBibs &amp; @spirit_blues | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/newcastle-v-everton-cotc-with-fplbibs-spirit_blues-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On the first of two Clash of the Correspondents this week James welcomes Newcastle fan Simon Bibby and Everton fan Sean Norton to discuss all the latest at their clubs and preview tomorrow night's GW12 meeting at St James's Park.
 Both clubs should appeal to FPL managers with Free Hitters likely to consider a Newcastle treble up this week and Gameweek 13 Wildcarders are likely to consider Everton enablers for the Toffees favourable four fixtures before the World Cup.
 Plus, there's discussion on the managers, expectations, tactics and one name gets tipped up as an FPL option which causes much disagreement...
 Follow Si on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fplBibs
 Follow Sean on Twitter: https://twitter.com/spirit_blues
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s4 ep12 - All the latest for Sky Fantasy Football... and still to come today James presents the GW12 Deadline Stream Live at 5pm BST
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in October features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's content features The Differential Show GW12 Preview
