    <item>
      <title>(Breakfast) Ask James | Friday October 14th 2022 |Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/breakfast-ask-james-friday-october-14th-2022-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>An 8am BST start for James for his Ask James stream as part of a trial for content during the World Cup. On the stream, topics covered include if this is the week to oppose Erling Haaland for FPL captaincy, if 11 starters is a must for GW12, holding Arsenal and Manchester City assets, the situation with Tottenham's wing-backs, best buys for the next 2 Gameweeks, next England manager if Gareth Southgate departs after the World Cup and lots more...
 Coming up Monday on Planet FPL - s6 ep17 reviewing all the weekend GW11 games and still to come today on the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents the GW11 Deadline Stream Live at 530pm BST.
 ___________________________________________
