    <item>
      <title>Southampton v West Ham | CotC with @CS_Wipeout &amp; @Fpl_SkyAddict| Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/southampton-v-west-ham-cotc-with-cs_wipeout-fpl_skyaddict-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On this week's Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Southampton fan Matt Samuel and West Ham fan Chris Stone to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview Sunday's meeting at St Mary's.
 Is time running out on Ralph Hassenhuttl? Could a change of manager be in the offing for Southampton? 
 Are wins against Wolves and Fulham a sign that West Ham are now nearer the best form?
 FPL assets from both discussed, plus Saints infrequent tactics, the impact of West Ham's new signings including Gianluca Scamacca and lots more...
 Follow Matt on Twitter: https://twitter.com/CS_Wipeout
 Follow Chris on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_SkyAddict
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - (Breakfast) Ask James with a live stream at 8am BST with an audio version posted shortly after. And James also presents the GW11 Deadline Stream on the Planet FPL YouTube channel at 530pm BST.
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in September features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's content features our weekly quiz
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 #Southampton #WestHam #FPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
