Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>It's a big period in Sky Fantasy with a (nearly) full midweek programme next week and despite no fixture and despite the postponement of Arsenal's fixture with Manchester City assets from both clubs still appeal going into the weekend.</p> <p>There's discussion on upcoming captaincy for the next 6 days including Friday's Brenford v Brighton single gameday, why Harry Kane will be popular Saturday and if Erling Haaland should be opposed on Sunday. While all 3 midweek gamedays don't have obvious captaincy conclusions and Sky managers may have to prepare for Plan B</p> <p>Plus, binning Neco Williams now looks a priority for many, enabler options, key pointers from the weekend games, community questions answered and lots more...</p> <p>Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: Southampton v West Ham with @CS_Wipeout &amp; @Fpl_SkyAddict</p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in October features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's Podcast offering is Tot&amp;Ham.</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#SkyFF #SkyFantasyFootball #SkyFantasy</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
