    <item>
      <title>Blatter, Platini &amp; The Corruption Trial | The People's Poll ep. 117 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/blatter-platini-the-corruption-trial-the-peoples-poll-ep-117-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>In July Sepp Blatter and Michel Platini were, too much public surprise, found not guilty during a corruption trial that revolved around a £1.7m payment Blatter's FIFA made to Platini in 2011 for work done advisory work the Frenchman did between 1998 and 2002.
 Suj &amp; James investigate and discuss what happened and how a verbal agreement meant that the pair was exonerated.
 Plus, the FBI's investigation into CONCACAF and CONEMBOL, what happens next to Blatter and Plantini and there's a review of last night's Nottingham Forest and Aston Villa draw that has left Villa fans calling for the removal of Steven Gerrard as manager...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s4 ep11 with all the latest discussion for Sky Fantasy Football  
 ___________________________________________
