    <item>
      <title>*NOT* The GW10 Deadline Stream | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/not-the-gw10-deadline-stream-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>With James on his travels again (likes the punishment apparently) to watch Tottenham at The Amex, he has brought forward The Deadline Stream forward to Friday night again and therefore released the audio again to listen to.
 Lots on the Pod including why James is likely to sell Ivan Perisic ahead of deadline and why expectations are low for the trip to Brighton. Plus, the time looks right for many FPL managers to invest in Wilfried Zaha, setting up with only Erling Haaland as a premium option until the World Cup, best defensive enablers and plenty more... 
 Coming up Monday on Planet FPL - s6 ep16 reviewing the weekend GW10 games
 ___________________________________________
