    <item>
      <title>Mad You Forgot | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 10 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/mad-you-forgot-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-10-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Yes, he forgot to buy James Maddison.... Suj &amp; James discuss all the key talking points for Sky Fantasy Football including key pointers from a weekend that included big captaincy hauls and Brighton assets just got very interesting again.
 Plus, there are plenty of choices for captaincy on Sunday, Wilfried Zaha is likely to be a popular signing and there's debate on Nottingham Forest and Aston Villa options ahead of their meeting on Monday night and that includes what to do with Neco Williams, who has returned -1 in his last 4 appearances.
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: Crystal Palace v Leeds with @Migtavius &amp; @fpl_tactician
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
