      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/not-the-gw9-deadline-stream-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>With James off to the North London Derby tomorrow and therefore unable to do the Deadline Stream in the hour leading up to deadline, James decided to still do the stream, but on Friday night instead and that means it's worthwhile releasing the audio!
 On the stream, find out the dilemmas FPL managers are considering ahead of Gameweek 9 and James's thoughts for the Derby, planning ahead and lots more...
 Coming up Monday on Planet FPL - s6 ep15 review the weekend GW9 games
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
