    <item>
      <title>Nottingham Forest | The Fan View with @FFScout_Mark | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/nottingham-forest-the-fan-view-with-ffscout_mark-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Nottingham Forest correspondent Mark Sutherns joins James to discuss all the latest at Forest following a difficult start to the season. A start that Mark predicted but recent defeats at home to fellow promoted sides Bournemouth and Fulham has caused alarm?
 Could Steve Cooper find himself under pressure if results don't improve in the near future or is he likely to make adjustments tpo tactics that are currently seeing Forest get overrun?
 There's discussion on the huge number of signings, who's likely to be first choice going forward, Monday's important trip to Leicester is previewed and the FPL assets of interest such as Neco Williams, Morgan Gibbs-White and Brenna Johnson are covered...
 Follow Mark on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FFScout_Mark
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - *NOT* The GW9 Deadline Stream Live! Stream at 7pm BST with an audio version to follow
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
