      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James dive into some of the data behind the start to the season which causes some interesting debate around assets managers may be considering and also some they may not...
 Thoughts on captaincy for the weekend, the big Monday Night game between Leicester and Forest is covered including alternatives to the 'obvious' James Maddison move, eyes on Leeds potential moves on Sunday, Man City's defensive players, reworking back to Liverpool and plenty more...
