      <title>England's Likely World Cup Squad | The People's Poll ep. 115 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/englands-likely-world-cup-squad-the-peoples-poll-ep-115-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss what England's likely final 26 man squad will look like for the World Cup. Who's definitely going? Who's likely to miss out? And could anyone make a late push for inclusion?
 Plus, discussion on if it's time for Gareth Southgate to step aside, fan expectations, how England may change system subject to opponent and why England's weaknesses aren't only limited to the defence...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s4 ep9 with all the latest discussion for Sky Fantasy Football  
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League:  https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
