    <item>
      <title> 4 Transfers 6 Points | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 8 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/-4-transfers-6-points-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-8-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss all the latest relevant news for Sky Fantasy Football and for James in particular it was a strong weekend but the transfers made didn't reap the rewards.
 There's focus on players who are about to become in-demand such as James Maddison and Wilfried Zaha, why some players such as Harry Kane and even (whisper it) Erling Haaland could be sellable in the near future.
 Plus, upcoming captaincies discussed, learnings from the weekend and community questions covered...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: Liverpool v Brighton with @FPL_LocoLord and @FPLSeagull
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
