    <item>
      <title>Spin The Narrative | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 14 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/spin-the-narrative-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-14-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the 7 games from Blank Gameweek 8, a weekend that saw Heung-Min Son score a 13 minute hat-trick as a substitute against Leicester, Erling Haaland scored again, Arsenal impressed and West Ham slumped to defeat at Goodison Park.
 On the Pod, Suj has gone early on a transfer and yet James is considering selling the same player!
 Plus, tactical insight into the weekend games, the player who didn't play who seems to be on everyone's mind, why Bournemouth assets could be worth a second look and the usual weekly dismantling of Leicester continues... 
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in September features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's offering is The Patreon Q&amp;A
