      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/james-wildcard-planet-fpl-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>James plan for a couple of weeks had been to plan now and back heavily against many well owned assets. As it is the postponements have now meant many of these players such as Liverpool assets are popular sells for the majority.
 James reveals his Wildcard selection (subject to today's Team News) and the reasoning behind his choices with Suj sense checking against James' choices and why he himself isn't activating just yet...
 Still to cone today on Planet FPL - James's presents the GW8 Deadline Stream live on the Planet FPL YouTube channel at 530pm BST.
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
