      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Ahead of Friday's Gameweek 8 meeting between Nottingham Forest and Fulham James is joined by Cottagers Correspondent Dara Curran to discuss Fulham's start to the season and hopes ahead of a very attractive fixture run.</p> <p>There's discussion on Fulham's likely best starting eleven going forward with the squad firmed up by the additions of late transfer window signings Layvin Kurzawa, Daniel James and Willian but there have been some impressive performances from the likes of Tim Ream and Neeskens Kebano which mean there's no guarantee the new additions get straight into the team.</p> <p>Plus, early impressions on the integration of Bernd Leno, Paulinha and Andreas Pereira and why for FPL managers both Pereira and star striker Aleksander Mitrovic are so hard to ignore. But with the promising fixture run until the World Cup should a third Fulham asset be considered...? </p> <p>Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - James's Final Wildcard Draft</p> <p>Join our Planet FPL Mini League: <a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree</a></p> <p>Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447">https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447</a></p> <p>You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785</p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in September features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's offering is a Quiz on King's</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah