    <item>
      <title>You That Scarred? | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 7 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/you-that-scarred-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-7-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj returns for his first Sky Fantasy Football appearance in 3 weeks and remarkably, he's still doing quite well!
 James details fixture updates with how this weekend's postponed games changes the outlook for many teams and assets, the implications of the Matchweek 12 Arsenal-Manchester City postponement and what the learnings are from yesterday's November TV announcement.
 Plus, captaincy for the 3 gamedays ahead discussed and why there's plenty of players to consider buying this weekend including Neco Williams, Palhinha, Aleksander Mitrovic and Jarrod Bowen. And the upcoming Brentford v Brighton single gameday means another look at Brentford players should be considered...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - The Fan View: @TheTinkerMen joins James to discuss Fulham
