    <item>
      <title>Why Did FIFA Ban India?  | The People's Poll ep. 114 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/why-did-fifa-ban-india-the-peoples-poll-ep-114-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>FIFA recently banned India from all competition and though that ban has now been overturned Suj &amp; James investigate how one of the biggest countries in the World managed to get themselves into such a state.
 There's talk of government interference, voting rights, investment concerns, why India are so far behind other nations on the pitch despite such a huge population and what may change going forward.
 Plus the Pod ends with thoughts on Thomas Tuchel's sacking and the likely imminent arrival of Brighton's Graham Potter at Chelsea...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - James presents his Ask James lie stream at 3pm BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel with an audio version posted shortly after conclusion
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
