    <item>
      <title>Flat Battery with @JamesCC1234 | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 6 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/flat-battery-with-jamescc1234-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-6-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>With Suj struggling to get back from holiday due to delayed flights and a flat battery (yes that's where the title comes from) James is joined at short notice by Patreon James Johnson to discuss all the latest for Sky Fantasy.
 The Pod starts with an intro to James who is picking up the game quickly in his 1st Sky Fantasy season and the morning's shocking news of Thomas Tuchel's sacking at Chelsea and what they may mean for in-demand Wesley Fofana for Sky managers.
 There's debate on potential transfers, key pointers from recent games and captaincies for upcoming games including Monday's single gameday between Leeds and Nottingham Forest...
 Follow James Johnson on Twitter: https://twitter.com/JamesCC1234
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast, vote for your topics of choice up to 5pm BST via this tweet  https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1567422524564164609?s=20&amp;t=-O9MatrTCF-9lz0MG8Ys1A
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
 ___________________________________________
