      <description>With Suj still away West Ham fan Luke Boarer stands in to join James and review the midweek football from Gameweek 5 and discuss potential implications for our FPL teams.
 Erling Haaland fired another hat-trick to make it 9 goals in 5 games, is he now the new king of FPL? ...But will he even start tomorrow?
 All 20 clubs discussed, including thoughts from the Planet FPL Derby, why several popular FPL names could be 'rested' this weekend and why the template could be shaken up around Gameweek 8.
