    <item>
      <title>Man Utd v Arsenal | CotC with @ismyCAPplaying &amp; @ThreeFiveWho | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/man-utd-v-arsenal-cotc-with-ismycapplaying-threefivewho-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>James is joined by Manchester United fan Gary Robinson and Arsenal fan Adam Pritchard on this Clash of the Correspondents to preview Sunday's big match at Old Trafford.
 For United, can they repeat the performance that overwhelmed Liverpool against The Gunners?
 Can Arsenal maintain their 100% record? And could they challenge for the title?
 There's discussion on the late nineties, early noughties rivalry between the clubs and if the rivalry still exists; the current status of the squads with the transfer window shutting later today and how Arsenal have often struggled at Old Trafford when United have been short of their best.
 Plus, FPL assets discussed including potential United options and the signing of Anthony and the best Arsenal assets that continue to attract interest...
 Follow Gary on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ismyCAPplaying
 Follow Adam on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Luke Boarer @FPLIrons just James for s6 ep11 reviewing all the midweek Gameweek 5 football
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
