      <description>Luke Williams joins James in this extended Sky Fantasy Podcast to discuss a variety of topics including captaincy, big hitting premiums and enablers.
 Luke has made a flying start in Sky and details how the right selections at the start have hugely helped. There's deliberation on Erling Haaland, Harry Kane &amp; Mo Salah, concerns about Joao Cancelo, tomorrow's Leicester and Manchester United single gameday, upcoming entry points, key pointers from the recent games, why Nottingham Forest can't be ignored and lots more...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents, Manchester United v Arsenal with @ismyCAPplaying &amp; @ThreeFiveWho
