    <item>
      <title>Hav Salah That! | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 10 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/hav-salah-that-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-10-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the football from a very memorable weekend in the Premier League and it featured a scarcely believable outcome for Fantasy Premier League managers.
 How could it possibly be that the FPL King Mohammed Salah failed to notch a single attacking return in a 9-0 win? You couldn't make it up! While at The Etihad Erling Haaland showed again that the hype is real as his hat-trick helped Manchester City overturn a 2-0 deficit against Crystal Palace.
 Plus, all of the Big 6 won despite moments of difficulty, Brighton and West Ham picked up important wins; all the games reviewed and all the FPL relevant topics discussed including upcoming rotation concerns and the players that need the bin and the assets catching our eye...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: Bournemouth v Wolves, with @AFCBNG &amp; @parker_bradley
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
