    <item>
      <title>Brentford v Everton | CotC with @FPLDummyTom &amp; @spirit_blues | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/brentford-v-everton-cotc-with-fpldummytom-spirit_blues-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>James welcomes Brentford fan Tom Medd and Everton fan Sean Norton to discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of Saturday's meeting in West London.
 What system is best for The Bees? And how does it impact the likes of Ivan Toney for Fantasy managers? Are Everton likely to continue to adopt a back five in upcoming weeks?
 Brentford's long and attractive fixture runs has begun, there's discussion on not just Toney but the likes of David Raya, Rico Henry, Josh Dasilva and Bryan Mbuemo plus expectations on new signings Keane Lewis-Potter and Mikkel Damsgaard.
 While for Everton the next week off the pitch feels as big as results on it. Should the club accept Chelsea's proposal for Anthony Gordon? What happens if Everton don't buy forward? Will Gana join Onana and is there anything FPL managers should be interested in beyond 4.0 defender Nathan Patterson?
 Follow Tom on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLDummyTom
 Follow Sean on Twitter: https://twitter.com/spirit_blues
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Ask James, scheduled for 3pm BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel with an audio version to follow
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in August features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's content features a Champions League Group Stage Quiz
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 #Brentford #Everton #FPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
