    <item>
      <title>Bullseye Speedboat | Planet SkyFF S. 4 Ep. 4 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/bullseye-speedboat-planet-skyff-s-4-ep-4-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss the upcoming period where difficult captaincy decisions lie in wait and fixture gains on premium assets cease with the Champions League start on the horizon.
 On the Podcast, if the move to Harry Kane or Heung-Min Son on Sunday is worth it, the importance of tomorrow's Champions League draw in trying to determine when players may be rested, captaincy for next Tuesday, further thoughts on enablers, De Bruyne vs Haaland, weekend learnings and Twitter questions covered...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents, Brentford v Everton with @FPLDummyTom &amp; @spirit_blues
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
