      <title>Manchester United 2-1 Liverpool | The People's Poll ep. 113 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/manchester-united-2-1-liverpool-the-peoples-poll-ep-113-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>In an extension of yesterday's Gameweek 3 Review Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss last night's brilliant win for Manchester United against Liverpool.
 What changed for United and how did they make Liverpool look so ordinary? 
 The individual battles discussed and the impacts for FPL going forward covered as James admits to considering activating the Wildcard and why Big at the Back is on the ropes, but can recover...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s4 ep4, All the latest for Sky Fantasy Football
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
