    <item>
      <title>Planet FPL 1000 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/planet-fpl-1000-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James celebrate reaching the milestone of 1000 Podcasts by discussing the best and funniest moments from the first 1000 Pods.
 Remember when Suj locked Leroy Sane in his basement or said Michail Antonio was 'tired'? Or when James labelled Jamal Lascelles big tasty?
 The funniest moments remembered and some of the popular podcasts reminisced including Chip Strategy specials, the difficult subject Pods, highlights from live streams including the 24 hour live charity stream, the influence of ManChild and the introduction of the Correspondents....
 Plus, what do Suj &amp; James really think of each other, how they met their wives, what's next for Planet FPL and so much more... 
 Tomorrow on the Planet FPL YouTube Channel - James presents The GW3 Deadline Stream Live
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
 ___________________________________________
