    <item>
      <title>Newcastle v Man City | CotC with @fplBibs &amp; @FPLPringle | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/newcastle-v-man-city-cotc-with-fplbibs-fplpringle-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>It's the 1000th Planet FPL Podcast and it seems only fitting that the Correspondents are involved as James welcomes Newcastle fan Simon Bibby and Manchester City fan Jonny Pringle to discuss the Super Sunday meeting between the clubs at St James's Park
 There's discussion on the ownership of the clubs with Newcastle now embarking on a path that City have already taken, but the journey for Newcastle looks like it will be tougher than it was for City.
 Plus, all the FPL assets that matter from both clubs, tactical insights into both teams and why it could be more open thatn we expect on Sunday...
 Follow Si on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fplBibs
 Follow Jonny on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLPringle
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet FPL 1000, celebrating a milestone of one thousand Podcasts
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
