      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast it's been a decent start for both Suj &amp; James but can Suj actually recognise that he has started well!?
 There's discussion on learnings from the weekend, captaincy picks for the weekend ahead, enablers to target, if Sky managers should be looking to own two of them and why timing may influence who people go for.
 Plus, Twitter community questions answered...
