    <item>
      <title>Chelsea v Tottenham | CotC with @Phantomantle &amp; @Rickysaunders77 | Planet FPL 2022/23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chelsea-v-tottenham-cotc-with-phantomantle-rickysaunders77-planet-fpl-202223</link>
      <description>On the first Clash of the Correspondents of the 2022/23 season James is joined by Chelsea fan Gary Mantle and Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders to discuss season aspirations, reflections on Gameweek 1 victories, Sunday's London Derby at The Bridge and the FPL assets that matter.
 Can either push Liverpool and Manchester City for this season's title or is Top 4 consolidation more of a priority?
 Plus, the rivalry, Antonio Conte, the tactical tweak Chelsea may deploy this weekend, Tottenham's growing confidence, their brilliant front 3, envious glances and all the FPL assets that matter including Reece James, Mason Mount, where Marc Cucurella fits in the Tottenham wing-backs and premiums, Dejan Kulusevski &amp; more...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Ask James, 3pm BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel with an audio version to follow shortly after
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
