    <item>
      <title>Who's The Best 5.0 Defender? | The People's Poll ep. 110 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/whos-the-best-50-defender-the-peoples-poll-ep-110-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>The price point the Twitter community decided they wanted Suj &amp; James to focus on is 5.0 defenders and the lads set out on trying to find out who's the best choice at that price and position bracket.
 The Pod begins by eliminating options, discussing those FPL managers should keep an eye on but not start with and then looks at splitting the options into two groups, players considered because they are locked first choices for strong defensive teams and then those that managers will pick because of their attacking potential.
 There are clear and popular choices but could it be that a low owned differential stands out as the best choice?
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s4 ep1, a preview of the Sky Fantasy Football season
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
