    <item>
      <title>Ivan The Doc | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 6 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ivan-the-doc-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-6-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>With four days to go before the Gameweek 1 deadline Suj &amp; James kick off their final week of pre-season content by discussing learnings from Correspondent Week and what new information became clear during the club's final pre-season friendlies.
 There's coverage of every club, run through from bottom to top based on the Correspondents predictions for the season with thought provoking discussion around the FPL assets under consideration.
 Plus, James clarifies the wing-back situation at Tottenham, why Reece James vs Mracus Rashford is a thing, the difficulty in picking the right goalkeeper for Gameweek 1, captaincy planning and there's advice to consider 'what if' scenarios in team structure...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast: 5.0 Defenders
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
