    <item>
      <title>Tottenham Hotspur with @Rickysaunders77 | CorrespondentWeek ep17 2022 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/tottenham-hotspur-with-rickysaunders77-correspondentweek-ep17-2022-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James are joined by Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders to give the full rundown on The Lilywhites and there is great interest from FPL managers in their assets.
 There's a deep dive in to the complicated situation in the much coveted wing-back positions and there are differing opinions between James &amp; Ricky.
 Up front should Harry Kane or Heung-Min Son be favoured for FPL managers. The good news is both look bang in form in pre-season so it could be a case of finding the favoured combination with players from other teams.
 Plus, Ricky makes a strong case for FPL managers to include Dejan Kulusevski, why the Gameweek 1 line-up might not feature too many of the 6 new signings, advances could still be made for another attacking player, the importance of Antonio Conte and could Tottenham make a challenge for the title?
 Follow Ricky on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Rickysaunders77
 Still to come today on Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episode 18 on Bournemouth with @AFCBNG
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785
