    <item>
      <title>West Ham United with @Fpl_SkyAddict | Correspondent Week ep 14 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/west-ham-united-with-fpl_skyaddict-correspondent-week-ep-14-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>West Ham fan Chris Stone joins Suj &amp; James to discuss The Hammers and the best FPL assets from The London Stadium.
 Can The Hammers break back into the top 6 again or will commitments in Europe hinder consistency?
 New signing Nayef Aguerd could be out until after the World Cup but with Gianluca Scamacca now a confirmed addition upfront The Hammers have additional firepower, but is it to the benefit of Jarrod Bowen and Michail Antonio's FPL appeal?
 Plus, who's likely to start in goal, are there 4.5 defensive assets to consider or is the Aguerd injury too damaging? Thomas Soucek and Pablo Fornals are debated for the 5.5 midfield bracket and the likely favoured starting formation. 
 Follow Chris on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_SkyAddict
 Still to come today on Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episode 15: Brighton with @FPLSeagull
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
