    <item>
      <title>Leicester City with @AaronLagor | Correspondent Week ep 13 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leicester-city-with-aaronlagor-correspondent-week-ep-13-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James kick off Correspondent Week Friday with Leicester City correspondent Aaron Lagor and there's only one place to start, where's the signings? 
 But with no European distractions and key players like Wesley Fofana fit again Leicester could kick on but doubts remain about the futures of the likes of Youri Tielemans.
 For FPL managers there are plenty of interesting options; the 4.5 full-backs appeal, midfielders James Maddison (8.0), Harvey Barnes (7.0) and Kiernan Dewsbury-Hall (5.0) should all be considered and Jamie Vardy always starts a season well.
 Plus, Kasper Schmeichel could be leaving, is Brendan Rodgers under pressure and the importance of The Foxes opening two home games and the brilliant run from Gameweek 9...
 Follow Aaron on Twitter: https://twitter.com/AaronLagor
 Still to come today on Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episodes 14 &amp; 15: West Ham with @Fpl_SkyAddict &amp; Brighton with @FPLSeagull
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
