    <item>
      <title>Chelsea with @Phantomantle | Correspondent Week ep 12 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chelsea-with-phantomantle-correspondent-week-ep-12-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James are joined by new Chelsea correspondent Gary Mantle to discuss The Blues FPL assets and hopes for the new season... but not all is well following the heavy pre-season defeat to Arsenal.
 Thomas Tuchel is not happy, there's an investigation into why and the learnings are that Chelsea need but are struggling to make new signings.
 All the FPL assets of interest are discussed including Edouard Mendy, Reece James, Ben Chilwell and Mason Mount and Raheem Sterling.
 Plus, back three expected, likely starting line-up, the interesting home and away fixtures quirk and the club takeover  
 Follow Gary on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Phantomantle
 Coming up tomorrow Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episodes 13-15: Leicester with @AaronLagor, West Ham with @Fpl_SkyAddict &amp; Brighton with @FPLSeagull
