      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[ <p>Suj &amp; James are joined by new Chelsea correspondent Gary Mantle to discuss The Blues FPL assets and hopes for the new season... but not all is well following the heavy pre-season defeat to Arsenal.</p> <p>Thomas Tuchel is not happy, there's an investigation into why and the learnings are that Chelsea need but are struggling to make new signings.</p> <p>All the FPL assets of interest are discussed including Edouard Mendy, Reece James, Ben Chilwell and Mason Mount and Raheem Sterling.</p> <p>Plus, back three expected, likely starting line-up, the interesting home and away fixtures quirk and the club takeover  </p> <p>Follow Gary on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/Phantomantle">https://twitter.com/Phantomantle</a></p> <p>Coming up tomorrow Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episodes 13-15: Leicester with @AaronLagor, West Ham with @Fpl_SkyAddict &amp; Brighton with @FPLSeagull</p> <p>Join our Planet FPL Mini League: <a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree</a></p> <p>Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post <a href="https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447">https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447</a></p> <p>You can also join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League. The Pin required is 8475785</p> <p>___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in July features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's content features the Patreon Quiz Final</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>#CorrespondentWeek #FPL #Chelsea</p> <p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
