      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/newcastle-united-with-fplbibs-correspondent-week-ep-11-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>As we enter the second half of Correspondent Week Suj &amp; James welcome Newcastle United fan Simon Bibby and he's come armed with the help of some friends to give a wider view from more Newcastle fans on their FPL assets!
 With Nottingham Forest up first Newcastle assets appeal, those on FPL managers minds are discussed including Nick Pope, Kieran Trippier, Bruno Guimares, Allan Saint-Maximin and Callum Wilson.
 But could Si really be tipping up Almirgeddon as an option...!?
 Plus, further signings expected, where they may be, the impact of a possible injury to Jonjo Shelvey may have on Guimares and seasons expectations...
 Follow Si on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fplBibs
 Still to come tonight on Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episode 12: Chelsea with @Phantomantle
