      <title>Wolves with @parker_bradley | Correspondent Week ep 10 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wolves-with-parker_bradley-correspondent-week-ep-10-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Welcome to The Pedro Neto Podcast! It's Wolves next on Correspondent week as Bradley Parker joins Suj &amp; James to discuss his team and why this season might be different to last.
 Is Neto a trap? A gift? Is he without question the best 5.5 midfield asset in FPL? Could Morgan Gibbs-White offer an alternative within the same club?
 Plus, a new Wolves to look forward to with a switch to a back four, why the days of Conor Coady as 1st choice could be over, what Wolves may do if Raul Jimenez isn't available for Gameweek and if Jose Sa and the 4.5 full-backs are being overlooked by FPL managers...
 Follow Bradley on Twitter: https://twitter.com/parker_bradley
 Still to come today on Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episodes 11 &amp; 12: Newcastle with @fplBibs and Chelsea @Phantomantle
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
