    <item>
      <title>Fulham with @TheTinkerMen | Correspondent Week ep 7 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fulham-with-thetinkermen-correspondent-week-ep-7-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Fulham Correspondent Dara Curran kicks off Suj &amp; James's Wednesday coverage of Correspondent Week by discussing The Cottagers and the best FPL assets from last season's Championship Winners.
 There's frustration at the lack of transfer activity, repeating mistakes from two years ago but incomings are on the way and those that are close to joining are discussed.
 There's an intro to new signings Palhinha, Manor Soloman and 4.5 FPL gold Andreas Pereira who is likely to start the season on some set-pieces and play in an attacking midfield position.
 Plus, why Aleksandr Mitrovic could excel this time, why Harry Wilson shouldn't be discounted from FPL managers thoughts but why the opening fixtures will be off putting and why a slow start could lead to a long hard season...
 Follow Dara on Twitter: https://twitter.com/TheTinkerMen 
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Correspondent Week episodes 8 &amp; 9; Aston Villa with @Lee_Jackson_92 &amp; Manchester City with @FPLPringle
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post https://www.patreon.com/posts/patreon-mini-69251447
