      <title>Champions Week ep5 with Suvansh Singh, FPL Runner-Up 2021/22 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/champions-week-ep5-with-suvansh-singh-fpl-runner-up-202122-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>In the final Podcast of Planet FPL Champions Week James speaks to Planet FPL Mini League Winner and Fantasy Premier League overall runner-up Suvansh Singh to discuss his incredible season, a season that's even more incredible when we learn how long he's played FPL for!
 In the discussion, Suvansh's mixture of pride at being India's highest ever FPL finisher but also the tinge of regret in not winning the ultimate prize, his strategy in the quest for glory and thoughts turn to next season and overview of the premium options across the positions under consideration...
 Follow Suvansh on Twitter: (3) Suvansh Singh (@suvanshfpl) / Twitter
 Next week on Planet FPL - It's the one you have been waiting for, Correspondent Week, 20 Podcasts in 7 days and it starts with Liverpool correspondent Dan Lord on Monday morning... 
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 Patrons can find information on their mini leagues this season via this post ⚠️ Patreon Mini League Info | Planet #FPL with Suj &amp; James on Patreon
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Podcast. The Pin required is 8475785
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in July features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's content features a near 2 hour Preview of the Gaffr season, the game for Championship Fantasy with Luke Boarer and Rob Pick
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl 
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg
 #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #ChampionsWeek
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
