      <description>James speak to Planet FPL Advanced Tier Patreon mini league winner Cole Bonzer discuss his successful FPL season where he finished just outside the top 2k in the World and to find out about his very unique and interesting introduction to football and FPL.
 Cole reveals the consistent approach that works for him, why he backs form players, thoughts on Man City's key assets and the impact Raheem Sterling may have at Chelsea...
 Follow Cole on Twitter: (2) Cole (@BonzerC) / Twitter
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Champions Week ep5 with Planet FPL Mini League Winner and Fantasy Premier League Runner-up Suvansh Singh
