      <title>Champions Week ep3 with Dave Perrins, Sky Fantasy Football Runner-Up | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/champions-week-ep3-with-dave-perrins-sky-fantasy-football-runner-up-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James is joined by Davie Perrins, last season's Sky Fantasy Runner-Up and also with an FPL season finish within the top 20k. How did Dave balance successful seasons in both Fantasy formats?
 There's an intro into the differences between Sky Fantasy and Fantasy Premier League and how Dave dealt with the pressure of competing for the first prize of £50,000 in Sky Fantasy. 
 Discussion focuses on strategy for both formats, what will be different in Sky Fantasy this coming season, current Sky drafts revealed and the merits of an FPL Gameweek 1 Bench Boost are all covered...
 Subscribe to Dave's YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQeEgaDTsvwuD8_p5lxz-OQ
 Follow Dave on Twitter: https://twitter.com/SimpleGull
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Champions Week ep4 with Advanced Tier Patreon Mini League Winner Cole Bonzer
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Podcast. The Pin required is 8475785
 ___________________________________________
