    <item>
      <title>Champions Week ep1 with Jamie Pigott, FPL Winner 2021/22 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/champions-week-ep1-with-jamie-pigott-fpl-winner-202122-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the first Podcast of Champions Week James interviews Jamie Pigott, the official Fantasy Premier League Champion of 2021/22 to discuss his incredible achievement and the mental side of dealing with the pressure and success.
 Jamie gives insight as to why strategy was so important to him, how luck played its part in his ultimate triumph, dealing with setbacks, his rise from novice to champion, thoughts of how to go against the template next season and so much more...
 Follow Jamie on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Futbolislifefpl
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Champions Week ep2 with Correspondent Mini League Winner and Leeds Correspondent Andy Martin
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 You can also join our Sky Fantasy Podcast. The Pin required is 8475785
