    <item>
      <title>Tot&amp;Ham: Double Down | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/totham-double-down-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest on their respective clubs and give the fan opinion on the topics that matter on their respective clubs Tottenham and West Ham.
 There's discussion on both clubs transfer incomings, outgoings and what may yet happen in the transfer window.
 There's info about a number of Hammers players coming towards the end of their contracts, a change in coaching personnel and outrage from fans at excessive ticket prices.
 Plus, James gives all the detail from Tottenham's win in Korea yesterday, why despite all the news faces it felt like the same team from last season and there's insight an opinion from watching the youngsters and one surprise overage player at Enfield Town on Tuesday night.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Ask James live stream 12pm BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel with an audio version to follow shortly after.
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in July features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's content tells the remarkable tale of Belgian club Royale Union Saint-Gilloise
