      <description>Suj and James discuss ideas for what their Gameweek 1 teams might look like by talking through draft ideas. Key pointers on structure, the importance of making non selected players accessible, key price points, going with and against (the magnificent 7) the 40%+ owned players and the rest of the current FPL template.
 3 premium, 2 premium or only 1 attacking premium player?
 Is it possible to start without the likes of Trent Alexander-Arnold or Erling Haaland?
 Drafts revealed... Play It Your Way
 Next week on Planet FPL - It's European Week on Patreon next week with stories on Barcelona, Hertha and Union Berlin, AC Milan, Royale Union Saint-Gilloise and PSG. Our front of house content will therefore be our regular Patreon content with the Patreon Q&amp;A opening the schedule.
