      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James discuss ideas for what their Gameweek 1 teams might look like by talking through draft ideas. Key pointers on structure, the importance of making non selected players accessible, key price points, going with and against (the magnificent 7) the 40%+ owned players and the rest of the current FPL template.</p> <p>3 premium, 2 premium or only 1 attacking premium player?</p> <p>Is it possible to start without the likes of Trent Alexander-Arnold or Erling Haaland?</p> <p>Drafts revealed... Play It Your Way</p> <p>Next week on Planet FPL - It's European Week on Patreon next week with stories on Barcelona, Hertha and Union Berlin, AC Milan, Royale Union Saint-Gilloise and PSG. Our front of house content will therefore be our regular Patreon content with the Patreon Q&amp;A opening the schedule.</p> <p>Join our Planet FPL Mini League: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHlheXZQbHU4QXZ5a0hZVFdFYWN1dHpSbTN5Z3xBQ3Jtc0trbk9oQ1l4aXl2d0ZaYmxiemRmTDh4VXNxOVhDdGZ3Wmw2dXpWNEttQ2hOM1JZMDBDMWtLMzdoU1ZjNXpyam1SSU9tRnE1YlFsanUzcjd4bG5JMzlnLWt1bUllYXgzOHQ5XzdPSFZzNWN6UUJHMWFkWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2Fauto-join%2Fyw6ree&amp;v=DbqBNznLegM">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a> ___________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in July features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's content features an Ask James live stream</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbENUVGY0NlVXZE5LYTVNOW80MnB2YXZPT2VkUXxBQ3Jtc0tuT2I1My1tUUxHMV9HNnNDYzV0M2pvVWV2bmctcjNDdHJjcllNVjZneWE4VFhTMmswM2FleGhLMW1xMEQ2QnRxc1lrTUs5dWV2eE5Md1Vta3hhWWNXdHRnWGV5QWNGZXVVSVRfZndvT0dIM3U1Rlpvaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;v=DbqBNznLegM">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a> Follow</p> <p>James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWtZOVI0NVQ4X0g2MjRJdXFhY0lLSlpDdFcxZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuTC1INjJBd2djNmM0RGRCakhMQldhV0pLbkJDekh6bjRzYmxuLWpCUTY1RGtLUEhwWjkxR1FBT2dlUktJU3V3bElFdmk2blhhYi1yWkFmRWx0TnA5SXhYQ1RpYjM2d0I4YWVOb1F1WjBkc3NCclJJNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod&amp;v=DbqBNznLegM">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbV9kdEV4TDRhb0o0WVluMVp5cU1ZeDBmdFhZZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsOHZLaC1XdFFCeUNtNkRtUUJZa3NZSmRuTWFhZXdObS1QajVhX1BZcFlRUWFXY2lGeTc1akljdHBjQ2sxYnp6RkxTUkRBZUNJVVdTSnF5Z1FnS2pESl9HTTZXXzNuUWR0aTBQQ295bFhKRWNzejZoaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fsujanshah&amp;v=DbqBNznLegM">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkxhQzh2b21WaXppamlKT1RiMU1zN2hLOUpMZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsaHhpWFJjU1hocTUweDg1QVlpZ041eGdLajJFb09BWC1pbl9uT3JycUJ0TU9BZVh5X1lhS24tU0s5VWN4VDh4bkJtQTdwS043cUVaWlVqa2dzRE5xM0RoRFg2S1Bub2JuM1kwZHhNd1cyQVljLVBjcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;v=DbqBNznLegM">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEp2TExMVFlYeXNwTFpIdDYzYXZvLS1JMi1kd3xBQ3Jtc0traVJLcWw5bTdwekdsMjA5SURLNW9TdUhuTE5kclhDOG1fcDdoSXI3dVBPT2ZVTEktV2dUS3Rlek5lNG5vanpCeTU3V0RXTkRWeF9Yd1BUZmlVVUJUaVhUSUxGTlZMRHRtS0hvYklWTjRISHVMVWNqRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;v=DbqBNznLegM">