    <item>
      <title>Chip Strategy | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 4 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chip-strategy-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-4-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James layout a roadmap of the season ahead (ok mainly James does!), analysing when FPL managers may want to use their Chips this season.
 There's an explanation of what's different from last season, why there isn't a clear 'biggest' Double Gameweek and detail of the best possible scenarios to use the Triple Captaincy and why it may be the last chip used.
 Plus, the Sword v Shield Free Hit options, why Unlimited Transfers during the World Cup will impact play and options for the first Wildcard which include going early, targeting 'the pretenders' and why it can be used as a Free Hit rather than a Wildcard. 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet FPL s6 ep5: First Drafts
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
