    <item>
      <title>Player Prices | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 3 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/player-prices-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-3-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>With Fantasy Premier League launched yesterday Suj &amp; James pour over the details of the player prices, assessing who's value, who's not and structuring team selection for Gameweek 1.
 There's talk on the Magnificent 7, the template choices already developing in teams and whether there are differential alternatives within the same teams who can be picked.
 James identifies budget enablers across the positions who should be of interest and why these players could eliminate a lot of more experience options from thinking.
 And there's an overview of the price points throughout the game...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet FPL s6 ep4: Chip Strategy
 Join our Planet FPL Mini League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/yw6ree
