    <item>
      <title>What's New? | Planet FPL S. 6 Ep. 1 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/whats-new-planet-fpl-s-6-ep-1-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the season 6 Premiere of Planet FPL Suj &amp; James take a look at all 20 Premier League clubs and ask 'What's New?'
 What impact can we expect big money signings Erling Haaland and Darwin Nunez to have on Manchester City and Liverpool respectively?
 Tottenham have done great business so far much to James's satisfaction and with more to come could they chase down the top two?
 Every clubs business analysed, potential tactical tweaks to watch out for, what clubs may yet do, who needs to spend more, who may sell assets, and who's causing concern.
 It's a Gameweek review Pod, but without the games...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet FPL s6 ep2: Fixture Analysis
