      <description>On the final Planet FPL Season 5 Podcast of the season Suj &amp; James discuss the weekend football talking points and begin by discussing Saturday's FPL Community North v South GW39 match raising money for Street Child United.
 There's also discussion on the disturbing scenes which Liverpool fans faced at Saturday's Champions League final, Nottingham Forest's promotion, two new correspondents for next season are introduced and there's some debate on some of the numbers that helped define Suj &amp; James's FPL seasons... 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - An end of season Q&amp;A, a free for all ask Suj &amp; James anything.
