      <title>The Problem With Pitch Invasions | The People's Poll ep. 109 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-problem-with-pitch-invasions-the-peoples-poll-ep-109-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the People's Poll Suj &amp; James discuss the rise in disturbance during football pitch invasions and ask what can be done to protect players and staff from recent unsavoury incidents. 
 Do stewards have any power to stop fans? What are the costs in policing a game? Can clubs do more? Can lessons be learned from Wembley stadium?
 But can invasions still be a good thing?
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - James presents his Ask James stream at 12pm BST on YouTube with an audio to be posted after.
