    <item>
      <title>Third Season Syndrome | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 42 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/third-season-syndrome-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-42-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the final Sky Fantasy Football Podcast of this season Suj &amp; James discuss their final season ranks, regrets and Suj's near miss in the May manager of the month.
 There's a review of the best performing players since both the Overhaul and the March international break and one team's defensive assets could stand out as a target for next season.
 Plus, thoughts on what could happen with the Overhauls next season, what would make the game better, lessons learned and more...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - People's Podcast, vote whether you would like us to discuss AC Milan, Kylian Mbappe or pitch invasions up to 6pm BST via this tweet:  https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1529387400576868352?s=20&amp;t=h3AaFPYf8NIgvQmuHURcRg
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in May features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's Podcast is our first ever Patreon phone-in.
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl 
