      <itunes:summary>On the final Sky Fantasy Football Podcast of this season Suj &amp; James discuss their final season ranks, regrets and Suj's near miss in the May manager of the month.
 There's a review of the best performing players since both the Overhaul and the March international break and one team's defensive assets could stand out as a target for next season.
 Plus, thoughts on what could happen with the Overhauls next season, what would make the game better, lessons learned and more...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - People's Podcast, vote whether you would like us to discuss AC Milan, Kylian Mbappe or pitch invasions up to 6pm BST via this tweet:  https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1529387400576868352?s=20&amp;t=h3AaFPYf8NIgvQmuHURcRg
