    <item>
      <title>GW39 Preview with @Benny_Blanco40 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/gw39-preview-with-benny_blanco40-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>James welcomes Benny Blanco on to the Podcast discuss this Saturday's Gameweek 39, a North v South encounter between members of the FPL Community to raise money for Street Child United.
 There's discussion on how the event in Birmingham came to be, the work that's gone on behind the scenes into organising the game, why Street Child United are the chosen charity and how Gaffr.io have supported the Fantasy Football game behind GW39.
 Plus, the banter behind the teams, the content creators involved, why Fantasy managers should avoid Suj &amp; James, what's happening during and after the game and why there's concern about ineligibility about some members of the North team!
 Buy tickets or donate at https://www.gw39northvsouth.co.uk/
 Follow Benny on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Benny_Blanco40
 Follow the official GW39 account: https://twitter.com/GW39FPL
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Suj and James wrap up their Sky Fantasy Football content for the season.
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in May features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's content features Tot&amp;Ham and James is obviously in a celebratory mood
