      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/its-a-toothbrush-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-56-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On the final Gameweek review of the season Suj &amp; James discuss the final day drama in the Premier League with a focus of what we can expect from clubs next season.
 James is still drunk rather than hungover following Tottenham's qualification for the Champions League and Suj is sober following West Ham's defeat and surviving the Eddie Nketiah bet.
 Plus, there's an extended Q&amp;A section which includes more food stuff and other nonsense.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - James welcomes @Benny_Blanco40 to discuss Saturday's charity match featuring members from the FPL Community who are coming together to raise money for Street Child United.
