    <item>
      <title>*NOT the* Planet FPL GW38 Deadline Stream Live! | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/not-the-planet-fpl-gw38-deadline-stream-live-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>With no Deadline Stream on the Planet FPL YouTube channel for James as he is off to Norwich for Tottenham's critical final day game at Carrow Road (priorities), The stream was brought forward to Saturday evening. That means it was worth publishing the audio ahead of Sunday's 230pm BST deadline.
 On the stream... James talks through his Free Hit team, captaincy preferences, benching dilemmas, predictions, community questions including if hits are worth taking and if Salah should be kept for those who still own and there's a non FPL question section at the end...
 Monday on Planet FPL - Suj &amp; James present Planet FPL s5 ep56, the final Gameweek review Podcast of the 2021/22 season. 
 ___________________________________________
