    <item>
      <title>Norwich v Tottenham | CotC with @Fpl_badger &amp; @Rickysaunders77 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/norwich-v-tottenham-cotc-with-fpl_badger-rickysaunders77-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the final Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcast of the season James is joined by Norwich fan Mark Hammond and Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders to discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of Sunday's Gameweek 38 meeting at Carrow Road.
 With Tottenham now needing only a point on Sunday is the top 4 race done or can Norwich cause one of the shocks of the season?
 There's discussion on the emotional of the last week for Tottenham having chased down the deficit on Arsenal and praise for the work Antonio Conte has done.
 Will Norwich be promoted again next season or does it look more difficult for them next season? And who's to blame for the difficult season?
 Plus best Tottenham FPL assets for the final day including debate on Emerson Royal vs Ryan Sessegnon and Harry Kane vs Heung-Min Son...
 Follow Mark on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_badger
 Follow Ricky on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Rickysaunders77
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - S5 ep55, looking back on the 5 games played Monday to Thursday with a summary of final plans for Gameweek 38.
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in May features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's offering is a quiz, testing Patrons knowledge on FPL assists throughout the current season.
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl 
