    <item>
      <title>KDB Nice To Each Other | Planet FPL S. 5 Ep. 53 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/kdb-nice-to-each-other-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-53-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review an incredible Gameweek 36 midweek that saw huge swings in scores for FPL managers as Salah was benched again, KDB went nuts and Bench Boosters generally did well because of Cycling Goalkeeper Ben Foster.
 There's discussion on dealing with the bad beats that the large variance in scores may have suffered this week and why FPL management is getting harder year on year.
 All the 6 midweek games reviewed including concern for Leeds, understanding Liverpool's selections, Tottenham's emphatic North London Derby win (Yes!) and thoughts on the best selection of premium and double gameweek players for the final double in 37...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Nothing actually. James presents the Gameweek 37 Deadline Stream on the Planet FPL YouTube channel on Sunday at 930am BST.
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in May features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's content features The Differential Show Gameweek 37 Preview
