    <item>
      <title>Kernow Or Never | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 40 with @fplkernow | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/kernow-or-never-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-40-with-fplkernow-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>With Suj away on real life work duties James is joined Neil Currah who is currently ranked 7th overall in Sky Fantasy and still has hopes of finishing 1st and taking the big prize.
 There's discussion on how Neil has done so well this season, the mind games that come into play at the top end of the overall leaderboard and how luck can play a part in a successful season.
 Plus, a look at remaining captaincy days, the potential for differential transfers and captaincy and the Pod finishes with a message from Suj who is in first place in his quest for a console and the May manager of the month.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Introducing Bournemouth (again) with @AFCBNG
 ___________________________________________
