    <item>
      <title>Aston Villa v Crystal Palace | CotC with @Lee_Jackson_92 &amp; @Migtavius | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/aston-villa-v-crystal-palace-cotc-with-lee_jackson_92-migtavius-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcast James is joined by Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson and Crystal Palace fan Migtavius to discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of the final double gameweek of the season which includes Sunday's meeting for the two clubs at Villa Park.
 There's discussion on if Philippe Coutinho will get back into the Villa team following Saturday's excellent win at Burnley, if Danny Ings could now be the preferred forward option over Ollie Watkins for FPL managers, Lucas Digne's shock return and if he's now a better option in Fantasy than Matty Cash.
 Is there any reason for FPL managers not to buy Wilfried Zaha? Arguably not, but there are cheaper options that could be considered, they're discussed as are defensive enablers and so to is recently dropped Jean-Philippe Mateta.
 And with both clubs set for a mid table finish there's a look at what the longer term ambitions are for the two clubs... 
 Follow Lee on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Lee_Jackson_92
 Follow Mig on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Migtavius
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - James is joined by @fplkernow for this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in May features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and today's offering see James welcome Patreon Sam O'Sullivan to the Podcast discuss his experiences attending over 100 games this season.
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl 
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg
 #AstonVilla #CrystalPalace #FPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
