    <item>
      <title>Leaked Vids &amp; Only Fans | Planet FPL S. 5 Ep. 52 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leaked-vids-only-fans-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-52-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss all the games from the Double Gameweek weekend as many struggled to find returns with popular assets from Chelsea and Liverpool blanking so far, but there's still the midweek games to go!
 There's discussion on the fallout from the big results as Tottenham halted Liverpool at Anfield, Arsenal tightened their grip on 4th, City hit five, Brighton dismantled United and Everton picked up another big win.
 There's focus on the FPL assets in mind for the final 2 gameweeks, how much luck is considered a part of FPL success, James is eyeing a top 50k finish and, for now, Suj still has his clothes on.
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: Aston Villa v Crystal Palace with @Lee_Jackson_92 and @Migtavius
