    <item>
      <title>Leicester v Everton | CotC with @AaronLagor &amp; @spirit_blues | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leicester-v-everton-cotc-with-aaronlagor-spirit_blues-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcast James is joined by Leicester fan Aaron Lagor and Everton fan Sean Norton to discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of back to back doubles for both clubs in FPL which will begin with Sunday's Gameweek 36 meeting at The King Power.
 There's discussion on the importance of Leicester's Europa Conference semi final 2nd leg in Rome tonight with the tie level at 1-1 and there's attempts to try and work out if there can be any faith in Leicester players playing twice for the very attarctive upcoming double with The Toffees and Norwich.
 Plus, talisman Richarlison, the Everton enablers to consider in FPL and the 3 way fight for survival with Burnley and Leeds
 Follow Aaron on Twitter: https://twitter.com/AaronLagor
 Follow Sean on Twitter: https://twitter.com/spirit_blues
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - Ask James, scheduled for 3pm BST on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after.
 ___________________________________________
