    <item>
      <title>You're Like My Wife | Planet FPL S. 5 Ep. 51 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/youre-like-my-wife-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-51-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On their review of Gameweek 35 Suj &amp; James discuss all the key talking points for FPL from the weekend including a review of James's Wildcard and both of the lads are focused towards a Gameweek 36 Bench Boost.
 On the Pod... a strong warning about selling Chelsea assets despite defeat to Everton who may themselves interest ahead of a double double, a situation that may also make Aston Villa and Leicester assets appealing.
 Plus, Heung-Min Son does the business again, concerns over getting players who will start twice, why Mo Salah will be the clear favoured captain for many this coming week but not necessarily the right choice for everyone and some late enablers have just put their hands up for consideration. 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep39: All the latest for Sky Fantasy Football
