    <item>
      <title>Comfort Or Console | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 38 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/comfort-or-console-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-38-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>It's time for Suj to try and win a console! There's debate with James about how best to go about trying to win the May manager of the month and the discussion should help give those with not many transfers left ideas for the remainder of the season.
 Plus, why Cristiano Ronaldo offers an explosive differential captaincy option on Monday night but why many may make a move for a Brentford player instead and for many teams assets this weekend it may be worth waiting one more weekend...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: West Ham v Arsenal with @Fpl_SkyAddict and @ThreeFiveWho
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in April features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's Podcast is Tot&amp;Ham: Discussing all the latest on Tottenham and West Ham
