    <item>
      <title>What Can We Expect From Ten Hag? | The People's Poll ep. 107 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/what-can-we-expect-from-ten-hag-the-peoples-poll-ep-107-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's People's Poll Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss Thursday's appointment of Ajax's Erik Ten Hag as Manchester United's new manager. 
 There's discussion on how Ten Hag won favourtism with the United hierarchy, whether The Dutchman can handle the egos at Old Trafford and what we can expect tactically next season.
 Plus, why Ten Hag has to be given time and patience, why the squad still needs a big overhaul and why a change of approach in the transfer market could work well...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep38 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy
