    <item>
      <title>Who Rose From The Dead? | Planet FPL S. 5 Ep. 50 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/who-rose-from-the-dead-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-50-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss the weekend that was in Gameweek 34 and another week where (so far) many double gameweek assets failed to deliver and a lot of the football on show, disappointed...
 Should Tottenham assets be sold? Should Arsenal assets be bought? There's discussion on how those with nothing to play for could impact FPL thinking for the fixtures to go, but double gameweeks will still catch the eye and for James the Wildcard is active, but interest in two particular teams may mean a late change of strategy for the deployment of remaining chips...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast: Vote for your choice of topic before 530pm BST today via the Twitter post below 
