    <item>
      <title>Teething From Your Children | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 49 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/teething-from-your-children-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-49-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj and James review the 6 midweek matches that completed Gameweek 33 including Liverpool's romp against Manchester United that saw Mo Salah haul again. Could United players even be sacrificed despite doubling again 34? While investment for many is focused on getting Chelsea assets ahead of their double, but should there be caution after they were well beaten by Arsenal?
 Plus, Wildcard ideas, paying extra for forwards, going with 1 premium for the remainder of the season, Man City assets, caution for Gameweek 38, rotation concerns, your questions and more covered...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - James presents the Gameweek 34 Deadline Stream Live at 10am BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in April features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's content features a the Differntial Show Gameweek 34 Preview.
