    <item>
      <title>Block Chelsea | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 37 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/block-chelsea-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-37-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss all the latest thinking for Sky Fantasy Football and there is a growing group think to invest in a block Chelsea defence, but is it the right play?
 There's discussion on the prospect of big moves to be made this coming Sunday for both The Blues and Liverpool assets, why tonight's the night if City is your preferred investment route.
 Plus upcoming captaincies discussed including the single gameday Burnley v Southampton and Crystal Palace v Leeds fixtures, if Son should be kept over Kane for those who own both and why even despite last night's embarrassing defeat at Anfield Manchester United assets remain part of the conversation... 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents: Manchester United v Chelsea with @ismyCAPplaying and @RotationFPL
