    <item>
      <title>Wildcard 34, Bench Boost 36, Free Hit 37 | The People's Poll ep. 106 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wildcard-34-bench-boost-36-free-hit-37-the-peoples-poll-ep-106-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Podcast, Suj and James focus on how they would consider seetting up a Wildcard if the plan was to Bench Boost in Gameweek 36 and Free Hitting in Gameweek 37.
 There's discussion on important assets from the likes of Chelsea and Manchester City, the difficulty fitting in premiums if focusing towards a Bench Boost, the nightmare trying to find decent defensive or attacking enablers that will be suitable for the Bench Boost.
 And Suj debates holding his own Wildcard until Gameweek 38... yes you read that right...!
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep37 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy
