      <description>On James' Ask James stream topics covered include Burnley's shock decision to dismiss Sean Dyche, West Ham and Leicester's brilliant European wins and lots of FPL chat ahead of this weekend's doubles which includes why a Crystal Palace win in the FA Cup could alter James' chip strategy in the remaining weeks and tips for this week's Free Hitters.
