    <item>
      <title>We Don't Talk About Bruno | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 47 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/we-dont-talk-about-bruno-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-47-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>An absolutely storming week for Suj with the captaincy on Heung-Min Son and differential Mason Mount coming good. For James, not quite so good a week in FPL (okay a lot worse!) but delight at Tottenham marching on in the race for 4th.
 All the Gameweek 32 games reviewed which included a big win for Everton, Brighton stunning Arsenal at The Emirates and the big title clash that ended with a Desmond at The Etihad and discussion from the games focuses on the impact for FPL with many mangers playing the Free Hit in the forthcoming Gameweek 33 so there is particular focus on those with upcoming doubles.
 There's discussion on the premium midfielders, the viability of captainig a single gameweek player in 33, misfiring forwards and more...
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast: Vote for your choice of topic before 5pm BST today via the Twitter post below  https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1513429922873757702?s=20&amp;t=C3raUklMvGwg3OFjqWO1GA
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in April features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier. Today's Podcast is our regular Monday feature: The Patreon Q&amp;A.
