    <item>
      <title>Chip Talk: When’s Best To Free Hit? | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chip-talk-whens-best-to-free-hit-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss the merits of what they’re thinking of doing with their remaining chips in FPL and the conversation centres on when is best to Free Hit for those who still have a Chip left. But is there a straightforward answer for fantasy managers…?
 There’s also discussion on if a Bench Boost will be prohibitive to a late Wildcard, the danger of boosting in 33, the common FOMO for whenever a Free Hit is deployed and why Aston Villa and Leicester will feature a lot in late season thinking…
 Still to come today, James presents the GW32 Deadline Stream on the Planet FPL YouTube channel at 530pm BST.
 ___________________________________________
