      <title>Double Or Quits | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 46 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/double-or-quits-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-46-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj returns from holiday to rejoin James and review all the Gameweek 31 football and it's relevance for FPL. 
 And we got fixtures! James details the outlook for Gameweeks 36 and 37 and the permutations for Manchester City's potential doubles, what may happen with the Manchester United v Chelsea game and why doubles in Gameweesk 34 and 35 are still possible.
 Plus, James details why he's made an early transfer for the first time in months (and it will make you smile!), plus the case for going through the remainder of the season without the great Mo Salah... 
 Tomorrow on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep35 with all the latest for Sky Fantasy
 ___________________________________________
