    <item>
      <title>Brighton v Norwich | CotC with @FPLSeagull and @fpl_badger | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/brighton-v-norwich-cotc-with-fplseagull-and-fpl_badger-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcast James is joined by Brighton fan Sam Murray and Norwich fan Mark Hammond to discuss all the latest at their clubs ahead of Saturday's Gameweek 31 meeting at The Amex.
 Can Norwich yet produce a miracuolus escape and avoid the drop are they destined to be relegated again?
 And what's happened to Brighton? Six defeats in a row, are they looking over their shoulder now at those below?
 Plus, there's discussion on inconsistent performances and there's a part serious, part comedy conversation on Maupay vs Pukki...
 Follow Sam on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLSeagull
 Follow Mark on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_badger
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - James presents the Ask James stream at 3pm BST on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after conclusion.
 ___________________________________________
