      <title>Planit Right with @PlanItSky | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 34 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/planit-right-with-planitsky-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-34-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Planning mastermind Ian Parrin joins James for the latest Sky Fantasy Football Podcast and James wants to get inside Ian's brain to find out how he can predict TV selections and what games will played on what day with such accuracy.
 There's a look ahead to how the final couple of the weeks of the season may be scheduled including what single gamedays Ian thinks wer may end up with and there could yet be some horrors around the corner.
 Plus the case is made to hop off the big 3's assets and come back to them, captaincy for the weekend ahead, transfer ideas, a predicted Sunday gamble and Twitter questions covered.... 
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Brighton v Norwich with @FPLSeagull and @fpl_badger
