    <item>
      <title>Burnley v Everton | CotC with @TurfyTopper and @spirit_blues | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/burnley-v-everton-cotc-with-turfytopper-and-spirit_blues-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcast James is joined by Burnley fan Jack Toner and Everton fan Sean Norton to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the battle to avoid the drop and the double gameweek for both clubs ahead of next Wednesday's meeting at Turf Moor
 It's only 3 wins for Burnley all season and Everton's woes, particularly on the road continue. Do the correspondents believe their clubs will escape the drop?
 Plus can either club's assets be trusted ahead of the forthcoming double gameweek for both clubs or should they be completely overlooked?
 Follow Jack on Twitter: https://twitter.com/TurfyTopper
 Follow Sean on Twitter: https://twitter.com/spirit_blues
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - James is joined by planning expert @PlanItSky for the Sky Fantasy Football Podcast
 ___________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Support our content on Patreon. March will feature over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier and this week features 10 Audiobook episodes, Goodbye To The Lane, James's story of the 2016-17 season, Tottenham's last at the Old White Hart Lane
