    <item>
      <title>Ask James Live Stream Audio | Friday March 25th 2022 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-live-stream-audio-friday-march-25th-2022-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On James's Live Stream this afternoon discussion includes... 
 Lots on potential chip usage chat with James himself beginning to go cold on the idea of Free Hitting in GW33, so if not then when? There's discussion on alternatives for Free Hit usage, Bench Boost 33 versus 36, the Burnley v Everton double.
 Plus, Gareth Bale, Declan Rice, Gareth Southgate's future, Leeds after Bielsa, the top 4 race, teams likley to rotate in the run-in and plenty more...
 Coming Up on Monday on Planet FPL s5 ep45 with special guest @UtterlyTC
