      <title>More Brains Less Hair | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 33 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/more-brains-less-hair-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-33-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On today's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss upcoming fixture amendments and why gains can be made immediately following the International break with exit points highlighted for the Big 3 and those without a weekend fixture in Matchday 33.
 Plus, additional interest can be had in find differentials from those playing on Sunday 3rd and Monday 4th, why it's all back to Nick Pope on Wednesday 6th, the single gameday that could drop in between matchdays 34 and 35 and Suj plots trying to win manager of the month...
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Tottenham v Newcastle with @Rickysaunders77 and @fpl_fitballer
