Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Over the last week there have been several attempts to interrupt Premier League games with members of the group Just Stop Oil trying to tie themselves to the goalposts. At Goodison Park last Thursday one member of the group was successful in tying himself to a post.</p> <p>Why are these protests happening?</p> <p>Why is football be targeted and are games likely to be subject to further protests?</p> <p>Should we have sympathy with the protesters and how has football reacted to the disruption?</p> <p>Can fans make an impact for change?</p> <p>Planet FPL talks climate change... this one's a little different.... </p> <p>Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep33, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football... </p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in March features 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier.</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a> </p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15K</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
