    <item>
      <title>The Most Massivist | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 43 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-most-massivist-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-43-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Ahead of tonight's Gameweek 30 deadline Suj &amp; James review the 4  Premier League games played since Monday's Podcast which included more returns for Kane and Kulusevski at Brighton and a crucial win for Liverpool at The Emirates.
 Plus there's discussion on what Gameweek 37 may look like and if those debating whether to use the Free Hit this week should proceed or hold off, James reveals his intended Free Hit team for this week which includes an overview of the 8 teams playing this week and Suj rejoices in West Ham's outstanding win last night in the Europa League...
 Still to come today on the Planet FPL network... The Gw30 Differential Show Preview and The GW30 Team News Stream Live at 430pm GMT. And on the Planet FPL YouTube channel James presents The GW30 Deadline Stream Live at 530pm BST
 ____________________________________________
