    <item>
      <title>Arsenal v Leicester| CotC with @ThreeFiveWho &amp; @AaronLagor | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/arsenal-v-leicester-cotc-with-threefivewho-aaronlagor-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcasts ahead of James is joined by Arsenal fan Adam Pritchard and Leicester fan Aaron Lagor to discuss all the latest at their clubs, and the all important FPL assets within them ahead of a Double Gameweek for The Gunners this week and an attractive fixture for the Foxes in Gameweek 30.
 There's discussion on what remains for both clubs, will Arsenal go on to claim 4th place? Will Leicester prioritise the Europa Conference League?
 And there's discussion on the FPL assets of interest from both clubs including Tierney, Martinelli, Saka and all the Leicester assets that could appeal in Gameweek 30...
 *Please note the Podcast was recorded prior to confirmation of a new injury for Jamie Vardy
 Follow Adam on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho
 Follow Aaron on Twitter: https://twitter.com/AaronLagor
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL s5 ep41, Suj and James will discuss the 4 games played on Thursday night in the Premier League, a review of Tottenham's win over at Everton, thoughts ahead of GW29 and we'll discuss the sanctioning of Roman Abramovich...
 ___________________________________________
