    <item>
      <title>Abramovich's Sale Of Chelsea | The People's Poll ep. 102 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/abramovichs-sale-of-chelsea-the-peoples-poll-ep-102-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Roman Abramovich is selling Chelsea. Or is he? On this Podcast Suj &amp; James debate the protracted sale of Chelsea football club and begin by asking if the club is really for sale?
 Is Abramovich being forced to sell and if so is that correct? And what happens if he doesn't? Could Abramovich's assets be frozen and therefore effectively make Chelsea's assets frozen?
 And what does the future hold for Chelsea if a sale goes through?
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep31, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football... 
