    <item>
      <title>Chip Talk: Strategy And Future DGWs | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chip-talk-strategy-and-future-dgws-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>"Would you like me to tell you a story Suj?" ...With the FA Cup results and quarter final draw now known James maps out what the future Gameweeks beyond the GW30 Blank may look like. How many teams will blank and double in 33? How many teams will double in 36? What could 37 look like? And will there be doubles is the remaining weeks?
 It's all covered by a story of probability by mapping out what may happen for each team. From there strategy is discussed for those with and without chips as the possibility of Free Hitting in 30, 33 or 37 are discussed and if GW36 still looks the optimal time to Bench Boost.
 Plus, which fixture is likely to be announced next for a double gameweek? The team that could land with a treble double, why there could be double double's at the end of the season for more than one team and lots more including what current wildcarders might be planning...
 This is a chip strategy special...
 Still to come on Planet FPL today... on Patreon The Differential Show GW28 Preview, and for Advanced Tier Patrons the GW28 Team News Stream. James presents the GW28 Deadline stream tomorrow at 10am BST on the Planet FPL YouTube channel and on Monday s5 ep40 revieweing all the GW28 weekend games....
