      <itunes:summary>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcasts ahead of James is joined by Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson and Southampton fan Matt Samuel to discuss all the latest at their clubs, and the all important FPL assets within them ahead of a Double Gameweek fot both in Gameweek 28.
 There's discussion on Steven Gerrard's tactical tweak in the win at Brighton and their concerning form prior to that victory at The Amex, and there's an apology to Ralph Hassenhuttl and praise for Southampton's form after progress to the FA Cup Quarter finals and only 1 defeat in 10 in the league.
 Plus all the key FPL assets discussed including Cash, Digne, Coutinho, Ramsey, Watkins, Livramento, Ward-Prowse, Adams and Broja...
 Follow Lee on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Lee_Jackson_92
 Follow Matt on Twitter: https://twitter.com/CS_Wipeout
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - Chip Talk: Suj &amp; James assess strategy ideas following confirmation of the FA Cup results and draw and take a look ahead to how the Double Gameweeks may land beyond Gameweek 30
 ___________________________________________
