    <item>
      <title>With My Eyes Open | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 30 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/with-my-eyes-open-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-30-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Suj &amp; James discuss why tonight's FA Cup results can have a major impact on strategy and transfers through to mid April.
 There's discussion on the known April TV selections, what could change from them but why fantasy managers shouldn't be too alarmed about the selections.
 Plus weekend captaincy picks discussed including Monday's single gameday between Tottenham and Everton and a look ahead to a pivotal day next Thursday when it could be about steaming into Chelsea, but rather than going all-in is there a case to completely ignore The Blues? And why many Sky managers may not go as heavy on The Blues as they may want to... 
   Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Aston Villa v Southampton with @Lee_Jackson_92 &amp; @CS_Wipeout
 ____________________________________________
