    <item>
      <title>Bielsa's Sacking at Leeds United | The People's Poll ep. 101 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/bielsas-sacking-at-leeds-united-the-peoples-poll-ep-101-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On Sunday after much speculation in the aftermath of Leeds' heavy defeats to Liverpool and Tottenham, Marcelo Bielsa was relieved of his duties as Leeds United manager and replaced by American Jesse Marsch.
 On this Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss what Bielsa meant to Leeds fan and why they're so upset by the Argentine's departure, why the majority of neutrals in the Premier League will miss him and why ultimately he was sacked.
 Plus, what we can expect to see change from Marsch's Leeds and why the ownership situation at the Elland Road club has links to the San Francisco 49ers....
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep30, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football... 
 ____________________________________________
