    <item>
      <title>Prepare To Get Yourself Blocked | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 39 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/prepare-to-get-yourself-blocked-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-39-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the Gameweek 27 weekend with a heavy focus on the clubs who have a double gameweek in 28 and importantly we now know Chelsea will face a double of Burnley &amp; Norwich away if they beat Luton in the FA Cup or if Norwich shock Liverpool.
 All the games discussed as Southampton and Newcastle continued their impressive runs and Tottenham assets rewarded owners with an impressive win at Leeds that led to the end of Marcelo Bielsa's reign.
 Plus, why popular assets like David de Gea, Joao Cancelo and Jarrod Bowen could be on the chopping block and the importance of waiting for the FA Cup results and draw for the quarter finals and how it could yet alter the strategy for many FPL managers in the coming gameweeks... 
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast, vote for your favourite via the tweet below before 5pm BST  https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1498221612948246529?s=20&amp;t=z0Z2MWWQuMz8oVXxC6dARw
 ____________________________________________
