    <item>
      <title>Brentford v Newcastle | CotC with @FPLDummyTom &amp; @fpl_fitballer | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/brentford-v-newcastle-cotc-with-fpldummytom-fpl_fitballer-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcasts ahead of James is joined by Brentford fan Tom Medd and Newcastle fan Simon Bibby to discuss all the latest at their clubs, and the all importnat FPL assets within them ahead of Gameweek 27 There's discussion on the battle to beat the drop. Should Brentford be looking nervously over their shoulders as those below them begin to discover form? And with 10 points from the last 12 available are Newcastle now the form horse and expected to beat the drop.
 Plus, are both clubs being overlooked by managers utilising the Free Hit Chip in Gameweek 27?
 And for those making transfers, Brentford have a good run including an all important Gameweek 30 fixture, while Newcastle have back to back double gameweeks in 28 and 29. We find out which assets should be under consideration in the coming weeks from both clubs....
 Follow Tom on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLDummyTom
 Follow Si on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fpl_fitballer
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - Suj and James complete their review of Gameweek 26 by discussing the 4 midweek fixtures and plans for the weekend on Planet FPL s5 ep38
