      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Podcast Suj &amp; James look ahead to the upcoming gamedays which includes 4 single gameday fixtures.
 Options for Arsenal v Wolves, Southampton v Norwich, West Ham v Wolves and Burnley v Leicester all discussed, the popular template move that many Sky Fantasy managers will make tonight.
 Plus, impact of the 6 additional fixtures announced between matchweeks 28 &amp; 30 including why Newcastle just became interesting and Suj lives up to his promise of announcing some planned rogue transfers....
   Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Brentford v Newcastle with @FPLDummyTom &amp; @fpl_fitballer
