    <item>
      <title>Free Hitting in GW27 | The People's Poll ep. 100 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/free-hitting-in-gw27-the-peoples-poll-ep-100-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>It feels like everyone in the FPL Twitter Community is Free Hitting in Gameweek 27, but is that really the case? On this Podcast Suj &amp; James assess the definite pros of a Gameweek 27 Free Hit but why it won't be for everyone, citing Gameweek 33 as a possible alternative.
 Plus, why the Twitter template shouldn't be overlooked for those activating the chip with Burnley, the Manchester clubs, Southampton and Tottenham assets likely to make up the majority of Free Hit teams, but there is room for a differential or two in the drafts discussed
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep29, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football... 
