    <item>
      <title>Gives Me The Shivers | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 37 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/gives-me-the-shivers-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-37-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>On their review of the Gameweek 26 Suj &amp; James review an FPL weekend that saw Mo Salah deliver for Triple Captiners, crucial wins for Burnley and Watford in the battle against the drop and Tottenham stunned Man City at The Etihad. There's discussion on the announcement of additional fixtures in Gameweeks 28 and 29 which pushed many into a pre GW26 Wildcard and means many others are considering using it in 28 as strategy ideas begins to diversify.
 Plus, why consciousness around Chelsea fixtures need to be maintained and the players most under consideration for FPL managers this week, including the legion of Free Hitters...
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - the 100th People's Poll Podcast. Vote for your topics of choice before 5pm BST today via this tweet
