      <title>Arsenal v Wolves | CotC with @ThreeFiveWho &amp; @parker_bradley | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/arsenal-v-wolves-cotc-with-threefivewho-parker_bradley-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the second Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcasts ahead of Double Gameweek 26 James is joined by Arsenal fan Adam Pritchard and Wolves fan Bradley Parker to discuss all the latest at their clubs, and the all importnat FPL assets within them ahead Gameweek 26 for both clubs.
 Sa vs Ramsdale, Jimenez vs Lacazette... there's discussion on several possibilities from both clubs ahead of their Double Gameweek, with squad depth and likley starting eleven's.
 Plus both teams outstanding defensive records are covered and there's openess about both sides chances of finishing 4th...
 Follow Adam on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho
 Follow Bradley on Twitter: https://twitter.com/parker_bradley
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - James presents his Ask James stream at 3pm BST on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after...
