    <item>
      <title>Liverpool v Leeds | CotC with @FPL_LocoLord &amp; @fpl_tactician | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/liverpool-v-leeds-cotc-with-fpl_locolord-fpl_tactician-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the first of two Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents Podcasts ahead of Double Gameweek 26 James is joined by Liverpool fan Dan Lord and Leeds fan Andy Martin to discuss all the latest at their clubs, and the all importnat FPL assets within them ahead Gameweek 26 for both clubs.
 There's further discussion on Bench Boost vs Triple Captain and if Trent Alexander-Arnold can offer legitimate Triple Captaincy competition for Mo Salah.
 And who is the third best Liverpool asset, is is still Diogo Jota? Or is it Andy Robertson or someone else?
 Are there concerns about Raphinha following his early substitution at Everton on Saturday? Can any of Leeds differentials offer value for the double and beyond?
 Plus can The Reds chase Man City down in the race for the title? And should Leeds be looking worryingly over their shoulder?
 Follow Dan on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPL_LocoLord
 Follow Andy on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fpl_tactician
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep28
 ____________________________________________
