    <item>
      <title>Bench Boost Vs Triple Captain | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 36 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/bench-boost-vs-triple-captain-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-36-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the weekend football from Gameweek 25 as Manchester United FPL assets flopped again but it was good news for those on Brighton defensive assets as returns for popular players were again hard to find. There's also further discussion about fixtures that could be added to Gameweeks 28 &amp; 29, the doublers who will interest FPL managers ahead of deadline, plus the big debate ahead of Double Gameweek 26 with the case for and against using the Triple Captain chip on Mo Salah... 
 And it's Valentine's Day!
 Coming up tomorrow on Planet FPL - Clash of the Correspondents, Liverpool v Leeds with @FPL_LocoLord &amp; @fpl_tactician
 ____________________________________________
