      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/look-man-look-lively-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-35-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Finally some actual Premier League football for Suj &amp; James to discuss on the Podcast in this review of all the Gameweek 24 football.
 On the show, deeper discussion of Southampton's brilliant win at Tottenham, Mo Salah's return, Everton's woes continued, Suj missed the deadline and James' transfer cost him 21 points, but it is without regret.
 Plus, misfiring forwards, the psychology around selecting (or not) Jacob Ramsey and Manchester United's and Brighton's Gameweek 25 Double previewed. 
