      <itunes:subtitle>GW23 is finally over two weeks after it began with Watford frustrating again, but the focus of the Podcast is what will happen next. With the FA Cup 4th round now complete and the 5th round draw known Suj &amp; James discuss various ways to deploy chip...</itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>GW23 is finally over two weeks after it began with Watford frustrating again, but the focus of the Podcast is what will happen next. With the FA Cup 4th round now complete and the 5th round draw known Suj &amp; James discuss various ways to deploy chip strategy, even for those short of options including how to navigate the blanks of Gameweeks 27 &amp; 30.
 Plus James details what he believes is likely to happen in the immedaite with potential rearranged fixtures creating more Double Gameweeks and why Gameweek 33 should not be discounted from strategy planning...
 Still to come to today on Planet FPL - our regular Monday Q&amp;A on Patreon. For our full content schedule this week view this post below
 https://www.patreon.com/posts/62230090
