    <item>
      <title>Man City v Brentford | CotC with @FPLPringle &amp; @FPLDummyTom | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/man-city-v-brentford-cotc-with-fplpringle-fpldummytom-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Manchester City fan Jonny Pringle and Brentford fan Jonny Pringle to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview the Gameweek 24 meeting at The Etihad Stadium.
 Have City got the title wrapped up or can they still be caught?
 Are Brentford nervously looking over their shoulder at the relegation scrap?
 Plus, we discuss the FPL assets of interest at both clubs with attractive fixtures ahead. Thoughts on Cancelo, Laporte, De Bruyne, Foden and rotation. If Mbuemo or Toney are still worth considering and the signing of Christian Eriksen.
 Follow Jonny on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLPringle
 Follow Tom on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLDummyTom
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - James presents his Ask James Live Stream at 5pm (BST) on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after.
 ____________________________________________
