    <item>
      <title>Overhaul: It's Up For Debate | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 26 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/overhaul-its-up-for-debate-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-26-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Only 3 days remain before the Overhaul closes and some of the biggest Sky Fantasy Football decisions of the season need to be made now.
 On this Podcast Suj &amp; James take us on a journey across the weeks and gamedays ahead and discuss critical coverage of four important teams that will cover much of February and March's captaincy days.
 Plus, the big Burnley v Watford opener and whether coverage can be skipped, why Southampton can't be overlooked, what means that many questions end with the answer of Aston Villa, potential fixtures that can get added, crucial entry points for the likes of Arsenal, Chelsea, Tottenham and Wolves, Ronaldo versus Kane and lots more... 
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Manchester City v Brentford with @FPLPringle &amp; @FPLDummyTom
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in January features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier.
