      <link>https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/fantasyfootballshow/PP010222.mp3</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss their current chip strategy on this People's Podcast.
 Is Double Gameweek 36 still likely to be the biggest Double Gameweek and best for Bench Boost?
 Will there be better Triple Capatincy options to a potential Mo Salah GW26 or GW29 double?
 Is it better to defend with the Free Hit in GW27 or attack in GW33? Will everyone use a Free Hiot in GW30?
 And when's best to Wildcard?
 All this covered and which teams are the most likely to have doubles in upcoming Gameweeks...
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep25, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football... and on Patreon our Tot&amp;Ham Podcast 
