        <![CDATA[<p>Suj &amp; James discuss their current chip strategy on this People's Podcast.</p> <p>Is Double Gameweek 36 still likely to be the biggest Double Gameweek and best for Bench Boost?</p> <p>Will there be better Triple Capatincy options to a potential Mo Salah GW26 or GW29 double?</p> <p>Is it better to defend with the Free Hit in GW27 or attack in GW33? Will everyone use a Free Hiot in GW30?</p> <p>And when's best to Wildcard?</p> <p>All this covered and which teams are the most likely to have doubles in upcoming Gameweeks...</p> <p>Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep25, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football... and on Patreon our Tot&amp;Ham Podcast </p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in January features 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier.</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a> </p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
