    <item>
      <title>Norwich v Crystal Palace | CotC with @fpl_badger &amp; @Migtavius | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://traffic.libsyn.com/fantasyfootballshow/norvcry-250122.mp3</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Norwich fan Mark Hammond and Crystal Palace fan Migtavius to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview the Gameweek 24 meeting at Carrow Road. Back to back wins for Norwich have propelled them out of the relegation zone; were we all too quick to write them off as relegation certainties? There's discussion on what's now working for Dean Smith and why there are some FPL enablers from The Canaries who should be considered.
 Palace sit 13th, which feels disappointing considering the quality within the squad but progress is clear to see and there are some very interesting offensive Palace assets to consider in FPL including Michael Olise and Odsonne Edouard...
 Follow Mark on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_badger
 Follow Mig on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Migtavius
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - James presents his Ask James Live Stream at 12pm (BST) on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after.
 ____________________________________________
