      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/reverse-engineering-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-25-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>With the Overhaul period now open and with 10 days remaining until final Sky Fantasy Football decisions must be made Suj &amp; James decide to assess the players of interest from all 20 clubs while we still wait for confirmation on fixtures for March and rearranged fixtures.
 Discussion includes the idea of working backwards from an ideal team, budget forwards and who's likely to form part of a post Overhaul template.
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Norwich v Crystal Palace with @fpl_badger &amp; @Migtavius
