    <item>
      <title>Why Oh Why? | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 32 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/fantasyfootballshow/s5ep32vid.mp3</link>
      <description>Suj and James review a Gameweek 23 that finally saw all Premier League games go ahead but also proved to be a dsiaster for many FPL managers.
 Why oh why did we invest in Watford players? That's the question many will be asking themselves after their hammering at the hands of relegation rivals Norwich. Should the likes of red carded Emmanuel Dennis be canonballed out of FPL managers teams? It might not be quite so straightforward as discussion on potential upcoming Double Gameweeks reveals.
 Plus, as usual all the games reviewed and there's discussion on Mo Salah's likely Gameweek 24 return, differentials gaining attention and caution is offered on selling many of the weekend's underperforming stars...
 Still to come to today on Planet FPL - our regular Monday Q&amp;A on Patreon and tomorrow the People's Poll returns for everyone, vote for your topic of choice via this tweet before 6pm BST https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1485584687246585870?s=20
