      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Suj &amp; James discuss the final
 Gamedays before the Overhaul period begins.
 Is any player worth a transfer, James makes the case where there is one scenario where the trigger should still be pulled. Gameday captaincy is discussed with Suj committing to trusting James' opinion on Saturday... ot oh!
 Post Overhaul thoughts also covered and why despite a competitive fixture schedule many Sky Fantasy managers are still likely to land within a similar template...
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Chelsea v Tottenham with @RotationFPL and @Rickysaunders77
