      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Suj &amp; James discuss the final</p> <p>Gamedays before the Overhaul period begins.</p> <p>Is any player worth a transfer, James makes the case where there is one scenario where the trigger should still be pulled. Gameday captaincy is discussed with Suj committing to trusting James' opinion on Saturday... ot oh!</p> <p>Post Overhaul thoughts also covered and why despite a competitive fixture schedule many Sky Fantasy managers are still likely to land within a similar template...</p> <p>Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Chelsea v Tottenham with @RotationFPL and @Rickysaunders77</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in January features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier.</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a> </p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
