    <item>
      <title>Aston Villa v Man Utd | CotC with @Lee_Jackson_92 &amp; @ismyCAPplaying | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/aston-villa-v-man-utd-cotc-with-lee_jackson_92-ismycapplaying-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Aston Villa fan Lee Jackson and Manchester United fan Gary Robinson to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview the Gameweek 22 Double and the Saturday evening meeting at Villa Park
 The Podcast includes discussion on Villa's new additions Lucas Digne and Philippe Coutinho and who the best Villa assets to consider are with a Double Gameweek on the horizon and a brilliant run of fixtures.
 There's also discussion on United's Ralf Rangnick, why The Red Devils continue to underwhelm and if any United assets beyond David De Gea and Cristiano Ronaldo should be considered for this week's double of Villa and Brentford away.
 Plus, transfer scenarios for FPL managers debated included if Ollie Watkins should be sold to enable captaining Ronaldo this week?
 Follow Lee on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Lee_Jackson_92
 Follow Gary on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ismyCAPplaying
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - Free Hit Drafts for GW22, but will Suj and James be active with the Chip
 ____________________________________________
