      <description>Suj &amp; James have an open conversation about all 20 Premier League clubs and what the may be trying to do during the January Transfer Window and it begins with a deeper look at the business Tottenham and West Ham will do.
 Will the Big 6 be spending this month?
 Could Aston Villa continue to invest?
 Why are Newcastle being linked with so many players?
 Do Everton need to sell?
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep23, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football.
