    <item>
      <title>Ask James Live Stream Audio | Friday January 7th 2022 | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-live-stream-audio-friday-january-7th-2022-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On James's Live Stream this afternoon discussion includes... Heung-Min Son's injury, what Tottenham may do without him, the lack of attractive options in the Gameweek 22 double, what it means to those intending to use the Free Hit chip, why single gameweek players shouldn't be overlooked, the arrivals of Coutinho and Trippier to the League and why the propspect of a Double Gameweek 23 shouldn't be overlooked.
 Coming Up on Monday on Planet FPL - s5 ep29, where we'll be looking at the teams who Double in Gameweek 22 and strategy ideas.
