    <item>
      <title>Burnley v Leicester | CotC with @TurfyTopper &amp; @AaronLagor | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/burnley-v-leicester-cotc-with-turfytopper-aaronlagor-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Burnley fan Jack Toner and Leicester fan Aaron Lagor to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview the Gameweek 22 fixture at Turf Moor.
 The meeting is likely to be the first part of a double gameweek for both clubs so FPL managers looking to Free Hit and invest in fresh blood in their squads are likely to be looking at both clubs.
 There's discussion on the best defensive Burnley assets to consider and fears that this may be the year where they suffer relegation while for Leicester there's a mounting injury list to contend with which leaves eyes on midfield options for FPL managers....
 Follow Jack on Twitter: https://twitter.com/TurfyTopper
 Follow Aaron on Twitter: https://twitter.com/AaronLagor
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - The Ask James Live stream returns at 3pm (UK) with an audio version to follow shortly after conclusion
 ____________________________________________
