      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Burnley fan Jack Toner and Leicester fan Aaron Lagor to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview the Gameweek 22 fixture at Turf Moor.</p> <p>The meeting is likely to be the first part of a double gameweek for both clubs so FPL managers looking to Free Hit and invest in fresh blood in their squads are likely to be looking at both clubs.</p> <p>There's discussion on the best defensive Burnley assets to consider and fears that this may be the year where they suffer relegation while for Leicester there's a mounting injury list to contend with which leaves eyes on midfield options for FPL managers....</p> <p>Follow Jack on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/TurfyTopper">https://twitter.com/TurfyTopper</a></p> <p>Follow Aaron on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/AaronLagor">https://twitter.com/AaronLagor</a></p> <p>Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - The Ask James Live stream returns at 3pm (UK) with an audio version to follow shortly after conclusion</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL and SkyFF community and support the Podcast? Our Patreon content in January features over 20 additional Podcasts from Intermediate Tier.</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a> </p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
