      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fart-in-a-jar-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-22-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest strategy ideas, likely fixture drops and why there is every reason for transfers to be made between now and Overhaul with plenty of fixtures gains still to be found.
 There's discussion on investing in Everton or Leicester assets next Tuesday, debate between Antonio and Bowen for the armband next Wednesday and being conscious to look ahead at potential fixtures when deciding who to sell. 
 Plus, why Watford may still be on the agenda, Mo Salah replacements and plenty more... 
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow...  Clash of the Correspondents: Burnley v Leicester with @TurfyTopper and @AaronLagor
