    <item>
      <title>ChampManFPL Season 3 Preview with @FplKaptain | The People's Poll ep. 94 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/champmanfpl-season-3-preview-with-fplkaptain-the-peoples-poll-ep-94-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Chris Fowler aka @FplKaptain on to the Podcast to discuss Thursday's launch of season 3 of ChampManFPL. A Fantasy Football game based on the classic Championship Manager 01/02 game.
 Chris talks us through how the game came to be and introduces how the game works for new players and how the live experience will be for players watching live every Thursday night.
 And there's a look at some of the popular picks in the ChampManFPL community ahead of Gameweek 1, tips for some of the early thinking for chip strategy and why fixtures are so important to consider.
 You can join in with Season 3 of ChampManFPL via this link https://www.gaffr.io
 And you can follow the game on the Fantasy Champ Man official Twitter account: https://twitter.com/FantasyChampMan
 And you can follow Chris on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FplKaptain
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep22, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football.
 ____________________________________________
