    <item>
      <title>I Must Spend This Money | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 28 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/i-must-spend-this-money-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-28-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James react to and review the seven games played over the weekend of Gameweek 21 and the late announcement on Friday of a Double Gameweek that saw many FPL managers steam into assets from doublers Brentford, Everton and West Ham.
 James also details what may happen with the fixtures for Gameweek 22 and why games previously selected for television broadcast are likely to get preferential treatment. 
 There's also discussion about why many may choose not to use the Free Hit Chip and keep non double Gameweek players in 22, the impact of those leaving for the African Nations, best Mo Salah replacements, tactical notes of interest on Arsenal, Brighton and Watford and lots more...
 Coming Up on Tuesday on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast will be a ChampManFPL season 3 preview as James welcomes @FplKaptain
 ____________________________________________
