    <item>
      <title>Rock The Kasper | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 27 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/rock-the-kasper-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-27-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss the 7 fixtures that took place in a chaotic Gameweek 20 that saw Capatin fantastic Mo Salah return a zero pointer after he saw his penalty saved by Kasper Schmeichel and Liverpool lost at Leicester.
 But there were some star performers in the likes of Jarrod Bowen and Phil Foden that still helped many to a good gameweek and Cristiano Ronaldo delivered for those who backed him with the armband.
 Plus there's more detailed discussion on the potential for fixture arrangements over the forthcoming gameweeks including whether the Gameweek 22 deadline could be brought forward and which players are in our thoughts to buy which includes ideas for Reece James replacements and why Emmanuel Dennis might be back on the buy or keep list...
 Coming Up on Monday on Planet FPL - Planet FPL S5 ep28 reviewing the fallout from the Gameweek 21 weekend and before that James will present the GW21 Deadline Stream Live! at 10am (UK) on Saturday
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Throughout December all Patrons will be boosted up to the next Tier level, meaning over 20 Patreon Podcats will be available for just £3 a month!
