    <item>
      <title>The FPL Gods Won't Let You | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 26 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-fpl-gods-wont-let-you-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-26-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss the fallout from yesterday's Gameweek 19 games and a chaotic period leading up to deadline that saw the FPL servers crash and meant many managers were unable to make transfers.
 As usual the games played yesterday are reviewed and discussion focuses on what to do ahead of tomorrow's Gameweek 20 deadline with Arsenal v Wolves and Leeds v Aston Villa and James details what could happen with fixtures which could lead to Double Gameweeks in 21 and 22. 
 Coming Up on Tuesday on Planet FPL - James presents The GW20 deadline stream at 1230pm (UK) on the Planet FPL YouTube channel
 ____________________________________________
