        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James discuss the fallout from yesterday's Gameweek 19 games and a chaotic period leading up to deadline that saw the FPL servers crash and meant many managers were unable to make transfers.</p> <p>As usual the games played yesterday are reviewed and discussion focuses on what to do ahead of tomorrow's Gameweek 20 deadline with Arsenal v Wolves and Leeds v Aston Villa and James details what could happen with fixtures which could lead to Double Gameweeks in 21 and 22. </p> <p>Coming Up on Tuesday on Planet FPL - James presents The GW20 deadline stream at 1230pm (UK) on the Planet FPL YouTube channel</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Throughout December all Patrons will be boosted up to the next Tier level, meaning over 20 Patreon Podcats will be available for just £3 a month!</p> <p>Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a> </p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
