    <item>
      <title>Ask James Live Stream Audio | Friday December 24th | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-live-stream-audio-friday-december-24th-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On James's Live Stream this afternoon discussion includes... chip strategy ideas, what should and shouldn't tip FPL managers over the edge for a Gameweek 19 Free Hit and the danger in setting up for a Gameweek 22 Bench Boost. Plus, Ronaldo and Son are on everyone's mind and why for many selling Mo Salah will be the right answer.
 Coming Up on Monday on Planet FPL - s5 ep26, reviewing whatever football we get in Gameweek 19 and latest thoughts ahead of Tuesday's Gameweek 20 deadline... and before that the Deadline Stream will take place on YouTube, currently at 1230pm (UK) on Sunday.
