    <item>
      <title>West Ham v Southampton | CotC with @Fpl_SkyAddict &amp; @CS_Wipeout | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/west-ham-v-southampton-cotc-with-fpl_skyaddict-cs_wipeout-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by West Ham fan Chris Stone and Southampton fan Matt Samuel to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview Sunday's Gameweek 19 meeting at The London Stadium.
 On the Pod, there's discussion on Michail Antonio's availability, Jarrod Bowen's increased importance to The Hammers, defensive issues at both clubs, Tino Livramento and Armando Broja FPL potential, squad depth, upcoming fixtures and there's discussion on the addition of a second Free Hit chip for FPL managers, which if deployed in a likely Double Gameweek 22 could see assets from both The Hammers and The Saints become very desirable.
 Follow Chris on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Fpl_SkyAddict
 Follow Matt on Twitter: https://twitter.com/CS_Wipeout
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - The Ask James Live stream returns at 3pm (UK) with an audio version to follow shortly after conclusion
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Throughout December all Patrons will be boosted up to the next Tier level, meaning over 20 Patreon Podcats will be available for just £3 a month!
 Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl 
