      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James attempt to make sense of the postponements and potential for fixture rearrangements in January.
 Plus, alternative Manchester United assets to consider other than Crsiriano Ronaldo, why Everton's Dominic Calvert-Lewin could quickly appeal, advice on keeping clubs like Tottenham with games in hand on side and thoughts on doing nothing if in doubt...
