    <item>
      <title>Make Mine A Quadruple | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 25 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/make-mine-a-quadruple-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-25-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss the fallout of Gameweek 18 and a weekend that saw only four of the 10 fixtures go ahead. There's extended detail on those fixtures as Arsenal and Man City romped to victory away from home, Wolves and Chelsea ended in stalemate and there's a very detailed analysis of the thrilling 2-2 between Tottenham and Liverpool with tactical insight and coverage of the controversial refereeing decisions.
 Plus, Gameweek 20 could be postponed with belief growing that Premier League clubs would like to delay the Gameweek until the New Year. What is the impact to FPL if this is the case? It could lead to FPL's biggest ever Gameweek and it may arrive sooner than we think...!
 Coming Up on Tuesday on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast, pick from these topics on Twitter up until around 6pm (UK) time via this tweet https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1472903783390879745?s=20
 ____________________________________________
