    <item>
      <title>Keep Calm And Carry On | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 24 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/keep-calm-and-carry-on-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-24-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj and James discuss the fallout from Gameweek 17 that saw only 7 games take place with a detailed review of all those games.
 But first conversation begins with tips for the upcoming weekend with only 5 games scheduled for Gameweek 18 as things stand. There's conversation on whether the Free Hit would be worthwhile, the lack of quality striker options available this weekend and remembering to think ahead and not price yourself out of players you want want in forthcoming gameweeks
 Coming Up on Monday on Planet FPL - s5 ep25, reviewing whatever football we get in Gameweek 18 and latest thoughts ahead of the Boxing Day fixtures... and before that the Deadline Stream will take place on YouTube, currently at 1230pm (UK) on Saturday but it will take place one hour before the Deadline takes place if further games are postponed 
