    <item>
      <title>St David &amp; Bernard | Planet SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 19 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/st-david-bernard-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-19-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest for Sky Fantasy Football in their regular Wednesday Podcast and for James it at one stage saw him first for the gameweek but ended with him lamenting two captains fail and regretting a transfer.
 Upcoming captaincy discussed for tonight, tomorrow and the weekend, why Watford and West Ham are worth a second look tonight, concerns around potential postponements, when games off could be rearranged, if Ronaldo should be sold if United and Brighton is off on Saturday and there's a brief look at the TV announcements for the first two matchweeks in February.
 *Please note this Podcast was recorded prior to strong rumours circulating this morning that the African Cup of Nations may be cancelled
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Wolves v Chelsea with @parker_bradley &amp; @RotationFPL
