    <item>
      <title>The Premier League's New Covid Crisis | The People's Poll ep. 92 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-premier-leagues-new-covid-crisis-the-peoples-poll-ep-92-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>With confirmation of the postponement of tonight's Brentford v Manchester United fixture following on from Sunday's cancellation of the Brighton and Tottenham fixture Suj and James discuss the current status of Premier League football with the new Covid variant Omicron spreading around the country.
 There's discussion on if the Premier League could be about to enter a circuit break period, what will change for players and fans at upcoming games and the potential repercussions for Fantasy Premier League managers including when postponed games could be played and tips for how to deal with the carnage this week.
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet SkyFF s3 ep19, discussing all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football.
 ____________________________________________
