    <item>
      <title>It Begins With P? | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 23 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/it-begins-with-p-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-23-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>It's James's Birthday today and in their review of Gameweek 16 there is more for Suj &amp; James to celebrate following successful Wildcards and foe Suj it was a particularly high scoring Gameweek.
 On the show, Wildcard choices reviwed penalties everywhere, covid postponement concerns, Dennis v King takes a twist, why De Bruyne may no longer be first choice for City, concerns continue over a Chelsea weakness, why Newcastle have got to change to avoid an Anfield massacre, fortuitous United, Antonio's concerning form and there could be more to come from Conor Gallagher...
 Coming Up on Tuesday on Planet FPL - The People's Poll Podcast and you can decide the topic of conversation in our poll on Twitter up until 6pm (UK) today. Link below... https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1470341556615983112?s=20
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Throughout December all Patrons will be boosted up to the next Tier level, meaning over 20 Patreon Podcats will be available for just £3 a month!
