    <item>
      <title>Wildcard(s) Revealed | A Planet #FPL Wildcard Special | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wildcards-revealed-a-planet-fpl-wildcard-special-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Both James and Suj are now on Wildcard ahead of today's Gameweek 16 deadline and on this Podcast reveal what is likely to be - subject to this afternoon's team news - their final Wildcard selections.
 For James he's been active on Wildcard since Saturday evening and bar one or two spots has a clear idea of what he wants to do with only a couple of spots open for a debate and he explains his plan moving forward in forthcoming weeks.
 While for Suj, the Brighton-Tottenham postponement and other injury issues has forced a Wildcard activation, but there aren't that many changes from his original squad...
 Still to come today on the Planet #FPL YouTube channel, James presents The GW16 Deadline Stream Live at 530pm (UK)
 ____________________________________________
