    <item>
      <title>Crystal Palace v Everton | CotC with @Migtavius &amp; @spirit_blues | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/crystal-palace-v-everton-cotc-with-migtavius-spirit_blues-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Crystal Palace fan Migtavius and Everton fan Sean Norton to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview Sunday's Gameweek 16 meeting at Selhurst Park.
 Palace come into the fixture following three straight defeats. A blip or is there more to the run of defeats? With a brilliant run of fixtures to come several Palace players will be under consideration for FPL managers and there's analysis of the likes of Vicente Guaita, Conor Gallagher and Wilfried Zaha.
 While Everton have been having a torrid time, Director of Football Marcel Brands has departed and many fans are unhappy with manager Rafael Benitez. Is his tenure doomed to fail or was Monday's victory over Arsenal a turning point?
 Follow Mig on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Migtavius
 Follow Sean on Twitter: https://twitter.com/spirit_blues
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - A Gameweek 16 Wildcard Special
