    <item>
      <title>Marry Kane!? | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 21 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/marry-kane-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-21-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the midweek games from Gameweek 14 and it was a very good week for both in FPL!
 Can James really proceed and captain Harry Kane over Mo Salah this week? 
 Will Suj ever activate the Wildcard?
 Discussion icnludes short term and longer term FPL assets under consideration, why Leeds will be okay, why Everton may not, why West Ham might overcome Chelsea this weekend, Tottenham's left hand bias and how to avoid a Watford treble up!
 Every team covered and their Fantasy assets covered as usual... 
 Coming Up on Monday on Planet FPL - Planet FPL Season 5 Episode 22, reviewing all the weekend action from Gameweek 15
