    <item>
      <title>Tottenham v Brentford with @Rickysaunders77 &amp; @FPLDummyTom | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/tottenham-v-brentford-with-rickysaunders77-fpldummytom-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Tottenham fan Ricky Saunders and Brentford fan Tom Medd to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview tonight's Gameweek 14 meeting at White Hart Lane.
 Can Harry Kane rediscover his scoring touch and offer a viable captaincy alternative to Mo Salah in Gameweek 15 with Norwich visiting Tottenham?
 What has been made of Antonio Conte's start at Tottenham and are the players suited to play his current three at the back system?
 Is it time to sell Ivan Toney and Bryan Mbeumo or can they be viewed as longer term holds in FPL?
 Are cracks starting to show for The Bees with injuries starting to take their toll on a squad that is not the biggest?
 Plus, plenty more including thoughts on Emerson Royal, Sergio Reguilon, Heung-Min Son, Rico Henry, Charlie Goode and long throws...
 Follow Ricky on Twitter: https://twitter.com/Rickysaunders77
 Follow Tom on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLDummyTom
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - Planet FPL Season 5 Episode 21, reviewing all the midweek action from Gameweek 14
