    <item>
      <title>Don't Confirm The Transfer! | Planet #SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 17 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/dont-confirm-the-transfer-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-17-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast James reveals his transfers made in the snow at Burnley, are the premium three forwards now locked into the team...?
 While for Suj it's time for a complete reconstruction of his team with several players on the chopping block.
 Plus, thoughts for captaincy for the five gamedays in the next week including why it's got to be Arsenal for Monday night, the potential impact of the Burnley v Tottenham postponement, news on the African Nations, Club World Cup and several Twitter questions covered with thoughts on Chelsea, Liverpool, City and United assets all covered and why it's not too late for Brentford assets...
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Tottenham v Brentford with @Rickysaunders77 &amp; @FPLDummyTom
