      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the Gameweek 13 action and even the action that didn't as James made it through the wind to get to Burnley, only to be greeted by heavy snow that led to the postponement of Tottenham's game at Burnley. How soon can we expect a rearrangement and potential double gameweek?
 Plus, looking ahead to the midweek games, learnings from the weekend gone and is Mo Salah in line for a rest at Everton on Wednesday.
