    <item>
      <title>Watford v Man Utd with @6thGoal &amp; @ismyCAPplaying | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wat-v-mun</link>
      <description>On this week's Planet FPL Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Watford fan Stephen Toumi and Manchester United fan Gary Robinson to discuss all the latest at their clubs, the FPL assets within them and preview Saturday's Gameweek 12 meeting at Vicarage Road.
 On The Podcast....
 Can Caludio Ranieri end the constant turnover of managers at Watford and stay in the job long term? And is it now inevitable that Ole Gunnar Solskjaer will leave United at the end of the season? Or is it position untenable if they lose on Saturday?
 Plus, Watford's Gameweek 16 fixture swing should be kept in mind, United's prolonged fixture swing is also coming, best assets are covered, but defensive concerns persist and should Cristiano Ronaldo owners give him the armband this Gameweek?
 Follow Stephen on Twitter: https://twitter.com/6thGoal
 Follow Gary on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ismyCAPplaying
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL -Ask James, 3pm (UK) on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after conclusion of the stream
 ____________________________________________
