    <item>
      <title>Tiers Before Tears | Planet #SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 15 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/tiers-before-tears-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-15-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Suj &amp; James discuss Tier points in more detail, looking specifically at Tier trends rather than specific players and there's some unexpected data to be found that may influence decision making for captaincy on Sunday with Harry Kane versus Joao Cancelo on the agenda.
 Plus, is best to stick with Mo Salah on Saturday despite Cristiano Ronaldo playing Watford? The current template, why it's not too late for Raphinha, planned moves and your questions covered.... 
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Watford v Manchester United with @6thGoal &amp; @ismyCAPplaying
