    <item>
      <title>Boxed In | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 18 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/boxed-in-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-18-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James uses the International break to discuss in more detail their current thinking for forthcoming gameweeks. Will Suj now end up Wildcarding in Gameweek 16 as James is planning?
 There's debate on weekend captaincy, is this finally a wqeek where Mo Salah can be opposed? And is Harry Kane fresh from his Eng;and hat-trick the man to back? Or is Heung-Min Son the better investment in Tottenham?
 Plus, there's a large listener Q&amp;A section...
 ... Coming up on Tuesday, The People's Poll, you can vote for your choice of topic on Twitter up until around 6pm (UK) https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1460188284873814017?s=20
