        <![CDATA[<p>Suj &amp; James uses the International break to discuss in more detail their current thinking for forthcoming gameweeks. Will Suj now end up Wildcarding in Gameweek 16 as James is planning?</p> <p>There's debate on weekend captaincy, is this finally a wqeek where Mo Salah can be opposed? And is Harry Kane fresh from his Eng;and hat-trick the man to back? Or is Heung-Min Son the better investment in Tottenham?</p> <p>Plus, there's a large listener Q&amp;A section...</p> <p>... Coming up on Tuesday, The People's Poll, you can vote for your choice of topic on Twitter up until around 6pm (UK) <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1460188284873814017?s=20">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1460188284873814017?s=20</a></p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
