    <item>
      <title>Harry And Ronnie | Planet #SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 14 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/harry-and-ronnie-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-14-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Suj &amp; James discuss another difficult weekend in the never ending pursuit of trying to climb rank and give early thoughts on captaincy for the next weekend.
 Some are considering selling rather than buying Harry Kane, is there reason to do so or should those without still buy? Plus, replacements for Youri Tielemans are covered with a closer look at midfield options below the Leicester player's value, there's thoughts on January's two single gamedays, why Palace defenders are being overlooked and the case is made as to why buying Cristiano Ronaldo in December might not be the must that it may appear to be....
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Wolves v West Ham with @parker_bradley &amp; @FPL_SkyAddict
 ____________________________________________
