      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/rice-rice-baby-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-13-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest talking points for Sky Fantasy Football including options for Southampton v Aston Villa on Friday night, a difficult and uninspiring dilemma for captaincy on Saturday and the one player who might be worth backing to outscore Salah on Sunday.
 Plus, James details the two players he intends to bring in this weekend and the moves that will enable him a Kane-Ronaldo-Salah trifecta in December and Suj is in search of solutions with many players in his squad that he is unhappy with.
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Leeds v Leicester with @fpl_tactician &amp; Aaron Lagor
