      <description>On the audio from James's Ask James Live Stream conversation is dominated by the shocking turn of events that has seen Antonio Conte appointed as the new Tottenham manager. As a fan how does James feel about the appointment and what does he expect to see change under the Italian? Tactics, likely lineups and mentality all discussed. Plus, Fantasy Football dilemmas answered
