    <item>
      <title>Ole Backed, Nuno Sacked | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 16 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ole-backed-nuno-sacked-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-16-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the weekend action in Gameweek 10 as home teams faltered and away teams impressed. Palace and Brighton caught our eye naturally with outstanding results at The Etihad and Anfield respectively and despite being the only away team to lose at the weekend Brentford assets are of great interest with Norwich next.
 Suj looks set to Wildcard after the next deadline, but James tries to make the case against. Plus, James is on the lookout for a budget defender, Conor Gallagher and Matt Lowton prove Gameweek heroes, why this might not be the week to buy Ben Chilwell and Tottenham's latest disasterclass is dismantled, with news breaking of Nuno Espirito Santo's sacking coming during the Podcast. 
 ... Coming up on Tuesday, Ask James Live on YouTube at 3pm (UK) with an audio version to follow shortly after
