      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/whats-his-name-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-12-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James wrap up all the latest in Sky Fantasy Football as injuries cause a change of plans for many Fantasy managers. 3 injuries have turned James's plans upside down. 
 On the Podcast, 3 budget midfield options to consider as a safety net below 7 million, Villa entry on Sunday to include the Friday night game at Southampton, Antonio vs Raphinha (if fit) for Sunday's captaincy, best options for Monday's Wolves and Everton encounter and coverage of the Twitter questions includes discussions on the likes of Aubameyang, Alexander-Arnold and Webster...
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Liverpool v Brighton with @FPL_LocoLord &amp; @FPLSeagull
