    <item>
      <title>Can Solskjaer Save His Job? | The People's Poll ep. 85 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/can-solskjaer-save-his-job-the-peoples-poll-ep-85-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Following Sunday's disastrous 5-0 defeat to Liverpool Ole Gunnar's Solskjaer's job as manager of Manchester United is very much under threat and some new outlets were reporting a decision would be made on his future last night, that decision appears to be that for now Solskjaer will remain in charge for Saturday's trip to White Hart Lane.
 Are United simply delaying the inevitable?
 Can Solskjaer possibly recover and stay in charge long term?
 Suj &amp; James discuss the current situation at Old Trafford, how the immediate issues could be fixed on field and if Antonio Conte could be the right fit to be the next manager.
 Coming up on Planet FPL on Wednesday - Planet SkyFF s3 ep12, all the latest Sky Fantasy Football
