 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Following Sunday's disastrous 5-0 defeat to Liverpool Ole Gunnar's Solskjaer's job as manager of Manchester United is very much under threat and some new outlets were reporting a decision would be made on his future last night, that decision appears to be that for now Solskjaer will remain in charge for Saturday's trip to White Hart Lane.</p> <p>Are United simply delaying the inevitable?</p> <p>Can Solskjaer possibly recover and stay in charge long term?</p> <p>Suj &amp; James discuss the current situation at Old Trafford, how the immediate issues could be fixed on field and if Antonio Conte could be the right fit to be the next manager.</p> <p>Coming up on Planet FPL on Wednesday - Planet SkyFF s3 ep12, all the latest Sky Fantasy Football</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg">https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
