    <item>
      <title>Kaitastrophe | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 15 | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/kaitastrophe-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-15-fantasy-premier-league</link>
      <description>A weekend of Premier League football none us will forget in a hurry and there were big point swings in FPL this weekend with Twitter favourite Kai Havertz blanking despite Chelsea scoring seven and Mo Salah grabbed four attacking returns including a hat-trick in Liverpool's historic 5-0 win at Old Trafford.
 In their review of Gameweek 9 Suj &amp; James discuss what it means for FPL managers going forward with key talking points covered from the ten games at the weekend that also saw Villa falter, City dominate, Watford score five of their own and Suj's West Ham win the Planet FPL Derby... 
 ... Coming up on Tuesday, The People's Poll Podcast, vote for your favourite from these choices on Twitter before 6pm (UK) today https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1452532606931714054?s=20
