      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/spilt-tea-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-13</link>
      <description>With no weekend Premier League football to review Suj &amp; James cover the majority of questions received on Twitter and cover a range of topics and dilemmas ahead of Saturday's Gameweek 8 deadline.
 Among the topics covered, upcoming captaincy, Chelsea &amp; Man City rotation concerns, South Americans likely to miss out this weekend, Brentford players creating interest and James details his short and medium term planning with a Wildcard now intended for Gameweek 16. Plus, there's a nice mix of non FPL questions too.
