    <item>
      <title>Outside For A Hwang | Planet #SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 9 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/outside-for-a-hwang-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-9-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James review another difficult weekend for Fantasy scoring and for James once benching and one red card meant three transfers were made over the weekend. There's explanation of why and the moves that were made.
 Plus, solutions for Ward-Prowse owners leads to conversation about Arsenal and Aston Villa assets, there's talk of the interesting Brentford entry point, why Everton assets can be removed despite an upcoming single gameday, concerns for South American players remains and lots of community questions covered....
 Plus, your Twitter questions covered &amp; more...
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
