    <item>
      <title>Have Barcelona Hit Rock Bottom? | The People's Poll ep. 82 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/have-barcelona-hit-rock-bottom-the-peoples-poll-ep-82-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Beaten 3-0 by Bayern Munich &amp; Benfica in the Champions League and defeated by Atletico Madrid in La Liga at the weekend, Suj &amp; James attempt to conclude if Barcelona are at their lowest ebb, or could the situation get worse yet?
 Discussion on the Podcast includes Barca's dire financial situation, what could reverse the problem, the loss of superstar Lionel Messi, the failed attempts to make money during the transfer window, bizarre signings, La Liga's strict wage cap and why Ronald Koeman is still manager...
