      <title>No Time To Cry | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 12</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/no-time-to-cry-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-12</link>
      <description>Another difficult weekend for many FPL managers but Suj &amp; James are here to cheer you up and talk through all the GW7 football. But this week it's Suj rather than James who sounds like he needs a cuddle!
 All the reaction to Ronaldo's benching, Lukaku's blank &amp; Salah's haul. Details of Tottenham's change of system, Brentford's shithousery and lots more from all the games for FPL managers to consider including who might miss out in GW8 due to international commitments... 
 Join our Planet FPL mini league, the winner will be invited on to a Planet FPL Podcast next summer! The code is d7mmxw or you can auto join at the link below https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw
