      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/say-it-james-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-8-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James review a weekend where many popular captains missed and look forward to the final weekend before the October international break.
 How important is Lukaku for this Saturday? Should Ronaldo be sacrificed to get the Belgian forward in?
 There's also discussion on if Antonio to cover Kane on upcoming Sunday's and the November TV selections including important notes for Tuesday November 30th, if the Southampton v Aston Villa single gameday should have a knock on impact on an approach towards Arsenal assets and there's lots of Twitter questions covered... 
 Plus, your Twitter questions covered &amp; more...
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Tottenham v Aston Villa with @Rickysaunders77 &amp; @Lee_Jackson_90
