      <description>On the audio from James's Ask James Live Stream on YouTube lots of questions on what to do with Patrick Bamford with the Leeds hitman ruled out of this weekend. You won't have to wait long on the audio for James's opinion.
 But what about the Leeds duo of Luke Ayling and Raphinha who remain doubtful for the visit of West Ham.
 Plus, thoughts for the GW6 captaincy, those who doubt Harry Kane, short-term punts and long=term options discussed, how Chelsea may set up in their encounter with Man City, gambling sponsorships in the EFL &amp; lots more...
