      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/theres-sense-in-that-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-7-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James review their weekends and look ahead to the 3 gamedays coming up this weekend.
 It looks like Ronaldo vs Salah on Saturday, who's the best to back? Does home advantage and the early kick off giving Ronaldo the edge?
 There's discussion on buying Harry Kane as many will be considering this Sunday, but is there a better alternative to consider?
 And Monday sees the anticipated Crystal Palace v Brighton single, who's best to buy on the night for those who don't have coverage?
 Plus, your Twitter questions covered &amp; more...
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Everton v Norwich with @spirit_blues &amp; @fpl_badger
