      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/surfing-the-web-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-6-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James reflect on their Overhaul selections and offer solutions for those now carrying injured or suspended players such as Michail Antonio &amp; Dominic Calvert-Lewin.
 Much of the focus of the Podcast though focuses on some less familiar names as potential replacements for Brighton's Adam Webster, who was a very popular Overhaul pick and is now likely out for a number of weeks. Both defensive and midfield options at under 8.0 are covered in detail.
 Plus, thoughts for captaincy at the weekend, James's premium striker chain transfer plan and community questions answered.
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Brighton v Leicester with @FPLSeagull &amp; @AaronLagor
