      <description>With the deadline for Gameweek 5 on Friday James brings his weekly Live Stream forward to today to cover questions from the YouTube Community.
 Topics covered include, Everton's win and performance last night, Calvert-Lewin solutions, Ronaldo vs Messi, why Leeds should still have our interest, plenty on Wolves assets, rotation concerns, captaincy for the weekend and plenty more including a reveal of James' selections for UCL Fantasy... 
