      <title>Good Cop Bad Cop | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 9</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/good-cop-bad-cop-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-9</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the 9 games played so far in GW4 and give their thoughts on what they're likely to do next with their FPL teams and cover all the major FPL talking points.
 Are Lukaku, Ronaldo, Salah about to become a Big 3 in FPL with those wildcarding this week likely to consider having all three players?
 Plus, where did it go so wrong for Tottenham at Palace? Important tactical notes, particularly on Liverpool, Manchester City and Southampton, who's disposable, who should be of interest, whether Antonio should be held or sold, fixture turns, why Arsenal, Leeds &amp; Wolves appeal this weekend and plenty more...
 Join our Planet FPL mini league, the winner will be invited on to a Planet FPL Podcast next summer! The code is d7mmxw or you can auto join at the link below https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw
 Coming Up on Tuesday, Ask James - 3pm (UK) Live on YouTube with an audio version to follow shortly after...
