    <item>
      <title>Ask James Live Stream | Friday September 10th | Planet FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-live-stream-friday-september-10th-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the audio from James's Ask James Live Stream on YouTube lots of talk about Cristiano Ronaldo, but there's just as much talk of Bruno Fernandes with many managers willing to sacrifice Fernandes, but James has to question why with Newcastle at home tomorrow.
 Plus, Heung-Min Son looks to be out for Tottenham for at least this weekend, Brazilian call-ups still don't know if they can play this weekend, thoughts on Arsenal, Wolves, Wildcards, big at the back &amp; more...
