    <item>
      <title>Watford v Wolves | C.O.T.C. with @6thGoal &amp; @parker_bradley | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/watford-v-wolves-cotc-with-6thgoal-parker_bradley-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James is joined by Watford fan Stephen Toumi and Wolves fan Bradley Parker to discuss their clubs and preview Saturday's meeting between the two at Vicarage Road ahead of attractive fixture runs for both clubs that should appeal to FPL managers.
 For Watford, the interest should be immediate with 3 attractive fixtures before a more difficult spell. We discuss defensive prospects that may interest those on Wildcard and the prospects of the brilliant Ismaila Sarr. Has he made it in to Stephen's team?
 While for Wolves the thinking is longer-term with an amazing fixture run up until GW14. Again we discuss defensive prospects, Raul Jimenez and Bradley reveals his preference between Adama Traore and Trincao....
 Follow Stephen on Twitter: https://twitter.com/6thGoal
 Follow Bradley on Twitter: https://twitter.com/parker_bradley
 Join our Planet FPL mini league, the winner will be invited on to a Planet FPL Podcast next summer! The code is d7mmxw or you can auto join at the link below https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw
