      <title>Overhaul Fixture Planning | Planet #SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 5 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/overhaul-watchlist-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-5-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James take a detailed look at planning for the coming weeks in Sky Fantasy Football with discussion on coverage of single days, jumping between premiums, the assets of interest and potential transfer entry and exit points.
 Plus, why managers can be aware of some confirmed fixtures all the way up to Matchweek 16 despite no official confirmation, why it's viable to go without Manchester City assets at the start, the awkward Romelu Lukaku problem, the players it's risky to go without early on and likely captaincy selections for this coming weekend.... 
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Watford v Wolves with @6thGoal &amp; @parker_bradley
