    <item>
      <title>What Happened To Bury? 2 (Years Later) | A Planet #FPL Special</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/what-happened-to-bury-2-years-later-a-planet-fpl-special</link>
      <description>2 years to day since first covering the expulsion of Bury Football Club from the Football League Suj &amp; James investigate what has happened to The Shakers since and find a town divided not over one football club, but two.
 Do Bury FC still exist? Could it yet make a comeback despite having no staff, entering administration and having not played football in over two years? Could a takeover yet still happen?
 And we learn about Phoenix Club Bury AFC, born to give Bury fans a football team in Bury. But not everyone is in support of the new club...
 You can find links to the first Podcast on Bury from two years ago via the below tweet https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1170320412460404736?s=20
 Join our Planet FPL mini league, the winner will be invited on to a Planet FPL Podcast next summer! The code is d7mmxw or you can auto join at the link below https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw
 Coming Up on Wednesday - Planet SkyFF: A detailed fixture planning analysis for the Sky Fantasy Football Overhaul
 ____________________________________________
