        <![CDATA[<p>2 years to day since first covering the expulsion of Bury Football Club from the Football League Suj &amp; James investigate what has happened to The Shakers since and find a town divided not over one football club, but two.</p> <p>Do Bury FC still exist? Could it yet make a comeback despite having no staff, entering administration and having not played football in over two years? Could a takeover yet still happen?</p> <p>And we learn about Phoenix Club Bury AFC, born to give Bury fans a football team in Bury. But not everyone is in support of the new club...</p> <p>You can find links to the first Podcast on Bury from two years ago via the below tweet <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1170320412460404736?s=20">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod/status/1170320412460404736?s=20</a></p> <p>Join our Planet FPL mini league, the winner will be invited on to a Planet FPL Podcast next summer! The code is d7mmxw or you can auto join at the link below <a href="https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw</a></p> <p>Coming Up on Wednesday - Planet SkyFF: A detailed fixture planning analysis for the Sky Fantasy Football Overhaul</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod">https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod</a></p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/sujanshah">https://twitter.com/sujanshah</a></p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl">https://www.instagram.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8043oOKTB4uP8Nq15Kz6bg