    <item>
      <title>Leeds v Liverpool | C.O.T.C. with @fpl_tactician &amp; @FPL_LocoLord | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leeds-v-liverpool-cotc-with-fpl_tactician-fpl_locolord-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James is joined by Leeds United fan Andy Martin &amp; Liverpool fan Dan Lord to discuss their clubs and their FPL assets ahead of the Gameweek 4 meeting at Elland Road.
 It's been a tough start for Leeds, could second season syndrome be kicking in for The Whites? What impact will new signing Daniel James have on the likes of Jack Harrison and Raphinha? Following Liverpool there's a great fixture swing for Leeds, is Patrick Bamford going under the radar?
 While at Liverpool a respectable 7 points so far but frustration at failing to see off 10 man Chelsea on Saturday and there is growing unease at Anfield at the lack of spending in the transfer window. Are Liverpool on the decline or has the return of Virgil Van Dijk and introduction of Harvey Elliott reinvigorated them? And is Mo Salah being overlooked for the Gameweek 4 captaincy? 
 Follow Andy on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fpl_tactician
 Follow Dan on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPL_LocoLord
 Join our Planet FPL mini league, the winner will be invited on to a Planet FPL Podcast next summer! The code is d7mmxw or you can auto join at the link below https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw
 Coming Up on Friday on Planet FPL - Ask James, streaming live on YouTube at 3pm (UK) with an audio version to follow shortly afterwards
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Follow James on Twitter: https://twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://twitter.com/sujanshah
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
