      <title>Drafting a Wildcard | The People's Poll ep. 78 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/drafting-a-wildcard-the-peoples-poll-ep-78-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Neither Suj or James are planning to Wildcard but on this Podcast the pair look at what they might do if they were to activate the chip.
 Why are wildcards being activated now? 
 Strategy and squad structure are looked at including why injury and transfer news could be important and being careful not to ignore the 8.0-10.0 midfield price point.
 And what price do we think Cristiano Ronaldo will be?
