    <item>
      <title>The Group Think | Planet #SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 3 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-group-think-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-3-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>It's the final week before Overhaul in Sky Fantasy Football and the advice is to sit tight until the weekend has passed. With the transfer window still open &amp; big transfers still likely Suj &amp; James are trying to avoid thinking too far ahead.
 Are Michail Antonio and Bruno Fernandes the obvious captaincy selections for the two gamedays days this weekend?
 A host of Twitter questions answered, why rank shouldn't mean too much at this stage, pros and cons of our GW1 selections, if 'anything' could make us use a transfer this week, why two fixtures after Overhaul could still change date, attacking mids v defensive mids &amp; and plenty more...
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Manchester City v Arsenal with @FPLPringle &amp; @ThreeFiveWho
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
