      <itunes:author>Suj &amp; James</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle>There is a potential problem on the horizon for FPL managers with current government legislation stating that individuals returning from red list countries must quarantine and with internationals following this weekend that means many star name could...</itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>There is a potential problem on the horizon for FPL managers with current government legislation stating that individuals returning from red list countries must quarantine and with internationals following this weekend that means many star name could miss GW4 and possibly even GW5.
 Suj &amp; James investigate which players could be affected, if clubs can deny their players leaving for international duty and why there could yet be exemptions provided for players... but even if there are exemptions South American stars could still miss out...
 Plus, last night's brilliant win for West Ham against Leicester is reviewed - is Antonio now the standout captaincy option in GW4?
 Join our Planet FPL mini league, the winner will be invited on to a Planet FPL Podcast next summer! The code is d7mmxw or you can auto join at the link below https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/d7mmxw
 Coming Up on Wednesday on Planet FPL - Planet #SkyFF s3 ep3
 ____________________________________________
