      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the weekend FPL action as the big Bruno vs Salah debate ended in an anti climatic fashion. What should FPL managers do next with GW3 looking appealing for a number of players?
 Key points referenced for Brighton, Everton, Leeds &amp; Wolves for upcoming weeks, how lucky Tottenham were, how bad Arsenal really are, how important Lukaku is and plenty more as the 9 weekend games are assessed and there are warnings on several popular FPL picks....
 And is it too soon to Wildcard...?
