    <item>
      <title>Let The Son Shine | Planet #SkyFF S. 3 Ep. 2 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/let-the-son-shine-planet-skyff-s-3-ep-2-sky-fantasy-football-0</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James assess the fallout from their first weekend in Sky Fantasy Football, if there were any regrets from their opening selections and transfer/captaincy plans for the weekend.
 Mo Salah to Heung-Min Son is looking a popular move on Sunday, will Suj &amp; James be making the move.
 Plus, replacements considered for Ilkay Gundogan and lessons learned from the opening weekend including some interesting notes on those that hit passing tiers, the problem with attacking enablers and why it's not worth ever engaging with the Sky Fantasy Football social media account...
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Clash of the Correspondents, Southampton v Manchester United with @CSWipeout &amp; @ismyCAPplaying
 ____________________________________________
