      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/best-budget-defenders-the-peoples-poll-ep-76-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Podcast, Suj &amp; James take a more detailed look at defensive budget enablers in FPL following the opening Gameweek and ponder best options, not necessarily for now, but in the weeks to come as FPL managers may be looking for value to help fit an extra premium player in their teams.
 There's an assessment of all the 4.0 defenders and two stand out as options to keep an eye on in the coming weeks and the 4.5 assets under consideration are discussed, but are there less players of interest than the original pricing had suggested there might be...? 
