      <description>The Premier League returned with a bang, Brentford humbled Arsenal, Man Utd hit Leeds for five, West Ham got four at St James's Park and Tottenham shocked Man City with Harry Kane nowhere to be seen. And for many FPL managers it was an exceptional and high scoring weekend.
 Suj &amp; James review the opening weekend in FPL where Bruno Fernandes and Mo Salah went big and they were supported by many other popular players, particularly among Twitter's FPL Community.
 Every game reviewed, every team assessed, tactical pointers and early thoughts of plans for GW2....
