      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/data-inspection-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-3</link>
      <description>A very different Planet #FPL Podcast to normal as Suj &amp; James take a dive into data from the 2020/21 season in a bid to unearth statistics that may have passed us by as the FPL deadline draws ever closer.
 There's a close inspection of data from the second half of last season and also the 9 Gameweeks after the March international break and with the help of the Planet #FPL Correspondents the final league table for the coming season is predicted with all 20 clubs covered on the show...
