      <itunes:summary>Suj and James begin their third season playing Sky Fantasy Football by covering all the important details for the first three matchweeks prior to the Overhaul.
 The Podcast begins by discussing best captaincy for Friday's single game day fixture between Brentford and Arsenal before moving on to coverage of matchday two's single gameday between West Ham and Leicester.
 Other captaincy days are covered including why Bruno Fernandes and Mo Salah look so important and why some Man City coverage looks important.
 Plus, should managers make moves before The Overhaul? Advice on playing the opening weeks safely, enablers and lots more...
 Join our Sky Fantasy Football Mini League - The Pin is 8475785
 You can find a download link to last season's Season 2 Episode 1 Podcast "An Introduction To Sky" at the link below  https://fantasyfootballshow.libsyn.com/an-introduction-to-sky-planet-skyff-s2-ep1
