    <item>
      <title>Starting Well &amp; Latest Drafts with @MrCalinMates | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 2</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/starting-well-latest-drafts-with-mrcalinmates-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-2</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James welcome Planet FPL Patreon and 2020/21 Advanced Tier Patreon mini league winner Calin Mates to discuss his successful season and plans for GW1.
 We learn of Calin's media channel in Romania and how he successfully rose through the ranks last season in FPL despite not having a spectacular start. 
 So how should we go about making a good start in FPL? Ideas are discussed and also current drafts are revealed, with each questionable selection sense checked to explain reasoning behind the choice...
 You can follow Calin on Twitter: https://twitter.com/MrCalinMates
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Sky Fantasy Football Season 3 Episode 1
