    <item>
      <title>Strategy, Chips &amp; The Watchlist | Planet #FPL S. 5 Ep. 1</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/strategy-chips-the-watchlist-planet-fpl-s-5-ep-1</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James kick off the final build-up to the new Fantasy Premier League season with the launch of Season 5 of Planet #FPL and on this Podcast the lads focus on strategy and players of interest ahead of Friday's deadline.
 James takes us through chip strategy for the season looking at popular times to use the Bench Boost, Free Hit &amp; Triple Captain chips and there's good news for many as it will likely be easier to navigate the season with chips than in 2020/21.
 There's discussion about when to use the first wildcard and there are suggested 'Chelsea' and 'Manchester United' Wildcard slots and there's a A-W team run through of who is on the guys watchlist for their FPL teams...
 Coming Up on Planet FPL tomorrow... Suj &amp; James welcome Advanced Tier mini league winner Calin Mates to the show to debate their latest drafts and how best to play FPL in the opening weeks...
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
