    <item>
      <title>Brentford with @FPLDummyTom - Correspondent Week ep 20 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/brentford-with-fpldummytom-correspondent-week-ep-20-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>We've made it to the end of Correspondent Week! And on the final Podcast Suj &amp; James are joined by Tom Medd to get all the detail on the Premier League's newest addition Brentford.
 Ivan Toney is proving very popular for FPL managers and appeals at 6.5 with a good opening and he's a likely shoe-in for Tom's team, but is he the only Brentford player of interest?
 Tom takes us through details on the squad, what we can expect from the new signings and who he expects to start for The Bees for their opening night fixture against Arsenal...
 You can follow Tom on Twitter: https://twitter.com/FPLDummyTom
 Coming up next on Planet FPL... our launch of Planet FPL Season 5 with Episode 1 taking a look at who's on our Watchlist following Correspondent Week and we'll be discussing Chip Strategy for the season...
 ____________________________________________
