    <item>
      <title>Chelsea @RotationFPL - Correspondent Week ep 18 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chelsea-rotationfpl-correspondent-week-ep-18-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Ted Maw is Suj &amp; James' guest on the final Day 6 Podcast of Correspondent Week to discuss all things Chelsea at a time when it is looking creasing likely that Romelu Lukaku might return to the club.
 Does Lukaku make Chelsea title contenders? Are they expected to challenge even without him?
 Ted explains the difficulty in predicting Chelsea's opening weekend line-up and with Crystal Palace at home there is a will from many to punt a Blues player or two in FPL, but is it worth it with a very difficult looking spell after the opening game?
 The ridiculous squad depth is assessed, why from GW7 it may be all-in on Chelsea assets and there's also a discussion on the academy and why some of The Blues brightest youngsters are leaving the club...
 You can follow Ted on Twitter: https://twitter.com/RotationFPL
 Coming up next on Correspondent Week - Liverpool @FPL_LocoLord
