    <item>
      <title>Leeds with @fpl_tactician - Correspondent Week ep 9 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leeds-with-fpl_tactician-correspondent-week-ep-9-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Day 3 of Correspondent Week is concluded with Leeds United fan Andy Martin who joins Suj &amp; James to discuss a squad full of attractive FPL propositions with the majority of the squad underpriced in Andy's opinion.
 Raphinha stands out at 6.5 but with Jack Harrison matching his point per game returns last season and cheaper at 6.0 is the Englishman being overlooked?
 Should FPL managers being buying both!?
 Or is there even better value in Stuart Dallas at 5.5 with a permanent move to midfield likely?
 Plus views on the defensive assets, why Diego Llorente offers an alternative to Luke Ayling, prospects for new left-back Junior Firpo and could Rodrigo threaten Patrick Bamford's starting spot...?
 You can follow Andy on Twitter: https://twitter.com/fpl_tactician
 Coming up next on Correspondent Week - West Ham United with @Fpl_SkyAddict
