    <item>
      <title>Arsenal with @ThreeFiveWho - Correspondent Week ep 8 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/arsenal-with-threefivewho-correspondent-week-ep-8-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the latest Podcast on Correspondent Week Suj &amp; James are joined by Adam Pritchard to discuss all things Arsenal ahead of the new season.
 With Chelsea and Manchester City in the first three games, starting with Arsenal assets in FPL looks tricky but they shouldn't be overlooked with a brilliant run beginning from GW4.
 Adam details the current likely starting selection for The Gunners at Brentford and why there are two players in particuLar he intends to start with from The Emirates.
 Is Pierre Emerick Aubameyang one of them?
 Is Nicolas Pepe finally going to step up and justify the price paid for him?
 Does Adam have interest in The Gunners defensively?
 You can follow Adam on Twitter: https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho
 Coming up next on Correspondent Week - Leeds United with @fpl_tactician
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
