    <item>
      <title>Watford with @6thGoal - Correspondent Week ep 6 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/watford-with-6thgoal-correspondent-week-ep-6-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James complete Day 2 of Correspondent Week with the returning Stephen Toumi to discuss all things Watford as The Hornets aim to establish themselves again as a Premier League outfit.
 There are ten Watford forwards listed in FPL, but are any of them any good? Perhaps, a couple of them might be unknown or under the radar but what does Stephen think of the prospects of the exciting Ismaila Sarr who currently sits in the drafts of botn Suj &amp; James?
 The Hornets had an incredible record during their promotion campaign, and with an attractive set of opening fixtures defensive assets should be considered too but who's likely to start at the back and who's the standout FPL asset?
 You can follow Stephen on Twitter: https://twitter.com/6thGoal
 Coming up next on Correspondent Week - Everton with @spirit_blues
 ____________________________________________
