    <item>
      <title>Wolves with @parker_bradley - Correspondent Week ep 2 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wolves-with-parker_bradley-correspondent-week-ep-2-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James are joined by Bradley Parker on the latest Correspondent Week Podcast to discuss all things Wolverhampton Wanderers. 
 Could Rayan Ait-Nouri remain out of position on the left wing when the season starts? Will he even start at all and are there better defensive options among the squad?
 New additions Jose Sa, Yerson Mosquera and Francisco Trincao are discussed, can Morgan Gibbs-White break into the team to offer a golden 4.5 midfield option? And can RFaul Jimenez return as good as before?
 An amazing fixture swing from GW4 is eyed and the likely tactics of new manager Bruno Lage are detailed...
 You can follow Bradley On Twitter https://twitter.com/parker_bradley
 Coming up next week on Correspondent Week - Newcastle United with @fpl_fitballer
 ____________________________________________
