      <title>Gaffr Fantasy Preview with @EFL_Fantasy &amp; @Angus81 | EFL Week | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/gaffr-fantasy-preview-with-efl_fantasy-angus81-efl-week-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>EFL Week concludes with James welcoming Jamie Roberts &amp; Angus McPhail from the EFL Fantasy Podcast to introduce and preview Gaffr Fantasy, the game for Fantasy Football in The Championship.
 The format of the game including the all important use of the boosts are covered and best premium. mid price and budget assets are highlighted with a thorough run through from Goalkeepers to Forwards.
 Plus, beware the transfer window and why in this game big at the back really can be a thing...
 You can follow Jamie on Twitter https://twitter.com/EFL_Fantasy
 You can follow Angus on Twitter https://twitter.com/EFL_Fantasy
