        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James continue Content Creator Week with Andy Mears, the King of FPL YouTube content, whose Let's Talk FPL channel has grown above 170,000 subscribers</p> <p>Andy discusses his history producing FPL content, how the channel exploded and how he has dealt with the extra traffic volume on his channel in a season where finished just outside the top 1000 in FPL. There's also talk of dealing with negative comments and making last minute FPL decisions.</p> <p>Plus Andy reveals what it was like to be at Wembley for England's semi final victory against Denmark and FPL midfielders are pondered for GW1 with discussion on Salah, Fernandes, Son, Man City assets and mid priced players...</p> <p>You can follow Andy on Twitter <a href="https://twitter.com/FPLGeneral">https://twitter.com/LetsTalk_FPL</a></p> <p>Coming up tomorrow... Az &amp; Mark from Blackbox</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaN