    <item>
      <title>In Discussion with @FPLGeneral | Planet #FPL Content Creator Week ep 03</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/in-discussion-with-fplgeneral-planet-fpl-content-creator-week-ep-03</link>
      <description>Suj and James continue Content Creator Week with Mark McGettigan, Twitter's FPL General who can boast 3 top 500 finishes in FPL to his record.
 There's discussion about the growth of FPL as a game and within the Twitter community, if FPL is an addiction and we learn how Mark's Podcast the 59th Minute partnered with The Athletic and Mark reveals how the eye test and watching games impacts his FPL decision making.
 Plus over-thinking and pre-season burnout are debated and there's talk of the FPL defenders that interest us most currently and it leads to an interesting conversation on Liverpool assets and team setup...
 You can follow Mark on Twitter https://twitter.com/FPLGeneral
 Coming up tomorrow... Let's Talk FPL
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
