    <item>
      <title>In Discussion with @WGTA_FPL | Planet #FPL Content Creator Week ep 02</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/in-discussion-with-wgta_fpl-planet-fpl-content-creator-week-ep-02</link>
      <description>Suj and James continue Content Creator Week with Who Got The Assist's Tom Cantle and discussion features the evolution of Tom's Podcast and some of the psychology behind FPL management including reflection on WGTA's Behavioural Science Podcast.
 There's also talk around selecting the right captain in FPL, initial thoughts on FPL Goalkeeper selection and strategy, why this pre season may feel a bit flat for many content creators and Tom drops knowledge bombs on some interesting statistics from the 2020/21 season.
 You can follow Tom on Twitter https://twitter.com/WGTA_FPL
 Coming up tomorrow... The FPL General
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
