    <item>
      <title>In Discussion with @Lateriser12 | Planet #FPL Content Creator Week ep 01</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/in-discussion-with-lateriser12-planet-fpl-content-creator-week-ep-01</link>
      <description>On their first podcast of a series of specials this week with some of the FPL Community's most popular content creators, Suj and James caught up with one of FPL's great minds Pranil Sheth, @Lateriser12 on Twitter, to discuss his amazing history playing Fantasy Football, how his Podcast The FPL Wire started up and lessons learned from a difficult FPL Season.   Could it be that content creators are suffering declines in FPL overall ranks because the game is no longer the main focus?  Plus, we discuss template players we can go against in GW1 and those that we perhaps shouldn't and why India have not yet produced a tournament qualifying international team...
 You can follow Pranil on Twitter at https://twitter.com/lateriser12 and The FPL Wire at https://twitter.com/TheFPLWire
 Coming up tomorrow... Who Got The Assist's Tom Cantle
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 16 Jul 2021 00:35:06 -0000</pubDate>
