      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On their first podcast of a series of specials this week with some of the FPL Community's most popular content creators, Suj and James caught up with one of FPL's great minds Pranil Sheth, @Lateriser12 on Twitter, to discuss his amazing history playing Fantasy Football, how his Podcast The FPL Wire started up and lessons learned from a difficult FPL Season.   Could it be that content creators are suffering declines in FPL overall ranks because the game is no longer the main focus?  Plus, we discuss template players we can go against in GW1 and those that we perhaps shouldn't and why India have not yet produced a tournament qualifying international team...</p> <p>You can follow Pranil on Twitter at <a href="https://twitter.com/lateriser12">https://twitter.com/lateriser12</a> and The FPL Wire at <a href="https://twitter.com/TheFPLWire">https://twitter.com/TheFPLWire</a></p> <p>Coming up tomorrow... Who Got The Assist's Tom Cantle</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​</p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFVVRDUycGl5NFRDUXMxUkwzcEhmWjNTeXZxUXxBQ3Jtc0trQmZvMjJ0RWJRejZBQTFnNmhsUGJsaWZOZFd3NWtfaG55VFg5SF96RkFRcTF3X0VRcWo1b184SFEweFNYb3ItTFpuUVY1NmpZNEhmLUVtdktDc1F1djAwbEdMZU5hSERTNm1FWUFKX1pEZGpjQ21obw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fplanetfpl%2F%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU9LZ1hmOG9GMzhwNlp2aW9YZzVKdWdCX0hpZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuZW9XalN4UXJkMUh1cmxPWmFqSTAtQ2lvbXJHUnJGWkNwZmtHcU1tMUZUODZuaDhFbkJNM2Y0Q3ZKU3FEOUxSUEtwMUp2OWYxYXJjM3hsUDhiVGd1a19iZWluWlJBdWV6WWlmemtZTmdVTk1ZSFREcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2FPlanetFPL%2F%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
