    <item>
      <title>FPL Happy Hour - Happy Hour Is Never An Hour (Part 2)</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fpl-happy-hour-happy-hour-is-never-an-hour-part-2</link>
      <description>As part of the Planet FPL Takeover week Suj &amp; James are inviting 4 of the best up and coming content creators in the FPL Community to share their content on the Planet FPL Network.
 On today's Podcast it's FPL Happy Hour...
 "On this week's FPL Happy Hour, Sham &amp; Rob start of by making some FPL Season predictions, as voted for by the community.
 The FPL Ownership Strategy – Does this work? What does this strategy look like?
 We look into 4 players that we really like for the start of the season and some stats that sit behind the theory.
 We end the show by looking at our current drafts and taking questions from the twitter community.
 Thanks for watching/listening. Once the season starts we’ll be producing two shows a week, one pre-record and one live stream. If you like what you've heard we’d love for you to subscribe to our Youtube channel youtube.com/c/TheFPLHappyH…
 We’re also on a number of audio platforms including Spotify and Apple. You can follow us on twitter @FPL_HappyHour / @FPL2Guys1Cup / @FPL_Panda
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 Jul 2021 20:59:49 -0000</pubDate>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
