    <item>
      <title>FPL By Dummies - s2 ep1 "A New Season, A New Hope"</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fpl-by-dummies-s2-ep1-a-new-season-a-new-hope</link>
      <description>As part of the Planet FPL Takeover week Suj &amp; James are inviting 4 of the best up and coming content creators in the FPL Community to share their content on the Planet FPL Network.
 On today's Podcast it's FPL By Dummies...
   "I've got a bad feeling about this, a brand new FPL season brings with it the fresh opportunity for the hopes of fantasy football glory to be dashed for the Three Dummies (Josh, Cam and Tom), but with our appetite for punishment suitably replenished, we are back.
   This week we first discuss our full range of emotions surrounding England's European cup final performance; sadness, depression... is full blown tears an emotion? And talk about the atrocious and embarrassing abuse received after the game by our England boys.
   We then turn our focus to this seasons FPL assets with our usual podcast segment "Snog, Marry, Avoid!" and discuss who we think some of the standout players could be for the upcoming FPL season... Apart from Charlie Taylor of course!"
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
