    <item>
      <title>Season Keepers - Season 2: FPL Fixtures 1-6</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/season-keepers-season-2-fpl-fixtures-1-6</link>
      <description>As part of the Planet FPL Takeover week Suj &amp; James are inviting 4 of the best up and coming content creators in the FPL Community to share their content on the Planet FPL Network.
 On today's Podcast it's The Season Keepers...
 "Good morning, good afternoon and good evening! In this episode we take you through each clubs first six fixtures with a direct comparison in stats to the corresponding games of last season. We look to discuss the teams to target and of course the fixture runs to avoid! Keep a listen out for those that we think are worth considering around Gameweek 3-4 which could provide some ideal budget enablers!"
