    <item>
      <title>Man On Podcast : Season 2, Episode 3, Planet FPL Takeover!</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/man-on-podcast-season-2-episode-3-planet-fpl-takeover</link>
      <description>As part of the Planet FPL Takeover week Suj &amp; James are inviting 4 of the best up and coming content creators in the FPL Community to share their content on the Planet FPL Network.
 First up it's the Man On Podcast...
 "Hello and welcome to this very special episode of the Man On Podcast! This week we are lucky enough to be part of the Planet FPL Takeover Week. Not only do we release our content as usual on our YouTube/Twitch and audio platforms but we also feature via the Planet FPL platforms as well! In this episode we discuss the aftermath of the Euro’s and our players of the tournament. We then do a deep-dive into the popular 4.5m defender options from a statistical perspective and then each give 3 players who will be featuring in our GW1 squads and why. We play and discuss multiple Fantasy Football games on the Man On podcast and next we look at GAFFR which is a game for the English Championship that has recently relaunched for the second season. We end with a little discussion on ChampMan ahead of Treble GW37. Thank you for taking the time to listen and if you have any feedback please don’t hesitate to send it over to @ManOnFPL"
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Jul 2021 12:07:46 -0000</pubDate>
