    <item>
      <title>Congratulazioni Italia | Planet #FPL Do The Euros | Ep. 25</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/congratulazioni-italia-planet-fpl-do-the-euros-ep-25</link>
      <description>Italy are the new European Champions having been England on penalties last night. There is congratulations to Italy, the tournament's best team in the opinion of Suj and James but naturally the conversation focuses on England with one particularly bruised hangover.
 Were England unlucky? Is there hope for the future? There's pride in the players on the pitch but disappointment with a lot that happened off the pitch from so-called England fans...
