      <itunes:summary>We are two days away from the biggest game in English football history for over 50 years and in their final Podcast before Sunday's Euro 2020 final Suj and James ponder if surprises could be in store from the two managers with their tactics and selections for the game, which gives James the opportunity to detail an unlikely Italian set-up that could leave England with major issues for the game.
 The lads also pick a combined eleven from the finalists, their team of the tournament and there's completely (unbiased) predictions for the final. Plus, final day plans for Euro Fantasy...
