      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>We are two days away from the biggest game in English football history for over 50 years and in their final Podcast before Sunday's Euro 2020 final Suj and James ponder if surprises could be in store from the two managers with their tactics and selections for the game, which gives James the opportunity to detail an unlikely Italian set-up that could leave England with major issues for the game.</p> <p>The lads also pick a combined eleven from the finalists, their team of the tournament and there's completely (unbiased) predictions for the final. Plus, final day plans for Euro Fantasy...</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​</p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFVVRDUycGl5NFRDUXMxUkwzcEhmWjNTeXZxUXxBQ3Jtc0trQmZvMjJ0RWJRejZBQTFnNmhsUGJsaWZOZFd3NWtfaG55VFg5SF96RkFRcTF3X0VRcWo1b184SFEweFNYb3ItTFpuUVY1NmpZNEhmLUVtdktDc1F1djAwbEdMZU5hSERTNm1FWUFKX1pEZGpjQ21obw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fplanetfpl%2F%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU9LZ1hmOG9GMzhwNlp2aW9YZzVKdWdCX0hpZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuZW9XalN4UXJkMUh1cmxPWmFqSTAtQ2lvbXJHUnJGWkNwZmtHcU1tMUZUODZuaDhFbkJNM2Y0Q3ZKU3FEOUxSUEtwMUp2OWYxYXJjM3hsUDhiVGd1a19iZWluWlJBdWV6WWlmemtZTmdVTk1ZSFREcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2FPlanetFPL%2F%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
