      <itunes:subtitle>One More win for England and Football really will have come home for The Three Lions... Suj and James discuss last night's dramatic extra time win for England against Denmark, how they felt emotionally before, during and after the game, whether the...</itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>One More win for England and Football really will have come home for The Three Lions...
 Suj and James discuss last night's dramatic extra time win for England against Denmark, how they felt emotionally before, during and after the game, whether the win was deserved and biased and non biased views on the big penalty call.
 And thoughts turn towards Sunday's Final and Suj wants to see England build a legacy...
