      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>One More win for England and Football really will have come home for The Three Lions...</p> <p>Suj and James discuss last night's dramatic extra time win for England against Denmark, how they felt emotionally before, during and after the game, whether the win was deserved and biased and non biased views on the big penalty call.</p> <p>And thoughts turn towards Sunday's Final and Suj wants to see England build a legacy...</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​</p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/re