      <description>Is it Coming Home? Suj and James review England's historic victory against Germany at Wembley and look forward to Saturday's encounter with Ukraine who overcame Sweden in extra time.
 The tactical dual at Wembley is covered, why Gareth Southgate's biggest gamble paid off but why it could be all change again in Rome.
 Plus, James gives early thoughts on his likely transfers in Euro Fantasy ahead of the quarter final and Suj has a strategy plan for his wildcard....
