      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>In Euro Fantasy it's Unlimited Transfers for all players heading into the last 16 but both Suj and James are on different strategies as James has used his Wildcard but Suj hasn't, so how different are their drafts ahead of the last 16?</p> <p>Strategy and thinking revealed, each tie predicted, captaincy plan for the 4 days ahead and there is an overview of the Fantasy assets that may be of interest from all 16 remaining nations...</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​</p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFVVRDUycGl5NFRDUXMxUkwzcEhmWjNTeXZxUXxBQ3Jtc0trQmZvMjJ0RWJRejZBQTFnNmhsUGJsaWZOZFd3NWtfaG55VFg5SF96RkFRcTF3X0VRcWo1b184SFEweFNYb3ItTFpuUVY1NmpZNEhmLUVtdktDc1F1djAwbEdMZU5hSERTNm1FWUFKX1pEZGpjQ21obw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fplanetfpl%2F%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU9LZ1hmOG9GMzhwNlp2aW9YZzVKdWdCX0hpZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuZW9XalN4UXJkMUh1cmxPWmFqSTAtQ2lvbXJHUnJGWkNwZmtHcU1tMUZUODZuaDhFbkJNM2Y0Q3ZKU3FEOUxSUEtwMUp2OWYxYXJjM3hsUDhiVGd1a19iZWluWlJBdWV6WWlmemtZTmdVTk1ZSFREcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2FPlanetFPL%2F%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
