    <item>
      <title>Group F Me! | Planet #FPL Do The Euros | Ep. 14</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/group-f-me-planet-fpl-do-the-euros-ep-14</link>
      <description>Suj and James review a chaotic final day of the Euro 2020 Group Stage as Spain mauled Slovakia, Poland almost came back from 2-0 down but eventually fell short against Sweden while there was chaos in Group F as the landscape changed several times with both Portugal and particularly Germany flirting with elimination as Hungary threatened a major shock.
 England now play Germany next Tuesday, there's first thoughts on the Wembley encounter, predictions for the last 16 and the players of interest for the knockout stage in Euro Fantasy... 
