      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Suj and James review a chaotic final day of the Euro 2020 Group Stage as Spain mauled Slovakia, Poland almost came back from 2-0 down but eventually fell short against Sweden while there was chaos in Group F as the landscape changed several times with both Portugal and particularly Germany flirting with elimination as Hungary threatened a major shock.</p> <p>England now play Germany next Tuesday, there's first thoughts on the Wembley encounter, predictions for the last 16 and the players of interest for the knockout stage in Euro Fantasy... </p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​