      <description>Suj and James reflect on last night's action at Euro 2020 as England clinched top spot in Group D after beating the Czech Republic but were the lads impressed, disappointed or somewhere in the middle about how The Three Lions played?
 Plus, the dream is over for Scotland, Ivan Perisic comes up trumps again for James in Euro Fantasy, tonight's Group E and F games are previewed and permutations for the knockout stage explained...
