    <item>
      <title>Auld Enemies | Planet #FPL Do The Euros | Ep. 10</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/auld-enemies-planet-fpl-do-the-euros-ep-10</link>
      <description>Suj and James review the 3 games played on Thursday in Euro 2020 as the match favourites Ukraine, Belgium and Holland all won, though for the Red Devils it was far from straightforward as Denmark gave them a big fright.
 The remaining Matchday 2 games are previewed including thoughts for the big clash at Wembley tonight between England and Scotland. There's thoughts on whether the wildcard will be needed or not for Matchday 3 in Euro Fantasy as the threat of mass rotation looms.
 And the Podcast concludes with the latest at the circus of Tottenham Hotspur with now no clarity on who the next manager will be... 
