    <item>
      <title>Here's To You Christian Eriksen | Planet #FPL Do The Euros | Ep. 06</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/heres-to-you-christian-eriksen-planet-fpl-do-the-euros-ep-06</link>
      <description>Suj and James review all the football from the opening 3 days of Euro 2020 as England start with a win, Italy and Belgium impress while Finland recorded victory on their major tournament debut. There's a deep tactical dive in to Italy, why there's no guarantee England will start with the same eleven on Friday against Scotland and implications for Euro Fantasy are discussed.
 But the weekend's football was overshadowed by events in Copenhagen and the Podcast begins with a discussion on Christian Eriksen and the heros who helped saved his life...
