    <item>
      <title>Flowers Of Scotland with @paulmcanulty1 | Planet #FPL Do The Euros | Ep. 03</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/flowers-of-scotland-with-paulmcanulty1-planet-fpl-do-the-euros-ep-03</link>
      <description>After a 23 year absence Scotland are finally back at a major international tournament. On this Podcast Suj &amp; James invite Paul McAnulty from the 3 for 1 Sky Fantasy Football Podcast to discuss Scotland's hopes for the Euros.
 Paul is lucky enough to have tickets for all of Scotland's Group games and recalls tales of travelling abroad to support his country, a catalogue of disappointments since the last qualification in 1998 and there is mutual agreement that home advantage shouldn't be overlooked and this Scotland squad is very capable of causing a surprise...
 You can follow Paul on Twitter @paulmcanulty1 https://twitter.com/paulmcanulty1
 James is also a guest on The FPL Happy Hour's 24th and final preview Podcast previewing England's hopes at The Euros https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PbZmw4WsLF0
 Our Euro 2020 mini league code is 64TZLYUG08 https://gaming.uefa.com/en/uefaeuro2020fantasyfootball/leagues/64TZLYUG08/0050006C0061006E00650074002000460050004C/James%20Linden
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 09 Jun 2021 11:15:00 -0000</pubDate>
