Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>After a 23 year absence Scotland are finally back at a major international tournament. On this Podcast Suj &amp; James invite Paul McAnulty from the 3 for 1 Sky Fantasy Football Podcast to discuss Scotland's hopes for the Euros.</p> <p>Paul is lucky enough to have tickets for all of Scotland's Group games and recalls tales of travelling abroad to support his country, a catalogue of disappointments since the last qualification in 1998 and there is mutual agreement that home advantage shouldn't be overlooked and this Scotland squad is very capable of causing a surprise...</p> <p>You can follow Paul on Twitter @paulmcanulty1 <a href="https://twitter.com/paulmcanulty1">https://twitter.com/paulmcanulty1</a></p> <p>James is also a guest on The FPL Happy Hour's 24th and final preview Podcast previewing England's hopes at The Euros <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PbZmw4WsLF0">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PbZmw4WsLF0</a></p> <p>Our Euro 2020 mini league code is 64TZLYUG08 <a href="https://gaming.uefa.com/en/uefaeuro2020fantasyfootball/leagues/64TZLYUG08/0050006C0061006E00650074002000460050004C/James%20Linden">https://gaming.uefa.com/en/uefaeuro2020fantasyfootball/leagues/64TZLYUG08/0050006C0061006E00650074002000460050004C/James%20Linden</a></p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYV