      <description>In the final featured Podcast of their season 4 content Suj &amp; James present a fun and factual quiz based on the FPL season that was.
 James is quizmaster, there are 50 questions and a possible 61 correct answers and Suj 'attempts' to get all the answers.
 And the Podcast ends with thanks to everyone for their support and a reminder that the content continues on Monday as the lads turn their focus towards Euro 2020 and there's full details of the Planet #FPL content plan all the way up to the beginning of the 2021/22 season.
