      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>In the final featured Podcast of their season 4 content Suj &amp; James present a fun and factual quiz based on the FPL season that was.</p> <p>James is quizmaster, there are 50 questions and a possible 61 correct answers and Suj 'attempts' to get all the answers.</p> <p>And the Podcast ends with thanks to everyone for their support and a reminder that the content continues on Monday as the lads turn their focus towards Euro 2020 and there's full details of the Planet #FPL content plan all the way up to the beginning of the 2021/22 season.</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​</