    <item>
      <title>Storytalha with @talha_nadeem_90 | Planet #SkyFF s.2 ep.42 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/storytalha-with-talha_nadeem_90-planet-skyff-s2-ep42-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the final season 2 Sky Fantasy Football Podcast of the season Suj &amp; James welcome Planet SkyFF mini league winner Talha Nadeem on to the Podcast to discuss his successful Sky Fantasy debut season where he finished 11th overall... and we discover that one different 50/50 call towards the end of the season could have led to Talha winning the whole game had he chosen a different path.
 We discuss learnings, what may be different next season, highs, lows &amp; Talha offers insights into Sky play and how he quickly picked up the game in his first season...
 You can follow Talha on Twitter @talha_nadeem_90 https://twitter.com/talha_nadeem_90
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our SkyFF community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
