      <description>Suj &amp; James welcome Planet #FPL Podcast 2020/21 mini league winner Dieter Minet to the Podcast to discuss his hugely successful FPL season where he finished 125th overall and 1st in Belgium!
 We find out that a template team can be successful in FPL but will Suj &amp; James learn from their mistakes and implement new learnings to their FPL management next season?
 Plus, there's a discussion on Belgium's chances of winning the Euros...
