      <title>Man City v Chelsea | C.O.T.C. with @FPLPringle &amp; @RotationFPL | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/man-city-v-chelsea-cotc-with-fplpringle-rotationfpl-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the final Clash of the Correspondents of the 2020/21 season James welcomes Manchester City correspondent Jonny Pringle and Chelsea correspondent Ted Maw to preview Saturday's Champions League Final.
 Likely line-ups, tactics, strengths, hopes, fears and weaknesses are all discussed ahead of Saturday's big game, plus the future including both club's possible search for a new forward and why a penalty shoot-out is so dreaded...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Man City Correspondent Jonny @FPLPringle https://twitter.com/FPLPringle
 Chelsea Correspondent Ted @RotationFPL https://twitter.com/RotationFPL
 ____________________________________________
