      <title>Ask James | Thu May 27th | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-thu-may-27th-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>In his first YouTube Live Stream for several weeks James answers questions from the YouTube community on a range of topics and discussion is dominating by strong rumours circulating that Mauricio Pochettino may be reappointed manager of Tottenham Hotspur...
 Plus, did Man Utd fail last night in the Europa League Final? Who should be cut from Gareth Southgate's England squad? Plus much more...
