      <title>What About Me? | Planet #SkyFF s.2 ep.41 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/what-about-me-planet-skyff-s2-ep41-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>With the 2020/21 Premier League season concluded Suj &amp; James review their Sky Fantasy Football season's and with the help of @FFstuff3's amazing statistical models discuss what led to James finishing with an overall rank of 30th but saw Suj back in the thousands.
 Lessons learned are discussed, pointers for next season, games likes and hates and why the feeling remains that a new player can win the game at the first attempt... but it's about to get tougher!
