      <description>With the Premier League season complete Suj &amp; James name their best and worst from the season, including manager of the year, player of the season, the best goal, the best assist and we laugh at some of the lowlights of the season including worst game, biggest flop and worst miss. 
 Plus the lads debate, argue and then ultimately agree at the end of the Podcast on a Premier League team of the season.
