    <item>
      <title>Leicester v Tottenham | C.O.T.C. with @AaronLagor &amp; @Rickysaunders77 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leicester-v-tottenham-cotc-with-aaronlagor-rickysaunders77-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the final Premier League Clash of the Correspondents of the season James welcomes Aaron Lagor and Ricky Saunders to discuss their clubs Leicester City and Tottenham Hotspur and the Gameweek 38 meeting at The King Power.
 We discuss Leicester's FA Cup triumph and their hopes for qualifying for the Champions League, the potential impact of Jonny Evans absence, if James Maddison offers FPL managers with with an alternative one week punt and is Kelechi Iheanacho the forward FPL players should target this week.
 Can Tottenham upset the Foxes and save their own hopes for European qualification, but do they even want it? Mourinho's exit, Daniel Levy, Harry Kane's future, the new manager hunt are all covered. Is Brendan Rodgers on the shortlist of candidates? And can Heung-Min Son and Harry Kane offer FPL managers final day goals or should they be sold?
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Leicester Correspondent Aaron @AaronLagor https://twitter.com/AaronLagor
 Tottenham Correspondent Ricky @Rickysaunders77 https://twitter.com/Rickysaunders77
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl​
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...​
 Visit our site: https://www.planetfpl.com​​​​​​​​​​​​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 22 May 2021 09:51:19 -0000</pubDate>
