    <item>
      <title>Fulham v Newcastle | C.O.T.C. with @TheTinkerMen &amp; @fpl_fitballer | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fulham-v-newcastle-cotc-with-thetinkermen-fpl_fitballer-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On the first of two Clash of the Correspondents Podcasts ahead of the GW38 deadline James welcomes Fulham correspondent Dara Curran and Newcastle correspondent Simon Bibby to preview Sunday's encounter at Craven Cottage.
 This threatened weeks ago to be a crucial final day decider but while many expected Fulham to push on and avoid the drop it is Newcastle who have improved the most over the last 8 Gameweeks.
 Ownership and manager issues at both clubs are discussed, expectations for next season and if there are any FPL gems we can consider for a one week punt...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Fulham Correspondent Dara @TheTinkerMen https://twitter.com/TheTinkerMen
 Newcastle Correspondent Si @fpl_fitballer https://twitter.com/fpl_fitballer
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl​
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...​
 Visit our site: https://www.planetfpl.com​​​​​​​​​​​​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
