    <item>
      <title>You Just Got Kane'd | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 48</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/you-just-got-kaned-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-48</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss the fallout from GW37, a week where fans returned, VAR controversies continued, popular FPL captain picks flopped and goalkeepers again caused carnage for FPL managers.
 All the games reviewed with thoughts focused on Sunday's final day with coverage on captaincy for GW38, why Bruno is expendable, final day punts, potential rotation and tactical thoughts.
 And Suj's West Ham qualify for Europe as James's Tottenham cock it up (again)....
 ____________________________________________
