    <item>
      <title>Game Over | Planet #SkyFF s.2 ep.40 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/game-over-planet-skyff-s2-ep40-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On the final Sky Fantasy Football Podcast of the season Suj &amp; James discuss final moves for those lucky enough to have remaining transfers and why they should be made tonight rather than waiting for the final day.
 Kane v Salah for tonight's captaincy and the final weekend discussed, differentials, options at Liverpool and West Ham covered, James tries to help Suj actually use the transfers he has left, lessons learned and more...
