    <item>
      <title>Hornets Buzz Again | The People's Poll ep. 73 with @6thGoal | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/hornets-buzz-again-the-peoples-poll-ep-73-with-6thgoal</link>
      <description>A week later than originally scheduled James welcomes Watford correspondent Stephen Toumi to the Podcast discuss to discuss Hornets promotion back to the Premier League and find out what has changed since relegation in 2019/20.  Strengths and weaknesses of the team are covered, the favoured formation, if star man Ismaila Sarr will stay, new names who may not be familiar now such as Francisco Sierralta and Joao Pedro but may be come August are covered.  We find out why Watford may be the best equipped of the promoted clubs to do well but will Xisco Munoz be given the chance to take the club forward when the Pozzo family are normally so quick to change the manager in charge?  You can follow our Watford correspondent Stephen on Twitter: https://twitter.com/6thGoal
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
