    <item>
      <title>Becker The Net | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 47</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/becker-the-net-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-47</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the football from Gameweek 36 that featured Free Hit madness for Suj as Man City dropped a shocker of a team, forwards were hauled off and misfired, Goalkeepers caused agony before one scored a heroic last minute winner!
 It seems like all FPL managers suffered this weekend with many popular picks disappointing!
 Punts and solutions discussed for the final two gameweeks including solutions for Diogo Jota owners, captaincy for the midweek fixtures debated and all the usual analysis from the weekend games included...
