      <description>With only hours to go before the Gameweek 36 deadline, Suj &amp; James discuss the 6 games played since Monday in the Premier League and discuss the fallout of FPL's Double Gameweek 35, a week where popular picks and even enablers went big with some managers hitting 100+ points and still got a red arrow.
 Best transfers are discussed for this weekend and with Suj on a Free Hit (hopefully he remembers to activate it!) the best options are all covered. James also reveals his -4 for today and plans for what to do once Gameweek 37 arrives.
