        <![CDATA[<p>With only hours to go before the Gameweek 36 deadline, Suj &amp; James discuss the 6 games played since Monday in the Premier League and discuss the fallout of FPL's Double Gameweek 35, a week where popular picks and even enablers went big with some managers hitting 100+ points and still got a red arrow.</p> <p>Best transfers are discussed for this weekend and with Suj on a Free Hit (hopefully he remembers to activate it!) the best options are all covered. James also reveals his -4 for today and plans for what to do once Gameweek 37 arrives.</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​