    <item>
      <title>8 Days To Go | Planet #SkyFF s.2 ep.39 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/8-days-to-go-planet-skyff-s2-ep39-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss strategies for the remaining 8 Gamedays and players to target for managers with both high and low transfer counts.
 Suj has 6 transfers left, should he steam into Everton and Liverpool assets?
 While for James with only 2 transfers left there's only 3 teams he can consider investing in.
 Plus a discussion on best captaincies for the gamedays left and which players are likely to perform best for the remainder of the season...
 ____________________________________________
