      <itunes:summary>On this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss strategies for the remaining 8 Gamedays and players to target for managers with both high and low transfer counts.
 Suj has 6 transfers left, should he steam into Everton and Liverpool assets?
