      <title>Picking England's Euro Squad | The People's Poll ep. 72 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/picking-englands-euro-squad-the-peoples-poll-ep-72-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>With England now permitted to call up 26 players players for Euro 2020 Suj &amp; James discuss both the squad they would pick for the summer and what they think Gareth Southgate's final selections may be.
 How many forwards should go?
 Are there any uncapped players who could be called up?
 Will Trent Alexander-Arnold make the final squad?
 What system is Southgate likely to play?
 And can England go all the way and win the trophy?
 ____________________________________________
