      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On today's Podcast Suj and James discuss the 9 games played so far in Treble Gameweek 35 and while it's been a good start for Suj it's not gone so well for James's FPL team...</p> <p>There's a discussion of what may be to come this week, the transfers in mind for the remaining Gameweeks and captaincy for Gameweek 36. Are there alternatives to Harry Kane and Mo Salah?</p> <p>In the review of the games, forwards put their hands up for FPL consideration including Newcastle's Callum Wilson who returned well at a lacklustre Leicester, why Leeds had too much for Tottenham, Eberechi Eze's adjusted role, why Sheffield United can still be targetted, how Everton were tactically superior to West Ham and there's a debate on if Mikel Arteta's Arsenal reign is coming to an end...</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...%E2%80%8B">https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...</a>​</p> <p>Follow James on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblctbFZFcEJEWEhYYVBjZXRKZTJPWFZSSVV2Z3xBQ3Jtc0tsTG54OVNadjBkczc2QjFwNG5vX2dTV1E3QjE0eHlfVjRYaWg2Uk9ENl9jZjhldy1lZk5QQWhqYVdWM0RFaUlyVGFQNFV3QjY5cFZsVUFfUFVKZWJxbC1ld1o1SlBVUXJ1VXJUX1hKbGF4YXJZTWM1Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2FPlanetFPLPod%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow Suj on Twitter: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFlOTdRMjlTQnJZemE3b0RaNkhSSnhPelM3d3xBQ3Jtc0tscGVIREdpMmRuRXl3d01hQnViY0xNUUlfdmxGRlhBazVZT2ZBSWlmYkhzZnI2bXU4S3NkOW0waExlNXJjU29maEM4OGNmbmViaGhJdWtQYTdaMTh1M1RPLTdBeFFrc203Nnk1NFBqV0ptQ0p4Q2RSaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.twitter.com%2Fsujanshah%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...</a>​</p> <p>Like us on Facebook: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFVVRDUycGl5NFRDUXMxUkwzcEhmWjNTeXZxUXxBQ3Jtc0trQmZvMjJ0RWJRejZBQTFnNmhsUGJsaWZOZFd3NWtfaG55VFg5SF96RkFRcTF3X0VRcWo1b184SFEweFNYb3ItTFpuUVY1NmpZNEhmLUVtdktDc1F1djAwbEdMZU5hSERTNm1FWUFKX1pEZGpjQ21obw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fplanetfpl%2F%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...</a>​</p> <p>Follow us on Instagram: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU9LZ1hmOG9GMzhwNlp2aW9YZzVKdWdCX0hpZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuZW9XalN4UXJkMUh1cmxPWmFqSTAtQ2lvbXJHUnJGWkNwZmtHcU1tMUZUODZuaDhFbkJNM2Y0Q3ZKU3FEOUxSUEtwMUp2OWYxYXJjM3hsUDhiVGd1a19iZWluWlJBdWV6WWlmemtZTmdVTk1ZSFREcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2FPlanetFPL%2F%E2%80%8B...%E2%80%8B">https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
