    <item>
      <title>Southampton v Crystal Palace | C.O.T.C. with @FPL_gaffer &amp; @Migtavius | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/southampton-v-crystal-palace-cotc-with-fpl_gaffer-migtavius-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Ahead of the Treble Gameweek James welcomes Southampton Correspondent Ali Mitchell and Crystal Palace correspondent Migtavius discuss the doubles for The Saints and The Eagles which includes a fixture against each other on Tuesday.
 The goalkeeper rotation between Forster &amp; McCarthy is covered but with Southampton having conceded 40 goals so far in 2021 can they even be trusted to keep clean sheets? Could Palace's Guaita ironically offer a solution?
 Ward Prowse vs Zaha is discussed, as are the prospects of Palace defenders Mitchell, Van Aanholt and Ward. Plus there's discussion about the impact on investing in either club beyond this gameweek, Hassenhuttl and Hodgson's futures get coverage and the Podcast features a dramatic conclusion... 
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Southampton correspondent Ali @FPL_gaffer https://twitter.com/FPL_gaffer
 Crystal Palace correspondent Mig @Migtavius https://twitter.com/Migtavius
 ____________________________________________
 Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl​
 Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/PlanetFPL?s...​
 Follow James on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/PlanetFPLPod​...​
 Follow Suj on Twitter: https://www.twitter.com/sujanshah​​​​...​
 Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/planetfpl/​​...​
 Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/PlanetFPL/​...​
 Visit our site: https://www.planetfpl.com​​​​​​​​​​​​...
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
