      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>James welcomes Chelsea correspondent Ted Maw and Arsenal correspondent Adam Pritchard to discuss all matters with their clubs ahead of Double Gameweek 35 including potential rotation headaches for FPL managers.</p> <p>Following on from reaching the Champions League Final Ted is in bullish mood but which Chelsea players does he believe are good choices heading into the blank?</p> <p>And what clues can we learn from Arsenal ahead of their European semi final tonight that may influence selection for their double? Is Adam confident ahead of the Villarreal tie?</p> <p>Plus, there's a discussion on the goalkeeping situation, centre-back rotation, assets that may appeal specifically for FPL managers on a Free Hit, a discussion on off field matters following the failed European Super League breakaway and thoughts on Manchester United assets ahead of their Treble Gameweek, could it actually be that Arsenal and Chelsea assets are the one's those should make way for United players in our teams?</p> <p>You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...</p> <p>Chelsea correspondent Ted @RotationFPL <a href="https://twitter.com/RotationFPL">https://twitter.com/RotationFPL</a></p> <p>Arsenal correspondent Adam @ThreeFiveWho <a href="https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho">https://twitter.com/ThreeFiveWho</a></p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Want to become a member of our FPL community? Join us on Patreon: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUNVcllOdUtQWThFbEltMzRyS2RMLWk1cVZnUXxBQ3Jtc0tudG4xRVBCRUJhbTE2ZGU3UHNYcFVZdU9WV1dCb2pMZlZsN0hHdVVlbzIyMFVzWERWSGRFY19ZMzhYWEV2aUdwZmVxOEJsVzJCSWpCSzhlOUVuMWhTMzJyYzFHQmJpZzhKeFNEYklJbEZtSmsxeGp0dw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fplanetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a>​</p> <p>You subscribe to our YouTube channel: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="