    <item>
      <title>A Wilful Mistake? | Planet #SkyFF s.2 ep.38 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/a-wilful-mistake-planet-skyff-s2-ep38-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss another low scoring Gameweek and for Suj there was some comical captain decisions!
 Permutations for a rearranged Manchester United v Liverpool fixture are discussed and there could be an impact on the Aston Villa v Everton and Newcastle v Manchester City single gamedays.
 Best captaincy choices for the week ahead are covered, Leicester exit points, the difficult in selling Man City assets, whether Bruno could be expendable, punting differentials such as Antonio and Bale and a run down of the best choices for Fulham v Burnley and Southampton v Crystal Palace.
 Plus James reveals his likely moves for his final 3 transfers.
 _____________________________________________
