    <item>
      <title>Star Wars | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 44</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/star-wars-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-44</link>
      <description>On this weeks feature Planet #FPL Podcast Suj &amp; James review all the Gameweek 34 action including Bale's stunning hat-trick in a week where points for FPL managers were hard to find.
 One major factor was the postponement of the Manchester United v Liverpool fixture and the Podcast begins with a discussion about Sunday's events at Old Trafford, why the protests won't stop and what the impact may be for FPL. Could it mean a Double Gameweek for Liverpool now in GW35?
 Much of the discussion focuses on next week's double and how rotation may again hurt FPL managers in the remaining four Gameweeks...
 ____________________________________________
 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Web: www.planetfpl.com
 Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)
 Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL
 Instagram: @planetfpl
 You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
