      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>On this weeks feature Planet #FPL Podcast Suj &amp; James review all the Gameweek 34 action including Bale's stunning hat-trick in a week where points for FPL managers were hard to find.</p> <p>One major factor was the postponement of the Manchester United v Liverpool fixture and the Podcast begins with a discussion about Sunday's events at Old Trafford, why the protests won't stop and what the impact may be for FPL. Could it mean a Double Gameweek for Liverpool now in GW35?</p> <p>Much of the discussion focuses on next week's double and how rotation may again hurt FPL managers in the remaining four Gameweeks...</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: <a href="http://www.youtube.com/planetfpl">www.youtube.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
