    <item>
      <title>Online Discrimination In Football | A Planet #FPL Special Podcast</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/online-discrimination-in-football-a-planet-fpl-special-podcast</link>
      <description>Over the weekend many in the football community boycotted social media accounts in protest against continued hate, discrimination and racism which continues to be seen on social media platforms.
 Will the silence have any impact on social media companies and could verification of accounts solve many of the issues seen on social media?
 There's discussion about exclusion of minority groups both in football and society, racism in the media, the mental impact on individuals who are abused, the progress that has been made but why there is a long way to go to erase discrimination from both social media platforms and football.
 ____________________________________________
 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
