    <item>
      <title>Burnley v West Ham | C.O.T.C. with @TurfyTopper &amp; @Fpl_SkyAddict | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/burnley-v-west-ham-cotc-with-turfytopper-fpl_skyaddict-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Burnley correspondent Jack Toner and West Ham correspondent Chris Stone to preview Monday's GW34 meeting at Turf Moor.
 After Chris Wood's hat-trick at Wolves the prospects of the New Zealander are discussed and if he is the perfect forward solution for FPL managers for the remainder of the season. Are The Clarets safe with a 9 point gap to Fulham? And we discuss some out of context Burnley performances, both good and bad.
 Can West Ham still finish top four? Can Jesse Lingard sustain his stunning form? Thoughts on how injuries have impacted The Hammers, why a return for Aaron Cresswell could be crucial to both defensive and offensive prospects and there's a differential debate in Dwight McNeil vs Jarrod Bowen.
 Plus Jack tries to sell James Tarkowski again!
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Burnley correspondent Jack @TurfyTopper
 West Ham correspondent @Fpl_SkyAddict
 ____________________________________________
 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Web: www.planetfpl.com
 Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)
 Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL
 Instagram: @planetfpl
 You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
