      <description>On this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James look back and laugh at a weekend that was mainly a winner for Differential seekers &amp; in this template game that won't have been many people!
 The decisions made to invest in Leicester assets last Thursday and if they were correct are reviewed, plus there's a look forward to weekend captaincy this weekend, why it's probably best for the majority of managers to do nothing and what plans are for the looming single gamedays such as Fulham v Burnley...
