      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/got-wood-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-43</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the 8 Premier League games played in GW33 and assess the fallout with only 5 FPL gameweeks to go!
 Is Bruno Fernandes really expendable despite a potential GW35 Double?
 Is Diogo Jota on the chopping block after several misses at the weekend?
 Are there good captaincy alternatives to Harry Kane this coming weekend?
 Plus, there's a look at 2021's outstanding FPL performers so far, upcoming Double &amp; Blank Gameweek possibilities are assessed and have the likes of Matheus Pereira, Chris Wood &amp; Wilfried Zaha shown enough to warrant inclusion in our FPL teams?
