    <item>
      <title>The 50+1 Rule | The People's Poll ep. 71 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-501-rule-the-peoples-poll-ep-71-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>In Germany Bundesliga clubs adhere to a ownership model know as the 50+1 rule that means fans have a significant say in the running of a football club.
 We discuss the positives and negatives of ownership in Germany and if the model could be introduced to clubs in England and what it may mean in the future for fans, ownership &amp; competitiveness on the pitch...
 ____________________________________________
