    <item>
      <title>Leeds v Man Utd | C.O.T.C. with @fpl_tactician &amp; @ismyCAPplaying | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leeds-v-man-utd-cotc-with-fpl_tactician-ismycapplaying-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Leeds United correspondent Andy Martin and Manchester United correspondent Gary Robinson on to this week's Clash of the Correspondents ahead of the Gameweek 33 meeting between the two clubs.
 The conversation begins with a powerful discussion between three fans about the failed attempt to form a European Super League and why competitive football remains so important.
 Plus, there's discussion on the rivalry that exists between the clubs and FPL dilemmas discussed including the prospects of Leeds assets such as Dallas, Raphina &amp; Bamford for the run-in, Cavani versus Greenwood and whether we would captain Bruno Fernandes again this season. Is United's talisman expendable?
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Leeds correspondent Andy @fpl_tactician
 Man Utd correspondent Gary @ismyCAPplaying
 ____________________________________________
