      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/am-i-madd-planet-skyff-s2-ep36-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>On this weeks Sky Fantasy Football... James is up to 23rd, is he back in the race for the big prize or is it too little too late?
 Fixture implications of the FA Cup semi final results are discussed and despite being blind to the May TV fixtures and it has opened up some potentially very naughty single gameday possibilities.
 Plus, tomorrow is the day to invest in Leicester but where is best to go. Key assets are highlighted and is there a case to sell Bruno Fernandes and Harry Kane?
