    <item>
      <title>Norwich Are Back | The People's Poll ep. 70 with @fpl_badger</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/norwich-are-back-the-peoples-poll-ep-70-with-fpl_badger</link>
      <description>James catches up with Norwich City correspondent Mark Hammond to discuss the Canaries successful promotion back to the Premier League at the first attempt.  We discuss what's changed since The Canaries were relegated and why this Norwich with a similiar squad and the same manager may be very different to the one that went down.  Will Daniel Farke be given funds to improve the squad and is the German he right man to take The Canaries forward? Familiar names in Aarons, Buendia, Cantwell and Pukki are debated... but will they all stay?  Plus, the Premier League player on loan who has starred at Carrow Road and Mark shares his experience of attending football during covid...
 You can follow Mark on Twitter @fpl_badger
 ____________________________________________
