    <item>
      <title>Jose &amp; The Franchise | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 41</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/jose-the-franchise-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-41</link>
      <description>In this much anticipated Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss a 24 hours like no other where the formation of the European Super League was announced and Jose Mourinho was sacked by Tottenham Hotspur.
 Will the Super League happen? Can it be allowed to happen? And what are the consequences for the 'Big 6' who have signed up to join this newly formed competition? Is it actually possible that they could be thrown out of the Premier League?
 And is James happy now that Mourinho is gone? What does it mean for the rest of Tottenham's season and the future?
 Plus, the Podcast begins with a review of the 5 games played so far in Gameweek 32 and what the impact of the FA cup results means for FPL managers loking to manage strategy for a possible Double Gameweek 35 and Blank Gameweek 36...
 ____________________________________________
