    <item>
      <title>Spur Of The Moment | The People's Poll ep. 69 with @RIckysaunders77 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/spur-of-the-moment-the-peoples-poll-ep-69-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Tottenham correspondent Ricky Saunders to discuss Jose Mourinho, Daniel Levy, the prospect of Harry Kane leaving in the summer and Tottenham FPL assets ahead of their Double Gameweek.
 Why is it so bad for Tottenham fans under Mourinho?
 Is Daniel Levy at fault for Tottenham's recent decline?
 Or should Tottenham fans be happy with a top 4 finish (though unlikely) still possible and a domestic Cup Final only 9 days away? 
 Could Kane stay? Is Heung-Min Son the more likely to leave?
 Who is the third best Tottenham FPL asset for DGW32?
 How many Tottenham players can be trusted to play both games in the double?
 Plus James has some news about the Carabao Cup Final in this heart to heart chat between two fans who love their club...
 You can following Ricky on Twitter @Rickysaunders77
 ____________________________________________
