      <title>Lingard On Ice | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 40</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/lingard-on-ice-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-40</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the action from Gameweek 31 and with Wildcards played review what they may have done differently.
 James makes his feelings clear on Tottenham assets ahead of their upcoming Double Gameweek while Suj delights in another squeeky bum win for West Ham for West Ham which featured another starring role for Jesse Lingard; but he's not the only Hammer creating interest for FPL managers...
 Plus, looking ahead at captaincy in future Gameweeks, Leicester's fixture swing begins, rotation fears for clubs and assets still competing in Europe and every club assessed including a more pragmatic Leeds and why Burnley games continue to be open.
