      <title>Wldcard Draft | A Planet #FPL Special</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wldcard-draft-a-planet-fpl-special</link>
      <description>With hours remaining until the #FPL deadline Suj &amp; James are on Wildcard and confirm their final drafts (subject to final team news).
 Which of the premiums make it in?
 How big a part will the fixture swing play in the final selections?
 What is the impact of Tottenham's double in GW32 and their Blank in GW33.
 Is consideration given to potential blank and double Gameweeks late in the season?
 Plus James details the 7 teams who can't double if there is a Double Gameweek 35 or will blank if there is a Blank Gameweek 36 and why the doubles or blanks that could happen are not overly attractive... 
