      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>With hours remaining until the #FPL deadline Suj &amp; James are on Wildcard and confirm their final drafts (subject to final team news).</p> <p>Which of the premiums make it in?</p> <p>How big a part will the fixture swing play in the final selections?</p> <p>What is the impact of Tottenham's double in GW32 and their Blank in GW33.</p> <p>Is consideration given to potential blank and double Gameweeks late in the season?</p> <p>Plus James details the 7 teams who can't double if there is a Double Gameweek 35 or will blank if there is a Blank Gameweek 36 and why the doubles or blanks that could happen are not overly attractive... </p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: <a href="http://www.youtube.com/planetfpl">www.youtube.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
