    <item>
      <title>Wild Things| Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 39</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wild-things-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-39</link>
      <description>Suj and James review all the action from a largely entertaining weekend of football that included West Brom hitting five at Chelsea, a Sunday full of comebacks and West Ham getting into the top 4.
 And James has activated his wildcard! Will Suj be joining him as the big fixture swing comes in to play for Arsenal, Chelsea, Leicester, Liverpool and Wolves. But 4 of the 5 were beaten at home this weekend... is there still confidence to trust their assets?
 Plus the players under consideration for all the clubs, Mourinho's 'same coach, different players' quote, the pros and cons of owning Bruno Fernandes and plenty more...
