    <item>
      <title>Crystal Palace v Chelsea | C.O.T.C. with @Migtavius &amp; @RotationFPL | #CRYCHE | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/crystal-palace-v-chelsea-cotc-with-migtavius-rotationfpl-cryche-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this weeks Clash of the Correspondents James is joined by Migtavius &amp; Ted Maw to discuss Saturday's London Derby at Selhurst Park between Crystal Palace &amp; Chelsea.
 We discuss the future for Palace, how consistency against bottom half teams has kept them away from trouble and if with a tough run-in to come there are any Palace assets that should be considered for FPL.
 Plus, we discuss what went wrong for Chelsea against West Brom, why investing in Chelsea's attacking players for FPL doesn't look appealing but why one particular defender stands and rotation concerns with The Blues still in the Champions League &amp; FA Cup
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Crystal Palace correspondent Mig @Migtavius
 Chelsea correspondent Ted @RotationFPL
 ____________________________________________
