    <item>
      <title>Arsenal v Liverpool | C.O.T.C. with @ThreeFiveWho &amp; @FPL_LocoLord | #ARSLIV | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/arsenal-v-liverpool-cotc-with-threefivewho-fpl_locolord-arsliv-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>It's a Big 6 meeting on the fourth and final Clash of The Correspondents of the International break as James welcomes Adam Pritchard and Dan Lord to discuss their clubs Arsenal &amp; Liverpool.
 Ahead of the meeting between the two clubs in GW30 both find themselves currently outside the top 6 and with both still in Quarter Finals in European competition is there a danger that their league campaigns will be sacrificed in a bid for glory in Europe?
 And what does it mean for FPL managers? Both clubs have brilliant fixtures following Saturday's meeting between the two but who will survive likely rotation in the coming weeks? The prospects of Tierney, Saka, Aubameyang, Alexander-Arnold, Jota and Salah are all discussed...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Arsenal correspondent Adam @ThreeFiveWho
 Liverpool correspondent Dan @FPL_LocoLord
 ____________________________________________
 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
