    <item>
      <title>Champions League Revamp | The People's Poll ep. 67 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/champions-league-revamp-the-peoples-poll-ep-67-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Over the next week or so UEFA are expected to announce changes to the format of the Champions League from 2024, which will see an increase from 32 clubs to 36 and an overhaul of the current Group Stage.
 Suj &amp; James explain how this will work, with clubs guaranteed 10 games in the competition, why it will make the rich stronger and what is the impact to the Premier League and domestic Cup competitions. Where will the extra 4 places come from? Could the Premier League have 6 entrants in the Champions League come 2024?
 Plus, changes to European competitions for next season are discussed including the introduction of The UEFA Europa Conference League...
 ____________________________________________
