    <item>
      <title>I Did It By Accident | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 38</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/i-did-it-by-accident-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-38</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James assess the fallout from a mainly entertaining Blank Gameweek 29, covering the 4 games and 8 teams who played, what affected the outcomes and where is our interest in those teams going forward.
 But first James details the potential for blanks and doubles for the rest of the season. What is the impact of the FA cup Results? Where will the scheduled Aston Villa v Everton &amp; Tottenham v Southampton fixtures go? Will GW32 have doubles? And why we could yet see a repeat Blank Gameweek with only 8 teams playing, followed by a double Gameweek where 12 teams double...
 Plus we confirm the Snail is invincible! What's next for Gareth Bale and praise for Leicester...
 ____________________________________________
