      <description>After much speculation on Friday it was confirmed on Saturday that Sheffield United and Chris Wilder had parted ways by mutual consent. James welcomes Blades correspondent Ben 'Tommo' Thompson on to the Podcast to discuss Wilder's successful reign at Bramall Lane, why the end has caused so much distress for fans, if it really was mutual consent and what might be next for The Blades with relegation almost a certainty...
 You can follow Tommo on Twitter @FPL_Blade
