    <item>
      <title>Killer Snails | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 37</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/killer-snails-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-37</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss the 9 games from the weekend in GW28 including Tottenham's woeful defeat at Arsenal, system changes for Brighton and Man City and Burnley's excellent win at Everton.
 There's detailed discussion on all eight teams playing in the upcoming Blank Gameweek 29 and assets that would interest both Free Hitters and those making transfers for the upcoming week and beyond. Plus why caution is still urged on binning Everton assets, when a -4 is and isn't worth it, specifically for the week ahead, why Suj expects West Ham to revert to a back four at the weekedn and James lets rip on Tottenham's failures in the North London Derby but does have praise for Arsenal too.
