    <item>
      <title>Arsenal v Tottenham | C.O.T.C. with @ThreeFiveWho &amp; @Rickysaunders77 | #ARSTOT | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/arsenal-v-tottenham-cotc-with-threefivewho-rickysaunders77-arstot-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>An extended and different Clash of the Correspondents this week as James welcomes Arsenal correspondent Adam Pritchard &amp; Tottenham correspondent Ricky Saunders to preview Sunday's North London Derby at The Emirates and take a deeper look into the rivalry between the two clubs.
 We discuss the evolution of the Derby in the 21st century as Tottenham have closed the gap between the two clubs, but are Arsenal still the bigger club based on on field success? There's a discussion about the experience of the derby, why it's not enjoyable, what's happening at board level, the impact of the stadiums moves and thoughts on Mikel Arteta and Jose Mourinho. 
 Plus, we discuss the strengths and weaknesses within both squads, why both clubs are underperforming and the FPL assets under consideration including Aubameyang and Bale...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Arsenal correspondent Adam @ThreeFiveWho
 Tottenham correspondent Ricky @Rickysaunders77
 ____________________________________________
