      <description>On this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss the difficulty for Sky managers heading into a period where the clarity on fixtures ends and in just over a week may all being blind when planning ahead.
 Plus, the captaincy and planned transfers for the week ahead discussed including plans for the single gamedays on Friday and Monday, why Arsenal, Brighton, Tottenham and West Ham assets should be on radar come Sunday, why the likes of Vestergaard, Calvert-Lewin &amp; Watkins should be kept on side in our planning and the surprise name at the top of the scoring charts since Overhaul
