      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the weekend action for Gameweek 27 and it was a difficult weekend for many Fantasy managers. But it wasn't all bad as Bruno Fernandes returned and Harry Kane hauled for the template.
 The forgotten Gameweek 28 to come is assessed and it could be a good week for the maverick pick with not many standout captaincy options, plus should owners invest in Gareth Bale with the Welshman now in form? James identifies an interesting 4.3 prospect, outstanding Fulham reviewed and there is a deep tactical analysis of how United beat City at The Etihad.  
