      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/football-index-scandal-the-peoples-poll-ep-66-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Over the weekend the Football Index market crashed with shares tumbling, dividends restructured and many traders crippled financially by the changes.
 Suj &amp; James look into what has happened, if Football Index was a scam to make money all along? Why Traders feel guilt and distress, the deception of Football Index, if the Gambling Commission can take action against FI and what's next for the company and traders
