    <item>
      <title>19 Blanks | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 35</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/19-blanks-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-35</link>
      <description>Well that didn't go as planned! Following on from their Podcast on Monday Suj &amp; James review the final 8 gameweeks of what ultimately proved to be an underwhelming Gameweek 26 for the majority of FPL managers.
 There's another double to come immediately however and focus turns to which Manchester City asset is best for the captaincy in GW27. Can we read anything into Guardiola's potential selection for games against Manchester United &amp; Southampton.
 Plus, among the topics covered there's discussion on Liverpool's crisis, Everton's flexible tactics, Tottenham's pressing problem, why James is selling Bruno Fernandes, the prospect of the Villa-Everton GW28 Double still happening and why Arsenal &amp; Wolves are soon to be on manager's watchlist.... 
 ____________________________________________
