    <item>
      <title>West Ham v Leeds | C.O.T.C. with @Fi_FplAddict123 &amp; @fpl_tactician | #WHULEE | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/west-ham-v-leeds-cotc-with-fi_fpladdict123-fpl_tactician-whulee-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>As focus now moves from the Double Gameweek towards the Blank in GW29 James welcome West Ham correspondent Chris Stone &amp; Leeds correspondent Andy Martin to discuss their clubs as both play in the blank and meet each other on Monday at the London Stadium.
 Can West Ham really qualify for the Champions League? We discuss tactical set ups and the solid defence that means there are 4 Hammers defensively that can be considered for FPL. Plus we discuss the impact of Lingard, the reliability of Soucek and the consistency of Antonio.  
 And are Leeds better suited to playing away as they do this week and again during the Blank Gameweek? We discuss pitch problems, crazy predictions and why Dallas, Raphinha and Bamford are still the go to FPL choices from Elland Road.
 Plus, we discuss Phillips v Rice for a place in the England team &amp; lots more...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 West Ham correspondent Chris @Fi_FplAddict123
 Leeds correspondent Andy @fpl_tactician
 ____________________________________________
 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Web: www.planetfpl.com
 Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)
 Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL
 Instagram: @planetfpl
 You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
