    <item>
      <title>Are PL Referees Rubbish? | The People's Poll ep. 63 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/are-pl-referees-rubbish-the-peoples-poll-ep-63-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>There is more scrutiny than ever on decisions made by referees in the Premier League and on this Podcast Suj &amp; James debate whether refeereing standards in the Premier League are at an all time low.
 What do we think of the likes of Mike Dean, Lee Mason, Andre Marriner, Michael Oliver? Do we believe VAR has impacted decision making of our refs? Plus, we discuss the human nature of refereeing, laws that aren't aiding officials and the prospect of what may happen in the future including being able to hear referee's conversation, something that already happens elsewhere... 
