Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>In the first of two Podcasts reviewing all the Double Gameweek 26 action Suj &amp; James discuss their FPL weekeneds &amp; the big talking points from the 9 games plahyed so far in FPL's biggest ever Gameweek!</p> <p>Disappointment for many Bench Boosters as Leeds were beaten by Villa but it's also been an underwhelming start for many Triple Captainers too with only Harry Kane from the popular selections returning and his 6 point return could well have been more. But the Tottenham forward was outshone on the day by Heung-Min Son &amp; a starring performance from Gareth Bale. Bale is discussed heavily and there's caution stressed as well as praise delivered.</p> <p>Plus, why Arsenal got their tactics spot on at Leicester, why Man Utd's big games aren't producing goals, West Ham's unfortunate defeat at Man City &amp; important points on those battling the drop all covered as eyes focus towards the Blank weekend of Gameweek 29.</p> <p>______________________________________________</p> <p>Patreon: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;redir_token=FanmfjjICom5fhH_-zsIxFySgkd8MTU5MjQ3OTE1NUAxNTkyMzkyNzU1&amp;event=video_description&amp;v=VZljXHKfJzw">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
