      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/whos-best-to-triple-captain-the-peoples-poll-ep-62-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James assess the possibilities for use of the Triple Captain Chip in FPL ahead of the biggest Gameweek of the season and cover a wide open race for captaincy in DGW26.
 Premium, template &amp; differential options all discussed including historical data versus next weeks opponents including Vardy's stunning record against Arsenal, why a City defensive captain shouldn't be ruled out, Bruno v Salah, KDB v Sterling, Watkins v Calvert-Lewin &amp; Kane v Son all discussed.
 Plus, alternatives for those on Bench Boost, when the rearranged Villa v Everton &amp; Tottenham v Southampton fixtures could take place, future potential to use the Chip &amp; James reveals why he'll be backing Harry Kane...
