      <title>One Minute Late | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 33</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/one-minute-late-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-33</link>
      <description>With the first 9 fixtures of DGW25 Suj &amp; James review the fallout from a weekend that started with a bang Friday night with the incredible fixture announcement one minute after the FPL deadline had passed and the trolling continued for managers with the bizarre start Meslier own goal that cost Leeds assets points...
 We discuss planned moves for the blockbuster 17 fixture Double Gameweek 26, how Everton won at Anfield for the first time in 21 years, why Leicester may be overlooked despite impressing again, tactical analysis, why the 2 unscheduled fixtures could be played &amp; Suj is all smiles after his West Ham beat James' Tottenham in Sunday's Planet FPL Derby 
