      <title>Ask James | YouTube Live Stream Fri Feb 19th | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-youtube-live-stream-fri-feb-19th-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this weeks Ask James YouTube live stream James urges calm about the lack of Double Gameweek 26 fixtures but suggests for those on a wildcard now it's time to consider contingencies to an intended Bench Boost plan.
 Plus, Leeds &amp; Southampton assets considered ahead of this weeks Double, captaincy debated, why Bamford will be best for many but not for others, Tottenham's performance last night assessed, plus all the team news &amp; James reveals the transfer he made last night....
