    <item>
      <title>Wolves v Leeds | C.O.T.C. with @parker_bradley &amp; @fpl_tactician | #WOLLEE | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/wolves-v-leeds-cotc-with-parker_bradley-fpl_tactician-wollee-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Wolves correspondent Bradley Parker &amp; Leeds correspondent Andy Martin to discuss their clubs and the Friday night DGW25 meeting at Molineux.
 We discuss disappointment with Wolves this season, the absence of Jimenez, the potential of Neto, altering formations, pressure on Nuno Santo &amp; if any assets can appeal should Wolves have a double in GW26.
 And with Leeds doubling this Gameweek we talk captaincy potential of Bamford and Raphinha, if alternatives to Dallas should be considered and teams which can benefit Leeds offensively and others that can damage them defensively.
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Wolves correspondent Bradley @parker_bradley
 Leeds correspondent Andy @fpl_tactician
