    <item>
      <title>Goalkeepers Are Like Horses | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 32</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/goalkeepers-are-like-horses-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-32</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the 10 games played so far in Double Gameweek 24 and discuss the fallout that affects their transfer thinking for the weeks to come...
 Why are Fantasy managers asking after Tottenham defenders after 1 clean sheet in 12? Should we be concerned about Aston Villa's performances &amp; Southampton's form? Can Fulham yet put a run together to stay up?
 There's further discussions on strategy planning, tactics, DGW25 captaincy, awareness of future Gameweeks, the Bruno &amp; Salah conundrum, why patience this week is important, why Suj compares Goalkeepers to Horses &amp; plenty more...
