      <title>Strategy &amp; Chips | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 31</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/strategy-chips-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-31</link>
      <description>With the FA Cup results now known Suj &amp; James have a clear understanding of the outlook for fixtures andtt discuss permutations for Blank &amp; Double Gameweeks and we could have 5 consecutive Doubles ahead of a blank with only 4 fixtures.
 So what's the best way to play?
 Will GW26 be the biggest gameweek &amp; best time to Bench Boost?
 What week looks best for the Triple captaincy chip?
 We look at different scenarios for using a 2nd Wildcard &amp; the Free Hit Chip, plus the teams we want to target in the short and medium term, captaincy overview for the next 6 Gameweeks &amp; plenty more...
