      <title>Chelsea v Newcastle | C.O.T.C. with @RotationFPL &amp; @fpl_fitballer | #CHENEW | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chelsea-v-newcastle-cotc-with-rotationfpl-fpl_fitballer-chenew-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Chelsea correspondent Ted Maw &amp; Newcastle correspondent Simon Bibby to preview the GW24 Monday night meeting at Stamford Bridge.
 What has Ted made about Thomas Tuchel's start at Chelsea? We discuss the pros and cons of Chelsea in a back three, the struggle to score goals countering the clean sheets we're currently seeing and we cover the current headache facing FPL managers who own Reece Jamers or Ben Chilwell.
 And how does Si feel about the evolution of 'Bruceyball', we touch on ownership, altering tactics, the influence of new coach Graeme Jones, an interesting defensive option has developed &amp; we congratulate Miguel Almiron on lots of things...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Chelsea correspondent Ted @RotationFPL
 Newcastle correspondent Si @fpl_fitballer
 ____________________________________________
 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
 Web: www.planetfpl.com
 Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)
 Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL
 Instagram: @planetfpl
 You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
