      <description>It's Overhaul time! Suj &amp; James reveal their current thoughts, and it could be as many as seven Man City players for James subject to the FA Cup results today &amp; tomorrow, while Suj is of course winging it as usual!
 We look at potential fixture changes, those awkward captaincy days coming up, why Villa, Everton, Leeds &amp; Southampton are important in our thinking, going without Kane or Salah, all the players under consideration &amp; why this Overhaul is different to previous years... 
