    <item>
      <title>His Wife Must Love Him | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 30</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/his-wife-must-love-him-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-30</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the 9 games played so far in GW23 and focus now turns towards upcoming Gameweeks &amp; the key message is not to make any early moves until the FA Cup ties are completed.
 Has Suj given up on his FPL season? The brilliant Phil Foden was among the players sitting on his bench while the Fulham-West Ham encounter could have caused James to have a car crash of a week, but 3 players saved the Gameweek for him.
 Double permutations discussed, why single Gameweek plaers shouldn't be ignored, United's front 3, Kane's return, early thoughts for captaincy in DGW24, Twitter Qs &amp; more including the 7 players shortlisted who James might buy from a team who don't have a double this week &amp; the double that could see James play the Triple captain chip in GW26...
 _____________________________________________
