        <![CDATA[<p>Suj &amp; James review the 9 games played so far in GW23 and focus now turns towards upcoming Gameweeks &amp; the key message is not to make any early moves until the FA Cup ties are completed.</p> <p>Has Suj given up on his FPL season? The brilliant Phil Foden was among the players sitting on his bench while the Fulham-West Ham encounter could have caused James to have a car crash of a week, but 3 players saved the Gameweek for him.</p> <p>Double permutations discussed, why single Gameweek plaers shouldn't be ignored, United's front 3, Kane's return, early thoughts for captaincy in DGW24, Twitter Qs &amp; more including the 7 players shortlisted who James might buy from a team who don't have a double this week &amp; the double that could see James play the Triple captain chip in GW26...</p> <p>_____________________________________________</p> <p>Patreon: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;redir_token=FanmfjjICom5fhH_-zsIxFySgkd8MTU5MjQ3OTE1NUAxNTkyMzkyNzU1&amp;event=video_description&amp;v=VZljXHKfJzw">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
