    <item>
      <title>Kittens &amp; Bananas | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 29</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/kittens-bananas-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-29</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review the 9 games played so far in GW22 as template managers score big but largely cancel each other out because everyone else did too! It's a red arrow for Suj on 72 &amp; possibly a red arrow for James after Tottenham-Chelsea with 76! So how do we change that and how easy is it to do so?
 Plus, how Saints were hit for nine again, why Newcastle games might be high scoring in the near future, Jesse Lingard forces Suj to eat a bit of humble pie and Liverpool are beaten at home again, this time by Brighton and it was no fluke.
 Targets for GW23 and beyond assesed, a look at the fixtures that may happen in GW29 that we can't see and Twitter Questions covered which include some answers that give us our Pod title...
 _____________________________________________
 Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl
