      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Suj &amp; James review the 9 games played so far in GW22 as template managers score big but largely cancel each other out because everyone else did too! It's a red arrow for Suj on 72 &amp; possibly a red arrow for James after Tottenham-Chelsea with 76! So how do we change that and how easy is it to do so?</p> <p>Plus, how Saints were hit for nine again, why Newcastle games might be high scoring in the near future, Jesse Lingard forces Suj to eat a bit of humble pie and Liverpool are beaten at home again, this time by Brighton and it was no fluke.</p> <p>Targets for GW23 and beyond assesed, a look at the fixtures that may happen in GW29 that we can't see and Twitter Questions covered which include some answers that give us our Pod title...</p> <p>_____________________________________________</p> <p>Patreon: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;redir_token=FanmfjjICom5fhH_-zsIxFySgkd8MTU5MjQ3OTE1NUAxNTkyMzkyNzU1&amp;event=video_description&amp;v=VZljXHKfJzw">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
