      <description>On this week's Ask James Live Stream topics include Harry Kane replacements, scenarios where it is and isn't worth a -4 for a transfer (for many that will mean judging it on one Gameweek), what Tottenham are likely to do in Kane's absence but what James would like to see done differently.
 Plus, benching headaches, an update on the prospects for the future Double &amp; Blank Gameweeks, what can influence what goes where, where it went so wrong for Tottenham in the defeat to Liverpool last night &amp; captaincy looks wide open for everyone this week...
