      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/gundogging-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-27</link>
      <description>With only Tottenham v Liverpool remaining in GW20 Suj &amp; James review the fallout from the 9 fixtures played so far in the Gameweek as Man Utd suffer a shock defeat to Sheffield Utd, Man City get five at West Brom and budget midfielders go nuts.
 It's been a good week for both but now they need to add more Man City to their squads, what are their plans and can James talk Suj out of a shock use of the 2nd wildcard?
 Plus, the exciting differential at Everton, why Villa continue to interest and consciousness of potential upcoming Double Gameweeks...
