        <![CDATA[<p>Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest in Sky Fantasy as Cancelo delights captainers with his haul at Man City &amp; it's a case of what could have been, particularly for James.</p> <p>Captaincy for the week ahead is discussed, why Chelsea, Leeds &amp; Tottenham are worth maintaining interest in, whether it's worth piling in even more Man City assets, the impact of FA Cup results on fixtures and why come Overhaul there may be a bigger split in selectiosn than we may anticipate....</p> <p>_____________________________________________</p> <p>Patreon: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;redir_token=FanmfjjICom5fhH_-zsIxFySgkd8MTU5MjQ3OTE1NUAxNTkyMzkyNzU1&amp;event=video_description&amp;v=VZljXHKfJzw">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
