      <description>In their second feature Podcast of the week assessing the Double Gameweek 19 matches Suj &amp; James assess all the action since Monday as Leicester close in on the top, United come from behind away to win again, City &amp; Villa put on a show &amp; Burnley end Liverpool's 45 month unbeaten home record.
 But the Pod starts with an assessment of the best Kevin De Bruyne replacements with The belgian superstar ruled out for 4-6 weeks &amp; during the Podcast it becomes apparent he's not the only big name likely on the shelf for a while... Vard Luck if you have both!
