    <item>
      <title>Dagger To The Heart | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 24</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/dagger-to-the-heart-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-24</link>
      <description>With less than 24 hours until the deadline for the big Double Gameweek 19 Suj &amp; James review a very low scoring Blank Gameweek 18, a Gameweek where James successfully deployed his Free Hit for a score of 62 but Suj... well Suj forgot to play it! Suj discusses how it happened, how he feels now &amp; what it means for his strategy now.
 Plus, when to and when not to Bench Boost in DGW19 &amp; it looks like both are going to go for it despite owning Single Gameweek players but could this also be the best week to use the Triple Captain Chip...? Transfer targets identified, who's safe &amp; who's not for the Double &amp; plenty more...
