    <item>
      <title>Taking The Biscuit | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 23</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/taking-the-biscuit-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-23</link>
      <description>Hot off the announcement that Tottenham will now host Fulham in Blank Gameweek 18 &amp; not travel to Aston Villa on Wednesday Suj &amp; James detail their thoughts &amp; planning ideas ahead of tomorrow's 430pm (UK) deadline.
 Will Suj now be forced into a Free Hit? How many Tottenham for James in his thoughts?
 On the agenda Free Hit 18 vs Wildacrd 18, is this Gameweek now clearly a better choice for the Free Hit than Gamewwek 29 when other fixtures will be postponed due to FA cup commitments?
 Plus, the 4-way battle for captaincy in the upcoming Gameweek &amp; plenty more including why Aston Villa could play 3 times in GW19 but might not even play at all. 
 _____________________________________________
