      <description>With Blank Gameweek 18 &amp; Double Gameweek 19 around the corner Suj &amp; James review all the action from Gameweek 17 as concern builds for the form of Liverpool &amp; Mohammed Salah having been beaten last night at Southampton.
 Plus, City give a performance at Chelsea that makes FPL managers take notice, while Man Utd's big win against Villa means their aim should now be the title.
 Form, fixtures, rotation and those absent at the weekend all get coverage, plus the Podcast opens with a discussion about the viability of a Gameweek 18 wildcard...
