      <description>On this week's Ask James Live Stream which was recorded on the evening of New Year's Eve James begins with up to date team news ahead of Friday's 4pm (UK) GW17 deadline &amp; then details his updated plans for chips &amp; strategy with Burnley v Man Utd (GW18) &amp; Man City v Aston Villa (GW19) now known rescheduled fixtures.
