      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss all the latest issues in Sky Fantasy Football &amp; the biggest of all will be will games even take place!? 
 James details his disastrous yet unlucky moves on Monday and what he intends to do now that he has 3 Man City players and with the prospect of them not playing again this coming weekend.
 Kane vs Salah for captaincy is debated plus weekend captaincies discussed, the issue with punting Jamie Vardy on Sunday, when rearranged games could be played &amp; Sky awarding points late after the event... 
