      <description>James welcomes Leicester correspondent Aaron Lagor &amp; Manchester United correspondent Gary Robinson to preview the #GW15 Boxing Day meeting between the two teams at the King Power.
 Can either make a sustained title challenge after important wins in GW14? We talk tactics, Leicester with a back four or back five, Paul Pogba's role at United &amp; with both clubs having a Double in GW19 we discuss potential of #FPL assets from both clubs, including Justin, Maddison, Vardy, Fernandes, Rashford &amp; Martial...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
