    <item>
      <title>The Need Vs Want | Planet #SkyFF s.2 ep.19 | Sky Fantasy Football</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-need-vs-want-planet-skyff-s2-ep19-sky-fantasy-football</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss the fallout of another high scoring Gameweek in Sky Fantasy Football and for James the top 100 is now within touching distance.
 The impact of fixtures after Overhaul are discussed and for the first time in a while patience is advised where possible and the difficulty of covering captaincy in the next week could prove problematic with the potential for rotation likely over the Christmas period.
 Plus why Southampton's Jannik Vestergaard may not be as appealing as he looks at first glance, why Harry Kane is still worth the extra over Heung-Min Son and why selling Kevin De Bruyne could hurt...  
