      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/humbug-carabao-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-19</link>
      <description>In an extension of yesterday's Chip Strategy Podcast Suj &amp; James begin this weeks featured Podcast with an updated overview with what the implications are of the Carabao Cup Final moving from GW26 to GW33. Could GW26 now be the biggest double Gameweek and does the prospect of such being an altered chip strategy?
 Plus, there's a full review of all the GW14 action, why Mo Salah's price will continue to soar after Liverpool hit Palace for 7, thoughts on the bonkers Man Utd-Leeds encounter and why Leeds won't change, City's strength defensively &amp; why judging Tottenham in the coming weeks may not be straightforward...
