      <description>On this Podcast Suj &amp; James look through the possibilities for deploying Chips for the remainder of the season with Blank Gameweek 18 and Double Gameweek 19 looming. When is best to play the Free Hit? Will GW19 likely be the biggest Double Gameweek? What impact will GW29 Blanks have on the potential for Doubles in GW26? Should those without the first wildcard deploy their 2nd wildcard at the earliest opportunity? Could we yet have a late season Treble Gameweek in GW37? Get your pens &amp; paper at the ready...
