      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/still-chipping-away-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-18</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James review all the GW13 action that including Bruno blanking, KDB underwhelming and Liverpool beat Tottenham to go back top. All 20 clubs are assessed as usual and with the Blank Gameweek 18 and Double Gameweek 19 fixtures now known planning ahead is particular important for FPL managers and this is reflected in the Podcast analysis.
 Plus, Arsenal get a point at home at last, Wolves down Chelsea, Leeds hit five, why short-term thinking may be important for some FPL managers, why Trent Alexander-Arnold is no Darth Vader, Tree Surgeons &amp; plenty more... 
