      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/fulham-v-brighton-cotc-with-thetinkermen-fplseagull-fulbha-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Fulham correspodent Dara Curran &amp; Brighton correspondent Sam Murray ahead of the meeting between their two clubs on Tuesday night at Craven Cottage.
 A win for Fulham would see them leapfrog The Seagulls in the battle near the bottom, the relegation battle &amp; both clubs hopes for the season are discussed, plus tactical thoughts including Fulham's interesting system.
 Both have good short-term fixtures so FPL prospects such as Lookman, Cavaleiro, Lamptey &amp; Welbeck are discussed and there's also talk around the impact of fans returning to stadium.
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
