      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-youtube-live-stream-fri-dec-4th-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>As the GW11 deadline looms the FPL Community seems undecided on whether keeping or selling Jack Grealish and other Aston Villa options with their fixture against Newcastle postponed. James does his best to answer dilemmas in his YouTube stream this afternoon including everyone's want for Kevin De Bruyne this weekend, what a missing Hugo Lloris would mean to Tottenham's chances in the North London Derby, the interesting tactical duels to watch out for in the Chelsea-Leeds game and James begins with a full rundown of all the GW11 team news....
