    <item>
      <title>Homophobia In Football - A Planet #FPL Special</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/homophobia-in-football-a-planet-fpl-special</link>
      <description>Homophobia in Football still exists and the subject remains a taboo conversation in our game. Suj &amp; James challenge it and discuss the fact we are still without an openly gay professional footballer in England. Does it matter? Why is it important? Has the role of dressing rooms, media &amp; fans stopped someone being brave enough to come forward?
 Football is for everyone.
