      <description>James welcomes Leeds United correspondent Andy Martin &amp; Arsenal correspondent Adam Pritchard to discuss their clubs, #FPL assets and the GW9 meeting at Elland Road.
 Both suffered heavy defeats in GW8, can they recover from their recent blows? Are Leeds the Premier League's new entertainers? Can Arsenal still achieve a top 4 finish? Are tactical structures restricting both clubs?
 Aubameyang's positioning, Bamford's finishing, defensive assets under scrutiny &amp; plenty more...
