    <item>
      <title>Leicester v Wolves | C.O.T.C. with @AaronLagor &amp; parker_bradley #LEIWOL| Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/leicester-v-wolves-cotc-with-aaronlagor-parker_bradley-leiwol-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Leicester City correspondent Aaron Lagor &amp; Wolves correspondent Bradley Parker to discuss their clubs, #FPL assets and the GW8 meeting The King Power Stadium
 With both clubs capable of going top of the Premier League this weekend we discuss hopes for the season for both and makes comparisons between the clubs.
 We look at Leicester tactically, when they should and shouldn't use a back five, how James Maddison may be integrated back in the team, Harvey Barnes potential and if Jamie Vardy might be the standout captaincy option for FPL managers in GW10.
 While at Wolves are they moving towards a more possession based game? Kilman's status as first choice is covered, the potential of the wing-backs, Neto v Podence, why Traore is not playing and the consistency of Jimenez.
 You can follow both correspondents on Twitter
 Leicester correspondent Aaron @AaronLagor
 Wolves correspondent Bradley @parker_bradley
 ____________________________________________
