    <item>
      <title>You Came To This Conclusion? | Planet #SkyFF s.2 ep.12</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/you-came-to-this-conclusion-planet-skyff-s2-ep12</link>
      <description>It's a potential injury crisis for many a Sky Fantasy Football Manager. Danny Ings out for 4-6 weeks and the status of many such as Lamptey, Maupay, Rodriguez, Pulisic and Antonio remains unknown. Suj &amp; James discuss solutions, if it's too late to get a player in for Friday captaincies, why double and triple ups can be a differential, the difficult in getting on to City assets at the right time, community questions and dilemmas, a template potentially moving towards passing tier kings at the back &amp; plenty more...
