    <item>
      <title>Red Arrows | Planet #FPL S. 4 Ep. 12</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/red-arrows-planet-fpl-s-4-ep-12</link>
      <description>It's going badly for Suj &amp; James but they take no shame in laughing at their latest disasterclass and for James especially it was a nightmare. So what's next? James explains why he still won't pull the wildcard and why this particular week is bad for it anyway. There's a full review of GW7's games including Wolves' success in wide areas, Arsenal's outstanding pressing display, targeting Fulham despite their win against West Brom, Bale's Tottenham impact, GW8 capatincy thoughts and prepping for Man City's fixture swing...
