    <item>
      <title>Newcastle v Everton | C.O.T.C. #NEWEVE with @fpl_fitballer &amp; @spirit_blues | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/newcastle-v-everton-cotc-neweve-with-fpl_fitballer-spirit_blues-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Newcastle correspondent Simon Bibby &amp; Everton correspondent Sean Norton to discuss their clubs, #FPL assets and the GW7 meeting at St James' Park.
 Si explains why he can't see the club progressing under the current ownership and management structure while Sean is in positive mood as the Toffees top the league.
 And we talks tactics, Newcastle's system, Saint-Maximin's best position, Everton's defensive concerns, exciting attack but squad depth concerns persist...
 You can follow both correspondents on Twitter
 Newcastle correspondent Si @fpl_fitballer
 Everton correspondent Sean @spirit_blues
