      <description>On this week's Sky Fantasy Football Podcast James convinces Suj that not all is lost in this marathon race for £50,000. On the agenda, bringing Kevin De Bruyne straight back in, the pros and the cons, solutions to replacing Michail Antonio should the West Ham hitman be injured, captaincy choices for the weekend, Son vs Kane after the International break and moves this weekend to cover Southampton v Newcastle next Friday. Is Danny Ings the obvious choice...?
