        <![CDATA[<p>An earlier Live Stream than usual for James with a Friday night deadline (630pm UK time) and he begins with a summary of the team news known so far for all 20 clubs. Among the discussion, James Rodriguez solutions, KDB's potential return, thoughts on the fitness of Aguero, Bale &amp; Pulisic, Salah vs Kane for the armband, Liverpool without VVD, James' confirmed transfer for GW6 &amp; plenty more...  </p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Planet #FPL Podcast mini-league code: a8c1hz</p> <p>Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: <a href="http://www.youtube.com/planetfpl">www.youtube.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
