    <item>
      <title>Burnley v Tottenham | C.O.T.C. #BURTOT with @TurfyTopper &amp; @Rickysaunders77 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/burnley-v-tottenham-cotc-burtot-with-turfytopper-rickysaunders77-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Burnley correspondent Jack Toner &amp; Tottenham correspondent to look ahead to the GW6 encounter at Turf Moor on Monday night.
 We discuss the importance of Ben Mee to The Clarets and since recording he has returned to training and ask if there are growing concerns for Burnley with only 1 point so far this season. Could Chris Wood yet prove a consistent &amp; value FPL option?
 While at Tottenham Harry Kane and Heung-Min Son are on fire with Gareth Bale about to be added to the team. But will defensive concerns go away? Tactics, predictions, Kane v Salah for the GW6 captaincy &amp; plenty more... 
 You can follow both correspondents on Twitter
 Burnley correspondent Jack @TurfyTopper
 Tottenham correspondent Ricky @Rickysaunders77
