        <![CDATA[<p>James welcomes Chelsea correspondent Ted Maw &amp; Southampton correspondent Ali Mitchell to preview Saturday's GW5 meeting at Stamford Bridge.</p> <p>Two clean sheets in a row for The Saints following the defensive horror show in GW2 against Tottenham. Have they fixed their problems or can Chelsea expose them with their pace? We discuss tactics &amp; all the latest on the FPL players of interest at both clubs...</p> <p>You can follow both correspondents on Twitter</p> <p>Chelsea correspondent Ted @RotationFPL</p> <p>Southampton correspondent Ali @FPL_gaffer</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Planet #FPL Podcast mini-league code: a8c1hz</p> <p>Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: <a href="http://www.youtube.com/planetfpl">www.youtube.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
