    <item>
      <title>Sheffield United v Fulham | C.O.T.C. #SHUFUL with @FPL_Blade &amp; @TheTinkerMen | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/sheffield-united-v-fulham-cotc-shuful-with-fpl_blade-thetinkermen-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this weeks Clash of the Correspondents James welcomes Ben 'Tommo@ Thompson (@FPL_Blade) &amp; Dara Curran (@TheTinkerMen) to preview the GW5 encounter between Sheffield United &amp; Fulham.
 It's been an awful start for both clubs, between them 8 games played and zero points on the board. Is there cause for serious concern for The Blades? Can Chris Wilder turn it around and will they start to score goals? While at Fulham, everyone has already consigned them to inevitable relegation, but could the recent additions in the transfer window offer new hope? 
 Spoiler, this Podcast has a staggering conslusion... 
 You can follow both correspondents on Twitter
 Sheffield United correspondent Tommo @FPL_Blade
 Fulham correspondent Dara @TheTinkerMen
