    <item>
      <title>Brighton v Man Utd | C.O.T.C. #BHAMUN with @FPLSeagull &amp; @ismyCAPplaying | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/brighton-v-man-utd-cotc-bhamun-with-fplseagull-ismycapplaying-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this weeks Clash of the Correspondents James welcome Sam Murray (@FPLseagull) &amp; Gary Robinson (@ismyCAPplaying) to preview the Saturday lunchtime encounter between Brighton &amp; Manchester United in #GW3.
 It's been a promising start for the Seagulls, an encouraging performance against Chelsea was followed up with an outstanding 3-0 win at Newcastle on Sunday, but for United old issues came to the fore again during Saturday's 3-1 defeat to Palace. We investigate why the clubs have made differing starts and why it may have no bearing on what we can expect next. Plus, all the FPL assets under consideration including Lamptey, Trossard, Maupay, Fernandes, Rashford, Martial &amp; more... 
 You can follow both correspondent on Twitter
 Brighton correspondent Sam @FPLSeagull
 Man Utd correspondent Gary @ismyCAPplaying
 ____________________________________________
