      <title>Chelsea with @RotationFPL | #CorrespondentWeek Ep. 19 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/chelsea-with-rotationfpl-correspondentweek-ep-19-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>We welcome our Chelsea correspondent Ted Maw to preview The Blues &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...
 It's exciting times for Chelsea fans as they look set to break the record spent by a Premier League club in a transfer window. We discuss the integration of those new players, Chilwell, Silva, Ziyech, Havertz (almost certain) &amp; Werner. But will those defensive issues go away, especially with no goalkeeper signed as yet...? Plus tactics, rotation and plenty more...
 You can follow Ted on Twitter @RotationFPL
 And you can find the full list of Planet #FPL Correspondents at the link below
 https://twitter.com/i/lists/1004492438009012225
