      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/sheffield-united-with-fpl_blade-correspondentweek-ep-18-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>We welcome our Sheffield United correspondent Ben 'Tommo' Thompson to preview Dem Blades &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...
 Have FPL actually priced The Baldes assets correctly!? We try and seek value looking at The backline. Which centre half offers the best prospect. We question if Baldock or Stevens can justify their 5.5 price, or if the best choice is Ramsdale. Plus Berge prospects at 5,0, the forwards assessed &amp; plenty more...
 You can follow Tommo on Twitter @FPL_Blade
 And you can find the full list of Planet #FPL Correspondents at the link below
