      <title>Everton with @spirit_blues | #CorrespondentWeek Ep. 13 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/everton-with-spirit_blues-correspondentweek-ep-13-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>We welcome our Everton correspondent Sean Norton to preview The Toffees &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...
 Morale ahead of the new season is low at Goodison. Why? We discuss in detail why and how issues particularly in the midfield can be fixed. Can the imminent arrival of James Rodriguez change things for the better and could he be an option from the start for FPL managers? Plus, Digne, Calvert-Lewin, Richarlison &amp; more...
 You can follow Sean on Twitter @spirit_blues
 And you can find the full list of Planet #FPL Correspondents at the link below
 https://twitter.com/i/lists/1004492438009012225
