      <description>We welcome our Aston Villa correspondent Adam Hopcroft to preview his club &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...
 We discuss Villa's great escape and discover this had much to do with an improved and resolute defence. We discuss the options available to us at the back and the goalkeeping situation. Plus, Adam his opinion on Trezeguet &amp; Davis and we talk at length about Jack Grealish, recorded prior to his England call up and just after his original snub we discuss where Villa could get the best out of their captain...
 You can follow Adam on Twitter @ahopcroft13
 And you can find the full list of Planet #FPL Correspondents at the link below
