        <![CDATA[<p>We welcome our Wolves correspondent Bradley Parker to preview his club &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...</p> <p>This Podcast was recorded 7 days ago when rumours of Matt Doherty's transfer to Tottenham were simply that, rumours. You'll be able to tell from this what a loss The Irishman is to Wolves and the potential impact on Wolves both offensively and defensively. We discuss all the FPL options you have under consideration and why the mood at Molineux seems a bit flat... </p> <p>You can follow Bradley on Twitter @parker_bradley</p> <p>And you can find the full list of Planet #FPL Correspondents at the link below</p> <p>https://twitter.com/i/lists/1004492438009012225</p> <p>____________________________________________</p> <p>Planet #FPL Podcast mini-league code: a8c1hz</p> <p>Patreon: <a href="https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: <a href="http://www.youtube.com/planetfpl">www.youtube.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
