      <description>We welcome our Southampton correspondent Ali Mitchell to preview The Saints &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...
 We discuss if Ings can replicate his heroics from last season and if we can even consider going without Southampton options. McCarthy, Walker-Peters, Salisu, Watd-Prowse, Armstrong, Redmond &amp; Adams could all appeal so we discuss all of them and if we think a top 10 finish beckons... 
