      <description>We welcome our Fulham correspondent Dara Curran to preview The Cottagers &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...
 We discuss what Scott Parker has changed that has made this Fulham team different from the one relegated in 2019 despite much of the squad looking the same. Plus an overview of the squad, a surprising 4.5 tip, the key signing required and of course the importance of talisman Aleksandar Mitrovic...
