      <title>Brighton with @FPLSeagull | #CorrespondentWeek Ep. 2 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/brighton-with-fplseagull-correspondentweek-ep-2-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>We welcome our Brighton correspondent Sam Murray to preview The Seagulls &amp; their FPL assets before the new season kicks off...
 Is Ryan the best 4.5 GK option or are their better 4.5 defender options within a squad that is now full of depth? Or is there even a cheeky 4.0 option to consider? There's a 4.5 midfielder debate that is agreed on quickly and we discuss the new signings and if Trossard or Maupay can expect to see more consistent minutes and returns in 2020/21 for a side we expect to improve...
 You can follow Sam on Twitter @FPLSeagull
 And you can find the full list of Planet #FPL Correspondents here
