      <description>Suj &amp; James discuss fears over a lack of access to games when the Premier League season starts. Can it really be true that no fan can have access to 160 Premier League games in the forthcoming season? Who is to blame if a resolution can not be found? Is it the broadcasters, the clubs or the Premier League? Even season ticket holders are likely be denied access to watch their teams as it stands, a situation that the lads believe is simply unacceptable...
