      <description>In today's feature Podcast Suj &amp; James analyse potential strategy for the 2020/21 and when it would be best to deploy those crucial chips. Does the blanks for the Manchester clubs in GW1 mean we should wildcard early or is that premature? Or is holding that first wildcard as late as possible? Plus what further blanks &amp; doubles could arise during the season and why unusually January could be this season's key FPL period.
