      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/season-3-the-conclusion-planet-fpl-s-3-ep-61</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James Pod one last time to conclude their content for 2019/20 and season 3 of Planet #FPL.
 The lads analyse some startling differences in the #FPL data from their respective seasons despite having a very similar final rank and this leads to a deep chat about captaincy selections and a reflection on the season's highs &amp; lows.
 Plus, a number of Twitter questions from the community are covered and there is a reflection on a landmark year for Planet #FPL before the season 4 launch on Monday August 17th.
 Thanks for the continued support!
