      <description>On this special Clash of the Correspondents James welcomes Arsenal fan Adam @ThreeFiveWho &amp; Chelsea Fan Ted @RotationFPL to discuss tomorrow's FA Cup Final at Wembley. There's a reflection on the excellent Semi Final victories, tactics for the big game, the strengths and weaknesses of both and expectations for the future for both clubs beyond the final. Plus, the Podcast starts by asking if winning the Cup still matters...
