      <description>James welcome Sean &amp; Neil to discuss the GW38 fixture between Everton &amp; Bournemouth. James is expecting goals, do the correspondents agree? A standout FPL pick from both sides is identified plus there a focus on each club, there current status and where it is going. How is Ancelotti doing at Everton and how big a rebuild is needed? Will Howe stay at Bournemouth if they are relegated and could there be a fire sale? All this &amp; more
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Everton correspondent Sean @spirit_blues
 Bournemouth correspondent Neil @AFCBNG
