      <description>On the final featured Podcast before #GW38 Suj &amp; James review the highs and lows of the last games played since the weekend in the Premier League with now all thoughts centred on those final moves for Sunday. Suj leads James by 7 points but James has the Free Hit Chip in hand, it's going to go to the wire in the battle for bragging rights comes Monday's Podcast.
