      <description>On today's Ask James Live Stream on YouTube James urges caution against early FPL decisions when so much can change over the next 36 hours in the Premier League plus the discussions include... GW38 team leaks, the seriousness of the Poker reference for GW38 FPL players looking to win a tight mini league, the importance of the the test, the race for the Golden Boot, the future of the League Cup, Coventry City's planned stadium move and Crystal Palace's struggles ahead of the final day encounter with Tottenham. Of course there's some Tottenham stuff too.
