      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ill-see-you-in-the-garden-planet-fpl-s-3-ep-58</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James give a detailed analysis of all the weekend action which began with a vital win for West Ham and yes they scored three as Suj had predicted. There was the laughable scenes at Norwich, the 9 point swing of Danny Ings missed penalty &amp; Tottenham also scored three, has James now been won over by Mourinho's tactics? Plus a look at the FA Cup Semi Finals, which includes praise for Arsenal and an analysis of why Man City seem to struggle when they go behind and why Chelsea were deserved victors against Man Utd.
