    <item>
      <title>A Planet #FPL Special - The Crisis At Wigan Athletic</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/a-planet-fpl-special-the-crisis-at-wigan-athletic</link>
      <description>How can a football club change ownership and then enter administration weeks later? Something doesn't add up!
 Suj &amp; James investigate the ownership at Wigan Athletic and why the club is now on the brink of going out of existence. How did it get this far and so suddenly? And how culpable are the EFL? Were no lessons learned from what happened to Bury?
 Suj is on the knowledge, James brings the passion...
