      <description>In this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James look ahead to transfer plans. Suj still has 8 transfers left but did he hit those important captancies to climb rank and James outlines his plans for his remaining 5 transfers which may see him done and dusted come next Thursday. Captaincy choices for the week ahead, the single game day traps and why targetting the teams and the value may be better than holding players just for a future captaincy. Sarr, Traore, Bowen, Kane, Vardy, those kids who are alright and more... 
