    <item>
      <title>Norwich v West Ham | C.O.T.C. #NORWHU with @Fpl_badger &amp; @Fi_FplAddict123 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/norwich-v-west-ham-cotc-norwhu-with-fpl_badger-fi_fpladdict123-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>James welcomes Mark &amp; Chris discussing all the latest at their respective clubs Norwich &amp; West Ham. They meet on Saturday in GW35 but first Norwich travel to Watford &amp; West Ham host Burnley so we look at all three fixtures ahead of tonight's GW34 deadline. The battle to stay up is intensifying with only 5 games to play, could Norwich yet still survive if they win both games this week? Are West Ham now safe after 4 points in a week? Plus of course we discuss the potential FPL assets at both including a potentially difficult choice between Antonio &amp; Bowen...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Norwich correspondent Mark @Fpl_Badger
 West Ham correspondent Chris @Fi_FplAddict123
