        <![CDATA[<p>In this weeks Sky Fantasy Football Podcast Suj &amp; James review the week ahead and know the time for making those big final moves is about to arrive. James has entered the top 500 for the first time &amp; Suj still has a mountain of transfers left. Fixture analysis, transfer plans, community questions &amp; more all covered.</p> <p>_____________________________________________</p> <p>Patreon: <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.patreon.com%2Fplanetfpl&amp;redir_token=FanmfjjICom5fhH_-zsIxFySgkd8MTU5MjQ3OTE1NUAxNTkyMzkyNzU1&amp;event=video_description&amp;v=VZljXHKfJzw">https://www.patreon.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl You Tube: www.youtube.com/planetfpl</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
