    <item>
      <title>One InSane Day | Planet #FPL S. 3 Ep. 50</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/one-insane-day-planet-fpl-s-3-ep-50</link>
      <description>The story began on Tuesday night with some ITK &amp; ended some 24 hours later with Manchester City beating Arsenal. In between the ITK Changed, a frantic FPL deadline approached, Suj went for it &amp; Sheffield United feel victim of one of the worst ever refereeing decisions.
 Football is back! Suj &amp; James discuss a crazy 24 hours &amp; review the night's opening evening of games including Arsenal's hangover, the goal that never was, their FPL decisions, fake crowd noises &amp; why the FPL transfer market may be quiet.
  
 *Today is the last day you can vote for Suj &amp; James in the category of best Fantasy Football Podcast at The Football Content Awards
