      <description>Suj &amp; James begin by revealling their plans for the return of #FPL, for James it's a bench boost plan with thoughts beyond GW30 &amp; includes a surprise single gameweek inclusion while Suj intends to Free Hit and go for a powerful attack, could that that include Leroy Sane...?
 The lads detail their thoughts on the best options from the 4 teams in the Double Gameweek &amp; during a very detailed session on the Twitter questions assess further options such as those at Chelsea, Man Utd, Norwich &amp; Tottenham.
 #PlayItYourWay 
