    <item>
      <title>Man City v Arsenal | C.O.T.C. #MCIARS with @FPLPringle &amp; @ThreeFiveWho | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/man-city-v-arsenal-cotc-mciars-with-fplpringle-threefivewho-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James welcome Jonny Pringle &amp; Adam Pritchard to discuss their clubs &amp; two teams who will feature on the opening night of the Premier League restart &amp; of course feature twice in the #FPL Double Gameweek.
 Could both clubs focus on the FA Cup rather than the league? Will anyone play twice in the double Gameweek bar Ederson for City? Can #FPL managers trust anyone other than Aubameyang for The Gunners? Who's the best captain option? All this covered, plus a focus on tactics, City's UCL Ban appeal &amp; more...
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Manchester City correspondent Jonny @FPLPringle
 Arsenal correspondent Adam @ThreeFiveWho
 *Remember you can vote for Suj &amp; James in the category of best Fantasy Football Podcast at The Football Content Awards
