      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/free-hit-the-peoples-poll-ep-41-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Podcast Suj &amp; James look at the merits of the Free Hit Chip &amp; why it can be used as part of an aggressive or defensive strategies.
 Naturally thoughts come back around to to the #FPL restart in 8 days &amp; the lads look at alternative uses for the Free Hit &amp; when may be best to play the chip if not in GW30 &amp; the lads also compare the benefits of the chip against the benefits of a bench boost. 
