      <description>Clash of The Correspondents is back!
 Suj &amp; James welcome Adam Hopcroft &amp; Ben 'Tommo' Thompson to discuss their clubs &amp; the two teams who we think will restart the Premier League season on June 17th, Aston Villa &amp; Sheffield United.
 Can Villa stay up? Can the Blades qualify for the Champions League? Best #FPL assets from both clubs &amp; #FPL strategy for the resumption are discussed including thoughts on chip usage.
 You can follow the correspondents on Twitter...
 Aston Villa correspondent Adam @ahopcroft13
 Sheffield United correspondent Tommo @FPL_Blade
