      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/mad-hatters-luton-town-the-peoples-poll-ep-40-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this People's Poll the lads investigate the current situation at Luton Town, currently 23rd in the Championship &amp; who have reappointed former manager Nathan Jones who walked out on them to join Stoke a little over a year ago. The impact of a potential relegation could have a wider impact on their stadiums plans, but could they yet pull off a miraculous escape &amp; survive relegation to stay in the Championship, a league where clubs are saddled with mounting debts?
 Suj &amp; James have been nominated for the award of Best Fantasy Football Podcast at the Football Content Awards &amp; you can show your support by voting at the link below... 
