      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/quiz-premier-league-final-day-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this weeks quiz James tests Suj on Premier League final day's and specific Gameweek 38 between 1996 &amp; 2019.
 20 questions &amp; a possible 30 correct answers to get.
