      <description>On this week's YouTube Ask James Stream James confirms full details at the start of the schedule and topics to be covered in tomorrow's 24 hour Live Stream to raise money for NHS Charities Together.
 Randomly the topics centre around England and what Gareth Southagte has tried to instill in the current squad to prevent failures of the past, there's Tottenham nostalgia as is often the case including the lengths James use to go to to make sure he didn't miss his team play, ChampManFPL questions are covered off &amp; there is honest truths from James on what launching Patreon means to him.
