      <description>Suj &amp; James look back at Manchester United's historic Champions League, Premier League &amp; FA Cup Treble &amp; ask the ultimate question were they best?
 United's remarkable season, he highs of those wins against Arsenal, Juventus &amp; Bayern Munich is reviewed &amp; the strengths of ntheir squad depth and starting eleven remembered.
