      <title>Ask James | YouTube Live Stream 15/5/20 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/ask-james-youtube-live-stream-15520-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>on his YouTube Live Stream this week James opens the show by announcing all 22 guests that will be appearing on the lads 24 hour live stream that begins at 6am on Saturday May 23rd. 
 There are extended opinions as has become common place on a Friday on a restart for football &amp; another defence from James on players, plus remembering some former Spurs forwards of the past, trivia, food &amp; some Champ Man FPL questions
 ________________________
