      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/1-message-received-planet-fpl-s-3-ep-44</link>
      <description>The latest on Project Restart, why the Brighton &amp; Dynamo Dresden cases highlight how difficult a completion of the Premier League season will be &amp; why for many players there is no reason to want to play
 The Twitter questions feature which clubs would be right for a Sugar Daddy owner, the rumours we wish had come true &amp; the text message we sent that we regretted the most!
 Plus from around minute 44 the lads finish wish an analysis of chip strategy fort Champ Man FPL now it's confirmed that Boro Vs Man Utd is off in GW13 &amp; doubles looms in GW15
