    <item>
      <title>Middlesbrough 1996/97 | #ThrowbackThursday | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/middlesbrough-199697-throwbackthursday-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James take a nostalgic look back at one of the Premier League's most remarkable campaigns when Middlesbrough bought Fabrizio Ravanelli &amp; Emerson to team up with the brilliant Juninho to thrill fans &amp; neutrals alike. But as the season concluded Boro had lost both domestic Cup Finals, been deducted points &amp; relegated from the top flight. 
 Which leads the lads to ask, were Teesiders the best side ever to be relegated...?
 This is the story of Middlesbrough's unforgettable 1996/97 season.
 ________________________________
