      <title>Olympiakos Match Fixing Scandal | The People's Poll Ep. 38 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/olympiakos-match-fixing-scandal-the-peoples-poll-ep-38-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Podcast Suj &amp; James investigate the match fixing scandal cirrcling around Greece's biggest club Olympiakos. What are the repercussions if the runaway Greek league leaders are found guilty? 
 The lads look back on some of the incidents that have blighted Greek football over the last 10 years, there's a gun on a pitch, a bombing, drugs &amp; corruption claims. The focus is very much on current owner Evangelos Marinakis who also now has majority ownership of Championship Club Nottingham Forest. Should the English club have concerns too?
