      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/may-the-fourth-planet-fpl-s-3-ep-43</link>
      <description>On Suj &amp; James' featured Planet #FPL Podcast the lads give all the latest on a possible restart for football and why there are fears that a voided season could be the natural conclusion. There is insight into the impact on players, both in the Premier League &amp; at lowers level of the English pyramid, ongoing financial implications and how streaming games behind closed doors could help save lower league clubs.
 There's the usual round of Twitter questions from the community plus as is now common to end on the Monday Podcasts the lads discuss all the latest in Champ Man FPL. 
