    <item>
      <title>Contain Your Impatience | Planet #FPL S. 3 Ep. 42</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/contain-your-impatience-planet-fpl-s-3-ep-42</link>
      <description>In this weeks featured Planet #FPL Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss the current situation with football returning &amp; it seems the Premier League are now seriously targeting an early to mid June restart. But James especially raises his continued concerns. Do the lads miss football &amp; how do they feel about the prospect of Premier League football with no crowd? 
 There's also a big announcement about a planned 24 hour live stream for the boys in May, the usual Twitter questions &amp; a feature towards the end of the Podcast on Champ Man FPL.  
