    <item>
      <title>Keegan's Entertainers | #ThrowbackThursday | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/keegans-entertainers-throwbackthursday-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Thursday Throwback Suj &amp; James look back at a time when Kevin Keegan took over at Newcastle United &amp; took them from the brink of relegation to Division 3 to The Premier League's great entertainers &amp; a 12 point lead at the summit inside 4 years. How did they get there so quickly &amp; how did it fall apart just as quickly.
 Lots of nostalgia as the lads reminisce about one of the Premier League's most fondly remembered teams &amp; those Keegan years on Tyneside.
  
 ________________________________
