      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/toon-takeover-planet-fpl-s-3-ep-41</link>
      <description>On this weeks featured Planet #FPL Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss the impending takeover of Newcastle United and whether the Saudi Arabian owners can fund success the way it has happened previously at Chelsea &amp; Manchester City. Is there any cause for concern or are loyal Geordies right to be excited about Newcastle's future? ...Plus, the latest in Scotland as an expansion of the league is debated, in England June the 8th is now the 'best case scenario' for a Premier League restart, but is that even viable? ... There's also discussion on Champ Man FPL after another disaster for Suj &amp; of course questions from Twitter which include Pochettino regrets for James  
