      <title>The Forgotten Champions: Leeds United 1991/92 | #ThrowbackThursday | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-forgotten-champions-leeds-united-199192-throwbackthursday-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj &amp; James begin a new regular feature on Thursday's until football returns with Throwback Thursday, &amp; on this episode the lads look back on Leeds United's often forgotten Division 1 title winning campaign in 1991/92, the final season before the formation of the Premier League League. The squad is reviewed and the stunning twist to their title run in with Manchester United which saw The Red Devils bogged down in a fixture pile up is remembered. Did Leeds deserve it? Why is the title triumph forgotten?
 Planet #FPL goes retro!
