      <description>In what is likely to be their final Sky Fantasy Football Podcast until the resumption of football Suj &amp; James discuss their debut Sky season and their successes and regrets. Could an aggressive start pay off for James next season? Could logging in enable Suj the chance to win £50,000!?
 There's an update on yesterday's announcement from UEFA, thoughts on resolving mini league conflict + an unintended reveal of what the boys may be doing on Wednesday's going forward. 
