      <description>How do Suj &amp; James feel as fans with football suspended for the forseeable? In a week when both should have been looking forward to the Planet #FPL Derby both are in a low key mood reflecting on a first weekend of football. Suj discusses the impact to small business &amp; the economy in general which can have a spiralling affect on business and football clubs at a lower level as the country goes into social isolation. plus James reviews Tottenham's Champions League exit in Leipzig.
