    <item>
      <title>Void Or Continue? | The People's Poll Ep. 31 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/void-or-continue-the-peoples-poll-ep-31-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>On this Podcast Suj &amp; James discuss what could happen to the football calendar with football suspended (almost) throughout the World. Tuesday's UEFA meeting is likely to hold the key to what happens next but could domestic football move from a winter to summer sport? When do the lads think football should resume &amp; what should it look like? 
 There are differing opinions on what should happen with the current season. Could the season really be voided as if it never happened? Or should the season be played to a conclusion no matter when football restarts? And if so what sacrifices need to be made from next season to ensure it happens?
 _________________________________________
