      <description>James is joined by Arsenal correspondent Adam @ThreeFiveWho and West Ham correspondent Chris @Fi_FplAddict123 to discuss the #GW29 London Derby at The Emirates and have a catch up on all the latest at Arsenal and West Ham. Recorded on Tuesday this Podcast takes on greater importance now we know that Arsenal will have a double gameweek this week and West Ham have become available for those looking to avoid a Gameweek 31 Free Hit.
 Is Aubameyang now the best captaincy this gameweek?
 Is now the time for Pepe?
 Can Antonio maintain fitness?
 Is Ngakia now FPL's best 4.0 option?
 All this and more....
