      <description>In their weekly featured Podcast Suj &amp; James review every game from one of the lowest scoring Gameweeks of the season, as Liverpool were finally beaten, comprehensively by Watford, Leicester slipped up at Norwich following Friday night panic to sell Jamie Vardy after injury news broke late on Twitter, which led to James buying a 3rd attacking Wolves player despite them playing at Tottenham!
 Plus, Twitter questions from the community covered and patience during this midweek is urged again ahead of the FA Cup 5th round games that will shape many a #FPL Chip Strategy.
