    <item>
      <title>He's Not Well, He's Not Right | TOT&amp;HAM Ep. 28 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/hes-not-well-hes-not-right-totham-ep-28-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Another defeat for Tottenham, a 3rd in a row, what happens if there is a 4th at home to Norwich in the FA Cup on Wednesday night? James details Tottenham's defeat at home to Wolves with details on Mourinho's repeated failures with a back five. Yet, was something better on Sunday despite defeat? There's also details on why Troy Parrott may have been denied a start so far despite the attacking injuries.
 Meanwhile Suj was delighted with the Hammers 3-1 win against Southampton &amp; why there is risk, but potential rewards in The Hammers sticking with a 4-4-2  at Arsenal on Saturday. Plus, notes on another supporter protest against the owners and find out Suj's surprising star from Saturday's London Stadium triumph and who was as "not well, not right"
 _________________________________________
