    <item>
      <title>Coronavirus &amp; Its Impact On Football | The People's Poll Ep. 29 | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/coronavirus-its-impact-on-football-the-peoples-poll-ep-29-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Coronavirus is spreading and its potential to impact on football is already being felt. But how big is the threat? Is it possible that if the virus continues to spread that the football season ends suddenly? 
 Suj &amp; James discuss what we currently know about Coronavirus and the escalating threat it is having on football both globally and domestically, with updates on the situation in Asia, Italy &amp; France &amp; what measures the UK government may take if the disease continues to spread. Are games being played behind closed doors a reasonable solution? And if the worst happens &amp; games are postponed, what happens next? 
