      <description>Suj &amp; James look ahead to Blank Gameweek 28 &amp; discuss the moves they may make as the Friday night deadline looms. Suj is buying a budget defender while James discusses the prospect of a sideways move from Salah to Mane that could in turn lead to sticking the armband on a player that hasn't returned in over 2 months! Differentials &amp; North v South teams discussed, plus, there have been a staggering amount of transfers in for Aubameyang this gameweek, despite no fixture for Arsenal. Are there really so many players not in the know? Or is there something else at play?
