      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/matthew-715-totham-ep-27-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Suj warns of False Prophets as an improved West Ham are still beaten at Anfield despite leading 2-1 during the 2nd half. The fear remains that The Hammers may not show up against so-called weaker opposition in the coming weeks. James briefs tactics in what was different about West Ham tactically last night and where it may lead to next, plus, updates on a potential suspension for Dele Alli, Rudiger's comments about racism winning and an awful quote fro Mourinho wanting the season to end summing up a dour mood at Tottenham following the defeat to Chelsea.
