      <description>Ahead on the Saturday evening Gameweek 27 meeting at the King Power Suj &amp; James welcome their correspondent from Leicester (Anup - @FoxyFpl) and Manchester City (Jonny - @FPLPringle) to discuss the latest at their clubs.
 Are Leicester FPL assets worth holding? Is their form more than just a blip in an otherwise great season?
 Can investment in Man City be made beyond the highly owned KDB?
 Plus, following Monday's People's Poll Podcast focusing on City's European ban the show kicks off with the Man City perspective on what the current mood is amongst the fanbase.
