      <description>Could Lionel Messi really leave Barcelona? And on a free transfer? Suj &amp; James discuss arguably the greatest player of anyone's generation and whether his career at the Camp Nou could be coming to and end? The lads discuss his commercial value, his genius and what could happen if he landed in the Premier League? What would he cost as an FPL asset and what would be an acceptable amount to pay for the Argentinian magician? Plus James reminisces in the pleasure of seeing Messi live at Wembley even though he destroyed his Tottenham on the night.
