      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>In this weeks Clash of the Correspondents Suj &amp; James are joined by Everton fan @spirit_blues (Sean) &amp; Crystal Palace fan @Migtavius (Mig) ahead of the Saturday lunchtime encounter between their respective sides at Goodison Park. Amongst the discussion is Carlo Ancelotti's impact on a rejuvenated Everton &amp; Palace's conistant problems scoring goals. Plus key #FPL (&amp; this week #SkyFF) assets discussed including Holgate, Richarlison, Calvert-Lewin, Kelly, PVA &amp; Zaha.</p> <p>_________________________________________</p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: <a href="http://www.youtube.com/planetfpl">www.youtube.com/planetfpl</a></p> <p> </p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
