      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>In this episode focusing on Sky Fantasy Football Suj and James debate all the upcoming issues before the Overhaul opens on Sunday. Should Mane be replaced tonight with injury likely to rule him out for Liverpoool's next 2? Salah vs VVD for captaincy both tonight at West Ham and against Southampton on Saturday? Is it worth buying an Aubameyang or an Aguero to cover captaincy on Sunday? Plus planning for the Overhaul including a discussion on the March TV fixture release.</p> <p>_________________________________________</p> <p>Web: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p> <p>You Tube: <a href="http://www.youtube.com/planetfpl">www.youtube.com/planetfpl</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
