      <description>On this People's Poll Suj &amp; James discuss the increasing concerns surrounding gambling and its influence on within football. Online, TV ads, shirt sponsorship, advertising hoardings, wherever you look currently you will find references to gambling during a Premier League game. Is this morally right for society? We discuss loop holes gambling companies find in advertising and the dangers to children and vulnerable people in the way gambling is advertised.
