      <description>In this episode looking at their clubs Suj &amp; James talk all the latest at Tottenham and West Ham. There looks to be an incoming at The Lane but does it mean Christian Eriksen is on his way, and what are James' hopes for Saturday's trip to Watford? There's frustration from Suj on VAR after the latest disallowed goal at Sheffield United (which causes anger) + a review of the racism case involving Antonio Rudiger which has been closed with no evidence found.
