      <description>Unfortunately in this week's Clash of the Correspondents Palace correspondent @Migtavius was unable to Suj &amp; James so it's up to James to bring the numbers on the Eagles. But the lads were joined by Arsenal correspondent Adam @ThreeFiveWho to have a detailed chat on Arsenal and the impact Arteta is already having on the Gunners ahead of the Saturday lunchtime meeting at Selhurst Park.
