        <![CDATA[<p>It's been a decent first 3 gamedays For Suj &amp; James &amp; the boys are well on course for the target of 150 points this week in Sky. The discussion includes total transfers used so far by the top ranking players, removing Man City assets &amp; the importance of timing transfers correctly.</p> <p>_________________________________________</p> <p>You can find more from the Planet #FPL Team here:</p> <p>Website: www.planetfpl.com Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj) Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL Instagram: @planetfpl You Tube: PlanetFPL</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
