      <description>After James sent a tweet on Saturday following the Spurs game that went viral, VAR is back as a main topic of conversation. With over 750 retweets, 2,500 likes and being picked up on the other side of the world by Fox Sports Australia - many people agree with the sentiment of #ScrapVAR. Listen in as the boys discuss this topic, for what they promise will be the last time, somehow I doubt it will be.
