      <description>With a Friday night deadline, there's not long to go before the deadline. James is finally saying farewell to Harry Kane and Suj is scrambling to find 0.2m to buy KDB. In a quiet week in the transfer market, there is sure to be a frenzy of activity tonight! We also run down the North v South teams, Zombies (who are 208k in the world!) and our Differential side too.
