      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/pp-ep-123</link>
      <description>Leading up to GW9 - we discuss a hot topic in the #FPL community. Wilson or Abraham? With Abraham's ownership over 40% and Wilson not even at 15% yet, it seems like it's almost a template vs. differntial debate. We look at fixtures, stats and FPL history - and surprisngly, we come to an agreed conclusion! Also a cheeky 5 minute chat on KDB's price drop.
