      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/the-rant-totham-ep-10-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>This episode is about one thing, and one thing only. James has a few choice words about his current Spurs team, the manager, the ownership and what is going on right now. Despite the bad form and negative media, they are only 3 points of the Top 4, Suj does try and put a positive spin on things, and has a cheerier demeanour on the Hammers. A great 30 mins for those wanting a more detailed look at Tottenham Hotspurs and West Ham United.
