      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/onwards-to-gw7-the-final-plan-ep-8-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>After the mid-week round of Carabao Cup matches, Suj &amp; James look forward to GW7 safe in the knowledge that their teams can focus on the league now...Suj's Wildcard keeps poking it's head out, but hasn't been instigated yet and James has made his transfers early...
 Listen in to find out what they boys are planning on doing for GW7.
