    <item>
      <title>Big @ The Back is Alive! | People's Poll | Planet #FPL</title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/big-the-back-is-alive-peoples-poll-planet-fpl</link>
      <description>Big at the back is alive...well at least in Planet #FPL land it is. Suj &amp; James are sticking with the likes of Triple Liverpool defence, two from Manchester City and Lucas Digne from Everton. This season there have been only 20 cleansheets from 49 matches (so 20 from 98 chances) which is the lowest for 3 seasons.
 Should we stop looking at Premium Defenders?
 Will we start seeing clean sheets again from the Top 6?
 What is the best £ for £ strategy now?
 In our regular Monday morning show, The People's Poll, we look at Big @ The Back and the clean sheets situation in a bit more detail.
 _________________________________________
 You can find more from the Planet #FPL Team here:
