      <description>In this episode we are joined at 4.30am in California by Stephen Toumi (@6thgoal) and in North London by Adam Pritchard (@threefivewho) to discuss this weekend's clash between Watford and Arsenal. Will the new manager bounce be enough to kick start Watfird's season or will Pepe's amazing stats finally translate into FPL points?
