      <description>With the season only 4 days away; it's time to pick our novelty teams. We start by looking at our North v South competition as thought up by the Mayor of FPL Tom Campbell. We also enter a dead team into the WGTA Zombie League and as well as pick a differential team with less than 10% ownership.
