    <item>
      <title>Did you miss us? - S. 3 Ep. 2 </title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/did-you-miss-us-s-3-ep-2</link>
      <description>After a whopping 10 days off (!?!), Suj &amp; James are back in business for the third season of Planet #FPL. We run down all of the transfer news from the past two weeks, look at our #GW1 drafts and squeeze in a few Twitter questions for good measure.
