      <description>Episode 28 sees us talk to Jack @Turfytopper our Burnley correspondant about his team and what we can look forward to in 2018-2019. As James pointed out, Burnley put more points on the board in the second half of the season than Spurs - and if that continues into the upcoming season, we surely need to keep an eye on them!
