        <![CDATA[<p>On Day 9 we speak to Adam @ThreeFiveWho - our Arsenal correspondant. We look back at what was an "up-down" season for Arsenal despite reaching the Europa League final - what could have been this season and what we have to look forward to next season.</p> <p>Our <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=%2330in30">#30in30</a> is here - 30 podcasts in 30 days, including reviews of the Champions League, Nations League, fixtures when announced and most importantly - interviews with the Planet FPL correspondants and more.</p> <p>You can find more from the Planet <a class="yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string" href="https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=%23FPL">#FPL</a> Team here:</p> <p>Website: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: <a href="http://www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL">www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</a></p> <p>Instagram: @planetfpl</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
