      <description>That's it now - #GW37 is done and there is only one Gameweek to go. In 7 days, the entire FPL season will be over and based on the current week, it can't end quick enough. As usual, Suj &amp; James discuss:
 - The title contenders keep trading blows
 - The top 4 are all trying to bottle it
 - Who to replace Son with...
 - All the usual Twitter questions
 And a usual run down of all of the games from the weekend.
 You can find more from the Planet #FPL Team here:
 Website: www.planetfpl.com Twitter: @PlanetFPLPod (James) / @sujanshah (Suj) Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL
