        <![CDATA[<p>After a shocking Gameweek for James and a decent Gameweek for Suj, the boys look back at the Gameweek for FPL, fixtures and more, including:</p> <p>- Is the holy trinity of premium defender becoming a holy four?</p> <p>- We help with a bunch of A or B player selections for people.</p> <p>- What to do with AWB and is Doherty now a must?</p> <p>- James offers a few stress relief strategies!</p> <p>You can find more from the Planet #FPL Team here:</p> <p>Website: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @TheFPLPodcast (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
