    <item>
      <title>Planet #FPL S.2 Ep.3 - We pick TWO teams in under an hour </title>
      <link>https://sites.libsyn.com/104154/planet-fpl-s2-ep3-we-pick-two-teams-in-under-an-hour</link>
      <description>In this episode, Suj &amp; James pick not ONE, not TWO teams.
 First team: A zombie team to compete in the Who Got The Assist zombie league - no transfers, no changes throughout the season, just hold your breath!
 Second team: a differentials team where all players in the team have less than 5% ownership AND we have to transfer players out when they hit 10% ownership...
 It's a fun-filled discussion looking at some players that you may not look normally.
 You can find more from the Planet #FPL Team here:
 Website: www.planetfpl.com
 Twitter: @TheFPLPodcast (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)
 Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
