Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>In this episode, Suj &amp; James pick not ONE, not TWO teams.</p> <p>First team: A zombie team to compete in the Who Got The Assist zombie league - no transfers, no changes throughout the season, just hold your breath!</p> <p>Second team: a differentials team where all players in the team have less than 5% ownership AND we have to transfer players out when they hit 10% ownership...</p> <p>It's a fun-filled discussion looking at some players that you may not look normally.</p> <p>You can find more from the Planet #FPL Team here:</p> <p>Website: <a href="http://www.planetfpl.com/">www.planetfpl.com</a></p> <p>Twitter: @TheFPLPodcast (James) / @sujanshah (Suj)</p> <p>Facebook: www.facebook.com/PlanetFPL</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
