 2. Eriksen or Sane for £9.5m
 3. Is Salah a must have for FPL this season?
 4. Are Arsenal to be avoided for GW1 &amp; GW2?
 5. Where is the value to be had in the bottom half clubs?
 6. Arnie, Zaha, or Tosun?
 and a whole lot more #FPL banter as always.
